  ('zcrm_1579374000063416131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, 'emailed Kallie HCBB information for knee MRI for her husband Don, I told them to reach back out to me if surgery is recommended so that I can put them in touch with the Care Connect Team. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-08 12:18:48', '2021-02-08 12:18:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063376044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', 'Prescriptions and Pharmacy', 'Spoke with Joe Lovelidge - Regional Director for RCI and he did some digging that Citizen''s Rx is no longer in contract with Walmart or Sam''s and that they are slowly doing away with the discount programs altogether.  

His recommendation is to use Good Rx for coupons and at this point to use the pharmacies that Welldine has in place for pharmacies.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-08 11:42:15', '2021-02-08 11:42:15'),
