  ('zcrm_1579374000063382026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041217015', 'Carl Ross', NULL, 'Member called in and asked if he could have the logiin &amp; pass to his portal.  I advised that he did not have access to that yet and asked wht he needed to do.  He wanted to get teh particulars of his plan, I explained IUA &amp; how plan worked.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-08 11:00:56', '2021-02-08 11:00:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063416041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', NULL, 'Stephen Scharf called in with follow up questions from his welcome call.  I explained the difference between presenting himself as a cash pay patient, and seeking an in-network doctor.  I am sending him the Zion needs submission link as well. -I went over HCBB with him in depth and I told him that he can choose whatever route in-network- out of network that he is the most comfortable with for his dermatology apt.  KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-08 10:42:03', '2021-02-08 10:44:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063384036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415357', 'Jill Leonard', NULL, 'Member had to rescheduled call for Tuesday, February 9, 2021 at 12:30 EST/10:30 Mountain time. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-02-08 10:35:12', '2021-02-08 10:35:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063415008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, 'Tanya called in and asked if I could find her the cheapest prices for an X-Ray due to her thinking she has a broken toe. I let her know I would look up facilities in her area on HCBB and send her an email with screen shots of the fair price graph, the list of facilities, and there was also 1 specific facility that has a Cash Price Discount that she can call and tell them she found their Cash Discount on HCBB and pay right over the phone and schedule an appointment for that exact price. If she chooses not to go that route I explained what she needs to do with the other facilities by presenting herself as a cash pay and responsible for the first $1000 of her IUA and anything there after to submit the bills into Zion and start a Need with them. Am also sending email that explains how to start the Need''s process with Zion. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-08 10:34:17', '2021-02-08 10:34:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063382021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046514182', 'Jordan Kirkwood', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will process.  Sedera notified via outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-08 10:30:59', '2021-02-08 12:01:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063416036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091256', 'Cynthia Shiko', NULL, 'Jami,

Please thank your team for helping Cynthia Shiko.  She is now able to access her HCBB account!

Now, I also have an update medically for her and it looks as though she will be using your services going forward She had an MRI done on her knee- it came back positive for a Torn ACL and Medial Meniscus Tear on the L knee.

She has a PT apt today and is about to go over her $1000 IUA, she wants to see a doctor that was recommended by her husband.  His name is Dr. Stephan Paul.  Here is her address information-

Mailing Street 2455 Franklin Ave
Mailing State CO
Mailing City Louisville
Mailing Zip 80027

Date of Birth Dec 12, 1959

phone number - 720-205-8130

and she is a Jan 1 start date on the plan.  So far, this sounds recent and not pre-x, but that is up for Zion to decide.

Please let me know if I am leaving anything out!

Thanks lady!

Kelly Anne Cheever

MPB.Health Concierge

1-800-519-2969 ext 1008', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-08 10:24:42', '2021-02-08 10:24:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063416031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610265', 'Julie A. Bekker', NULL, 'Julie Bekker called Planstin about the Covid Vax and they told her that she wasn''t a member.  She called us for support- I told her that I would ask John and Patti to help with this but that she DOES have those benefits.  She is paying for them every month.  I answered her Covid question.  I answered all of her preventative care benefit questions and sent appropriate templates.  I reached out to Slack for support and tagged John and Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-08 10:09:30', '2021-02-08 10:09:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063382016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491144', 'Margaret Sherman', NULL, 'Spoke to Kevin Michaels about this member and he was unaware of anything having to do with her.  We agreed that I would reach out to her and ask why I got the enrollment in the Select plan.  Then suggest that there are some new options that Kevin could explain to her if she was interested.  I left VM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-08 10:09:10', '2021-02-08 10:09:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063382011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919346', 'Troy Wells', NULL, 'I reached out to Wendy to ask if she had any dealings with this member since I received an enrollment from Sedera into the Select plan.  Wendy offered to reach out to member and let him know that enrollment was closed for the Select plan and possibly get him onto Zion.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-08 09:33:06', '2021-02-08 09:33:06'),
