  ('zcrm_1579374000063416003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059752001', 'Kim McMurtry', NULL, 'Kim visited the ER over the weekend and she wanted to know that she was doing everything right.  I told her that she did- I told her to present her Planstin card to see follow up cardiologist Ethan Robert Ellis- because he is showing in Zion''s network.  The hospital was also in the PHCS network.  She did not pay anything out of pocket. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-08 08:39:14', '2021-02-08 08:39:14'),
