  ('zcrm_1579374000063384003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '2-5-21 Son has covid. They called telehealth first and that dr. told him to go to ER for difficulty breathing. He''s on his way to ER and Eric called to find out how to deal with the process and what to do. I told him to present himself as self-pay and they are responsible for $1500 and not to pay more. Get Super bill and call Concierge when has that to process Need. He said ok and thanked me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-05 15:42:13', '2021-02-05 15:42:13'),
