  ('zcrm_1579374000063340019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054126', 'Santiago Mussi Tiscornia', NULL, '2-5-21 Left vm for Santiago letting him know of payment issue for past 3 months. He owes $172x3 which is $516. I told him to call me or Patti at Concierge # ASAP. UPDATE - He called me and left vm and said cc was hit by fraud and therefore changed. I sent him form to update it. Haven''t spoken to him yet, just via vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-05 12:11:38', '2021-02-05 15:24:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063305053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096003', 'David Klaff', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I refunded 2/1 pmt &amp; cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-05 12:07:28', '2021-02-05 12:07:28'),
