  ('zcrm_1579374000063305043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691226', 'Dolores Pope', NULL, 'on 2/4 member asked me to rerun the payment which I did.  member has been in contact with the bank who says that they do not see any transactions.  I sent screen for member to show bank.  We will see if transaction gets processed.  Also member told me that Zach Masters filled out Payment update not her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-05 11:40:39', '2021-02-05 11:40:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063376019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046483021', 'Rochelle Kirkwood', 'Follow up with Sedera', '-Sedera was called on behalf of member.  I spoke to Thomas since Lizzy was unavailable.  Thomas informed that ACCESS could have very well paid most of the bills and that they would pick up the remaining balance once member submitted all bills to them.
-Member was then called and advised to call the Billing Department at the hospital and to get the remaining balance that ACCESS did not pay.  Ask them to send a copy of that remaining balance to her so she could then submit it to Sedera.
-Member was ok with this solution and said she would do the follow up work.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-05 11:09:51', '2021-02-05 11:09:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063376008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046514182', 'Jordan Kirkwood', 'Cancellation Notice Update', 'Rochelle Kirkland is mother and payer for this account and when she got the email she sent it back without putting Jordan''s name on it.  
-I called Rochelle and told her I was sending another email and to be sure to put  Jordan''s name on the notice.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-05 10:56:02', '2021-02-05 10:56:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063331038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, 'called wondering how she could submit a colonoscopy bill that she incurred while with Planstin.  I gave her Planstin''s phone number and told her to reach out to them for support. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-05 10:47:40', '2021-02-05 10:47:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063376003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810025', 'Kellie Stafford', 'Adding daughter to program', 'Kellie called to see if she could add her daughter to her plan.  After asking if she claimed her on her taxes, she determined her daughter would need to stay on the same state plan she is on now .', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-05 10:05:38', '2021-02-05 10:05:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063331033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508113', 'Kristen Boyle', NULL, 'sent another welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-05 09:58:52', '2021-02-05 09:58:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063331028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044279010', 'Helena Hofer', NULL, 'Helping member further understand her correspondence with Sedera- her bill that she is trying to submit got "messed up" by going through RCI''s PHCS network.  I have now given her Jennifer Chasteen''s contact information and told her that Jennifer will be able to fill in any gaps that I am missing here. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-05 09:50:14', '2021-02-05 09:50:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063331023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'sent Etta a needs Submission template for Sedera- it looked like from Wendy''s emails that she needed it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-05 09:47:57', '2021-02-05 09:47:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063340008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, '2-5-21 Melissa was worried because she had to seek service for recent incontinence and back pain. She was panicked bc was now told by Concierge that it might be pre-x. However, this was the first time she''s seen a doctor and doesn''t believe any records show anything prior to this very recent visit. She''s referred to a specialist next and also doesn''t believe it will exceed $25K. So, not super worried and apologized for yelling at the girl from yesterday which was KellyAnne. UPDATE - KC said Melissa didn''t yell at her, she just let her vent. All is well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-05 09:24:24', '2021-02-05 10:41:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063331018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058319043', 'jordan batchelder', NULL, 'called in asking when he would receive his 1095- I told them that they would be leaving the office to our members shortly. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-05 09:23:58', '2021-02-05 09:23:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063340003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768243', 'Haley Collins', NULL, '2-5-21 Talked with Haley and claiming that she wants two months refund bc doesn''t want to pay so much for telemedicine. I explained that''s one small piece of the membership and explained how the billing works. Once I said we might be able to find another plan for March 1st bc they are re-opening enrollment, the truth finally came out. She got employee benefits which she only has to pay $100 of her employer plan which is $250 and includes wellness. Patti will cancel her for March 1st moving forward once she completes the form.  She was claiming wants money back because she never used it!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-05 09:14:53', '2021-02-26 14:51:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063331013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768243', 'Haley Collins', NULL, 'Haley would like to cancel because this isn''t the plan she thought it would be, she is also asking for a full months refund.  I told her ask for this refund in the cancellation form that I just sent her, but that Patti Baron the one who will get the form when submitted will be the one to decide whether or not that happens.  I offered to go over her plan again with her, but she declined.  She said it just wasn''t a good fit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-05 08:51:47', '2021-02-05 08:51:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063331008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929005', 'Cynthia Bermea', NULL, 'Cynthia needed help in accessing the MPB.Health portal- I sent her the link and username and password per Diane. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-05 08:45:27', '2021-02-05 08:45:27'),
