  ('zcrm_1579374000063305003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165370', 'Amanda Salzman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  She has been cancelled out of HES.  No refund needed as no payment was received', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-05 07:16:28', '2021-02-05 07:16:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063280016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062248001', 'Melissa Blatt', 'E&O Update', 'Spoke with Melissa about updating her E&amp;O with us for $25 a month since the E&amp;O she has on file with us does not cover specific MPB Medical Cost Sharing.  And this is the new policy moving forward. 
-Also discussed a possible new enrollee for her.
-Discussed the $100 referral fee for those sending business her way.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-04 18:16:53', '2021-02-06 04:58:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063280008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046483021', 'Rochelle Kirkwood', 'Check to see if there is an Open Need', '- May 2, 2020, one day after start date, member went into the hospital. The hospital gave her an application for ACCESS Insurance to help pay the cost of the one night visit.
- At that point, member did not realize she needed to reach out to us and Sedera to Open a Needs.
-Bill starting coming about a month later
-From what she remembers she opened the Need up with Sedera
-She is trying to reconcile what ACCESS and Sedera has paid.
-She is working with Lizzy Moore with Sedera to see how much they over paid her since ACCESS paid the whole bill.
-Told member I would reach out Lizzy Moore  at Sedera to check the status of this situation.
- Phone was disconnected in the middle of the conversation, however, I called her back and left a message that I would reach out to Lizzy Moore tomorrow to see what we can do to close this Need.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-04 17:27:17', '2021-02-04 17:30:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063244043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689074', 'Frank Becvar', NULL, '2-4-21 I was not informed of this cancellation in advance. However, I just let Cari Adams Waneka know so she can try to get the client back and under her account now, since they are Cari''s neighbors and long time friends. We will see...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-04 17:21:36', '2021-02-04 17:21:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063244038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '2-4-21 Bobbi enrolled in Bright Health Silver $0 Direct. I completed her enrollment directly on Bright Health''s site. It would not allow me to put in her payment info yet. I suspect they have to approve it before they allow her to pay since out of open enrollment. I uploaded her proof of Cobra ending 2/28/21. Total cost is $1415.20 which is lower than it was on C4. Benefit of going direct I guess! App is showing as Pending. I told her to put note on her calendar to make sure she''s heard from Bright Health to set up her auto payment. She agreed. All set and appreciative. Says they should invite me over for dinner. :-)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-04 17:14:23', '2021-02-04 17:14:23'),
