  ('zcrm_1579374000063208023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, 'had to explain the pre-x clause to Melissa- she said she was completely unaware of this.  She would like a call from Wendy.  I also told her that Debbie''s information wasn''t ALL of the information that she needed.  She can present herself as a self pay patient, ask for the best cash discount and submit her bills to Zion.I sent her the link for Zion needs submission. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-04 13:51:51', '2021-02-04 13:51:51'),
