  ('zcrm_1579374000063244013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '2-4-21 I spoke with Mike Bechtol today about Etta''s doctor visit that was never scheduled through Redirect with her doctor. She showed up and they had no record of the appointment. She rescheduled for Friday. She was not pleased needless to say. He could see the notes. He''s going to call her now to make sure she''s 100% set moving forward so she doesn''t experience any further problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-04 12:56:54', '2021-02-04 12:56:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063244008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889096', 'Samantha Wilson', NULL, '2-4-21 I reached Mike Bechtol and he could see that Redirect reached her at 12:31 just after I was notified about how pissed she was for not getting a response from them.  Mike is going to call her himself to make sure she''s all set moving forward. He was nice and helpful. Will be taken care of.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-04 12:54:46', '2021-02-04 12:54:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063217028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740011', 'Kathleen VanGoethem', NULL, '-Called and left message with Kathleen regarding her card. I let her know the message received from Eric at Planstin which was:  

