  ('zcrm_1579374000063208013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889096', 'Samantha Wilson', NULL, 'Samantha called in berating us because she thought we were Redirect Health.  I explained that we were not Redirect Health.  She told me that she scheduled an appointment with Redirect last week, and when she showed up to her doctors office today she told me that the office staff didn''t have an appointment for her and told her that they would not reach out to Redirect on her behalf.  I explained that Wendy and I would do whatever we could to reach out to the management team on her behalf, so I filled out a form through Redirect''s  extra help page, Wendy will get a hold of Robert- since he seems to have better connections than she does, and now she is calling Samantha back for support. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-04 12:34:18', '2021-02-04 12:34:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063244003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889096', 'Samantha Wilson', NULL, '2-4-21 Left vm for Samantha bc she spoke with Kelly Anne and super pissed bc Redirect isn''t responding in a timely fashion for her doctor visit. I left Robert a vm too. I left Mike Bechtol a vm yesterday for another client. I will try him again now. Kelly Anne is submitting the Extra Help form as well now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-04 12:32:17', '2021-02-04 12:32:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063242008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889096', 'Samantha Wilson', NULL, '2/3/21 Member called not knowing what membership she had and tells me that they made an appointment with her gyn.  The gyn had no idea from what she tells me about an appointment.  I  suggested she call self direct..DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-02-04 12:30:28', '2021-02-04 15:02:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063241014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126003', 'Christopher Martine', NULL, 'Received notification from Sedera that this member was cancelled therefore I refunded 2/21 MCS .', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-04 12:28:59', '2021-02-04 12:28:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063208008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, 'called to make sure that she was getting her 1099- I told her that they just arrived at our office this week and will be sent to her shortly. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-04 12:15:58', '2021-02-04 12:15:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063242003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447266', 'Ruhi Khan', NULL, 'Ruhi called and was very frustrated with a few issues. She told me that there are 3 incidences that happened while she was still on her Co-Pay plan with us. She stated that all 3 of these issues have been filed with RCI and processed but the payment have not been sent out still. All of these happened back in November. For a very long time the actual doctor office has been calling Ruhi for payment and the doctor has even called RCI for payment and all RCI keeps saying is they will send it out ASAP and has not. Ruhi is very upset by this and says it is unacceptable. She will NOT pay for it. When she called she instantly asked for John because he has helped he out in the past with these issue and I told her that John is not part of member services anymore and that I can certainly help her out. After she told me everything I let her know that the only thing that I can really do is just call RCI and ask that these payment get sent out and expedited NOW. After she then started explaining to me what the doctor appointments were for I realized that 2 out of 3 were not RCI related at all and when I told her that she say No they are because of the Co-Pay plan and that they were covered. I was confused so I tried calling Joan Phelps who I am supposed to call when it comes to something I can not handle or do not know. Come to find out Joan does not have a phone and she is not even set up with the phone system, so there is no way to get in contact with Joan to call other than teams and that is not how the phone system works with members. I tried calling Joan''s cell phone and she did not answer. This is also only a few minutes after getting off a conference call on Teams with Joan. So I had to go to John and ask if he could help me with this because I have no one else. He asked me to get Ruhi''s phone number and he will call her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-04 11:39:16', '2021-02-04 11:39:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063241003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691226', 'Dolores Pope', NULL, 'Left VM for this member about 2nd decline gave her until end of day to get pmt update in.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-04 10:48:29', '2021-02-04 10:48:29'),
