  ('zcrm_1579374000063213006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297409', 'Lauri Wakefield', NULL, '02.04.21:  spoke with Lauri.  Learned that they have used several MCS services (LHS, etc.) in the last 4 years.  Determined  SECURE w/a $1000 IUA is the best plan for her and her husband.  She will be adding a DPC membership to this plan for herself only, as her husband wants a male doctor and the doctor she chose is female.  They want to be covered w/a MEC in terms of any ACA requirements coming into effect, so she''ll be paying for both MPB and DPC memberships. We scheduled her enrollment process for 2/16/21 at 10 a.m.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-02-04 09:42:45', '2021-02-04 09:46:56'),
