  ('zcrm_1579374000063173008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165370', 'Amanda Salzman', NULL, '2-3-21 Interested in SECURE or CARE+. Thinking about if it''s worth setting up HSA for tax benefits or not. She''s a minimalist on that front. The only health stuff she''s done in past year is she froze her eggs and doesn''t believe she will have any issues. None so far. Also does some acunpuncture that she''s willing to pay for on her own if needed. Paying $449 now and can instead pay $275 or $215. Earns $300K so tax benefits can be good.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-03 17:07:24', '2021-02-03 17:07:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063173003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967156', 'Alexandria Wright', NULL, '2-3-21 Wants dental which I sent her information via Spirit/Ameritas for family.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-03 15:21:28', '2021-02-03 15:21:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063161008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, 'Dhai called in and asked if a chiropractor was covered with her plan. I told her no BUT I could use Tivity and look and see if the chiropractor she was recommended was on the list for a coupon. I looked and he was not on the list but I told her how Tivity works and she was thrilled with the service. She said she is only looking for someone to go to like twice a year because she gets migraines and needs to see a chiropractor that specifically does upper spine cervical on her neck area. She does not want someone that is long term all the time. That is why she choose this plan because she does not go to the doctor very often. Dhai absolutely loved the idea of Tivity and I set her up with getting to the site herself and she went to register. There was something wrong with the link of some sorts (she called back and spoke to Kelly Anne). Kelly Anne told this to Ali and Ali is working on getting it fixed. Very very please member even though what she needs is not covered, I was still able to provide her with services that she can at least save money on. Very happy. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-03 15:15:44', '2021-02-03 15:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063164003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238273', 'Jennifer Bradfield', NULL, '2/3/21  Member called concerning the wife getting a mammogram.  They have a self-direct plan with Sedera.  Member has no MEC.  I told him that it was an out of pocket expense, then he should open up a need and submit payment because they do pay for mammograms, colonoscopies, and Immunizations. DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-02-03 14:43:49', '2021-02-03 14:44:09'),
