  ('zcrm_1579374000063122018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'Etta called in because she was in a primary doctors waiting room, she had called Redirect a week and a half ago to set up an appointment.  But when she got into the office today they told her that no one had called or made payment on her behalf.  Etta tried calling Redirect 8 times this morning with the only response being a message that stated "someone will contact you at 12:30".  Her appointment was for 11:30.  I went to the redirect extra help page and sent a message to them on Etta''s behalf.  Letting them know that she was still in the lobby of the provider''s office, and that she needs immediate assistance.  This is for her preventative wellness visit.  So it should be covered 100%.  Wendy called Mike Bechtol and left a vm as well.  I told the member that we would do everything on our end to resolve this situation for her today by reaching out to Redirect''s mngmt team on her behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-03 11:55:08', '2021-02-03 11:55:08'),
