  ('zcrm_1579374000063119003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480177', 'Andrea Rice', NULL, 'member called 2/1/21 wanting to talk to Patty about billing.  I told her Patty was in a meeting and she insisted on at least leaving a message...so I transferred her. DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-02-03 08:14:50', '2021-02-03 08:14:50'),
