  ('zcrm_1579374000063089003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091256', 'Cynthia Shiko', NULL, 'sent welcome call scheduler to Cynthia per Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-03 07:08:59', '2021-02-03 07:08:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062988047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, '2-2-21 Sara and Lori called in a panic because HCBB was telling Sara they may need to delay her knee surgery which is scheduled for Friday, Feb. 5th, in 3 days. She needs a special 3 day covid test at a partner clinic of the surgery center. Apparently Jamie with HCBB told her that is separate and won''t be shared as part of the surgery. I spoke with Tim Hirsch at Zion to find out how to handle this situation and to keep on schedule. He said they just need her medical records and it will take 24 hours to review and approve.  She obtained her records directly from the provider and I forwarded them to Dr. Jeff Lee and KellyAnne to give to Jamie. Now suddenly Jamie said she had them already but just never sent them to Zion. At one point they thought Vince with HCBB forgot to forward them to Zion but now discover it was Jamie. Either way, everyone has all of the records. HCBB negotiated down from full price of $29881 and reference price of $23462 to $8095 plus HCBB fee to total $9945 which is a savings of $13517!  Also Tim game verbal agreement that the special covid test is included in the sharing cost of the surgery. Sara got the test and is all set to go moving forward. She will also forward me the email she just received from their Needs Dept at Zion! Onward! Sara and Lori are immensely appreciative of my assistance with this. They had no idea which was to turn anymore. They thanked me many times over!  I should have them write a referral some day.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-02 15:17:12', '2021-02-02 15:18:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063001021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, 'New plan: Member Only $500 IUA DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-02 14:39:40', '2021-02-02 14:39:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063025038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044279010', 'Helena Hofer', NULL, 'Good afternoon Josh,

Thanks for reaching out, I spoke with Helena about this before.  She does have preventative mammogram covered at 100%  in network, I believe the bill that she is trying to submit is for ultrasound not mammogram.  And ultrasound is not one of the services mandated by the ACA- and not a covered expense by her RCI plan.  I just left a message with her for clarification, but I believe that is the case, and what she expressed to me was the frustration.

I will update you as to what our conversation is when she calls me back, but it may be a good thing to reach out to her yourself to see where her confusion lies and see if there is anything that can be done.

Please let me know if you have any questions!






Kind regards,

Kelly Anne Cheever
MPB.Health Concierge
1-800-519-2969 ext 1008', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-02 14:35:37', '2021-02-02 14:35:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063025033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044279010', 'Helena Hofer', NULL, 'Hello MPowering Benefits,


