  ('zcrm_1579374000063015038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, 'This member stil had questions re: HSA Set up.  I resent email to Juliann''s email with link to open an Individual account.  I also sent Provider lookup instructions as she had questions about Preventative and providers.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-02 10:03:18', '2021-02-02 10:03:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063025018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, 'I helped Mary Ann with finding in network providers with Zion Health- also sent her a link to look on her own. Confirmed that Cleveland Clinic is in network in case she or her husband would like to go there for Covid if they need too.  Sent member comment form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-02 09:54:19', '2021-02-02 09:54:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063015033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578731', 'Ryan Tuinstra', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove spouse that has gotten pregnant in the waiting period.  She will have other coverage eff 3/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-02 09:43:52', '2021-02-02 09:43:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063025013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578731', 'Ryan Tuinstra', NULL, 'Ryan called to remove his wife from the plan because she found out that she is pregnant. Sent member change form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-02 08:44:08', '2021-02-02 08:44:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063004008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056599123', 'Elizabeth Baker', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in and said that she has been having pain in her hip and back and wanted to know what her options are. I see that she has Sedera so I explained that she is cash pay up to her IUA of $5000. Anything over that she needs to contact Sedera and start a Need with them. She thought she had to get it approved first. I told her not necessarily but it is a good idea to call Sedera and let them know what is going on so they know ahead of time and can start the process just in case she goes over her IUA. She thanked me very much and will call them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-02-02 08:38:23', '2021-02-02 08:38:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063025008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570050', 'Silvina Irimia', NULL, 'SEE TICKET!!!!!!!!!!! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-02 08:28:37', '2021-02-02 08:28:37'),
