  ('zcrm_1579374000063015013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467102', 'Jacqueline Saporito', NULL, 'Sally called in asking about a mammogram for this member from 2019 that is now in collections.  I asked if it was a screening Mammo, asked if it was coded correctly.  Then gave her RCI contact number to ask why it was rejected.  She then asked who was this member''s Concierge, I advised that whoever answers the phone would be able to help the member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-02 07:30:43', '2021-02-02 07:30:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063015008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055292101', 'Lori Zubrod', NULL, 'Member called in and siad that she will have state coverage as of 3/1.  I sent out the Cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-02 07:11:28', '2021-02-02 07:11:28'),
