  ('zcrm_1579374000062987040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571152', 'Wayne Porter', 'Welcome Call Email', 'Member called to say that he had not received his Welcome Call Email.  I tried multiple times to send  to the primary address.  We opted to send it to a new address which is his gmail account.  It went through immediately.

Member was satisfied and looking forward to finding out more about his plan.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-01 17:08:04', '2021-02-01 17:08:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063001016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297409', 'Lauri Wakefield', NULL, '02.01.21:  Recvd. email from Lauri.  They are interested in SECURE due to the ACA ramping up again.  They don''t need an HSA.  She wants to schedule a call and gave me possible times.  I explained they need to have a bus. I.D., evidence of self-employment or 1099 status to get SECURE.  I offered a few times to set up a call.  We decided on Thursday at 10 a.m.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-02-01 16:33:57', '2021-02-04 07:57:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063001011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297409', 'Lauri Wakefield', NULL, '01.31.21:  Responded to Lauri''s email.  Sent link to click funnel and pricing for Secure and Care+.  Sugested we schedule a call to further discuss her needs.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-02-01 16:30:10', '2021-02-01 16:30:10'),
