  ('zcrm_1579374000062984028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, 'I never received a message back from Tim about this.....I checked in with Suzanne and she still hasn''t had any luck getting ahold of anyone at the center. But she is calm.  I told her to hang in there.   And that I will be in touch with her tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-01 14:55:00', '2021-02-01 14:55:00'),
