-Will send out email', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-01 14:03:44', '2021-02-01 14:03:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062984023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522128', 'Keira Gannon', NULL, 'Called to be reminded of how to gain access to preventative care benefits.  I sent over the preventative care templates and explained what was contained in them before doing so. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-01 13:54:46', '2021-02-01 13:54:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000063001003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, '2.1.21:  Lisa emailed me her spreadsheet of pricing for all aspects of her maternity/labor medical package.  I forwarded this to Rod, Robert and John.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-02-01 13:23:18', '2021-02-01 13:23:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062984018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, 'Suzanne''s oncology appointment was cancelled today because they didn''t accept her Planstin card.  I have reached out to Tim so that someone on his team can reach out to the facility and "smooth the rails" on her behalf.  I also told Suzanne to explain that she IS a self pay patient and that her Planstin card only covers the 63+ ACA mandated services.   She has gone over her IUA of $1000, so Zion will need to step in sooner than later on her behalf today anyway. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-01 13:10:01', '2021-02-01 13:10:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062964047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, 'I spoke to Robin re shingles shot.  Explained situation and a little bit about preventative.  Went into the challenges of the finding someone in the network that has the vaccine.  Also spoke about Covid shots being something that would be handled by provided by provider vs govt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-01 13:09:35', '2021-02-01 13:09:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062987025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032122001', 'Eileen Fagan', 'Follow up from DPC Plan Discussion', 'Reached out to Member.  She has currently  decided to stay with what she has since she doesn''t see any major difference in the two plans at this time.  We  did check the Tivity site to find out how many Chiropractors are within a closer range than 15 miles.  Member was informed there was only one.
Member appreciated the follow up.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-01 13:06:51', '2021-02-01 13:06:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062964042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042073021', 'Karen Throener', NULL, 'I was unable to contact member via email or phone so I called Misty and asked if she could be in contact with this member re: cancellation &amp; plan expiring.  Misty said that they do Medicare so she can help her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-01 12:56:03', '2021-02-01 12:56:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062984013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, 'sent out HSA info to Julianne per Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-01 12:46:05', '2021-02-01 12:46:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062964037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042073021', 'Karen Throener', NULL, 'Sent email to member after trying to call and not being able to leave a VM .  She will be turning 65 2/8 and will be off the plan.  Need to get cancellation from her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-01 12:45:01', '2021-02-01 12:45:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062988008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063000020', 'Kim Reichhelm', NULL, '2-1-21 Kim is 60 years old and has primary residency in OR and lives in Mexico part of the year. Has doctors in FL and CO. BUT, she has back issues now. She has a spinal fusion years ago but that causes ongoing pain and pressure on other discs. Also had hip surgery in July of 2019 and has been treating for parasites which caused liver issue recently. Also had 4 shoulder surgeries between 1997-2017. Those aren''t causing any issues now. Paying $1097 a month for Vumi which is insurance through Mexico but also doesn''t cover her back. She really wants to find something that will work with her pre-x but knows she doesn''t want ACA plans that are offered since she hears terrible things about those too. She will keep looking around. This isn''t ideal for her. Her issues won''t be shared due to pre-x clause. No tobacco and healthy otherwise. Sounds like she earns too much for subsidy as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-01 12:34:48', '2021-02-01 12:34:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062964032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529781', 'Robert Johnston', NULL, 'Relieved email from member asking about the "individual mandate".  I advised that that was repealed back in 2019 and are no longer required to have Minimum Essential Coverage.  However some states had State mandate Colorado not being one of them.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-01 12:22:25', '2021-02-01 12:22:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062964027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, 'Debbie asked me to speak w/member abut Shingles shot in and outs of how to get.  I called member and got her VM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-01 12:15:22', '2021-02-01 12:15:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062964022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467102', 'Jacqueline Saporito', NULL, 'Sally verified that this member is not a contractor so she must be changed to Care +.  I will notify Zion and refund difference of $60', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-01 12:01:39', '2021-02-01 12:01:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062987015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, '-Called Bruce back and told him that at this time we are still working on the few people that are unable to get into their portable.
-As a work around, Member was advised to call us for anything that had to do with  change of membership forms or prescription forms
-Also, had member go to the Member Portal and explained the new Member Assistance Program.  Member was given access code to get in.  Member was also told that the New Cards were being mailed out this month to all members.
-He also said  his wife was able to finally connect with CirrusMd and he said yes and that she was treated.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-02-01 11:15:06', '2021-02-01 11:15:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062964017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091788', 'Ben Sargent', NULL, 'Member called in with many questions, he wanted some "proof" as to what option he had.  I told him what he had.  I made sure he understood what the IUA was .   I explained differences in all the cards and what everyone did.  Explained how to present at appts. Also told him that he needs to register for Cirrus.  Explained to him that he would be getting info about MAP to be looking for that.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-01 11:07:52', '2021-02-01 11:07:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062984008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, 'SEE TICKET. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-01 10:50:44', '2021-02-01 10:50:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062988003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447500', 'Clove Berger', NULL, '2-1-21 Clove''s husband had a broken ankle in Sept. It''s all healed but he does have a plate in it. She was just curious if that plate needs to come out sometime what happens and I explained pre-x clause. She''s not too worried. She''s more concerned about getting her annual physical done, mammo, etc. She wants to switch for March 1st if possible. Also husband had stitches in forehead which she''s going to make sure they submit the bills right away since has $500 IUA. Not sure if cost is $600 or $1000.  She also wants dental and one daughter will likely need ortho. Likes Boulder Orthodontics but Dr. Lang is no longer showing on their website. She''s going to call them. She will call me back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-01 10:43:00', '2021-02-01 10:43:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062984003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, 'gave her Jennifer Chasteen''s info at RCI to help her with her billing.  Also explained why cologuard is not a covered expense and sent her the ACA mandated list. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-02-01 10:07:05', '2021-02-01 10:07:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062964012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049932121', 'Natividad Buros', NULL, '2/21 decline - after not receiving any response from Jamie (spouse) I sent final notice  2/4-spoke to Jamie nad advised him I would give him rest of day to submit Pmt update then I would have to cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-02-01 07:56:52', '2021-02-05 08:15:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062942003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Called Samantha and left message to  thanked her for the lead of Frank and Sandra Rzuck.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-29 16:40:29', '2021-01-29 16:40:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062932021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297409', 'Lauri Wakefield', NULL, '01.29.21:  No response to date.  Emailed Lauri - asked to schedule a call.  
