  ('zcrm_1579374000062928018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921634', 'Joanna Lyons', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Member is a bit overwhelmed by the plan....especially because she says that the IUA was not explained properly to her.  I sensed that it threw her off.  But I explained to her that THIS is why the MPB Concierge team is there for her....to help her learn how to use all of the tools and resources.  To empower her into making all of this a breeze.  She was also daunted by preventative care- again....I explained that preventative care will be the most daunting because it is the only true insurance component of the plan.  I am reaching out to Planstin/Zion  to ask that they send her a new batch of PDF copies of her cards.  She is completely overwhelmed with the amount of emails that she has been getting from all of the vendors involved, so I thought that it would make it easier if it was sent again and at the "top of the pile".  Letting Wendy know because Andrea is still out of her office. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-29 12:41:26', '2021-01-29 12:41:26'),
