  ('zcrm_1579374000062928008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, 'from recent ticket-
Maria wanted to know if she could get into the Swedish Medical Center in Englewood Co- for a covered Wellness visit through the PHCS network BECAUSE her friend works there and told her that the facility bought A LOT of Covid vaccines.  I explained to Maria that I would try my best, BUT that the Covid vaccine would be an out of pocket expense because as of 1/28 is has still not been listed as one of the 64+ preventative care services that are mandated by the ACA (I sent her a link for reference).  Maria was ok with that- she just wants to get the vaccine.  So I looked in the PHCS network for Swedish Medical Center- I could only find one INTERNIST that was showing in network at that facility associated with Swedish Medical Center.  I sent her that information.  She called that number and apparently he is NOT associated with the Swedish Medical Center.  I told Maria that my advice would be to call the facility and ask them if any of their Internist''s participate in the PHCS network so that she knows with certainty that this is even an option for her.  I tagged Wendy as well last night for support because I gave this advice after hours and I wanted to make sure that the member was helped right away.  Closed- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-29 09:25:23', '2021-01-29 09:25:23'),
