  ('zcrm_1579374000062861003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243659', 'Karen Meyer', NULL, 'I reached out to Jennifer Chasteen (RCI) and left a voice message regarding an email from Terri Romey from RCI. 
Terry had sent me a message via email regarding Karen''s bill.  I then called Terri directly and asked her to cross reference to be sure she is not in their system.  She could find her no where.  I will do some further investigation.

1:30 After further reading of the notes, I misread the Preventative Company as RCI when it should have been ASi. I then reached out to Nancy at ASi and she reviewed the Coding of the visit and found that it should have been preventative.  She wants to take it to her supervisor for further clarification.  
