  ('zcrm_1579374000062840003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563343', 'Amy Simon', NULL, 'Jeff reached out to me about his client, Amy Simon.  He said that for the last two weeks he has been trying to reach out to Amy- but with no response.  He apologized that we are in the mess that we are in with this member, he is to meet with her tomorrow to try to smooth things over on this end.  Jeff and I spoke about the importance of Zion/Planstin getting their cards out promptly- we both wonder if this isn''t the main reason she was "turned off" all of the sudden by the plan.  Jeff says that Amy was a Liberty member- but you would "think" she came from traditional health insurance by the way she has been reacting to us and the plan.  He is going to update me after their meeting tomorrow and I thanked him for the added support. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-28 08:48:27', '2021-01-28 08:48:27'),
