  ('zcrm_1579374000062794014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549095', 'Sean Frankhouse', NULL, 'Sean called me and told me that he wanted to re-instate his plan.  told him it was too late for that.  He told me that teh Redirect option was not working out for him lots of billing problems, accounts going into collections etc.  I told him to get in touch with Robin and see what other options were out there.  I will email him Robin''s contact info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-27 13:02:46', '2021-01-27 13:02:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062813018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, '1-27-21 Annie wanted to change her plan bc she''s pregnant and earning less money. But, she still doesn''t qualify for a tax credit. Her income is at $55K in the system and her best guess is $40K for 2021. It was $39K for 2020. Either way, she doesn''t qualify for a subsidy so her plan choices don''t change. Therefore, it''s not considered a qualifying event according to healthcare.gov - "Other qualifying events - Changes in your income that affect the coverage you qualify for."
 She just wanted a lower ded plan. But, understands pregnancy will still probably cost the same when it''s all done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-27 12:19:05', '2021-01-27 12:20:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062817011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', 'Colonoscopy', 'Member called to confirm her doctor was in network for her colonoscopy for Feb 17.  Dr. Robert Levine and Boulder Medical Center are both in Network.  
Member also asked if Walgreen''s was in Network for the script prior to the procedure.  Member was told that Walgreen''s is in Network with Citizen''s Rx. (after confirming with RCI)
2:30 Left message with member regarding information.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-27 11:53:26', '2021-01-27 12:46:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062813013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904449', 'Hein Brutsaert', NULL, '1-27-21 Spoke with him to update his payment information bc of some issue. He was driving and will check his email to fix the problem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-27 11:53:00', '2021-01-27 11:53:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062817003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', 'Prescriptions and Pharmacy', 'Due to the nature of this situation, I reached out to RCI to confirm that she was with Citizen''s Rx.  I spoke with Emily and she stated that at one point RCI was with Welldine and in July 2020 they switched back to Citizen''s Rx.  However, RCI has her listed with Citizen''s Rx.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-27 11:33:56', '2021-01-27 13:39:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062805030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058265123', 'Xiao Neng March', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Registered with CirrusMD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-27 10:54:55', '2021-01-27 10:54:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062814008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, 'called in for billing support- transferred line to Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-27 10:53:22', '2021-01-27 10:53:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062814003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007637033', 'Nancy Elgie', NULL, 'SEE OPEN ON HOLD TICKET!!!- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-27 10:48:21', '2021-01-27 10:48:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062813008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '1-27-21 James also needs to upload his newest Need which was $1200 to get the $200 reimbursed and count towards 1 of their 3 Needs per year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-27 10:46:27', '2021-01-27 10:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062813003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '1-27-21 James was NOT able to get Ivermectin through CirrusMD. His friend got it from a childhood friend who''s now a doctor. That family took ivermectin while exposed to another family member who had covid. The family member with covid got better in a day and the rest of the family never got covid. James fortunately didn''t get covid either. But, the drs. aren''t allowed to prescribe it yet!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-27 10:42:05', '2021-01-27 10:42:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062794009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608685', 'Christian Hager', NULL, '2/21 payment declined I will send out notice', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-27 10:09:32', '2021-01-27 10:09:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062772046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459043', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, '1-26-21 Laura got a bill from long ago for her annual wellness visit but RCI was telling her she''s no longer a member. She is a member and has been ongoing. Patti looked into it and she was somehow cancelled in Nov. of 2020. This happened at the same time they removed family members. Something got messed up at that time. Patti contacted RCI and got her reinstated appropriately with the correct ongoing membership. Patti instructed me to have her wait a few days before she resubmits her bills from the wellness visit, to give RCI/Apex time to update their records. They are also going to send her new, updated cards. She should be all set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-26 16:51:53', '2021-01-26 16:51:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062772041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679158', 'Cheryl Stephenson', NULL, '1-26-21 Cheryl chose some other alternative insurance bc she couldn''t handle the paperwork according to her cancellation form. She was considering joining her boyfriend''s plan, but I don''t believe that was allowed. She thinks this other option will be easier.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-26 16:47:51', '2021-01-26 16:47:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062772036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '1-26-21 Marie-Christine Carel emailed with concerns that Ann has no idea how her membership works and is complaining bc a knee issue isn''t "covered." She never completed her Welcome Call. I''ve put her in touch with KellyAnne to complete the Welcome Call and get her oriented in how to address a knee issue to get the costs shared above $1000. She''s completely lost and confused.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-26 16:46:06', '2021-01-26 16:46:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062772031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939079', 'Patricia Mitchell', NULL, '1-26-21 Needing assistance to submit wellness visit/Quest Diagnostic lab from May 2020 wellness visit. Put her in touch with Concierge.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-26 16:27:42', '2021-01-26 16:27:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062772018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, '1-26-21 Kristy called and I connected her with Patti to fix bank account since it was new account as of Dec. 2020.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-26 15:59:20', '2021-01-26 15:59:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062701060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964449', 'Nazaria Molina', NULL, 'Thsi enrollment was totally screwed up by Jane.  Member put his name in both Primary &amp; spouse area.  I notified Planstin of the change and the need for new cards.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-26 14:55:01', '2021-01-26 14:55:01');
