  ('zcrm_1579374000062701055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, 'Member submitted new payment info.  I updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-26 14:08:49', '2021-01-26 14:08:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062701047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000316', 'Symone Sandquist', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel via RCI portal notify Sedera (via outlook) and cancel billing &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-26 13:42:22', '2021-01-26 13:42:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062701039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679158', 'Cheryl Stephenson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Sedera (via outlook) &amp; RCI and refund 2/1/pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-26 13:32:30', '2021-01-26 13:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062687058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', NULL, 'Completed a virtual call reviewing the Prescription plan and the questions Chuck had sent me. One the main reason for the call is the confusion of which pharmacies are in Network with Citizen''s Rx.  

Member stated that she called Citizen''s Rx and they couldn''t find her in the system.  She is very frustrated because she had to pay $100 for birth control which she has never done before.  She has always gone to Sam''s.  Sam''s said she was not in Network with them any longer. 

Discussed sending a the Walkin Lab Link for Chuck to review for his upcoming urology test..... well as Sedera''s information on Covid Testing.  


Explained how our prescription plan worked and they were thrilled.  I will be forwarding an email with all the information listed.

Member wants a follow up call on Friday, Jan 29.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-26 13:26:32', '2021-01-27 13:38:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062687053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, 'Bruce called back to say that he spoke with CirrusMD and they suggested he call us back on to add his wife to CirrusMD.
I checked the Eligibility File and her name is on the file that was sent to CirrusMD.  
I put in a ticket with CirrusMD on behalf of the member.
Member also complained he is still unable to get into his portal.  I will speak with John on member''s behalf.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-26 13:19:20', '2021-01-26 13:19:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062772013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, '1-26-21 Left vm for Kristy about issue with bank account rejecting payment for Jan. and Feb 2021. Told her to call main toll free line and talk with Patti. Also asked her to let me know when it''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-26 12:54:42', '2021-01-26 12:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062701034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459043', 'Laura Plummer', NULL, 'Per a call from Wendy I looked the reason why this member was having issues with her card.  I looked her up in the RCI portal and it was showing her as cancelled.  I contacted RCI and told them of the issue and they will reinstate her and also change her name.  Will get new cards out to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-26 12:43:56', '2021-01-26 12:43:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062772008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, '1-26-21 Carrie is a small biz owner and has 2-3 employees and possibly some PT folks that may want to join. She will pay for employee and they can choose if they want to pay for their family members. Carrie is 45 and husband is 52, employees, 31, 31, 34 and may be hiring emp in 20''s soon. March 1st is perfect. Told her deadline is 15th to get site going and 20th to get everyone enrolled for March 1st. Everyone is super healthy, no tobacco. This is important to her bc she''s a medical practitioner. She and husband have LHS now and are ready to move away. She was asking about Sedera but I told her the differences and challenges as group to enroll in Sedera. Plus she will have more benefits with the SECURE membership at the $1000 IUA level. I will send her the audio and overview to share with her employees to educate them. She will keep me posted over next few weeks. Understands this is great value to incentivize and retain employees. Super excited about this prospect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-26 12:36:00', '2021-01-26 12:36:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062701029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442456', 'Dhai Barr', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to update pmt info I sent link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-26 11:45:29', '2021-01-26 11:45:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062772003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091646', 'Carol Lovejoy', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Email verification sent to register with CirrusMD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-26 11:28:13', '2021-01-26 11:28:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062691036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, 'SEE TICKET. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-26 10:40:22', '2021-01-26 10:40:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062691026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091788', 'Ben Sargent', NULL, 'Member called in for support that he is doing everything by the book for his preventative care visit on Friday- I went over everything with him, as well as sent templates, this member was thrilled for the support! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-26 10:37:25', '2021-01-26 10:37:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062691021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Rita called in for help with her CirrusMD account-I reached out to Natalie @CirrusMD and this has now been resolved.  We discussed the difference between going in network for services OR forgetting that there is a network for all services outside of preventative care.  I sent some HCBB information as well as instructions on how to login herself. Very happy member, I let her know about our business hour changes as well! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-26 10:36:21', '2021-01-26 10:36:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062701024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921086', 'Rebekkah Boehm', NULL, 'members 2/21 payment declined for invalid acct number I left VM for member 2/1 - sent final notice', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-26 10:08:08', '2021-02-01 07:41:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062733008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'Michael called in and said that he was given lab work from his provider to go and get done. I asked if this was from a preventative wellness visit he had done and he said yes but the tests are above and beyond preventative. I let him know that there is no network for that and he can go anywhere of his choosing and present himself as a cash paying patient and get the best cash price that way. He is only responsible for the first $1000 of his IUA. He already knew that and understood, he just wanted to make sure he was doing the correct thing. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-01-26 09:48:58', '2021-01-26 09:48:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062701016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049932121', 'Natividad Buros', NULL, 'Spoke with Jamie who is a dependent about the decline "Account Closed"  I will send him out payment update form for updated payment method.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-26 09:48:05', '2021-01-26 09:48:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062691016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, 'to Jami @HCBB after my conversation with Suzanne-
Jami,

An update on Suzanne Picard, she has appointments with two breast specialist surgeon''s- tomorrow she has an appointment with one by the name of Stephanie Miller (303-296-13700) and next month she see''s another by the name of Stephen Johs (303-296-1370)  she has had the breast MRI with contrast done, and she is now out of pocket $750- the specialist visit tomorrow will probably put her over her IUA that she has with Zion of $1000.

After the results of the MRI- she is now either going to go with Lumpectomy with radiation tx- OR full mastectomy.

It will take these two visits with these doctors for her to make that decision.

She is not interested in reconstructive surgery.

She understands why you cannot help her with radiation tx and chemo drugs, but she is thrilled that you are willing to help her negotiate this burdensome surgery.  She will let me know the exact CPT code of the surgery that is to be preformed as soon as she gets some clearer guidance from her doctors.

Thank you so much for all that you do!

Kelly Anne Cheever

MPB.Health Concierge

1-800-519-2969 ext 1008', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-26 09:12:32', '2021-01-26 09:12:32'),
