  ('zcrm_1579374000062701003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063804100', 'Roger Gaudreau', NULL, '01.23.21:  Recvd. quote request from Amy.  Interested in SECURE for herself and her husband w/a $2500 IUA.  Non smoker.  Called - l/m to c/b.  Amy returned my call.  Discussed SECURE plan.  She seems interested but has to discuss it with her husband.  Emailed her link to my click funnel.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-01-25 15:15:25', '2021-01-29 10:10:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062692023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062699001', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '1-25-21 See notes under Michael Remacle. Hillary
Email michael@remacle.com
Phone 3034191697
Account # 8535675600
Plan Name Friday Bronze HSA X
Plan ID 63312CO0600037-01

Hi — I’m having a terrible experience with Friday health, my MRI a was denied saying Cu not covered now— not to mention my Mammogram experience last week - wasted 4 hours of my day, when they told me BCH Boulder community hospital was covered then to get there, and they said it wasn’t. Had to leave mammogram - to come back to talk to Friday health to be told oops a mistake, you are in network.

Also, my deductible is 6,900 $
Not 6k which we discussed.
They are having all kinds of problems—
To find now they aren’t covering my MRI due to CU sports not being in-network, however when we called and confirmed twice that they were.
I am disappointed we switched from Blue cross - as it’s basically the same plan, but they covered all these places. Now, I’m having issues of where to get a MRI.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-25 14:58:35', '2021-01-25 14:58:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062687048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, '-Member Laura  called to find out how to get on Cirrus MD.  I checked with Cirrus MD to see if they were registered.  He has already registered and member was advised to speak with her husband about adding her to the platform. She is interested in speaking with someone on there regarding Women''s Wellness.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-25 14:55:11', '2021-01-25 14:55:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062692018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026552012', 'Karen W. Isaac', NULL, '1-25-21 Left vm for Karen about expired cc and gave her instructions to update it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-25 14:39:28', '2021-01-25 14:39:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062692013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', NULL, '1-25-21 Ricki called to ask how to go about do wellness colonoscopy. I told her the card to use and gave some basic instructions over vm. Told her to call Concierge for further assistance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-25 14:35:40', '2021-01-25 14:35:40'),
