  ('zcrm_1579374000062692008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768243', 'Haley Collins', NULL, '1-25-21 Called bc confused by billing. She enrolled on the last day of Dec. and was billed on Jan 4th or so for Jan. Then she was just billed on the 20th for Feb.  It''s all on track. I left her a vm to explain.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-25 12:01:04', '2021-01-25 12:01:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062692003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176111', 'Lisa Carnahan', NULL, '1-25-21 On Lisa''s cancellation form, "I now have employer coverage. That I wouldn''t have to pay providers as a "self-pay" and which is the higher rate. Subsidy from my employer." She said she had no welcome call and education post enrollment! I received no word of the cancellation prior.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-25 11:55:31', '2021-01-25 11:55:31'),
