  ('zcrm_1579374000062687003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, 'Eric has a mouth injury- I explained that the only charges that will be shareable with Sedera are the ones that are medically coded.  I sent him the Sedera Portal instructions so that he has a jump start on that.  I transferred the line to Wendy to see if she had any ideas outside the box to help him on the dental end of things. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-25 09:58:58', '2021-01-25 09:58:58'),
