  ('zcrm_1579374000062661008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584155', 'Hali Nurnberg', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change Form to add newborn son.  I advised of the price change also that I need SS# when they get and also Sedera will need proof of DPC coverage.  Upon authorization I will charge the difference of $144 for 2/1/21.  I will submit to Sedera via outlook.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-25 07:46:07', '2021-01-25 07:49:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062661003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674173', 'Ellen Tresnak', NULL, 'Member emailed that she was still being charged The pricing for the $5000 IUA.  I realized that this had not been changed in FTNI.  I emailed member offering to only charge her for 1 month and changed MCS going forward.  I will await response from member.  Per email ok with member to charge $116', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-25 07:22:53', '2021-01-25 12:22:26'),
