  ('zcrm_1579374000062649016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220137', 'Deoni Levy', NULL, '1-22-21 Deoni called because she wanted to inquire for her 28 year old son, no pre-x, no meds, YES tobacco. He''s going to school at CU Anschutz and CU is wanting to charge them $433 a month for health insurance. He has to decide by Feb. 2nd. He has no taxable income so he''d have to choose Medicaid if not choosing school insurance. He needs Feb. 1st start date and already missed that deadline with MPB. He will be graduating in May and likely get benefits in June. So, Medicaid may be best for him. She was curious about herself as well. Described SECURE but she had back surgery in June of 2019 or close to that she thinks. Best to wait at last 24 months before moving to Zion. She and husband are both PT''s so didn''t go anywhere for PT after surgery. She''s paying $556 now and if can switch sometime it would be $495/$1000 or she removed her 21 year old daughter and it''s $275. She may call her soon to be 26 year old son to see if he wants to join CARE+ for $215/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-22 14:36:36', '2021-01-22 14:36:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062648008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, '1/22/20 member called wanting to speak to Planstin concerning a bill she received. I transfered her call to Planstin so she could speak to them.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-22 13:42:00', '2021-01-22 13:42:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062633033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921360', 'Maria Lorences-Cruz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Maria is a wonderful new member! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-22 13:40:59', '2021-01-22 13:40:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062645023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654119', 'ANDREA LEWIS', NULL, 'Member called to say that she received her Planstin Card.  Her question was which one does she use for her Preventative visit next month.  She stated that on her Welcome Call she found out her doctor was in network.  
I told her that there was no indication for her Preventative visit, but she would get the discount price of the visit since the doctor was in Network.  She asked if I could double check to make sure she did not have preventative and I told her that I would.
Diane Border and I chatted regarding this and Diane is going to get back to me once she has her documentation on what type of MEC she has.
- Action Item - Call member as soon as Diane lets me know how to proceed.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-22 13:10:34', '2021-01-22 13:10:34'),
