  ('zcrm_1579374000062644013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', 'Prescription', 'An email was sent by Lynn regarding her dilemma with the Rx.  Patti forwarded to me.  I contacted the Rx portion RCI and spoke with Jenny to see if there was an additional list of pharmacies she could contact regarding getting a fair price.  She stated that the member would need to call them directly at
