- As a side note, Deb handled this situation very professionally since I was in the same room with her when the call took place.  She offered several times to do the research for fair pricing and Lynn was very short and abusive with her.  Deb maintained professional composure at all times even up to the point of Lynn hanging up on her.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-22 12:05:58', '2021-01-22 12:05:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062649011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725056', 'Payton Hoops', NULL, '1-22-21 Payton cancelled due to "Getting insurance through my employer! It’s been a great service." She will refer people. Her new insurance will cost her less.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-22 11:45:15', '2021-01-22 11:45:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062649006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679158', 'Cheryl Stephenson', NULL, '1-22-21 Cheryl is considering moving to her boyfriend''s company''s insurance plan as a common law person. But, they do not file their taxes together. She doesn''t know the cost and thinks she can enroll any time. I told her to verify bc I don''t trust that''s possible re timing and common law scenario. She also has a torn meniscus and isn''t sure if she needs surgery. I told her to stay put until the knee issue is solved due to pre-x clause if she cancels and returns. I also described SECURE to her for future when knee is good, $275/$1000. She''s paying $368 now with Co-Pay and Sedera. Understands what she loses if cancels and comes back. Also her current membership is no longer offered. She is self-employed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-22 11:41:21', '2021-01-22 11:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062633023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959250', 'Brigitte Fleeman', NULL, 'explained why she doesn''t have access to the MPB.Health Portal- what it contains and how she can make  changes to billing and address by reaching out our her team. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-22 11:15:57', '2021-01-22 11:15:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062633018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, 'assisting Suzanne when finding out about a positive small mass that was found during a routine ultrasound.  I am asking HCBB if they can help since services will exceed $5000.  She is calling Zion today to let them know the situation, what she is doing today in getting a breast MRI- and letting them know that as soon as she gets the detailed medical receipts she will start uploading them! Suzanne has a wonderful spirit through this! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-22 11:14:24', '2021-01-22 11:14:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062648003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', NULL, '1/22/20 Member called wanting some prescription information.  I explained to her that I would send her a form to fill out and I would have some research completed and try to find the best price for her.  I also told her she could continue to use Citizen RX.  She was quite rude and said she does not want to go through this every time she goes to her doctor.  She wants her physician to call in a prescription to her local pharmacy.  I tried to tell her she could do that but it would be an out of pocket expense and I could possible check to see if I could get it for less through researching it.  She hung up on me.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-22 10:42:17', '2021-01-22 10:42:17'),
