  ('zcrm_1579374000062645013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539248', 'Levi Bowen', NULL, 'Member called in and said that he had to remove his spouse as they are now divorced.  Also email has to be changed.  I sent him the link to Member Change form and will have to refund him difference as he has already been charged', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-22 10:13:09', '2021-01-22 10:13:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062633013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692101', 'Kari Myroniuk', NULL, 'Member was given all of the information from Diane about the Care+ Plan not including preventative services- Diane also gave her the ACA links to the preventative care services that the Secure plan offers.  After talking with Diane, Vanessa and this member- the member was given all of the information- plan seems "like a lot of work, but I think I''m stuck with the Care+ Plan" - I assured her that we would help her with cost mitigation tools for labwork that is not "covered" by the ACA guidelines, but she will need to reach out to us first- use HCBB for line items- use sites like directlabs.com as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-22 10:10:03', '2021-01-22 10:10:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062633008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539248', 'Levi Bowen', NULL, 'called to make sure that his ex wife is removed from the plan- also wants to update address. I sent him a payment update form and transferred the line to Patti for the rest because he claims he has filled out a member change form already. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-22 10:02:33', '2021-01-22 10:02:33'),
