  ('zcrm_1579374000062598016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, '1-21-21 From Layton in Slack - We are reaching out to him.  He has been emailed as recently as the 18th and 3 of the 5 girls in the needs team says they have spoken with him.
@Wendy Scipione, if anything else like this happens, verify that they are calling Zion Healths toll free line. We have had situations where members of the team give out their direct lines and those team member leave, change positions, or the numbers are repurposed and no longer work.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-21 15:29:19', '2021-01-21 15:29:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062598011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, '1-18-21 Tom called bc has an open need which began in October-December. He''s submitted the bills and supporting ICD codes and docs for a number of visits all tied to the same medical issue. He just notified me that he has not yet been reimbursed for any of the expenses since he exceeded his IUA back in November. This seems far beyond the promised quick 5-7 day turnaround time to reimburse clients. Please advise me in what to tell this client. He''s owed $2500-$3000 at this point. 
I Slacked Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-21 15:28:27', '2021-01-21 15:28:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062598003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491580', 'Francis Lanzano', NULL, '1-21-21 Francis called bc he got a covid test for $100. But he thought the umbrella of his plan was Cigna and they obviously couldn''t process it since it has nothing to do with Cigna. So, he will resubmit it to Walgreens stating he''s a self-pay patient. He also wants to get the vaccine through Kaiser which he believes Kaiser is allowing members and non-members to obtain the vaccine through them.  He will also tell Kaiser he''s a self-pay patient. He''s all set for now. I also told him to use Nextera for covid test in the future. He will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-21 14:17:25', '2021-01-21 14:19:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062590031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563343', 'Amy Simon', NULL, 'Amy Simon is NOT happy- via email....I could not get her on the phone.  She''s that angry about her Zion/Planstin cards that were sent earlier this month....but wound up in Spam- she swore she never got them.  Eric resent them to her and another account Brooke Altman (this is her daughter) When Amy emailed me initially this upset I was to speak in a few minutes on the Affiliate training webinar.  I forwarded the email to Jeff Kanter and asked him to help me, explaining the situation.  I didn''t get a response.  What I could do at that time was reach out to Zion/Planstin via Slack tell them that this was a serious situation, that I thought these members would cancel without their cards.  I never heard back from Jeff...but I did hear back from the member- multiple times, Tuesday morning I called Amy Simon right away to offer support to help clear any confusion that she has- I left a voicemail, and all I got was an email that said I''m so confused by this plan, I can''t be the only member.  I assured her that she was not the only member, that this plan is a HUGE paradigm shift from traditional insurance BUT she has the MPB.Health Concierge team to call on for ANY question regarding her health.  I told her that she doesn''t need to wrap her mind around it all at once.  If she has a medical need, or question she and her daughter can call anytime and we will guide her as to what she needs to do in that situation.  Silence.  From her and from Jeff.  I did finally tell her that her cards were RESENT.  I have talked to Patti Baron about this situation, she told me to make a note, because I think that she will cancel, and I am not getting any support from Jeff over here.  If we lose sale I have done everything in my power on this end. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-21 14:07:35', '2021-01-21 14:07:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062590026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, 'William called frustrated that he wasn''t able to confirm with the doctor that is showing up on the PHCS network online that they are in fact in network.  He even went so far as to speak with their billing department with the response "I''ve never heard of the PHCS network"  I told Bill that this probably means that they are no longer participating in the network.  But he was so frustrated.  I told him that I would reach out to Planstin Management and ask that they call to confirm benefits.  I slacked this request just now.  I told Bill that I would follow up when I hear anything back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-21 13:49:58', '2021-01-21 13:49:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062586029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, 'Member called and said that she received a bill for her Preventative Visit and she wants to find out how to get it paid.  
Member also inquired about Bone Density screening for preventative.  Member was told that you must be 60 or older for it to be covered as a preventative.
Member was transferred to RCI
Member was also emailed the ACA guidelines as well', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-21 13:21:33', '2021-01-21 14:09:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062576034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636833', 'Kittredge Stephenson', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he cancelled LHS and was charged by us.  He will be sending in cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-21 12:43:30', '2021-01-21 12:43:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062590021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, 'Samantha called in for a general refresher on how her plan works...I went over all important aspects, sent all corresponding templates and reminded her that she is not completely alone in paying out out of pocket medical needs up until she reaches her $5000 IUA with Sedera....she can always reach out to us and we can get her the FAIR pricing for most services from HCBB so that she can use them as a tool when negotiating a cash pay price. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-21 11:47:28', '2021-01-21 11:47:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062590016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, 'See ticket! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-21 11:20:59', '2021-01-21 11:20:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062586024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921312', 'Martin Dempsey', 'CirrusMD', '-Member called to say that she was attempting to sign into CirrusMD and it was rejecting.  We made sure it was her husband''s email that was being used.  She was using her email to gain access and since she in not on the plan it would not work.  However, when she put in her husband''s email, everything went fine.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-21 11:13:33', '2021-01-21 11:13:33'),
