  ('zcrm_1579374000062534003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, '1.19.21:  Lisa left a voice message reporting her experience at her first OBGYN visit:  the pricing for the OBGYN is about $3000 after a 25% discount, if you pre-pay.  Their office wouldn''t give her any other pricing and said she''d have to inquire directly at the other participating providers for this need.  She will research this and I responded she could email me the pricing she is quoted.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-01-21 06:27:24', '2021-01-21 06:27:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062437178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921312', 'Martin Dempsey', NULL, '1/20/21  Member called wanting some information about behavioral coverage in her membership. I told her about CirrusMD.  I also introduced her to the MAP.  She was extremely happy about the information I had to give her.  She will be calling CirrusMD and she will be getting familiar with the MAP once I send her the link.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-20 14:51:28', '2021-01-20 14:51:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062482018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570050', 'Silvina Irimia', NULL, '1-20-21 Silvina started to enroll with me on the phone but she had to go for an appointment. She was all the way down to the payment section. Hopefully she won''t have problems completing it if she walks away. SECURE $1000/$275 EO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-20 14:38:04', '2021-01-20 14:38:04'),
