  ('zcrm_1579374000062437158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024446006', 'Shannon Frankel', NULL, 'I received a email from RCI advising that they got a request from members new employer to cancel her coverage w/RCI.   I tried to email member however mailbox not set up.  I emailed member letting her know that I would need a cancellation form from her and that RCI is not the only component of her plan.  I cancelled billing ahead of cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-20 13:15:28', '2021-01-20 13:15:28'),
