  ('zcrm_1579374000062437112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427020', 'Doug Lewis', NULL, '-Kelley called to say that she spoke with CirrusMD regarding a Dermatology issue. After checking in with them for a follow up call, they suggested she make an appointment with a Dermatologist.  She called to see how to go about using the PHCS Network.  Member was walked through the process and found someone she can use.
-Member also inquired about the Welcome Call Calendar stating that there is no availability for the next year.  Member was informed that this was an old calendar and that I would send out a new link.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-20 11:17:07', '2021-01-20 11:17:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062445059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563343', 'Amy Simon', NULL, 'Amy emailed me upset about the plan...but really....her cards.  She hasn''t received them yet.  After hours I forwarded her complaints to Jeff to try to get some additional support.  Today I reached out via a phone call and couldn''t leave a message because the mailbox was full.  I sent a very detailed email explaining that I was trying to get a hold of her...but that I am advocating on her behalf for her and her daughters PDF cards- Zion management told me that they sent Amy her PDF cards but never gave me word on whether or or not Brittany''s cards were sent (on another membership)  I have asked Amy to let me know if Brittany has received them and let her know that she can call us during business hours and have her questions answered...and if she can''t get through for any reason she can always reach out to Jeff.  I gave her his contact info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-20 11:07:47', '2021-01-20 11:07:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062437107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467102', 'Jacqueline Saporito', NULL, 'I contacted Advisor Sally Thomsen to get a cancellation for this member''s Sedera membership.  Also she does not know if prospect is a business owner so I might have to change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-20 10:50:12', '2021-01-20 10:50:12'),
