  ('zcrm_1579374000062437087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, '1/19/21 Member called wanting to know what to present to physician at a wellness visit.  I told him to present his Planstin card.  He can temporarily use the digital one.', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-20 10:20:39', '2021-01-20 11:22:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062445054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921086', 'Rebekkah Boehm', NULL, 'called to see if birth control was a covered expense- I explained that why with her plan it is not.  I explained that I could send her a script quote request and we could tell her the best price and place to pick it up from.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-20 10:04:13', '2021-01-20 10:04:13'),
