  ('zcrm_1579374000062445044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061173001', 'Robert (Drew) Ervin', NULL, 'I helped look up a very expensive script for Drew''s wife- it is controlled- so Reid can''t help.  Drexi can''t help anymore than goodrx.  I sent him the link for Prescription Bliss....I told him that she would have to qualify for the plan but that it is her best bet at this point.  I also suggested that she either speak to her established Dr about the situation OR get a second opinion at another specialist- I told him that I would look up a fair cost for that office visit in his area and send it to him if he needs. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-20 09:48:45', '2021-01-20 09:48:45'),
