  ('zcrm_1579374000062437023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045376098', 'Ryan Nelson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  There was a mixup and member wanted to cancel for 1/1, I was not notified. Member is asking for refund for Jan.  Per Rod after trying to call Leslie I sent Email to Leslie &amp; Wiley, Rod &amp; Robert explaining.  Cancelling effective 2/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-20 08:16:38', '2021-01-20 08:16:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062445039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044279010', 'Helena Hofer', NULL, 'I finally got to speak with Helena,  her questions were a bit complicated but Guy Travis told her to reach out to me....she thanked me for my time and told her that I made her feel much more confident about what she needs to do next. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-20 08:14:58', '2021-01-20 08:14:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062445034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013154', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, '1-19-21 Spoke with Jani bc KellyAnne said she was frustrated by not reaching Concierge during EST bus hours. I called her and got her dialed in with all of her questions and helped her create a new need for new hormone, peri-menopause issues.  All of her docs keep retiring. So, she has another new gyn who will soon be going virtual as well (Through CirrusMD)! I talked her through creating a new Need and she will work on uploading bills. Hasn''t reached $1000 IUA yet but will over time. Also completing Quest Diagnostic form as self-pay patient. Understands wellness is her cost but Sedera will share in mammogram cost. Also sending her Access Guidelines.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-19 16:24:01', '2021-01-19 16:24:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062445024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740011', 'Kathleen VanGoethem', NULL, '1-19-21 I spoke with Kathy and she just wants her Planstin card for her annual wellness visit that''s coming up early in Feb. I can''t see the message from Michele, so I also sent a message via Slack and referenced KellyAnne request for the cards one month ago. I explained to Kathy that she doesn''t need a card for any visits other than her wellness visit. I re-explained the process. She didn''t realize she''d have to get all of the bills and upload/track them after she reaches her IUA. She thought they''d bill Zion directly. Now she understands better.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-19 15:26:03', '2021-01-19 15:26:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062401113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563343', 'Amy Simon', NULL, 'I received bettiegram from this member.  She was very overwhelmed told me that she still hadn''t received her cards and that she had her welcome call and she didn''t get anything out of it.  Told me also that her daughter Brooke Altman (separate membership) did not know how to get prescriptions.  I explained to her that she needed to submitt form to get pricing checked out.  Also said that husband needs to get MRI"s every 3 mos because he is a cancer survivor.  That I told her to speak to Zion about.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-19 14:46:30', '2021-01-19 14:46:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062437013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740011', 'Kathleen VanGoethem', NULL, '-Saw that I had a missed call from Member.  Returned her call.  She insisted on speaking to Kelly Anne since that is who she left the message with.  I asked to see if there was anything I could do for her and she stated that she is wanting her cards but that Kelly Anne will help and that she is the only one to help her.  She refused to speak further to me.
