  ('zcrm_1579374000062317031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062318001', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '1-15-21 All notes on in his original account to be merged when it''s closed out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-15 17:27:49', '2021-01-15 17:27:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062317026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415080', 'Kristine Ferguson', NULL, '1-15-21 Kris is part way through enrolling and I explained the rest which she will complete. Sounded like she was in a rush. She had me review how it works again and she was super appreciative of how helpful I was. She will join DIRECT $1000/$245 paired with Dr. Borchers MDVIP. Reviewed a few items on record which she believes were all long before the past 24 months, therefore, not pre-x. She''s thrilled that this will be way better than Anthem with the $6K ded and higher mop. Feb. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-15 17:18:58', '2021-01-15 17:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062317021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570050', 'Silvina Irimia', NULL, '1-15-21 Silvina is still deciding what she wants to do. She has learned that Freedom Life / US Health has many limitations that she didn''t know about. But, it''s super cheap and includes dental for $37 a month. However, she called her gyn per my recommendation to ensure that they can code the entire wellness visit to get an IUD removed and replaced at no cost. If so, she will make the move. If not, she may wait a year. She just really wants to keep the cost low and doesn''t like the idea of having to pay the first $1000. She usually has a UTI and urgent care or 2 visits per year. She''s not sure those can be taken care of with virtual healthcare. But, trying to wrap her head around it all. She will reach out to me on Tuesday Jan. 19th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-15 17:03:24', '2021-01-15 17:03:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062317016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '1-15-21 Cathy called to ask if she can keep her daughter on who also has insurance through school. I told her she can keep this as a secondary option and school''s ins is primary. Price will remain same either way. Asked about her other daughter who is moving to HA. In CO she would qualify for Medicaid but will just keep her on since this will work in HA as well and Cathy is paying for it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-15 16:15:04', '2021-01-15 16:15:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062317008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '1-15-21 Lester is cancelling HES and enrolled in above Oscar Plan for Feb. 1st start date. Completing cancellation form now for HES and LHS is next. Daughter is going to be on Medicaid with x-wife since she and her common law husband lost their jobs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-15 16:03:57', '2021-01-22 10:58:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062317003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '1-15-21 Successfully enrolled Lester into Oscar $0 Ded/$8550 MOP -  Oscar Bronze Classic Next ($3 Prescription List + Free 24/7 Virtual Visits + Free Personal Care team).  Acct # 9030171032, Plan ID 44559CO0010005-01.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-15 16:00:56', '2021-01-15 16:00:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062294076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467454', 'Michelle Oftedahl', NULL, 'Member called in and I answered many questions.  They will mkae decision and possibly get back with me to enroll', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-15 14:39:38', '2021-01-15 14:39:38'),
