  ('zcrm_1579374000062305023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, 'Elizabeth reached out to Wendy for advice on what to do with a lab bill that she had when she still had benefits through ASI- I then gave her Nancy Ly''s contact information to get that process started.  I also gave her tips on how to save on labwork in the future now that she has a plan that doesn''t have a MEC. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-15 12:03:39', '2021-01-15 12:03:39'),
