Told member I would email her back the answers to those questions.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-15 10:58:03', '2021-01-15 10:58:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062305013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163282', 'Zina Murray', NULL, 'No response. Sent email to reschedule call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-15 10:37:31', '2021-01-15 10:37:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062294021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289539', 'Peter Earsman', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-15 10:07:55', '2021-01-15 10:07:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062294013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091599', 'Cortney Heintz', NULL, 'This member submitted cancellation request as she went direct w/Zion.  I will refund member and no commissions will be paid out. Per Rod refund will include 1st month +$100.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-15 09:49:11', '2021-01-15 09:58:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062310003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', 'New Welcome Call Link', '-New email was sent out with new Welcome Call link as per bettigram in previous note.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-15 09:46:34', '2021-01-15 09:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062305008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004339007', 'Phil Guinouard', NULL, 'Phil called in a bit confused about where to find his Zion guidlines and asked what the best way to get his blood pressure medication would be.  I gave him all of his options and sent him a prescription medication quote form.  He was very very happy for the help! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-15 09:20:28', '2021-01-15 09:20:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062305003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768159', 'Robert Pyle', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-15 09:09:31', '2021-01-15 09:09:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062294008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289481', 'Sheila Clark', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-15 08:47:57', '2021-01-15 08:47:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062294003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004031922', 'Denise Pride', NULL, 'Member cancelled eff 11/5', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-15 08:08:44', '2021-01-15 08:08:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062243080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Angelo called in tonight for help in accessing a psychiatrist, I went over all of his options and he prefers to present himself as a self pay patient to get the best cash discount.  So I grabbed a list of fair price doctors from HCBB in his area as well as the Fair Cost of an initial exam and Fair Cost of follow up exam.  I also explained the $3000 cap on mental health sharing with Zion and then proceeded to go over the MAP program- I sent him the link and login to get access.  I also let him know that if he is in a crisis situation  he can reach out to CirrusMD to talk to someone.   You could tell that the time that I spent with him showing how all of the different facets of our plan can really really help him really touched him!   I let him know that he can reach out to MPB.Health/CirrusMD/and the MAP program anytime, someone will be available to help him! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-14 15:08:57', '2021-01-14 15:08:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062239076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, '1-14-21 KellyAnne is helping Angelo with medications and assistance with psychiatry visits and our EAP program. They are happy again. Rita was in a bit of a panic since they couldn''t reach the Concierge immediately.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-14 14:52:32', '2021-01-14 14:52:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062266003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, 'David chatted me on SalesIQ and said that he is stuck on the enrollment page. I told him I would have John Kach give him a call because he is part of the tech help and enrollments whenever there is an issue. Got his full name and phone #, confirmed that those were correct from the info given on the SalesIQ chat box. He said those were correct. I read the message to John and gave him his name and #. John is going to call him in a few minutes to help him through the enrollment. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2021-01-14 14:40:29', '2021-01-14 14:40:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062260026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116389', 'Katherin Khidirian', NULL, 'I received Payment update form I updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-14 13:17:19', '2021-01-14 13:17:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062243075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, 'Welcome call with Laurie complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-14 13:01:20', '2021-01-14 13:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062260018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, 'Member called in to request payment receipts for the following months for her PPP Loan.  May, June, July, Aug/2020.  I advised her that she is sent receipts every month when she is billed.  Said she did not have these months.  I emailed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-14 13:00:16', '2021-01-14 13:00:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062258034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, 'Member called and said that she sent an email to ADMIN@mympb in regards to medical receipts that she needs to upload.  I inquired with Patti in regards to this email account since I was unable to see any results for that particular account.  Patti felt it best I transfer the call.
I transferred call to Patti.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-14 12:42:19', '2021-01-14 12:42:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062258029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', NULL, 'Charles called in to find out if we had his correct DOB on file.  After verifying this, he asked who he should call about correcting it for his preventative medications and visits.  Member was given Apex''s number to correct his DOB.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-14 12:25:43', '2021-01-14 12:25:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062260013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921086', 'Rebekkah Boehm', NULL, 'Member called in to update her payment method I will send out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-14 12:23:09', '2021-01-14 12:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062243070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583032', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, 'Erin received a Planstin card about a week ago and she asked Wendy if it was an error- Wendy reached out to me and I reached out to the Planstin/Zion team on her behalf.   It turns out that it was a mistake and a good catch by the member.  They have already sent the appropriate PDF Zion card over to her...and I told her that she can expect a hard copy of the card in 3-4 weeks time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-14 12:08:06', '2021-01-14 12:08:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062243065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057777111', 'Amy Chase', NULL, 'Amy called for HCBB support in finding a specialist and questions regarding what to expect.  I told her that she had two options with this situation- she can simply present herself as a cash pay patient and ask for the best cash discount and use the HCBB for fair pricing tools for services rendered.  OR she can present her Planstin card at time of service for an already pre-negotiated price.  I checked HCBB and was unable to log Amy in so I will reach out to to home office about this today.  I made sure that the doctor was in Zion''s network.  I took screen shots of all services from the HCBB site that Amy might encounter and sent them to her.  I told her that we will work on the back end to get her in.  She was thankful for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-14 11:34:36', '2021-01-14 11:34:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062261011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, '1.14.21:  KellyAnne asked Jami of BBCC if they handle maternity cases.  Jami said the following:

So in regards to your inquiry below, we typically don''t work maternity cases, as they''re just too unpredictable to confidently negotiate pricing.  The good news is, our doctor color ratings are based on referral patterns, and not the amount they charge for their own services.  In our experience, the fee that drives a procedure''s cost either up or down, is the facility, as this is the fee where we see the most price variance. In this case, the doctor''s rating of red indicates that she typically refers her patients out to or performs procedures in higher cost facilities, but in Lisa''s case, her delivery will be taking place at a green facility, which means that the dr. broke her normal referral pattern and scheduled the patient at a more reasonably priced facility.  
Since this member will be self pay, I would still advise her to call the hospital and doctor ahead of time to confirm their cash pay fees for vaginal delivery.  I''ve included our fair price information below for reference!  You''ll notice in the breakdown at the bottom, the fair price for the facility / hospital fee in her area is $9,266, the fair price for the doctor fee is $3,674 and the fair price for the anesthesia is just above 2K.  As long as her estimates get close to those totals, she can be sure that she''s not being overcharged.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-01-14 10:48:49', '2021-01-14 10:48:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062261006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, '1.13.21:  I was apprised today by Rod and John about this new member, enrolling in the wrong plan, and needing assistance with finding a provider for a maternity need.   She was told to call me directly.  
I spoke w/Lisa. She explained she was given 3 names of providers a few weeks earlier (didn''t remember with whom she spoke).  Since we have no record of any such communication, we think it was Zion who provided her with those names when Michele transferred her call to them.
Lisa has an appointment with Dr. Lynn Ellington in Franklin, TN tomorrow at 10 a.m.  She was asking about HCBB.  I told her I didn''t know if BBCC would assist in a Maternity Need but would find out.  We will, however, help her w/finding a provider at fairest price and hgihest quality of service. We will also check out Dr. Ellington.  I told her to try and get the global pkge. price for this need from her provider so that we have a base figure to work with.  She agreed to do so and let me know.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2021-01-14 10:42:10', '2021-01-14 10:42:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062243060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-14 10:32:59', '2021-01-14 10:32:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062258024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255074', 'Connor Duplessis', 'IUA Update', 'Spoke with Conner regarding the answer to his IUA question.  This is the message that came directly from Tim Hirsh at Zion.  "Members can make 1 change annually to their IUA. The change to a lower IUA is only effective for accidents within the first 60 days of that change being made."  

I told member that we would send him a change of form membership to update his IUA and that he could but in the note section the IUA change.

Email was sent.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-14 10:29:48', '2021-01-14 10:29:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062258019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116389', 'Katherin Khidirian', NULL, 'Member called to say they have not received the payment change form yet.  I spoke with Patti and she sent it out a 2nd time.  While on the phone, member''s assistant found the email.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-14 10:25:29', '2021-01-14 10:25:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062243052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, 'This prospect, called in about a week ago, I answered his questions for about 45 minutes- he wouldn''t leave his contact information nor tell me that he was already working with a rep.  Through the course of a week- he has spoken to Michele and Patti to ask questions.  He left 2 bettigrams last night complaining that he had been trying to reach out to us with no response.  I called him back today,   I told him that if he doesn''t want to use the FL rep that didn''t give him sufficient answers he would need to reach out to Joan.....he interrupted me before I could give him the number.  I answered his questions and let him know that at MPB.Health, we are willing to help answer his questions, but for more in depth conversations he needs to speak with a rep.  Our priority if for our members first.  I reminded him that he has spoken to 3 in house staff members for this assistance so far,   because he doesn''t want to go with said FL rep.  He was very happy to speak with me and have a few more questions answered- in the future he may want to bring on a group.  He was thrilled with our conversation and when I left it he was in front of the mpb.health enrollment page.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-14 10:10:17', '2021-01-14 10:10:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062258003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032122001', 'Eileen Fagan', NULL, '-Spoke with member through email in outlook since it was working through the CRM.  We have a set time for Jan 15 at 1230pm to finish the new Enrollment Process for the DIRECT Plan.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-14 09:41:34', '2021-01-14 09:41:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062252008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, '1/13/21 Member called and insisted on talking to Joan....Did a warm transfer...Joan was not available...so I took a message and related message to Joan.   DP

Prior to her insisting on only Joan helping her...she quoted" I  made a mistake on the choice of membership I have chosen, and my advisor wants her to help me".    DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-14 09:20:27', '2021-01-14 10:18:24'),
