  ('zcrm_1579374000062243028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062250051', 'Cody Bennett', NULL, '1-13-21 Cody is 40 and lives in Lafayette. Works for Grace Design and was sent to me by Eben Grace and Kevin Shay. Cody is a smoker! Income will be about $24K in 2021 bc his other seasonal job probably won''t happen in 2021 bc of pandemic. No pre-x and wants to quit smoking. Wondering if plan has smoking cessation program which I didn''t know the answer to. He gets a $231.39 APTC and his cost is $134 and Full cost is $366.14 for Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5000. Acct # 4007379220. Plan ID 49375CO0060019-05. He thought he wanted to see Dr. Jeffrey Stoll as referred by his friend/co-worker but Jeffrey Stoll was only in Bright Health network and Cigna had best looking plan for him. So, he''ll find another doctor. He hasn''t had insurance for about 5 years and no wellness visit for a long time either.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-13 17:29:14', '2021-01-13 17:32:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062243023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '1-7-21 - 1-13-21 Lester is now earning about $70K. But also still considered self-employed with coaching biz. We explored SECURE for him. But his company nixed it.

