Thanks
Lester"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-13 16:10:48', '2021-01-13 16:10:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062243018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '1-6-21 "Hi Wendy I just had change my employment in the group I’m working for is offering to pay a portion of my health care.  Basically I am getting $500 a month, pretax, add it to my salary to offset any health insurance costs.They’re requesting that is actually health insurance and not a health share so I’m looking for some lower cost recommendations and will be leaving liberty health share.

