  ('zcrm_1579374000062239013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779429', 'Elizabeth Charter', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in because she had a medical scare over the weekend and wound up in the ER- she presented herself as a self pay patient and asked to be billed.    She wanted to make sure she was doing everything right.  She also needs to follow up with a cardiologist.  I suggested a few things that I could do for her that might help in the situation.  I told her that I would do a HCBB lookup for cardiologists in her area and give her the Fair price she should negotiate for a New Patient visit.  I also suggested the MAP program tele support therapy to help ease some of the stress in her situation.   I sent her the ZIon Needs submission template.  I told her to call me back if she is recommended for other testing so I can look up that information for her as well.  Elizabeth was very very grateful for all of the support, she said that every time she has reached out to us the response time has been fantastic! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-13 09:34:29', '2021-01-13 09:34:29'),
