  ('zcrm_1579374000062239008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, 'Margaret called to follow up with me about what happened with Planstin yesterday.  She called, told them that YES I just rechecked the facility IS in network.  And Planstin responded by saying "you''re right, they are!"  so she was instructed to call the provider and ask that they resend the billing showing that they are a part of the PHCS network.  Great news! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-13 08:50:58', '2021-01-13 08:50:58'),
