  ('zcrm_1579374000062180016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '1-12-21 Enrolled in Friday Health Bronze X HMO. Full cost is $528.79. Her cost is $144.31 with APTC of  $384.48. She was concerned about possible pre-x with weird mammograms.  Gave her instructions to pay even though we paid with banking account on C4. Told her to double check on payment. We also cancelled MPB at same time for Feb. 1st end date. Should be all set on all fronts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-12 16:09:02', '2021-01-12 16:15:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062180011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002207005', 'Reid Inouye', NULL, '1-12-21 Reid just turned 65 in Jan.  They were looking to keep LHS but it will be $399+$25 since he''s 65+. I recommended she talk with a Medicare expert in HA to help with that. LHS might not be the best supplemental to pair with Medicare. She was appreciative and will do more research. She will add her son to her own employee plan. He''s only 16.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-12 15:33:34', '2021-01-12 15:33:34'),
