  ('zcrm_1579374000062130008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Dug a little into this and Compliance form was submitted to reflect Member &amp; Spouse and we have been being charged for Member &amp; Family since 8/1  Zion back dated Hannah''s removal to 8/1/for me since we would never get the $295.50 difference per month back from member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-11 12:27:28', '2021-01-11 12:27:28'),
