  ('zcrm_1579374000062127018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583190', 'Jay Allen', NULL, 'In Cirrus system....however, I need a unique email for each of them to utilize the service.  Will do that at welcome call today.  All set with portal and temp QR code. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-11 11:58:11', '2021-01-11 11:58:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062131008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '1-11-21 Robin called bc she needs to bring her daughter to Children''s Hospital and they didn''t recognize her insurance card that she provided. She inquired if she was supposed to say self-pay for this. I called and left her a vm and confirmed that she is supposed to tell them that she doesn''t have insurance and she is a self-pay/cash paying patient and wants their best cash price. I told her if she has problems with that to please call Concierge for further assistance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-11 11:58:08', '2021-01-11 11:58:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062127013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, 'Spoke to Nanci and explained the type of plan that she has, she thought that she was going to receive a MEC card that she could use for her mammogram.  I told her that she doesn''t have a MEC however screening mammogram and colonoscopy will be shared with Sedera at 100%- she can go wherever she likes and submit the bills after the fact for reimbursement. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-11 11:49:10', '2021-01-11 11:49:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062131003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, '1-11-21 Jennifer called to ask about psychiatric care for dr. who only accepts cash. In the most recent guidelines I have, but told her there might be newer guidelines now after the 1st of the year, it shows up to $1500 sharing for psychiatric care. Told her to call Concierge for assistance and advice as to how to proceed. They might need to pre-approve cost since price can be large range for drs. not accepting insurance. She will call and appreciated my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-11 11:24:26', '2021-01-11 11:24:26'),
