  ('zcrm_1579374000062128003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032122001', 'Eileen Fagan', NULL, '-Member called to see about changing plans to SECURE for the HSA benefits.  However, upon questing her further, it seems like the DIRECT plan would be a better fit since she really wants to keep her DPC.
