  ('zcrm_1579374000062127008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, 'Holly is requesting a summary of payment for 2020- I told her that she cannot use it for tax purposes because she doesn''t have a MEC.  She said she knew and that it wasn''t what she wanted it for.  Tricia is going to get this for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-11 10:05:21', '2021-01-11 10:05:21'),
