  ('zcrm_1579374000062060045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '1-8-21 Sandra had her colposcopy already and might have to do Leap procedure she thinks. She''s not sure if it makes sense to move to Friday Health or not since she likes her membership. She''s going to exceed her $1000 IUA likely with next appt. If switches then she''ll have to pay again to meet ded. But, wants to be safe in case anything turns into cancer moving forward. She didn''t understand that making a move would restart the pre-x clause. Looks like she chose on her own and then we talked afterwards from what I can see from the notes. I can look back at my written notes though to make sure. She''s going to sleep on it again before she decides what to do. I also told her she can call Concierge to help her price out possible chemo of breast cancer if it ever comes to that. Likely safest to move her to Friday Health.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-08 16:08:24', '2021-01-08 16:08:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062060031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060863094', 'Jenn Dempsey', NULL, '1-8-21 Matthew with C4 helping me now. But, her account is a huge mess. He''s making sure only Jenn is enrolled for Jan. 1st start date with medical escalation for Anthem Bronze Pathway X HSA for $608.82.  Enrollment ID 284950849. They wanted me to submit letter stating I failed to call in for Jan. 1st start date which is not true. Matthew agreed to press that since I''m not willing to lie. Supervisor will look into the problems. Matthew will send a DBCR to carrier which will send letter to request 1/1/21 start date. TKT # 210108-001318. He included medical escalation due to breast cancer patient and needing biopsy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-08 14:56:58', '2021-01-08 15:10:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062060023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060863094', 'Jenn Dempsey', NULL, '1-7-21 Via Jenn, "I’m comfortable sticking with the Anthem Bronze X-Pathway plan; I have enough evidence that I’ll be covered at UC Health."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-08 14:37:16', '2021-01-08 14:38:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062060018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683010', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '1-8-21Matthew with C4 is helpful! He''s reinstating Friday Health Bronze $447.87 for Jan. 1st onward. Enrollment ID is 313259253. Now will be Feb 1st start but still active in Jan 1 -Jan 31st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-08 14:28:52', '2021-01-08 14:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000062043043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091292', 'Carl Cheetham', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete, asked for PDF cards from Planstin/Zion.  He is THRILLED about the MAP program. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-08 14:21:56', '2021-01-08 14:21:56'),
