  ('zcrm_1579374000062060013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032752077', 'Mui Suri Fisher', NULL, '1-8-21 Mui and Arisa are exploring new group plans and possibly moving away from Kaiser for the first time in years. I had full report done for all group options and I''m recommending Friday Health or SECURE. She will research information on Friday Health. Looking at Friday SG Silver Rx Copay HMO Ded $5K/$10K $40 PCP/$80 Specialist, $8550/$17100 at $3653.93 if all employees chose this. Also looking at Friday HealtH SG Gold Rx Copay HMO Ded $950/$1900 at $4699.19. Or SECURE at $2835 for all levels of employees AND HSA compliant. This is instead of Kaiser Bronze 8550/40 $3808.95 and Kaiser 1500/30 POS Gold for $6133.45. She figured by going with Friday Health it will save them $500 a month. If go with SECURE it will save them about $2k per month I think. I need to figure out deadline and how/who funds the HSA for a group plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-08 14:00:37', '2021-01-08 14:00:37'),
