  ('zcrm_1579374000062043028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091166', 'Courtney Cowan Gray', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  These members never received their CirrusMD invites, so I reached out to Natalie about that.  They also have asked that I request PDF and hard copies of their cards from Planstin/Zion.  Great new members I told them that it was great that they were both on the phone call!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-08 12:32:47', '2021-01-08 12:32:47'),
