  ('zcrm_1579374000062060008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683010', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '1-8-21 Spoke with Michael and Hilary paid binder payment to Friday Health on Monday, Jan. 4th but I received notice today that they didn''t have her binder payment yet. The report may have been run before she made her payment according to the notice. I gave her the Customer Service at 800-475-8466  to call. I need to make certain C4 cancels the Anthem plan that they were charged for in for Jan. 1st for entire family! They need refund since never chose Anthem for family in 2021.  On hold with C4 now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-08 12:14:53', '2021-01-08 12:14:53'),
