  ('zcrm_1579374000062043018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893122', 'Phillip Haddad', NULL, 'I helped this member with HCBB information for his wife Rachel today, he also called to ask what telehealth service he should use.    He said he received a new Planstin card in the mail today that had telehealth information on it that was different from CirrusMD.  Member is going to take a picture of the card and send it to me. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-08 11:05:35', '2021-01-08 11:05:35'),
