  ('zcrm_1579374000062060003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, '1-8-21 Andre called to confirm that a PSA test is included in wellness. He was sitting there with the Dr. already. Dr. said yes he can code it as wellness. Andre also learned it costs $100 or so at another facility if he had to pay cash. But, if included in plan he can do it at same location but cost is $300 but then run through insurance and all included via Planstin. I assume the rate is then pre-negotiated and actually less than the $300 retail cost. I also checked doctor network for Dr. Michael Check and he shows up in the network! He should be all set. He also needs a new Planstin card and possibly digital one too if that can be sent immediately.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-08 10:37:57', '2021-01-08 10:37:57'),
