  ('zcrm_1579374000061986118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881351', 'Ronald Stear', NULL, '1-7-21 "Coverage. None of our primary care physicians and our local hospital are in network. With the whole pandemic we need to covered by our local physicians." This is likey true for wellness visits, but not relevant for all other issues. I called to explain. I don''t think he remembers or understands, judging from his cancellation form. Ugh. We''ll see if he calls me back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 16:49:34', '2021-01-07 16:49:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010492001', 'Anabella Aguilar', NULL, '1-7-21 "Cover absolutely everything a person could need, that is why we pay a monthly premium. I paid a lot of money and when I need them to cover my hormone treatment need they didn''t do it. 

In my case, I am SUPER healthy, but because of my age, I need hormones. They explain to me that hormones are not covered because they are considered a chronic illness and that for me is totally ABSURD!"

Her new health insurance, "They cover EVERYTHING that I need or I could need, with no deductible, and a maximum out of pocket of $1,400 a year."

Perhaps she''s better off. BUT, she would only have to pay the first $1000 of her hormone stuff and they rest would have been shared up to $25K! I left her a vm to clarify. We don''t want unhappy members or past members. She''s always been super great in the past!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 16:44:56', '2021-01-07 16:44:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521418', 'Joshua Keith', NULL, '1-7-21 "There are limited differences between the new plan and MPower based upon my understanding. I am making the change due to my workplace beginning their own workplace plan."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 16:36:24', '2021-01-07 16:36:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020287', 'Brendan Duffy', NULL, '1-7-21 Spoke with Karen about Joshua''s cancellation form (Brendan''s brother). She said they are on Molina now and wasn''t sure if he got a tax credit or not. But, I think she''s more comfortable with having both boys Joshua and Brendan on trad ins. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 16:35:10', '2021-01-07 16:35:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020226', 'Joshua Duffy', NULL, '1-7-21 Spoke with Karen about Joshua''s cancellation form. She said he''s on Molina now and wasn''t sure if he got a tax credit or not. But, I think she''s more comfortable with having both boys Joshua and Brendan on trad ins. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 16:34:01', '2021-01-07 16:34:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020161', 'Joshua Duffy', NULL, '1-7-21 Clarified with Karen how her membership works. She''s feeling better and likes it so far. She wanted to have a card but I explained the benefits of Not having a card to use. Now she understands the value of being a self-pay patient much more. She did cancel her two boys. They got Molina locally. I think she feels better having them on traditional insurance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 16:32:09', '2021-01-07 16:32:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020226', 'Joshua Duffy', NULL, '1-4-21 Cancelling due to not enough places "accepting" this membership! There is no limitation on the providers he can go to. I just tried calling Karen Vaughan since her # is the only one on the account. The line drops and won''t allow me to leave a vm. I sent her an email instead. I just want to make sure they understand how to use the membership. I think he already found new traditional insurance but it''s worth one more try. Live in WA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 16:19:17', '2021-01-07 16:19:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060863094', 'Jenn Dempsey', NULL, '1-7-21 Jenn will harass UC Health again to get a definitive answer about considering her plan in-network or not. Then we can make a final decision to remove cancellation at end of month or choose a new plan with drs. in network. She will let me know as soon as she gets more answers hopefully today or tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 16:01:09', '2021-01-07 16:01:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570050', 'Silvina Irimia', NULL, '1-7-21 Silvina currently has Freedom Life for $220 a month. It includes dental. Send her Spirit dental link too. Goes to doctor for annual wellness visit and usually Urgent Care 2x per year for virus of some sort. She''s skeptical of virtual health from her experience with Freedom Life''s telehealth that usually just tells  her to go to do in person. She''s a contact worker and earns about $120K per year. She has no ded with Freedom Life but was going to have to pay $450 to have IUD removed and supposedly $1800 total to add new one. With SECURE it''s included in ACA compliant wellness which I verified again on gov website. Told her to always make sure her dr is willing to code is fully as wellness/preventative visist and must stay in network for that part. She understands. She''s super interested in this and just wants to read about it further.  Also had an HSA in past.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 15:20:29', '2021-01-07 15:20:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061990043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961051', 'Steve Ramona', NULL, 'Great Welcome Call Complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-07 15:02:34', '2021-01-07 15:02:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061988013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961149', 'Michael Balser', NULL, '1/7/21 member called concerning his medication for high blood pressure. He needs a physician to check his blood pressure and refill a prescription, He also wanted information on getting blood work.', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-07 14:39:09', '2021-01-07 14:39:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '1-7-21 Spoke with Lee at C4 and he can see she was sent a renewal letter stating her plan was not eligible to auto-renew. She had to make a new choice. They recommended Anthem Pathway X Essentials 5500 at $83.08 her cost which is about half of what she''s paying now. BUT, the network is smaller. So we will need to talk before we renew her moving forward. She had a PT appt today but it''s too late to choose a plan for Jan. I left her a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 14:17:32', '2021-01-07 14:24:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683010', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '1-7-21 I spoke with Lee at C4 about Hilary''s account. The Rep I spoke with the first time wrote the notes wrong.  This was a call Michael added me to when he called C4. They erroneously cancelled Hilary''s plan at the end of Jan. 2021. We either need to re-enroll her or ask them to undo the cancellation. IF we re-enroll, we will want them to back date the start date to 1/1/21 as to not mess up any deductibles for the year or simply remove the cancellation done in error by the C4 Rep.  Tkt # is 210107- 001150. Just left a vm for Hilary and Michael now...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 14:10:52', '2021-01-07 14:11:29'),
