  ('zcrm_1579374000061986057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516016', 'David Sims', NULL, '1-7-21 David called bc broke his arm. He called # to Apex and they told him it''s "not covered." He panicked a bit. He''s back on track and will call Concierge for assistance in submitting bills to Sedera. Super thankful. He''s already paid $3k and suspect it will be $40K when all done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 12:34:47', '2021-01-07 12:34:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061986052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415080', 'Kristine Ferguson', NULL, '1-7-21 Kris is recently divorced. She''s uncertain of the next steps for work. She may run her own psycho therapy business but is currently unemployed. No pre-x, no tobacco, takes hormone meds. She goes to Dr. Borchers and pays the $1800 Annually for his MDVIP membership. Therefore, DIRECT is her best option at $245/$1000. She also wants VSP. She had breast implants 30 years ago and simply wanted to get them checked for integrity this past year. But, MRI was going to cost $3K through insurance so she chose not to. No problems ever, no symptoms of anything. She was just asking since it had been 30 years. She will call PA to make sure nothing will negatively impact her regarding the records noted. She will call me when she has the answers.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 12:28:20', '2021-01-07 12:28:20'),
