  ('zcrm_1579374000061986028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610622', 'Leif Anderson', NULL, '1-7-20 Natalie called out of total confusion as to who to call and what to do. She has a new Need she submitted to Zion and doesn''t like their Needs submission process. She liked Sedera''s better because it was more detailed. But, she said she just submitted it and will have to wait to see how it is to work with Zion moving forward. She also didn''t know how to access CirrusMD. I talked with Kelly and she said Leif is set up already. She called Natalie but her vm is full. She sent the invite again to register. I''ll call one more time... OK, vm is full on her 503 just as Kelly said.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-07 10:24:52', '2021-01-07 10:26:45'),
