  ('zcrm_1579374000061933013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826196', 'Christopher Howe', NULL, '1-6-21 - Tina Rutherford called on behalf of her husband regarding he needs to have an ECHOcardigram.  I merged call with Kellyanne so that I could learn from this situation.  Basically the outcome was to call Sedera and start a NEEDS.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-06 13:17:34', '2021-01-06 13:20:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061934008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725001', 'Kathleen Malone', NULL, '1/6/21 Kathleen called wondering what the Planstin card was for.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-06 12:58:43', '2021-01-06 12:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061911033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060050020', 'Adele Paxton-Miezejewski', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Amazing new member that had already done all of her homework and had the plan figured out! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-06 12:52:27', '2021-01-06 12:52:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061921045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165306', 'Bonnie Eckert', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form effective 2/1 I will process and change end of month', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-06 12:35:48', '2021-01-06 12:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061935018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670004', 'Holly Hill', NULL, '1-6-21 Holly called bc she was frustrated about scheduling the Welcome Call. The confirmation emails are not getting sent and when she calls it goes straight to music without any indication of reaching MPB or that someone will be with the client in a moment. Michele said they are working on the email confirmation scheduling issue. She will also put in a ticket to add a message when folks call in indicating they have reached MPB and will be connected to the next available Rep.  Holly is all set and completed her Welcome Call with Kelly. She''s feeling better and understands there were technical problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-06 12:29:45', '2021-01-06 12:29:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061935013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, '1-6-21 Called, emailed and texted Carol to make sure her membership is not cancelled due to non-payment. I haven''t heard back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-06 12:13:08', '2021-01-06 12:13:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061935008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, '1-6-21 Rita''s bank account had issues and Patti just discovered it. I called Rita and she had already re-submitted her payment form to Patti. Patti is trying again. Rita said there''s plenty of money in the account. Sometimes if she eliminate the first 4 digits which were something like 1090 then it will work. Patti will keep me posted. But, Angelo had major frustrations with CirrusMD in getting an antibiotic for a sinus infection. The CirrusMD dr. told him to try all the things he''d already tried such as Netti Pot, wouldn''t allow him to get a 2nd opinion and wanted him to wait 6 days before he''d prescribe him anything. She''s not sure if the infection went away or not. This happened New Year''s Eve and he''s ready to cancel his whole membership because of this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-06 12:12:18', '2021-01-06 12:12:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061921037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044701107', 'Annette Nathan', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will process Refunded Renewal fee', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-06 12:11:06', '2021-01-06 12:15:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061911028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002647007', 'Benjamin Pieper', NULL, 'called to schedule a welcome call, sent an online scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-06 11:54:09', '2021-01-06 11:54:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061933008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823005', 'Angie Ward', NULL, '-Member called to update Payment form.  Member was sent email.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-06 11:26:44', '2021-01-06 11:26:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061935003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017950001', 'Robin Kemp', NULL, '1-6-21 Robin received a welcome packet and card from Zion without a start date. She did not enroll in Zion. John created a Product - Care+ to add her to CirrusMD. In doing so, Zion thinks she joined which she did not. John said he will rectify the problem now so MPB is not billed. Robin can continue her cancer treatments through Sedera. Her dr. recommended she apply for assistance to the company that provides the medication she needs which is $33K! She was approved and therefore the medication company is waiving the full cost of the meds. It is based on financial need and Robin didn''t pay herself much last year and her husband didn''t work much bc of covid. I suggested she let Joan know about this tactic to help our other clients when a Need like this arises.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-06 11:24:42', '2021-01-06 11:24:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061934003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921716', 'Polly Tucker', NULL, '1/6/21 Called Polly today regarding her Dr''s appointment.  She claimed "everything went fine".  Planstin sent her a digital card. Polly presented that to the Dr. and mentioned again that it was a Preventative appointment.  She was so happy that I contacted her again and repeatedly thanked me.  DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-06 10:57:33', '2021-01-06 10:57:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061911023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636259', 'Michael Prestel', NULL, 'Michael called in confused about his billing, I assured him that he has the Secure Plan with us and that the $399 charge he needed to cancel with Liberty. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-06 10:50:46', '2021-01-06 10:50:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061921026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059150079', 'Heather Palentchar', NULL, '1/6/21 Heather called concerning a medical appointment that she has, but has not received  a card as of yet.  I had her check if she received a digital card.  She checked her email and her spam and nothing as of yet. I connected her to Planstin   DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-06 10:22:57', '2021-01-06 10:22:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061921021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924192', 'Juzef Klim', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-06 10:22:12', '2021-01-06 10:22:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061916060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654211', 'Hans Erickson', NULL, 'Email verification sent about CirrusMd registration. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-06 10:03:23', '2021-01-06 10:03:23'),
