  ('zcrm_1579374000061933003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, '-2nd meeting went well.  Was unable to complete registration at this point because she still needed to speak with her husband.  I took the opportunity to review all of her questions once again and then go into more detail on the MAP service.  After taking her to the MAP site, she was very excited about the plan all over again.  
-Said she would discuss everything with her husband and hopefully make a final decision in the next few days.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-06 09:55:06', '2021-01-06 09:55:06'),
