  ('zcrm_1579374000061916024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964393', 'Michele Thome', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled call for Friday, January 8, 2021 at 10:00 a.m. EST. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-06 09:07:50', '2021-01-06 09:08:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061921006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924034', 'Scott Robinson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-06 09:06:52', '2021-01-06 09:06:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061911013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061045091', 'Yilin Zhang', NULL, 'Yilin called wondering where all of her new membership materials were.  I explained a general timeline when she could receive these items and encouraged her to schedule a welcome call with us. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-06 08:42:53', '2021-01-06 08:42:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061916019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964393', 'Michele Thome', NULL, 'Email verification sent about Cirrus MD registration. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-06 08:30:41', '2021-01-06 08:30:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061911008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768391', 'Srinivasa Reddibathuni', NULL, 'Srinivasa called to ask how he could get his membership cards asap 5 minutes after I was informed he was just enrolled with us.  I explained that I was just getting his Welcome email ready to go but that his cards will come from Planstin and Zion as soon as they are entered into their system. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-06 08:27:11', '2021-01-06 08:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061916011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583361', 'Renee Rowe', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Already registered with Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-06 07:57:38', '2021-01-06 08:23:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061916003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059881171', 'Hazar Habbab', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Mike. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-06 07:52:42', '2021-01-06 07:53:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061911003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'SEE TICKETS from Angelo. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-06 07:20:36', '2021-01-06 07:20:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061860061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '1-5-21 Kristen is joining now in SECURE. She is small biz owner in family biz. Also sounds like she''ll fund HSA for tax benefits. $1000/$275.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-05 17:34:31', '2021-01-05 17:41:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061860056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165306', 'Bonnie Eckert', NULL, '1-5-21 Bonnie just completed her cancellation form online with my assistance. They somehow found a Cigna PPO as self-employed people. I have no idea how they found it and she thought it was from a cold call. She should be all set moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-05 16:47:30', '2021-01-05 16:47:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061860043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '1-5-21 Sandra is concerned bc she had a weird pap last year with some strange cells. She did a Leap procedure to get rid of them. She was told to wait a year. She then went in recently for her 1 year pap screening again and they found some weird cells again which they are again recommending another Leap procedure. She had a biopsy and they show pre-cancerous cells. She''s nervous in case she winds up with a cancer diagnosis bc she''s under the pre-x clause of sharing cap at $25K which may not cover cancer if she winds up with that diagnosis somewhere in the next few years.
We looked at C4 plan options and with $50K income and APTC of $304 she can get Anthem or Friday Health to keep Dr. Phillip Priebe who she likes. But, she still wants a 2nd opinion. She will be very sad to leave MPB bc she really likes the self-pay rates that she''s been getting. They give her a 30% discount by paying cash up front. The cheapest Friday Health is about $224 per month with an $8550 ded and mop. That may be her best option at this point to play it safe. She will call C4 to login to her account and call me tomorrow after 12:30 when she''s had time to process it all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-05 16:08:36', '2021-01-05 16:09:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480158', 'Margaret Weaver', NULL, '-Member called to say that she spoke with CirrusMD regarding pains that are shooting from the front to back of her chest.  She knows it is not a heart attack and does not want to go to the ER but needs to know what type of doctor to go to. 
-Member was warm transferred to Zion.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-05 15:20:00', '2021-01-05 15:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001781007', 'William (Bill) Schaefer', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent him online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-05 14:58:35', '2021-01-05 14:58:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058195001', 'Steve Ramona', NULL, 'Steve forgot about the welcome call and asked to reschedule. Sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-05 14:42:45', '2021-01-05 14:42:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670004', 'Holly Hill', NULL, 'Missed Welcome call, sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-05 14:39:55', '2021-01-05 14:39:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670004', 'Holly Hill', NULL, '- Called to speak with Kellyanne regarding Welcome Call.  She said she did not get a confirmation email.  Member was told about the issue with  Confirmation emails.  She was transferred to Kellyanne''s extension.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-05 14:35:23', '2021-01-05 14:35:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Sandra called because her doctors are doing more testing for ovarian cancer, she told me that she has been dealing with this on and on since last year.  I explained that there would be a $25,000 cap.  She is distraught, I transferred her to Wendy to hopefully help her get on to a traditional insurance plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-05 14:00:42', '2021-01-05 14:00:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061842023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921716', 'Polly Tucker', NULL, '1/5/2021 spoke to Polly regarding her appointment today.  She recently became a member and was wondering if her mamo gram would be covered today..  DP Her membership began 1/1/2021 so I transferred her to Planstin  because she has Secure and a Mec   DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-05 13:45:56', '2021-01-05 13:57:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921278', 'Timothy Dilley', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Great call! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-05 13:42:04', '2021-01-05 13:42:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725092', 'Mark Garcia', NULL, 'Member called in and needed to update his Account information.  I sent link  1/6-account updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-05 13:25:53', '2021-01-06 08:01:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, '-Member called to say she wants to open a NEEDS with Zion due to her pregnancy.
-Member was connected to Zion.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-05 13:11:39', '2021-01-05 13:11:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549095', 'Sean Frankhouse', NULL, '-Ticket stated he needed to make an appointment with TeleHealth and that he was not registered.  After reviewing his plan, he has TELEDOC with Redirect.  A message was left stating that he needs to reach out to Redirect for those services.  I left a number for him to call.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-05 12:59:52', '2021-01-05 12:59:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061842018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '1/5/2021 spoke to Aaron concerning an ear, nose and throat physician in his area. He also wanted me to add his e-mail to the family membership which is Aaronweiner00@gmail.com           He is Randall''s son, and is a member.   DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-05 12:58:13', '2021-01-05 12:58:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061860038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058609163', 'Denise Schulz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-05 12:31:25', '2021-01-05 12:31:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362044', 'Therese Antonino', NULL, 'Received Payment update form in I updated in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-05 12:28:00', '2021-01-05 12:28:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061841060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798003', 'Merret Anne Mann', NULL, 'Merret double booked and then wouldn''t take help from Vanessa, would only speak to me.  Vanessa asked what she could help her with, Vanessa saw the email that I had already sent to her and said "look! Kelly''s already given you the answer, I''ll resend it to you!"    I tried calling Merret myself but it wasn''t at the scheduled time, because that''s not when I am scheduled for calls....and the line disconnected after two rings.  I resent all important info over to her, she has all of the tools that she needs.  It''s up to her now. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-05 11:55:07', '2021-01-05 11:55:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061860028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798003', 'Merret Anne Mann', NULL, 'Spoke to Merret thought the call was going to be with Kelly C. Kelly has been in contact with this women many times. Refer to notes. Sent her email to reschedule call. Also she wanted to know how to submit bills to Zion. Sent email on how to do so. This  information was already emailed to her on December 2, 2020.', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-05 11:15:00', '2021-01-05 11:15:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061842013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007369033', 'James Sorensen', NULL, '1/5/2021 James called wondering if he  he should show his Zion card when going to his Alternative Medical Professional..DP', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2021-01-05 10:55:08', '2021-01-05 10:55:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061860023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654211', 'Hans Erickson', NULL, 'No response. Mailbox not set up yet. Not able to leave message. Sent email to reschedule the call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2021-01-05 10:36:00', '2021-01-05 10:36:00'),
