  ('zcrm_1579374000061841034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, '-Spoke with Dena regarding SECURE Plan.  Is interested.  Will be talking to her tomorrow morning at 10am for further clarification.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2021-01-05 09:48:53', '2021-01-05 09:48:53'),
