  ('zcrm_1579374000061841026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'This member so far has not paid us any money and now owes set up &amp; 2 months .  I will call &amp; email member. 1/6 - I emailed Wendy to get involved and I heard from Rita and she sent me in the same bank info I retried', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2021-01-05 08:55:53', '2021-01-06 10:57:05'),
