  ('zcrm_1579374000061799054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '1-4-21 Robin called bc originally 6 months ago Dr. Katie Mang-Smith showed up in the PHCS network but Valley View Women''s Health is saying they don''t accept the PHCS network. BUT, Dr. Emily McCarty IS showing up in the network on the PHCS network site. I told her to call the MPB Concierge for further assistance and ideas of next steps. She''s much rather see an ob/gyn for her annual women''s health physical than Dr. Knaus her Family Practice doctor. She was scheduled to go in for annual visit and Valey View called her 2 hrs before her visit to say PHCS isn''t an accepted network! She will call Concierge tomorrow and seek help from them as to what to do. If all else fails, we will determine next steps, perhaps ask Tim or choose PCP dr.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-04 16:36:58', '2021-01-04 16:37:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061799049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '1-4-21 Kristen is 60 and no ins now bc Anthem messed up her payments 6 months ago and she missed Jan. 1st deadline. She never goes to the dr. No pre-x other than thyroid issue treated with meds and hormone issues treated with estrogen and progesterone. Both are affordable and she already pays cash for them anyhow through GoodRX.  Came to me via Carolyn Glah and Susan Kinney, but primarily Carolyn. She goes to chiro but pays cash already as well. She already did a mammogram a few years ago and a colonoscopy once a few years ago. Otherwise doesn''t do annual wellness visits or immunizations. So, she''d rather do CARE+. Employment status is employed with family business which she''s part owner but is paid by the LLC. She''s not certain how it''s set up if it will be considered as self-employment or biz owner. But, doesn''t matter if chooses CARE+ anyhow. $215/$1000. Also likes to do alternative medicine to avoid doctors at all costs. Does do blood draw for thyroid. Wants Feb. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-04 16:22:43', '2021-01-04 20:59:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061799041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '1-4-21 Michael wants a life insurance policy for just him right now. They had a family policy for $125 for $2M for him, $500K for Hilary and $100K each for kids. They had 10 year term and now price is going up to $1200 month for just him! He had the 2nd best rating 10 years ago with Trans America. He wants to focus on $500K, $1M, or $2M for him at 10 or longer term. Doesn''t want to run into the price increase again in 10 years!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-04 15:33:56', '2021-01-04 15:33:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061799036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003748040', 'Natalie Lampert', NULL, '1-4-20 I let Natalie know we don''t pay out the referral fee for clients who are already with MPB. She wants a referral fee for if/when Ben Lampert choose to move away from LHS to possibly SECURE. I plan to waive Ben''s $100 Admin Set Up fee since he''s been with MPB for many years! They are brother/sister. Ben referred Natalie years ago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-04 15:14:52', '2021-01-04 15:14:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061794038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844042', 'Roland Doucette', NULL, 'I sent a quote from Reid at World Meds as an option while she waits to see what happens with Prescription Bliss. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-04 14:58:04', '2021-01-04 14:58:04'),
