  ('zcrm_1579374000061799031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091208', 'Cheryl Yeary', NULL, '1-4-20 Cheryl now sees her List Bill. She wants to set it up for auto-pay here on out and of course still receive the invoice every month. She will wait until tomorrow when Tricia is back in the office to finalize it all for her and her EF one employee ES who joined both with Nextera. The rest of the employees kept UHC and want to watch and see how this all works for Cheryl and employee. Letting them test the waters until they jump ship from UHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-04 14:36:39', '2021-01-04 14:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061794033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Teresa called in to say that her husband had hurt his back.  She asked if all she needed to do was pay up to the $5000 IUA and then it will be covered?  I told her not necessarily- for alternative care, this needs to be pre-approved first.....I told her to fill out the needs form on the link I sent her to have that done and opened so that at least they can tell if it will be pre-approved or not while he is seeking treatment. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2021-01-04 14:25:58', '2021-01-04 14:25:58'),
