  ('zcrm_1579374000061799018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '1-4-21 Michael called in bc his daughter Lauren is at the drs. now and wanted member #, etc. I re-explained he needs to tell them they don''t have insurance and pay the cash price up to $1000. He thinks she might need surgery. I reaffirmed it''s not possibly a pre-x and he said no it''s not pre-x. It''s completely unexpected.  He understands and he also knows he needs to complete his welcome call. He also needs to set up each family member on CirrusMD and will get help with that next from Concierge.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-04 11:33:31', '2021-01-04 11:33:31'),
