  ('zcrm_1579374000061799008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '1-4-21 Nanci called to figure out how to do her mammogram. She never received a Planstin card. So, I told her to call Concierge Team to get a new digital and hard copy card which she will do. She said there''s only one place in town which is Boulder Community Hospital to get mammogram. Looks like they are in network, but I told her just to double check before she goes.  UPDATE - She''s not on Planstin and doesn''t have a MEC. She''s with Sedera / No MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-04 11:07:43', '2022-02-18 11:50:06'),
