  ('zcrm_1579374000061799003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826196', 'Christopher Howe', NULL, '1-4-21 Tina Rutherford called on behalf of her husband Chris Howe and simply wanted to understand what to do in case of a new Need they are dealing with. She called the # on her Apex card and panicked when they told her he has a $3K deductible. I explained that card is ONLY for wellness visits and HSA compliance. I explained he needs to go in as a self pay patient and get the cash price. Then call the Concierge for assistance in next steps. She was relieved and said that sounds more like what she previously understood. All set! Helped her since Andrea is gone for a while.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-01-04 10:59:59', '2021-01-04 10:59:59'),
