  ('zcrm_1579374000061711003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045976082', 'Stacey Garrett', NULL, '12-31-20 Amanda is asking about Dental and Vision. I asked her to call her dentist to find out what dental ins they accept for individuals. She will do so. I will send her VSP options. She was also asking about maternity because looking to get pregnant ASAP. Described SECURE membership to her bc of better maternity. She will wait to make sure she''s not pregnant yet. Once confirmed she will call me when they decide. If pregnant they will just stay put. If not, will consider the switch and knows of the 60 day waiting period which she''s not psyched about bc close to turning 40. Both Dr. I looked up are showing up in the PHCS network, Dr. Erica McCarty and Andrew Henrichs PA. They use a local chiro friend who charges only $40 per visit, so they can continue to pay that on their own. No pre-x in family. They just want to make sure they can still get their preventative colonoscopies since problems run in their families, protect for major accidents/illnesses and best option for maternity. SECURE will save them $116 per month, lower their IUA and lower their cost by $3k for maternity. Amanda is also working on getting her name changed to her married name, but SS office closed for holidays.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-31 11:25:53', '2020-12-31 11:25:53'),
