  ('zcrm_1579374000061441023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238442', 'Anne DeWaters', NULL, 'Anne DeWaters called she needed to to speak to Sedera about an upcoming surgery....I explained that they were closed, because it is Christmas Eve.  She didn''t like that answer "F%%%!   and then I have to go home to straighten out my F$$$tard brother!"  She didn''t have Sedera''s phone number so I gave it to her and told her that she could try them now....but that it would be best to give them a phone call on Monday.  I reached out to Sedera via Slack and told them that she was upset that she couldn''t get a hold of them today (despite the holiday) and asked that someone reach out to her on Monday.  Messaging Wendy about this as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-24 12:42:11', '2020-12-24 12:42:11'),
