  ('zcrm_1579374000061289039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255020', 'Timothy Cobbett', NULL, '12-22-20 Cheryl Yeary passed along my audio and supporting email and all documentation to educate him. She also was planning to help him enroll. He enrolled on his own successfully! I did not have a chance to speak with him personally since he''s part of the employer group and educated through Cheryl. Group Dakota Ridge DIRECT  $1000/$635 EF.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-22 18:10:25', '2020-12-22 18:13:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061289034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067763189', 'Karen Levine', NULL, '12-22-20 Karen is 63 and husband is 64. They just signed up for Sedera today and moved away from LHS. But, Nancy Thompson called her and told her to call me ASAP since this SECURE membership sounded better. I explained some of the differences and shortfalls of Sedera''s membership in comparison to SECURE. Her husband is self-employed. They do want Jan. 1st start date. I let them know that Sedera will refund their money if they choose to cancel before their membership begins. She will let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-22 16:19:00', '2020-12-22 16:19:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061289026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, '12-22-20 Nancy was super nice! She said I was incredibly helpful with her when she was in charge of Joy Spring''s executor when she passed away past year. She''s interested in traditional health insurance or MCS. She has LHS now and was curious about Sedera. BUT, she had a hip surgery 2 1/4 years ago. She hasn''t had any visits since then. Might wants PRP therapy in the future, but hardware super solid and secure. She also had rotator cuff surgery 6 months ago and she''s not worried about that. It''s healed great.  When we looked up trad her APTC with $60K is $279 a month. But, if earn $70K then she''d lose that and full cost of lowest plan is $644 in order to keep Dr. Blackwood. Dr. McCarty is not in network for either of Anthem or Cigna. Her husband is 74 11/18/46 and she''s 61 at 10/10/59, 80301. Paying $399 to LHS now and fighting to get paid back from LHS. Would love to get a Jan. 1st start date if LHS will allow her to cancel for Jan. 1st, 2021. None of her current providers will accept LHS anymore either. She''s not pleased with them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-22 15:56:50', '2020-12-22 15:57:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061292003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578349', 'Marie Burns', NULL, 'Call with Marie, she is requesting to push back Effective Date to FEB 1.  Husband is retiring one month later than planned. He will have group benefits for them through Jan. 31.  - Jane', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2020-12-22 15:27:42', '2020-12-22 15:27:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061291003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929321', 'Ruth Jackson', NULL, '-Jane called on behalf of Member and then did a 3 way merge to discuss getting a coupon for the medication Intrarosa 6.5 inserts.  Member needs help with finding a discount since she is on a limited income.  
-Email was sent out regarding discounted card and a phone number for the member to call.  Unfortunately, the coupons we found were still too expensive and over $200 which she can not afford.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-12-22 14:20:39', '2020-12-23 09:18:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061289013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042933004', 'James Pendleton', NULL, '12-22-20 Jim was charged in Dec. for old and new membership. Talked with Patti and she will refund him the $545 right away but just needs his bank account since can''t refund cc. He''s running up to the house right now to call her before she leaves for the day.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-22 14:17:08', '2020-12-22 14:17:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061258123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042933004', 'James Pendleton', NULL, 'Need to refund this member the Redirect Amt for Dec Refunded 12/22', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-22 14:14:31', '2020-12-22 14:31:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061289008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '12-22-20 Called her back to let her know looks like account was refunded on Nov. 19th for enrollment fee according to Patti''s notes. I also gave her the name of 3 doctors above bc she lost the note she wrote them on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-22 14:03:05', '2020-12-22 14:03:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061258118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061255326', 'Fred Winkler', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 50-64 Conn Wkst', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-22 14:02:40', '2020-12-22 14:02:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061258113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806201', 'Marti Winkler', NULL, 'HES member from 1/1/2017 to 12/31/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-22 13:56:02', '2020-12-22 13:56:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061280043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, 'I called Elizabeth per Wendy to let her know that I ran a search for free covid testing in her area as well as the fact she has another option to go to any provider in Zion''s network and get a discount that has already been negotiated.  Elizabeth thanked me for my time and said she was already searching online for a free test. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-22 13:49:03', '2020-12-22 13:49:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061258108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810493', 'Michael Lutfy', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-22 13:44:09', '2020-12-22 13:44:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061258103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810493', 'Michael Lutfy', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled in the Secure option', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-22 13:43:50', '2020-12-22 13:43:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061289003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, '12-22-20 Lizzy called to get help with Covid testing but left a vm over the weekend. I asked KellyAnne to call her just now and she will do so. :-)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-22 13:38:40', '2020-12-22 13:38:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061280038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091742', 'Louise Meusel', NULL, 'Louise called in to me today because she reported that she called Zion, got to speak with an "Amy" and that "Amy" gave her information about her plan that Louise said almost made her faint.   "Amy"s instructions to Louise were that Louise would have to wait for the bills to come, pay the IUA for her husband and do this before the 31st when Steven''s last day on the plan is (he is aging out) .  So Louise is calling us, begging us to make sure there is more time for her to actually get this done before the 31st.  She said she would write them a check right now.   I told her that we would advocate for her but I wanted to transfer the line to Patti and have John listen as well.  Patti wasn''t available.  John said he would give her a phone call back. 
Louse said that Amy sounded new and was unsure of her answers, she is hesitant to give them a call back first before she tried to get help from us. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-22 13:22:10', '2020-12-22 13:22:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061258098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037471035', 'Judith Lucas', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will notify Sedera Billing cancelled already.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-22 13:00:15', '2020-12-22 13:00:15');
