  ('zcrm_1579374000061258093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003748040', 'Natalie Lampert', NULL, 'Member emailed me and said that she was having financial issues this month and would not have enough money when we drafted.  said she would have money in 1-2 days.  I responded and told her I could give her 2 day but would have to have $ by Xmas break.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-22 12:51:29', '2020-12-22 12:51:29'),
