  ('zcrm_1579374000061280003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522092', 'Nancy Allawos', NULL, 'Nancy called MPB to finish choosing a plan- I had to stop her and remind her that she was Wendy''s lead and had a conversation with her about her hip back in Aug 19''- transferred the line to Wendy and reached out to Wendy about this on Slack. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-22 09:41:05', '2020-12-22 09:41:05'),
