  ('zcrm_1579374000061238003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052864149', 'Catherine Brown', NULL, '12-21-20 Cancelled since she got a subsidy on C4. She said she chose a "traditional healthcare plan that won''t require us to call well in advance to get approval. too difficult to know about healthcare reimbursement." She had Redirect and clearly struggled with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-21 16:29:50', '2020-12-21 16:29:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061218008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788057', 'Jean Thompson', NULL, 'I helped Jean with a Provider search, I also sent her preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-21 14:59:09', '2020-12-21 14:59:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061208013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737144', 'Catherine Rongey', NULL, 'This member called in to ask about cancelling.  I told her that I would get the link out to her and that she needed to get that back to me ASAP as it will be billing tomorrow .  I cancelled billing ahead of tomorrow.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-21 14:11:29', '2020-12-21 14:14:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061208008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061224018', 'Billie Brownell', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-21 14:03:12', '2020-12-21 14:03:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061218003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'David was emailing John stating that he still needed help with finding a covered Shingles vax.  I resent the original email and then gave him a call and left a vm that directed him to check his email and that all that he needs is inside.  I told him that he can reach back out to me with any questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-21 13:27:35', '2020-12-21 13:27:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061208003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012724007', 'Brenda Flowers-Specht', NULL, 'Member called into the Concierge and let me know that her husband had gone on Medicare 11/1 and that she had been being billed for him.  She did not submit any forms to us at all.  I sent her out the plan change form with instructions to fill out ASAP.  I will try to get money back &amp; refund.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-21 13:06:52', '2020-12-21 13:06:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061171023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725001', 'Kathleen Malone', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-21 12:34:35', '2020-12-21 12:34:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061153046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161176', 'Lisa Ryerson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-21 12:16:25', '2020-12-21 12:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061171018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, 'Sara understands the pre-x cap with Zion and is totally fine with it.  She is so so happy and grateful for CC service and looks forward to starting this process with Jami.  I tried to warm transfer but only got Jami''s voicemail.  I left a message with Jami to please call Sara back sometime today as she is on a road trip and will be in the car all day.  I also sent Jami a HCBB secure email asking that she call Sara back directly.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-21 11:42:15', '2020-12-21 11:42:15'),
