  ('zcrm_1579374000061096013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654211', 'Hans Erickson', NULL, '12-18-20 Enrolling in CARE+ $215/$1000. He just had a puck to the face in Jan. and got stitches. All set now. He''s a character. Took forever to get reimbursed from LHS. Waiter in Aspen area making about $40K-$50K.  He''s super enthusiastic and happy to move to this away from LHS. He will also share this with his friends.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 17:34:46', '2020-12-18 17:40:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061096008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012485012', 'Colby Adams-Waneka', NULL, '12-18-20 Patti cancelled Colby for non-payment. Colby thought he''s paid the whole time. Cari is double checking. Colby wasn''t able to get the meds he needed this past time so he wants to cancel anyhow. After he jumped through hoops and got doctor records, etc. and submitted them to CirrusMD they told him they can''t give him the meds even though they did it before. Therefore, he doesn''t believe the membership is worthwhile any longer. He will submit a cancellation form but also check on the billing since April 24th. Cari will let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 16:45:56', '2020-12-18 16:45:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061096003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238350', 'Amy Wentworth', NULL, '12-18-20 Amy called in a bit upset about her experience primarily with Redirect but initially blaming it on MPB. But, Redirect is still supposed to reimburse her for her annual wellness visit. I gave her the extrahelp link to use. She was following their processes and still didn''t have success. Then within all that she was diagnosed with breast cancel and had a double mastectomy! It''s all done and all went well. She was super healthy otherwise and no issues prior. She got nervous about using Sedera and hospital recommended she apply for Medicaid which she did and was approved for her and her son. They''ve paid everything except the initial $2800 which was before she was on Medicaid. But, they will back date it and pay for 3 months prior.  So, she''s waiting for that. She kept this PDHC as back up and considering cancelling. But, I also let her know that this will now be pre-x if she cancels and renews once her income is back. I also suggested she could cancel her son and keep her on, if she thinks she wants to join again later.  Cost would be $312 instead of $567 for EO instead of EC. She will ponder over the weekend and try to decide by Sunday. Told her she can cancel after but easiest to do so by 20th. She was very appreciative.  She''s also young, 47.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 16:26:03', '2020-12-18 16:26:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061086049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061092044', 'Charles Kinne', NULL, '12-18-20 Charlie is 62 and Linda 63. They prefer traditional ins. He says they are old school.  Income she''s guessing around $40K. We input it as all self-employment even though he gets $20K from investment $, $10K capital gains, $10K self-employment. But, that didn''t register and put him into Medicaid. We moved all income to $40K in case he makes more than expected. This way he may get money back rather than a penalty come tax time. His income fluctuates significantly. He has family history of heart disease and has high cholesterol and blood pressure. Also ER visit due to dizziness which turned out to be nothing other than high blood pressure. No heart issues found. Wife has high cholesterol and other meds. Dr. Clark Zimmerman showing as only accepting Bright Health. He''s getting an APTC of about $1265 and his monthly cost is $349 Bright Silver $0 ded. He will need a stress test this year which can cost a lot. All set for Jan. 1st start date. But, I told him he has to call C4HCO to request the Jan. 1st start date and to call before 6:00 tonight!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 15:32:31', '2020-12-18 15:35:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061067068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, 'Katie has been having a difficult time with her Sedera needs coordinator, in fact I reached out to Dania about the same issue a few weeks back.  Dania''s response was....."I''ll give it to her needs coordinator" .
I reached out on Slack again tonight to ask the same think.  Hey guys Benjamin''s mom is super confused and calling us again because she is having a hard time uploading the bills to you....the needs coordinator needs to call her right away.  We''ll see if that works.  I tried calling Katie, but it went to vm.  I left a long voicemail explaining that I again had reached out to Sedera and asked them to reach back out to her to help her.  (hopefully things get straightened out this time for her)

I am leaving this open because I haven''t gotten a response back from Sedera  and I want to check in with Katie on Monday. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-18 15:27:43', '2020-12-18 15:28:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061086038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '12-18-20 Krista is enrolling now. SECURE $1000/$500 ES Jan. 1st start date. MOHS surgery for squamous cell carinoma in lower left leg in May 2019 and understands it''s pre-x.  No further issues.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 15:13:22', '2020-12-18 15:15:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061067063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, 'Wendy told me that Sara''s case is a pre-ex because she is almost certain it started in August.  Wendy went over the pre-ex cap with her but asked me to reiterate it again.  I told Wendy that I would. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-18 14:31:45', '2020-12-18 14:31:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061058033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form to add daughter Kallie back to the planeff 1/1/20.  I adjusted pricing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-18 14:22:51', '2020-12-18 14:22:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061067058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, 'left a message with Sara as promised at end of day to update her that HCBB is processing her information and that we will pick up the process early next week.    Also I need to figure out if this is pre x and let her know if there is the $25,000 cap. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-18 14:18:09', '2020-12-18 14:18:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061067053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012791079', 'Francis Ramirez', NULL, 'I sent Francis free Covid test links, explained to him that he cannot submit his preventative care bill because they weren''t in network (he never checked in the first place) and then sent him directlabs.com and other online lab store sites where he can get a discount on his lab work.....because it was out of network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-18 14:15:33', '2020-12-18 14:15:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061067048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057170036', 'Derek Dimitri', NULL, 'Rita called to say that she needs to cancel from the plan.  I sent her a member update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-18 14:05:55', '2020-12-18 14:05:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061067043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893122', 'Phillip Haddad', NULL, 'loose unscripted Welcome Call complete.  spent 45 minutes on the phone with Phillip....nice guy and eager to learn! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-18 13:21:03', '2020-12-18 13:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061086033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091256', 'Cynthia Shiko', NULL, '12-18-20 Cynthia is 61 and lives near me I believe on Franklin behind me. She is healthy, just takes anxiety meds generic Prozac, trazadone and Fluoxetine, and HRT for bio identical hormones due to age related issues. No tobacco, no other health issues. She''s active, exercises, eats well, etc. Uses Tracy Shulsinger as PA for HRT and she loves her. Self-employed and works for functional health company. Choosing SECURE $1000/$275. Wants Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 12:56:46', '2020-12-18 12:56:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061090008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091292', 'Carl Cheetham', NULL, '12.18.20:  Called.  L/M to C/B.  Carl emailed me. He is ready to enroll. Helped him enroll today and told him what "Welcom" materials to expect.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-12-18 12:14:46', '2020-12-18 14:45:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061090003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659573', 'Robin Bernhard', NULL, '12.18.20:  Robin returned my call.  Left a message that she found other insurance that will work for her, so she is good for now.  Called her back to find out what insurance she bought and if there is anything else we can help her with.  L/M.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-12-18 12:11:23', '2020-12-18 12:11:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061067033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141488', 'Evian Hanshaw', NULL, 'Evian called in confused as to who called her and left a message.  After a long talk we figured out it was her needs coordinator at Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-18 11:41:16', '2020-12-18 11:41:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061086028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039780126', 'Brian Van Blaricom', NULL, '12-18-20 Just wants something showing proof of membership for fabrication shop he works for.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 11:33:43', '2020-12-18 11:33:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061086023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '12-18-20 She wanted to know what cards to use and what to do when traveling to Mexico tomorrow. Told her to go in as self-pay patient for all situations except her annual wellness visit. She can leave Planstin card at home and doesn''t need Zion card to complicate matters. She can bring her MPB Card for the QR Life Code on it. She was super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 11:30:10', '2020-12-18 11:30:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061086018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '12-18-20 I talked with Krista extensively and answered the rest of her questions. I should have just started fresh with her to eliminate so many questions. She is originally from CO, Lakewood and Littleton. Misses CO but it''s so expensive. Now lives in Santa Fe, NM. She lost 1/3 of her income this year due to covid. She is self-employed and husband''s work offers terrible ins. She broker her little toe recently and wants it looked at further. Understands the pre-x clause and looked at LHS Conversion price which is $100 more per month, so she is fine with dealing with pre-x on her own. Also does her annual wellness visits every year. She did have knee surgery in 2016 from a car accident. Sounds like goes to chiro now due to that, but also will be pre-x. Looking at SECURE - $1000/$500. I will talk with her again at 3:00 to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 11:23:35', '2020-12-18 11:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061067028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, 'Sara called in today to get help setting up a torn miniscus (L) surgery.  I asked her some questions and told her all about Care Connect.  The hold up is right now that she is not in HCBB''s system.....and can''t be found on any of the eligibility files.  I have asked John to send her information over to HCBB. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-18 10:34:30', '2020-12-18 10:34:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061067023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, 'see ticket! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-18 10:29:54', '2020-12-18 10:29:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061086013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683052', 'Emory Patterson', NULL, '12-18-20 Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO 7000 for HSA.  Plan ID 76680CO0220022-01.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 10:24:07', '2020-12-18 10:24:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061086008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491580', 'Francis Lanzano', NULL, '12-18-20 Called to verify if he''s on Select or Access with Sedera. As Indiv he''s an Access member now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 10:18:04', '2020-12-18 10:18:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061086003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, '12-18-20 Sara has a torn meniscus that happened she believes in Aug. That means it''s pre-x which I told her. So, she now knows it''s capped at $25K sharing. I gave her the Concierge # to call to get assistance. She has another doctor''s appoinment soon to determine if needs surgery. She''s had x-rays already, PT isn''t helping and it''s still causing problems. She was super nice. Rodney got on the phone and chatted with me as well. Shared story of Donald Trump Jr. sending private, personal text to Sara regarding a hunting group they are part of.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-18 10:06:12', '2020-12-18 10:06:12'),
