  ('zcrm_1579374000061025021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659573', 'Robin Bernhard', NULL, '12.16.20:  Patti briefed me on Robin''s current healthcare situation.  She asked me to take over this prospective sale and call Robin.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-12-17 17:20:08', '2020-12-17 17:20:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061025008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '12.17.20:  Krista called.  I told her since Wendy started working with her a few years ago, I''d like to have Wendy continue working with her now.  She said that would be fine but asked me to answer some questions for her at that moment.  She''s not happy with LHS taking 6 mos. to reimburse her for every need and not happy about the price hike.  She asked some questions about Secure, preventive care, Zion medical cost sharing, alternative medicine.  She likes what she heard and is very interested in moving forward.  I will contact Wendy to get in touch with Krista.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-12-17 15:03:30', '2020-12-17 15:03:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061025003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, '12.16.20:  Received a quote request from Krista re: the Secure plan.  Interested in $1000 IUA.  Called and left a message to call me back. (Didn''t know she was Wendy''s prospect until I tried to put her in  Leads).', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-12-17 14:55:41', '2020-12-17 14:55:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061015018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779348', 'Mary Beth Bruner', NULL, 'Mary Beth called because she claimed she never received the cancellation form that Michele sent her yesterday.  I guided her to the email.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-17 14:43:41', '2020-12-17 14:43:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061003037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380257', 'Rachel Brisson', NULL, '12-17-20 Rachel just learned that her husband''s employer is going to start paying for spouses coverage in 2021 as well! So, she''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-17 14:34:38', '2020-12-17 14:34:38'),
