  ('zcrm_1579374000061003027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006173', 'Brian Delaney', NULL, '12-17-20 Brian Delaney is enrolling now in SECURE $1000/$275.  It took him 6 minutes and only about 4 once he got onto the site!  All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-17 14:06:54', '2020-12-17 14:06:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061008038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-17 14:00:21', '2020-12-17 14:00:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061003013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '12-17-20 Nathan is healthy, no meds, no pre-x, no tobacco. He and Maya Burlingame are married now! They wanted to all be on same membership to keep continuity. They just cancelled PDHC since it was going to be $905 ($500 IUA Sedera) a month vs $685($1000 IUA Zion). I explained pre-x clause bc she has post-partum depression and taking prozac now. Has an appointment soon. She knows she will pay for that at cash price. Also explained to always ask for cash price when not going in for wellness visits. They get it. Chose SECURE $1000/$685 EF Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-17 13:54:41', '2021-01-18 15:23:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061008033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006092', 'Nicole Mata', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-17 13:49:46', '2020-12-17 13:49:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000061015008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755369', 'Rachel Allen', NULL, 'Rachel booked a welcome call for the 21st....her plan doesn''t start until Jan 1.  I cancelled the time slot and emailed Rachel why I was going to cancel it and asked that she rebook after the 1st.    So....she doesn''t respond to my email.  Rather, she goes back and books the SAME TIME on the SAME DAY that I had originally cancelled.  I am going to talk to Joan about this one. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-17 13:45:28', '2020-12-17 13:45:28'),
