  ('zcrm_1579374000061003003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491580', 'Francis Lanzano', NULL, '12-17-20 Francis was told by Sedera that they will share in the cost of his rapid covid test that''s $99 as long as he completes a form they gave to him. The first person told him no it''s not shared and the call dropped. The 2nd person at Sedera said yes as long as he completes their form. So, he just needed to know his IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-17 12:22:11', '2020-12-17 12:22:11'),
