  ('zcrm_1579374000060933117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564382', 'Gregg Wurtz', NULL, '12-16-20 Gregg discovered the Essentials Plan he signed does NOT include Dr. Corenman. So, I went  back to drawing board the the Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO HSA for $819.26 appears to include Dr. Corenman still! I sent him the new application. He already cancelled his other application directly with Anthem today after waiting to confirm his enrollment. Luckily he double checked the network and learned he needed to make a switch!  He will look it over tomorrow and enroll if it makes sense. His MT Anthem plan is a PPO which also includes Dr. Corenman but it''s $1001 or so per month. I believe his primary residence is here in CO as well, so not really kosher to keep MT. He will decide tomorrow morning.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-16 17:14:08', '2020-12-16 17:14:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060933112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005273011', 'Tina Le', NULL, '12-16-20 I found BOR form for Oscar to send to her. Or, if I help them enroll through my portal it will be even easier.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-16 16:03:22', '2020-12-16 16:03:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060933107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005273011', 'Tina Le', NULL, '12-16-20 Tina is looking to possibly move to Oscar plan OFF-Mkt and cost will be $1400 a month! She thinks she Might need a orthoscopic rotator cuff surgery. If so, the move might be wise if cost will be higher than $25K. I told her she can call Concierge for insight about that cost if she wants. She''s now trying to understand the Oscar plan better before she joins. Their accountant seems to have swayed them towards traditional insurance. They are not working with another Broker. So, I''m looking for the AOR form with Oscar in case they choose that path. She will let me now via email in a few days once she better understands it all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-16 16:01:13', '2020-12-16 16:01:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060946013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384233', 'Gregory Tatham', NULL, '12.16.20:  Greg sent in a cancellation form terminating on 12.31.20.  He said he was told by our concierge that we do not offer Major Medical.  Since that''s what he needs, he has gotten a plan through the market place.  I emailed him to clarify that since we are not health insurance, we, instead offer medical health sharing for catastrophic care, etc.  I also corrected some other issues he mentioned on his form, such as not enough education (no welcome call) on his plan.  Told him about our new plans and improved Concierge service.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-12-16 15:46:23', '2020-12-16 15:46:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060933102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899452', 'Kristopher Hall', NULL, '12-16-20 Sarah called me back and apologized bc she didn''t realize I did regular ins as well. She will discuss with Kris about switching to use me as Agent. They did spend 1 hr with some new guy on last Friday to join. But, she said I''ve been a huge help these past few years and might like to switch back to me. She''ll let me know ideally by Friday, the 18th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-16 15:22:57', '2020-12-16 15:22:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060936028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667149', 'Tonya Cauduro', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-16 14:58:34', '2020-12-16 14:58:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060933094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899452', 'Kristopher Hall', NULL, '12-16-20 Sarah Nolan and Kris found a new traditional insurance plan with Oscar Health. I''ve asked if they have an agent and sent the Select an Agent instructions but they haven''t answered that question. She wants to know how to cancel. I''ve left her a vm just now to explain the process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-16 14:49:02', '2020-12-16 15:21:25'),
