  ('zcrm_1579374000060933051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921634', 'Joanna Lyons', NULL, '12-16-20 Andrea is passing her clients to me while she is in AZ helping her mom with family matters. But, Joanna was somewhat educated already. I spent 30 minutes answering questions and explaining the rest. I also got her enrolled. But, I gave the client to Andrea still in spite of Andrea saying not to. I told Joanna that Andrea is still her point person, but if Andrea is still gone, I will help her. She appreciated that. Joanna runs a spa and salt cave in Telluride. She doesn''t have any pre-x. She did have an abnormal pap and then did the colposcopy. Results are all clear now. She has another pap screening in 6 months. She''s most worried about getting mammogram to be included at no cost in PHCS network. Dr. Wittman is in PHCS network which is within the same practice as her Dr. Bourkovski that she wants to see. Also, Montrose Memorial in Montrose and St. Mary''s in GJ both show as in PHCS network. BUT, I told her to verify with ALL involved in mammogram including radiologist to make sure it will be run through PHCS as in network.  She will ask.  She enrolled in SECURE $1000/$275 for Jan. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-16 11:24:36', '2020-12-16 11:24:36'),
