  ('zcrm_1579374000060904003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091292', 'Carl Cheetham', NULL, '12.15.20:  Carl emailed me to ask "how any health share ministry is HSA plan compliant.  Zion isn’t so how is your bundle make that happen?"  I responded by explaining the difference between health care  ministries (exempt and not allowed to offer HSA compliant plans) and how our program works with Planstin''s MEC high-deductible preventive health plan which is HSA compliant.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-12-16 07:02:48', '2020-12-16 07:02:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060864067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921312', 'Martin Dempsey', NULL, '12-15-20 Enrolling in SECURE for EC. Martin''s dr. said extremely rare to have any further complications with heart issue. Dr. is NOT concerned. $1000/$495 for Jan. 1st start date. Also Dr. Jonathan Zonca is in network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-15 17:50:33', '2021-01-04 11:36:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060864062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921312', 'Martin Dempsey', NULL, '12-8-20 Jenn called husband''s cardiologist and he got a glowing report. They are not worried about further issues with heart. Jenn IS worried about her recent breast cancer and she is also taking tomoxifin for 5 years now to avoid further problems. But, she understands the risk is too high if there''s a recurrence or if they deem anything new in another part of body as recurrence as well. Plus she''s had 7 basal cell carcinomas removed and did multiple MOHS surgeries. That is also too risky. So, she will go onto Anthem which I will look up for her Anthem Bronze Pathway X HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-15 17:49:06', '2020-12-15 17:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060864057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921312', 'Martin Dempsey', NULL, '12-1-20 Jenn is 54, husband Martin, 54, and kids 21, 19, 15. They were on super great company insurance, then Cobra and now sees the terrible individual plans. She was on hold for 2 hrs. and 50 min yesterday and they told her the system was down and they couldn''t help her after that! Daughter is in school in DC. She has occasional basal cell carcinoma and had stage 1 breast cancer this year and had lumpectomy. She will call Dr. to see chances of it coming back. She doesn''t believe it can or will.  Husband had aortic aneurysm 5 years ago and sees cardiologist 1x per year for check up and all is well. He was born with bi-cusped valve instead of tri-cusped.  She understands the pre-x clause and she is going to call their doctors to determine the risk of recurrence for either of them. She loves the sound of this otherwise and is eager to move forward depending on the doctor''s response.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-15 17:48:09', '2020-12-15 17:48:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060864052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060863094', 'Jenn Dempsey', NULL, '12-15-20 Enrolled in Anthem Pathway X Bronze HSA $608.82 for Jenn only due to recent breast cancer.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-15 17:44:16', '2020-12-15 17:44:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060864041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921229', 'Jared Allomong', NULL, '12-15-20 Jared 36 and wife, kids 1 and 4. They are healthy, no known pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. Interested in maternity and I told him of the 60 day waiting period. Is on LHS now but wound up paying most of birth after going to collections. He was never able to get the documents LHS wanted in the 6 month time frame they asked and therefore they never paid. He''s happy to be done with them. I told him how to cancel with them.  Enrolled SECURE $685/$1000 for Jan. 1st.  He wants to learn about the $1M Baby possibly in the new year after talking with Maya Burlingame about it. He has an investment person already who already advised against it. But, he will ponder and reach out in the new year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-15 16:36:53', '2020-12-15 17:00:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060884023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029949150', 'James Purvis', NULL, 'I took a late call from James, I helped him find some free Covid testing and explained his benefits as a refresher.  Sent lots of RCI info/preventative care info, another summary of plans email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-15 15:41:26', '2020-12-15 15:41:26'),
