  ('zcrm_1579374000060864021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808030', 'Mathieu Shields', NULL, '12-15-20 Matthieu will call his former employer to find out if he had dental insurance for 12 months. If so and he can show proof Delta Dental will likely wait the 12 month waiting period. He thinks he had it for exactly 12 months and the break was no more than 63 days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-15 12:16:11', '2020-12-15 12:16:11'),
