  ('zcrm_1579374000060828043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844315', 'Douglas Long', NULL, 'Spouse Hillary is a Sedera member.  I spoke previously to Doug and he was going to go on her membership so I sent him out the change link.  Late on that afternoon he enrolls in the Zion option.  Later I get a call transferred form Kelly C that now he wants to change his plan to DPC. Leslie Jablonski confused this member and told him he could change .  I will address after open enrollment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-15 10:19:26', '2020-12-15 10:20:20'),
