  ('zcrm_1579374000060799026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012485012', 'Colby Adams-Waneka', NULL, '12-14-20 Just discovered I''ve never received commission on this. Commissions were never entered. I called Patti and she will enter the commissions now and is leaving a note for John to make sure he''s moved to my account in Admin 123. I also left John a vm after reviewing the changes in Admin123. I need to be paid back to inception which was April 24th, 2020.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-14 12:37:51', '2020-12-14 12:37:51'),
