  ('zcrm_1579374000060799011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060801001', 'Katie Witters', NULL, '12-14-20 Hi Wendy, 
So sorry for the delay. We have decided to go with a different insurance company. Thank you so much for your help and your time,
Katie', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-14 11:11:48', '2020-12-14 11:11:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060799003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808030', 'Mathieu Shields', NULL, '12-24-20 Mathieu is enrolling now for SECURE $1000/$685 EF Jan. 1st start date. He will also enroll in Delta Dental and VSP.  He enrolled using his phone since he didn''t have his computer with him at work.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-14 10:43:30', '2020-12-14 10:43:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060776041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177222', 'Amy Vasterling', NULL, 'Member submitted a tkt asking if she could change her IUA as she will be having foot surgery .  I advised that very soon she will have to be re-enrolling w/Sedera and that at that time she could change her IUA.  However that would not apply to an existing need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-14 10:27:15', '2020-12-14 10:27:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060776033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781071', 'Dante Ali', NULL, '-Member called to say that he had his annual scheduled for today at 2pm and that he has not received his Planstin digital card yet. I spoke with Melissa at Planstin and she let me know she would send out the email to him.
-Left Message with Member regarding the Planstin emailing the card', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-12-14 10:02:09', '2020-12-14 10:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060776028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537009', 'Jeanine Ford', NULL, '-Member called to say she never received her QR Life Code.  Member was told that she would be send an old card for now and when I new card came in she would receive one then.
-Member also wanted additional information on the IUA.  Member now has a better understanding of how it works.
-Member also wanted to know what labs were covered by the ACA.  Member was told the two labs that were covered.  She now knows why she had to pay for the additional labs her doctor ordered for her.
-Member wanted to know where to upload a Healthcare Power of Attorney.  Member was given the option of transferring her to Zion directly or calling at a later time.  Member was given number to call at a later time.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-12-14 08:52:16', '2020-12-14 08:52:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060776023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013427005', 'Amber Schorie', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will porcess', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-14 07:22:23', '2020-12-14 07:22:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060776018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514075', 'Diane Burrell', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-14 07:11:31', '2020-12-14 07:11:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060776013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514384', 'Leo Hanus', NULL, 'Memebr emailed in to cancel I will send him out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-14 07:04:32', '2020-12-14 07:04:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060776008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286068', 'John Phinney', NULL, 'Member called in via Betties to cancel.  I will send him out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-14 06:54:57', '2020-12-14 06:54:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060776003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842427', 'Jill O''Dell', NULL, 'Member contacted Redirect &amp; requested cancellation.  I will send her out cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-14 06:52:30', '2020-12-14 06:52:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060771003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626228', 'Chelsea Mickeal', NULL, 'Per Rod no commissions are to be paid out on this member', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-13 20:10:20', '2020-12-13 20:10:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060711019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564382', 'Gregg Wurtz', NULL, '12-11-20 Gregg completed his application direct on Anthem but it didn''t connect to me bc he pressed the back button. So, I''ve asked him to complete the AOR form for me to get connected to his account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 18:27:04', '2020-12-11 18:27:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060711014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027648080', 'Beth Lichtenstein', NULL, '12-11-20 Hi Beth,

Here''s some helpful information to read. It sounds like your Social Security income counts towards your income. However, your son''s social security income may not count. I''d highly suggest speaking with a tax professional to gain clarity on this as well.

https://www.medicare.org/articles/does-social-security-count-as-income-for-medicaid/
Does Social Security Count as Income for Medicaid? | Medicare & Medicare Advantage Info, Help and Enrollment
Applying for Medicaid services involves an evaluation of your income and assets. These limits are determined by each state, but federal policy establishes what types of income and assets are counted or exempt for retirees. Common Types of Social Security Benefits The Social Security Administration (SSA) manages various benefits programs that pay cash allotments to […]
www.medicare.org
Assuming only your social security income counts, you are then borderline Medicaid eligible for a household of two. It will depend on your self-employment income for 2021.

I hope this helps!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 18:25:54', '2020-12-11 18:25:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060711003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808030', 'Mathieu Shields', NULL, '12-11-20 Mathieu and his wife are ready to enroll. I resent him the Delta Dental and VSP options to enroll directly. We have an appt on Monday to enroll for medical.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 18:06:22', '2020-12-11 18:09:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060679095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '12-11-20 Robin left vm saying she confirmed with MPB that she could see Dr. Katie Mang Smith for her mammogram. I just looked her up and I don''t see her in the PHCS network. Per notes above it looks like Katie was trying to get them to become a network provider. It doesn''t look like they obliged. I left Robin a vm. Sounds like she has a $450 bill to deal with!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 16:47:41', '2020-12-11 16:47:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060679090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '12-11-20 She''s debating whether or not to move away from LHS or switch to SECURE. Her dr. is not in network but per above, she''s willing to switch. She just needs to make sure if she does a mammogram next year all folks involved will be in network. Aspen Valley Radiology does show up in network which is half the battle. She''ll keep me posted on her decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 16:36:13', '2020-12-11 16:36:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060679085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027648080', 'Beth Lichtenstein', NULL, '12-11-20 Beth''s scenario is extremely unique. She and her son are getting Social Security income from her deceased spouse. I did not enter the Social Security income, the system automatically shows it at $38,400. She said they get $1700 a month each which totals $40,800. Perhaps her $1700 amount is slightly off. But the system seems to know how much they receive. Her self-employment income is super low, 2 years ago was down to $1000 after deductions. We put in $4000 for 2021. After school and health ins deductions her income is showing at $30,400. BUT, the system had already renewed her plan for 2021 with a $0 APTC for her same Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO for $740.50. She''s willing to pay full price since she wants to stay on Medicaid. SHe will have to pay back an entire year of APTC for last year because she was also on Medicaid. The Medicaid people she talked with tell her they don''t include Social Security in the income tally. I''m wary of that but she''s convinced that''s true. She pressed them every way possible to be sure and they reassured her. Either way, for 2021 she''s paying full price, so it doesn''t matter. She won''t get penalized. I told her to make sure she''s not bumped off for 2021. If so, we will need to push through a tax credit so she''s not paying full price. She will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 16:20:12', '2020-12-11 18:15:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060679077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683052', 'Emory Patterson', NULL, '12-11-20 We are leaving Emory on this plan as a secondary plan since the price doesn''t change for them. Plus this won''t restart her pre-x clause to hop off and back on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 15:09:20', '2020-12-11 15:09:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060679072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683052', 'Emory Patterson', NULL, '12-11-20 Husband earns $400K per year so definitely not subsidy but we still enrolled through C4 since Anthem was more difficult to apply through judging from my experience yesterday with another client. Lindsay was SUPER appreciative of my help, professionalism, responsiveness over the years and it''s really allowed her to trust trying the new MCS options. She appreciates my help and guidance moving her daughter to traditional insurance to get them through the uncertainty of her daughter''s adenoid that might need to be removed.  All set and I told her to make sure she makes initial payment and ongoing payments directly with Anthem within 7-10 days from now.  She also said I have the patience of a saint!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 15:09:07', '2020-12-11 15:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060679067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683052', 'Emory Patterson', NULL, '12-11-20 Lindsay is going to enroll her daughter in Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO for HSA for $269.69. She did talk with Zion about her daughter''s adenoid and they finally told her they will pay up to $25K and possibly they would submit it to Special Needs case if something went wrong. But, she''s not super comfortable with that since they don''t really know what is wrong, no diagnosis yet. Therefore, playing it safe and enrolling in traditional insurance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 15:08:49', '2020-12-11 15:08:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060679062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683052', 'Emory Patterson', NULL, '12-9-20 Lindsay called and was panicked bc her dauther has an adenoid on her nose that might need to be removed. Cici at Zion told her there is no sharing for pre-x in year one. Cici is clearly not aware of the special membership through MPB and Zion with immediate sharing for pre-x year one up to $25K. Lindsay asked for ballpark price of possible surgery and was told $30K. She doesn''t think this is the cash price since her c-section which was an overnight stay cost $30K. Her daughters situation is outpatient.  She also recognizes with ACA she will likely need to pay at least $5K min deductible before cost is shared as well. So, she is incredible relieved. She will let me know if she has further problems with Zion honoring the pre-x and I told her I''d help work it out on our end. She was super thankful!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 15:08:39', '2020-12-11 15:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060679057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, '12-11-20 We are leaving Emory on this plan as a secondary plan since the price doesn''t change for them. Plus this won''t restart her pre-x clause to hop off and back on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-11 15:02:18', '2020-12-11 15:02:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060672028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059752001', 'Kim McMurtry', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-11 14:57:22', '2020-12-11 14:57:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060671073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659573', 'Robin Bernhard', NULL, '12/9-Member called in and wanted to reinstate her membership.  She advised about her lawsuit.  I heard back from Dania that she would have to re-enroll and that her need around her car accident would be considered Pre-Ex so not shareable.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-11 13:24:05', '2020-12-11 13:24:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060676039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406017', 'Patricia Nard', NULL, '-Member (Trish) wanted to find out if the doctors in her small town were in network
-Member was given the name of both doctors in the town where she lived
-Member was appreciative of the help since she hasn''t been to the doctor in a long time.
-Member said she may call back to get info on the Mammo and Colonoscopy Facilities when the time comes for those test', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-12-11 13:16:34', '2020-12-11 13:16:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060672023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, 'Katie Roth called in and told me that she was having a hard time getting ahold of Benjamin''s needs coordinator Connie.  She was only given an email for contact and Connie has not responded to her last 2 messages. I sent a Slack post to the Sedera crew and asked that someone please contact Katie today. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-11 13:09:53', '2020-12-11 13:09:53'),
