  ('zcrm_1579374000060672008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874248', 'Dylan Thomas', NULL, 'Dylan called because he received an anesthesia bill that is attached to his preventative colonoscopy.  He wanted to know what to do with the bill.  I told him that he could reach out to RCI via phone, send the bill to claims@regionalcarebenefits.com, or send it snail mail to the claims address on the back of his card. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-11 10:08:12', '2020-12-11 10:08:12'),
