  ('zcrm_1579374000060602103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091208', 'Cheryl Yeary', NULL, '12-10-20 Cheryl is the Office Manager for Dakota Ridge Auto and she''s interested in Sedera with Nextera. I mentioned we have a new MCS we''re working with that is easier and has more benefits. She says they are paying $3800 a month now for the group. She and her husband can''t afford the monthly cost bc they are 57 and 61. She listened to the audio. Her husband has shoulder pain. He also takes meds he buys through Blink Health which is a water pill for acne and something for migraines. Everyone at the shop is healthy to her knowledge. They do have one smoker who is 38. The have 5 eligible employees, 1 owner and 1 former employee who is on a State Continuation. She said it''s not Cobra since they are such a small group. Currently the owner pays about 40% but suspects he will contribute 50% since this is cheaper.  She will share my audio and overview email with the group for review. I will send her breakdown of costs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-10 20:24:16', '2020-12-10 20:24:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060602098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165360', 'Connie Mansour', NULL, '12-10-20 Hi Wendy, looks like FRIDAY Health has the most options for us.
