Let me know what plan you suggest and all the nitty gritty on OOP and Premiums, etc.  
Thanks,
Connie', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-10 18:06:15', '2020-12-10 18:06:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060602093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165453', 'Alison Burchell', NULL, '12-10-20 Alison''s account is showing Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5000 for $65.82 a month successfully auto-renewed for 2021!  All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-10 17:39:26', '2020-12-10 17:39:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060602088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683010', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '12-10-20 Hillary called bc she needs an MRI at Anschutz who doesn''t take Bright Health. They do take her current Anthem plan so she''s all set for now. She will call CU Sports Medicine to make sure all drs. and aspects that she will need will be covered with Bright Health. She''ll call me back shortly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-10 16:21:08', '2020-12-10 16:21:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060602083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564382', 'Gregg Wurtz', NULL, '12-10-20 Greg is enrolling for Anthem Bronze Essentials Pathway X HMO HSA for $722 a month. I had him apply directly through Anthem because on C4 it was $819.26. The only difference is the name on C$ doesn''t include the word Essentials. Otherwise seemingly no difference. But, I can only see a super brief summary of benefits, not the full benefits to review. He will call Steadman''s to make sure they accept this exact plan as well. Only other concern was some pre-x clause due to cheaper price. BUT, this plan shows up on Anthem''s site as compliant and available with subsidy as well. Somehow Anthem and C4 are no agreeing on the pricing. So, we chose the cheaper option by applying directly with Anthem. He was still completing application when I had to jump off the phone for next client. Hopefully he''s all set. I will tell him to review the full benefits when he receives them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-10 16:04:09', '2020-12-10 16:04:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060602078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780068', 'Sofia Gomez Villafane', NULL, '12-10-20 I called and she was a bit confused saying her provider won''t accept Sedera anymore. But, they don''t need to. I clarified all of it for her. But, truly she''s able to get an ACA plan for only $160 with a tax credit and a $0 deductible for 2021. So, that will serve her better. Sent her the cancellation form.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-10 15:59:45', '2020-12-10 15:59:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060602073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027648080', 'Beth Lichtenstein', NULL, '12-10-20 Beth has been calling many times and I was on the phone every time. I finally called her back and left a vm and also sent her an email. Apparently she has the tax id for each dr. which isn''t helpful to me. Ugh! I will wait until we connect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-10 15:52:24', '2020-12-10 15:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060602065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165429', 'Jodie Brenner', NULL, '12-10-20 Jodie is super nice. She lost her job many months ago and just realized she is eligible for Medicaid or big APTC so plan is $0. She wanted to know downfalls of cancelling now and re-joining later. I told her that her plan is no longer available. But, she''s turning 60 in July and we will want to move her to SECURE or CARE+ anyhow. She doesn''t have any pre-x. We may or may not be able to include Redirect at that point. I don''t know yet. She will cancel for Jan. 1st 2021 to save $ for the next bunch of months until has income again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-10 15:45:15', '2020-12-10 15:45:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060617258', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'James called in to ask about his IUA and when his membership day was- simple questions that I answered and he seemed thrilled! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-10 15:05:56', '2020-12-10 15:05:56'),
