  ('zcrm_1579374000060602038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165360', 'Connie Mansour', NULL, '12-10-20 Connie and Eduardo were auto renewed for Cigna Bronze HSA $6500 for $0! Cigna is the ONLY carrier that accepts Dr. Christine Hansen according to C4 which is Connie''s most important Dr. But, they  also want Dr. Shahla Mousavi for Eduardo and Dr. Delgado also for Connie. Connie will ponder if she''s willing to switch doctors to get better priced plan and lower ded and mop or if she wants to keep her dr. and stick with Cigna.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-10 13:02:40', '2020-12-10 15:46:25'),
