  ('zcrm_1579374000060617003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'See ticket!!! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-10 07:09:46', '2020-12-10 07:09:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, '12-9-20 Lindsay called and was panicked bc her dauther has an adenoid on her nose that might need to be removed. Cici at Zion told her there is no sharing for pre-x in year one. Cici is clearly not aware of the special membership through MPB and Zion with immediate sharing for pre-x year one up to $25K. Lindsay asked for ballpark price of possible surgery and was told $30K. She doesn''t think this is the cash price since her c-section which was an overnight stay cost $30K. Her daughters situation is outpatient.  She also recognizes with ACA she will likely need to pay at least $5K min deductible before cost is shared as well. So, she is incredible relieved. She will let me know if she has further problems with Zion honoring the pre-x and I told her I''d help work it out on our end. She was super thankful!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 16:11:39', '2020-12-09 16:11:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050370005', 'Arian Shirakhoon', NULL, '12-9-20 Her account auto-renewed for Cigna Connect Flex Silver 3000 Rx Copay Silver/EPO.  Premium $349.26 and APTC $96.53.  All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 15:54:41', '2020-12-09 15:54:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877120', 'Andrea Thomas', NULL, '12-9-20 Andrea''s account auto renewed for $248.62, a few dollars less than last year and no APTC. Chose Bright Health Bronze 6300 Bronze/EPO. Plan ID 31070CO0010019-01. Account # 3720002550.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 15:51:46', '2021-01-25 15:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000877080', 'Andy Barbo', NULL, '12-9-20 Looks like his account is auto renewed for Friday Health Bronze Rx Copay X Bronze/HMO for $291.80. No APTC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 15:47:31', '2020-12-09 15:47:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007792019', 'Carolyn Hope Clark', NULL, '12-9-20 I was able to finally push her enrollment through. It did NOT auto-renew like we were hoping. We have renewed her Anthem Silver Pathway Essentials X HMO 5500 HMO/Silver for $314.96 and APTC of $820.69 so total cost is $1135.65. It''s finally showing up in the enrollments successfully. I sent her the confirmation page. She will keep an eye on the billing to make sure it''s billed accurately. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 15:44:23', '2020-12-09 15:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028294073', 'Amber Shipley', NULL, '12-9-20 Enrolled in Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5000 Silver/EPO for 2021 at $320.59. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 15:11:48', '2020-12-09 15:11:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060580013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, '-Member called to find out how to get connected to her family plan on CirrusMD.  I told her I would put in a ticket for her regarding this.
-Member also wants to know how to start a NEED with Zion.  She suspects her daughter may need to see an ENT and may need surgery.  Member was transferred to Zion.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-12-09 15:10:38', '2020-12-09 15:10:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060565079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-09 14:34:39', '2020-12-09 14:34:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060565074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583542', 'George Yeager', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-09 14:22:19', '2020-12-09 14:22:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380257', 'Rachel Brisson', NULL, '12-9-20 Rachel does not have ins at all now. She''s a W2 employee at law office and they don''t offer benefits. She has slightly high blood pressure sometimes, not always. She is prescribed lisinopril but doesn''t always have to take it. She''s interested in CARE+ at $215/$1000 or $175/$2500. She knows of Dec. 18th deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 14:12:46', '2021-01-12 10:33:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056191010', 'Beth Wilson', NULL, '12-9-20 Beth says her previous broker from another state has become licensed in CO to sell her a different plan. She says that plan has more alternative care options, surgery benefits, etc. but there''s a one year waiting period. Therefore, it is NOT ACA compliant and she cannot get it through C4, therefore she will not be eligible for APTC upon tax time. She''s going to ask her other broker those questions. I''m sure that broker has no idea what''s involved in becoming certified with C4HCO as a new broker. 8 hrs for returning brokers and much more for new brokers. It won''t be worth her time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 14:00:10', '2020-12-09 14:00:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010760035', 'Amanda McCracken', NULL, '12-9-20 Renewing again with Kaiser for 2021 with APTC $542.07 and full cost is $609.94. Had Moorea Velda Butler in Aug. of 2020. Chose not the get legally married yet so still getting huge APTC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 13:53:19', '2020-12-09 13:53:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006333009', 'Allison Dutton', NULL, '12-9-20 Allison has not renewed for 2020 or 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 13:48:05', '2020-12-09 13:48:05'),
