  ('zcrm_1579374000060576048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964144', 'Christopher Loven', NULL, 'Already registered with CirrusMD, all set with MPB Portal and QR code! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-09 10:48:55', '2020-12-09 10:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060600013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670268', 'Andrew Braudis', NULL, '11-30-20 Listened to audio. Family of 3 or 4. Husband is Andy and son is Shawn. Shawn is not a member of MDVIP w/ Dr. Borchers. Paying $900 now without preventative. Ellie is paying $240 and is in Art School in MA. Needs psychiatrist and takes psych drugs. Is transgender, born female and is now male. Likely will remain on school''s insurance. Andy takes lipitor for high cholesterol for 14+ years.  He owns his own biz. Rachel is a vet nurse. She has hashimotos, hypothyroidism. They get their annual wellness visits done through MDVIP which is DPC and qualifies for discounted rate. But, they seem to want CARE+ which is most affordable option. $1000/$550 EF and ready to enroll on Friday at 9:30 am.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-09 10:23:53', '2020-12-11 09:32:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060565028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583190', 'Jay Allen', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $5000 IUA Secure + Tobacco', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-09 10:20:25', '2020-12-09 10:27:23'),
