  ('zcrm_1579374000060576043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori called in asking questions about Zion''s sharing guidelines surrounding sleep study.  I ran a PHCS search for her sleep study  Dr off of Zion''s site and let her know about what that meant.  I then told her that for anymore specifics she would need to speak to Zion directly or review her guidelines.  I warm transferred her to someone at Zion''s member services to get that info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-09 09:52:04', '2020-12-09 09:52:04'),
