  ('zcrm_1579374000060470008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480158', 'Margaret Weaver', NULL, '12-7-20 This is Cari''s first Training Sale. It''s her friend who lives in FL. She does have some health issues. She uses c-pap machine for sleep apnea. She gets injections for migraines, uses medication osthena for vaginal dryness and prozac as anti-depressant. She understands the pre-x clause. Apparently she was denied by UHC for some traditional non ACA compliant plan. So, she''s fine with the pre-x clause bc she only wants this for anything new that arises. Cari will let her know about referral program. She already uploaded proof of business license as self-employed realtor. Jan. 1st start date for SECURE $1000/$275.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-07 15:59:04', '2020-12-07 16:05:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060404081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725199', 'Susan McCormick-Davis', NULL, '-Member called to say they could not get into their portal.  They have already uploaded one document but when they go to upload another one she could not remember her password.  Member was advised to click on "forgot password" which she did and it directed her to call the 800 number.  
-A ticket was open on her behalf.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-12-07 14:48:33', '2020-12-07 14:48:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060470003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030990050', 'Michael Fargano', NULL, '12-7-20 Michael is inputting $20,400 income for 2021 but is including wife in household which puts him into Medicaid level since 2 in household. Left him a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-07 14:44:58', '2020-12-07 14:44:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060404076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798003', 'Merret Anne Mann', NULL, 'I called Merret at the scheduled 3:30 welcome call slot that she had chosen and it rang to vm.   She has all of the information to proceed with bill help with either Zion/Planstin on her own.  If she would like to call me during regular business hours she is more than welcome to do so and I will warm transfer her at that time.  I cannot however keep chasing her to help her do something so simple. -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-07 13:56:42', '2020-12-07 13:56:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060404071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059150079', 'Heather Palentchar', NULL, 'Heather called for some questions she had about the MPB card she received- I explained the different ones and what they are for, I also scheduled a welcome call for her, and sent preventative care emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-07 13:50:34', '2020-12-07 13:50:34'),
