  ('zcrm_1579374000060426043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480020', 'Marian Salley', NULL, '12-7-20 Marian is enrolling now into SECURE to get HSA compliance and also has Cloud Medical membership. She chose not to go with Direct in order to gain HSA benefits. She does her hormone treatments with Cloud medical. She has seen a doctor in the past 12 months for check up past cancer.  Cloud does labs for oncologist bc it''s way less expensive. She understands the pre-x clause which I repeated yet again.  Choosing $2500/$235 SECURE for Jan. 1st start date. No insurance at the moment.  It would have cost her about $12K per year so she chose not to get insurance at all.  She''s a mental health therapist so not interested in our new MAP.  She will be traveling this month and was hoping to backdate membership to Dec. 1st but I told her it''s not possible. Hopefully she will stay safe between now and Jan. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-07 12:05:52', '2020-12-07 12:12:38'),
