  ('zcrm_1579374000060426028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335359', 'Benjamin Roth', NULL, 'Katie called us because I think she thought that her welcome call coordinator was on our end.  I explained the process and told her to call her Needs Coordinator directly. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-04 13:52:18', '2020-12-04 13:52:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060426023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, 'Felicia had emailed me last night asking me to schedule another welcome call with her to discuss past bills and previous bills, and just her plan in general, I reached out this morning with times to make that happen today and she never responded.  I will send her a welcome call scheduler and have her book a time with me next week. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-04 13:49:27', '2020-12-04 13:49:27'),
