  ('zcrm_1579374000060429037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141299', 'Jeff Carden', NULL, '12-4-20 Their cancellation form said they want counseling to be included. So, I just left them a vm about our new memberships that include mental health visits up to 12 at no cost.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-04 13:14:47', '2020-12-04 13:14:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060429029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066564382', 'Gregg Wurtz', NULL, '12-4-20  Holly Hill and Greg Wurtz have a blended family with 3 kids, 24, 22, 21. Little Holly 22 year old had 4 ACL surgeries in past 5 years. Still got care into 2020, so not good candidate for MCS. 24 and 21 year olds are either in school or earning very little money to gain APTC in their respective states, MI and MT. They are healthy but likely won''t join. Family travels to Mexico so wanting to be protected their when possible. Greg had a # of back surgeries with the last one on Oct. 30th, so he''s going to stay on traditional insurance and wants Dr. Corenman from Steadman''s clinic in Vail, therefore only Anthem as option. Looked at Anthem Bronze HSA for $819.26 to gain tax benefits. They earn over $100K. Greg DOB 5/9/58 in 80305.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-04 13:06:47', '2020-12-04 13:06:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060429021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670004', 'Holly Hill', NULL, '12-4-20 Holly Hill and Greg Wurtz have a blended family with 3 kids, 24, 22, 21. Little Holly 22 year old had 4 ACL surgeries in past 5 years. Still got care into 2020, so not good candidate for MCS. 24 and 21 year olds are either in school or earning very little money to gain APTC in their respective states, MI and MT. They are healthy but likely won''t join. Family travels to Mexico so wanting to be protected their when possible. Greg had a # of back surgeries with the last one on Oct. 30th, so he''s going to stay on traditional insurance and wants Dr. Corenman from Steadman''s clinic in Vail, therefore only Anthem as option. Looked at Anthem Bronze HSA for $819.26 to gain tax benefits. They earn over $100K. Greg DOB 5/9/58 in 80305. Holly is self-employed and they have houses in CO, MT and Mexico. Kids file own taxes. Holly is self-employed. Greg DOB 5/9/58 80305.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-04 13:02:37', '2020-12-10 14:26:56'),
