  ('zcrm_1579374000060429011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', NULL, '12-4-20 Sarah Bergstrom is now married to Brian Getzelman. She has an older daughter on own and son is 19 but filing as independent. So, he will enroll on own. Brian has own biz for 35 years and is still getting income from it even though moving towards retirement. Sarah is also semi retired. Deb Bergstrom has been in telehealth biz for last many years 20-30 years. Cindy Suplizio is living between Vail/renting and Basalt permanently. She''s Asst Principle and Math teacher at Vail.  Kerry Schlopy is on Housewives of SLC! Funny! Anyhow, Sarah and Brian are paying $1200 for Cobra with just 2 adults. They enrolled immediately and will enroll son after they discuss it with him. He just lost his job so he might get on ACA option. Brian climbs a lot so he gets cortisone injections in his shoulder, also used to play football. That''s it for pre-x for them. Chose SECURE $500/$1000 for Jan. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-04 11:59:01', '2020-12-04 11:59:01'),
