  ('zcrm_1579374000060429003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, '12-4-20 Enrolled EF SECURE $1000/$685 for Jan. 1st. She had vertigo in past 24 months. Steve had diverticulitis and broken ulna. Daughter has nothing in past 24 months. Suzanne wants to know if they are allowed to request the same doctor on CirrusMD if they like the Dr. Robert is double checking with Brody. Robert said yes for Behavioral Health and possibly for all others if you are willing to wait until that doc is on shift.  We are going to enroll their son Elias on Tuesday Dec. 8th. She just needs to get his information to enroll in CARE+ at $215/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-04 11:49:36', '2020-12-04 11:51:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060409081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Member called in and said that she had to make a name change.  I asked her to hold off until the beginning of the year after open enrollment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-04 11:40:07', '2020-12-04 11:40:07'),
