  ('zcrm_1579374000060321003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141299', 'Jeff Carden', NULL, 'Received a bettiegram from spouse letting me know that they wanted to cancel.  I sent out cancellation link.  Will cal to let her know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-03 20:40:28', '2020-12-03 20:40:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060296067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '12-3-20 Martha called and she''s interested in both CARE+ and SECURE, but leaning towards SECURE for wellness and HSA. Willing to see Dr. McCarty in Glenwood Springs instead of her current dr. since McCarty shows in PHCS network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-03 17:32:27', '2020-12-03 17:32:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060296057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '12-3-20 Martha missed her call with me just now. Thinking of switching to SECURE possibly away from LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-03 15:05:39', '2020-12-03 15:05:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060296052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, 'Margaret called to see if her preventative colonoscopy would be handled by us, or Planstin.  I confirmed with her that it was through Planstin and that all she needed to do was present the card at the time of service.  She told me that she had already made sure that everything was in network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-03 15:00:04', '2020-12-03 15:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060285064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, 'Talked to steve about Secure for him and his wife    2 kids aged out and Andrew has pre exsisting   1000 IUA', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-12-03 13:40:08', '2020-12-03 13:40:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060296047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, 'To add Redirect for Family it will be an additional $365 now. That may not be worth it since that is $4380 per year. Estimate if pay for wellness on own, it could be around $2125 as rough estimate John and I came up with. Call and give him update.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-03 13:36:45', '2020-12-03 13:36:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060296036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '12-3-20 Danna and entire family are Nextera members with Dr. Flanagan. We are going to keep David and Shayna on MPB CareZ worksite membership for $336. Move Danna to Friday Health with Dr. Edward Donner for her back surgery. Might have to re-enroll to conversion to put David and Primary member. Danna will Friday $428.79 with HSA.  Let Patti know when re-enrolling to have John put product back up.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-03 13:02:46', '2020-12-03 13:06:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060296031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830286', 'Maureen Gannon (Hanson)', NULL, 'I called Maureen for a follow up call to make sure that everything had worked, that she was helped and that she was now in a better place since we spoke.  I am happy to report that she is indeed in a better place, that all tasks I had requested from other TPA''s had been completed and with excellence!   She was thrilled for the follow up call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-03 12:50:32', '2020-12-03 12:50:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060285038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904355', 'Linnea Peterson', NULL, 'Cirrus MD registration completed. Also changed email from tazlin@centurytel.net to linnpeters01@gmail.com. Also added another phone number. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-12-03 10:58:51', '2020-12-03 11:23:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060285033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462261', 'Brian Tilley', NULL, 'Spoke to Brian about Cirrus MD registration. Will do in email. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-12-03 10:53:35', '2020-12-03 10:53:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060284023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874248', 'Dylan Thomas', NULL, 'Dylan called in questioning if his plan was going to change in any way the 1st of the year.  Told him no.  He also had some general questions around opening needs &amp; Preventative which I answered for him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-03 10:53:27', '2020-12-03 10:53:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060296026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844131', 'Adam Nolan', NULL, '12-3-20 Patti said they cannot get Adam in for Dec. 1st. He''s enrolled for Jan. 1st at least. CARE+ $1000/$215.  I just lead him to Life By Spot - GetSpot.com to enroll in that for Dec. It will start Dec. 4th and protect him up to $20K for 1 month if he has an accident. He''s enrolling now. He was appreciative of my help and bummed we couldn''t get him on for Dec. 1st since he tried connecting with me on the 27th but I was out for the holiday. Still super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-03 10:52:35', '2020-12-03 10:52:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060285028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227111', 'Jeffrey Parker', NULL, 'Left message about Cirrus MD registration. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-12-03 10:46:58', '2020-12-03 10:46:58'),
