  ('zcrm_1579374000060296021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650438', 'Anthony Osborn', NULL, 'Anthony called for help setting up his Cirrus account.  I helped him in setting up his account and then sent both his wife and older daughter an email verification from Cirrus.  I went over the Cirrus basics with him as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-03 10:38:05', '2020-12-03 10:38:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060296013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, '12-2-20 Dear MPower,
I have not been satisfied with my service. To receive even a yearly physical, I would have to drive over 30 miles.  This is completely unacceptable.  I have not used this service once over the months that I have had it and have never understood how to take advantage of it.
I am happy to speak with a representative before a full cancel, but I do not want to renew at this time. If you wish to set up a call, please feel free to email me.
Sincerely,
Thomas Boyce
I left him a vm just now to address this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-03 10:37:42', '2020-12-03 10:37:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060296008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056191010', 'Beth Wilson', NULL, '12-3-20 Beth will now research doctors for her breast reduction so she can decide which plan will serve her best between the two listed above.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-03 10:24:24', '2020-12-03 10:24:24'),
