  ('zcrm_1579374000060284003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674173', 'Ellen Tresnak', 'Letter requesting Change of IUA', 'Dania &amp; Elizabeth,
          This is the request that Dania and I spoke about yesterday on Slack yesterday.  Our member Ellen Tresnak is requesting to lower her IUA from the present $5000 to $1500 effective 1/1/21.  She has been a member since 1/1/19.  Please let me know . Thank you for letting us do this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-03 09:28:50', '2020-12-03 09:28:50'),
