  ('zcrm_1579374000060246003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'CirrusMD registered, all set with QR codes and MPB Portal. - I am going to reach out to Vanessa to let her know that for the welcome call today that her son will also be on the call and needs direction in setting up his own account with his own unique email address.   Also to grab that address so that they can both receive emails from the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-03 07:25:45', '2020-12-03 07:25:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060801001', 'Katie Witters', NULL, '12-2-20 Katie and her boyfriend want to join. They wanted to join as domestic partners but they aren''t married, no co-mingled funds and only together for about 2 years. They each have W2 jobs so CARE+ only option. They are each paying around $300 each per month for Anthem right now. They are opting out of their employer plans bc with Kaiser and expensive. $1000/$215.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 17:03:30', '2020-12-02 17:03:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163125', 'Sharon Linnebur', NULL, '12-2-20 Added SS# to CRM and emailed Patti just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 16:24:55', '2020-12-02 16:24:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024225', 'Jason Fishburn', NULL, 'Helping Jason figure out a plan for in network Flu vaccine''s and Covid testing.  I sent him free testing links, I am just finishing up the rest of the project. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 16:17:25', '2020-12-02 16:17:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, 'I gave Laura a phone call trying to get her husband using CirrusMD for his sore throat- I left a message and then sent a very detailed email with instructions as well as offering my own help in him enrolling. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 16:15:18', '2020-12-02 16:15:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165330', 'David Fenerty', NULL, '12-2-20 David wants to re-enroll in Kaiser. It looks like it auto-renewed already at $717.46.  I will recheck in a few days. Nothing has changed. He turns 65 in May and I referred them to Andrea to help with that. They want Aniko who is 66 to have some insurance while they are here. But, I''m not aware of any insurance they can have since she''s a Hungarian citizen. She does have a SS# apparently but is not a naturalized citizen or green card holder or anything.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 16:10:14', '2020-12-02 16:10:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049815007', 'Aniko Toth', NULL, '12-2-20 Wants to re-enroll in Care for Jan. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 16:08:04', '2020-12-02 16:08:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '12-2-10 Andrew 57, wife is 60 in March of 2021. They are on Cobra now. He''s 24% owner of biz which he is the only employee as of now. He can show proof of biz ownership. They are paying $844 to Aetna PPO 6350 via Cobra now for 9 more months. But, may switch sooner. They live in Naples, FL 6 months of year and Steamboat Springs rest of year. They are both healthy, no meds, no tobacco. They already have an HSA via HSA Bank. SECURE is best at $1000/$500 but Dr. Charlie Petersen is not in the network at the moment. He is willing to see a new doctor in Naples where there''s a much larger network but really likes his dr. They are in no rush but may switch to save a ton of money.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 15:46:16', '2020-12-02 15:46:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798003', 'Merret Anne Mann', NULL, 'Merret was a missed call today and left a message asking for support with uploading bills.  I had in the past explained to her that this was Zion''s purview.    So Michele R and I worked all day working out how warm transfer the line to an outside Vendor, we even sped up the process....just for Merret.  By the time we figured it out it was the end of the day. I gave her a call and it went straight to vm,  so I emailed her many options of either me helping her with the warm transfer, her calling Zion directly- or her using the member support chat box.  Links and everything.  I tagged Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 15:22:36', '2020-12-02 15:22:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844131', 'Adam Nolan', NULL, '12-2-20 Adam tried contacting me in Nov. but I wasn''t able to connect with him until today. He lost his job and has no ins as of Dec. 1st and wants to see if we can backdate. Patti is inquiring.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 14:59:00', '2020-12-02 14:59:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163125', 'Sharon Linnebur', NULL, '12-2-20 Called and left vm to get her SS# which is required by Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 14:45:26', '2020-12-02 14:45:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220284', 'Michael Kennedy', NULL, '12-2-20 He is an ANGRY, ANGRY man and didn''t want my help or anyone''s help in resolving his problems of getting billed for his wife''s wellness visit. Total cost between his visit and his wife''s is about $700 but sounds like both are wellness, not sure. He says he''s spend countless hours fighting with MPB even though there''s no proof of any calls or notes. He did not call me either. He was blaming MPB for everything. I tried to coach him to use the correct card and he doesn''t care. He''d rather just pay the bill and be done with MPB. He also doesn''t want to be billed for his annual renewal fee since he cancelled for Jan. 1st. But, his renewal was Dec. 1st. I will talk with Patti. I never want to deal with him again. He''s too angry and will not reason with me at all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 14:23:45', '2020-12-02 14:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822359', 'Heather Rose', NULL, 'sent follow up info from HCBB over to Heather. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 14:23:04', '2020-12-02 14:23:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044701107', 'Annette Nathan', NULL, 'Annette called in with many complicated cancellation questions, I tried to answer them but was unable.  Transferred the call to Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 14:14:51', '2020-12-02 14:14:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, 'Rita called in very anxious as to how to use her plan- she sounds as though she is new to health sharing.  I went over the basics and then made an appointment for her and her son to have a welcome call with Vanessa tomorrow morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 13:59:43', '2020-12-02 13:59:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844131', 'Adam Nolan', NULL, '-Member called to see if he could speak to Wendy regarding reinstating his plan or a new one.
-Member was transferred to Wendy.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-12-02 13:52:24', '2020-12-02 13:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027648080', 'Beth Lichtenstein', NULL, '12-2-20 Beth is on Medicaid but also chose an Anthem plan and got a subsidy which she will have to pay back bc she was on Medicaid. But, she wants to keep both and now knows she has to pay full price. She wants traditional insurance to help with her doctors that won''t accept Medicaid. She has many doctors and nobody covers all, nor the most important ones. She''s going to call each doctor to find out if they will accept each of the plans.
Dr. Stuart Kassan, Dr. Elizabeth Yurth, Dr, Sean Gavin Grey, Dr. Ian Kaminsky are the most important docs, then Dr. Dirk Dolbeare, Dr. Mikyong, Dr. Edward Hepworth.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 13:51:15', '2020-12-11 15:32:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, 'sent covid info via email- per Patti- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 13:18:49', '2020-12-02 13:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406197', 'Suzanne Muller', NULL, 'Suzanne called in and wanted to know if mammogram and colonoscopy were a "covered" service under her plan.  I told her yes, through Sedera.  She asked me the steps and I went over them all with her.  She was pretty upset that she would then have to pay for a doctor visit to get the orders for the procedures.  I am working on sending out a Health Grades list to her for a reference point. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 13:18:18', '2020-12-02 13:18:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, 'she called because she didn''t have her Planstin card and she was at the doctors office.  I gave her Planstin''s phone number. Also I am going to double check with them to make sure that they send her the PDF and hard copies of the card. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 13:16:11', '2020-12-02 13:16:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060176113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616183', 'Steven Caywood', NULL, 'Member called me back. Cirrus MD registration completed with member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-12-02 13:15:46', '2020-12-02 13:15:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060172133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163282', 'Zina Murray', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-02 13:11:12', '2020-12-02 13:11:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060172128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163234', 'Carl Hall', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-02 13:02:57', '2020-12-02 13:02:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798003', 'Merret Anne Mann', NULL, '12-2-20 I explained all of the different companies and their purpose. She understands better. She also revealed she has a hip issue and torn labrum. She''s not sure if she saw the Dr. before or after her Aug. 1st start date. I explained the pre-x clause and cap of $25K year 1 and 2. I also told her if she winds up needing expensive surgery that we will want to put her on traditional ins by Dec. 15th or Jan. 15th to protect her. She was thankful for that info. She will call Concierge Team to get help with setting up CirrusMD, asking for new Planstin replacement card, submitting current bills and asking process for getting pre-approval for chiro if necessary with hip issues since alternative. She was appreciative of the help and will take the next steps. She also said the osteopath charges $325 for about 20 min!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 12:24:47', '2020-12-02 12:24:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335359', 'Benjamin Roth', NULL, '12-2-20 Hi Wendy,
Surgery went well, thanks!!  Ben is relieved as the rest of the family!
Thank You!
Katie 
303-570-9300', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 11:45:25', '2020-12-02 11:45:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060172123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153147', 'Tara Weaver', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request citing unaffordability.   i will cancel Sedera &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-02 11:43:58', '2020-12-02 11:43:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990073', 'Danna Hinz', NULL, '12-2-20 Danna is realtor and earned about $230K in 2020, so no APTC possible. She converted to Zion believing they didn''t have any pre-x. But, she has had back pain her whole life and there was nothing to do. BUT, she recently had tailbone/butt pain and it turns our to be crushed disc, exposed spinal cord and floating bones. She has spondelosis and 8" of movement and spinal cord not supported. Therefore, she can''t fall bc it could damage spinal cord. She needs 2 levels of a fusion completed and cost may be around $200K!  She will call Spine West and CO Spine Institute to ask which individual plans they accept and we will choose trad plan for Jan. 1st 2021.  She already had ultrasound and steroid injections and MRI''s counting towards her IUA. She is only protected up to $25K with Zion since she had chronic back pain previously. Traditional insurance will be best for 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 11:39:59', '2020-12-02 11:41:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008372009', 'Adrianne Middleton', NULL, '12-2-20 Auto renewing with Cigna for 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-12-02 11:23:50', '2020-12-02 11:23:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808040', 'Thomas DeAngelis', NULL, 'Cirrus MD verification sent, MPB Portal and QR code all set! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 11:17:41', '2020-12-02 11:17:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, 'already registered with Cirrus, and all set with the MPB Portal and QR code. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 11:15:41', '2020-12-02 11:15:41'),
