  ('zcrm_1579374000060200041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044279010', 'Helena Hofer', NULL, 'The RCI number I gave Helena didn''t work.  I gave her Jennifer Chasteen @ RCI direct line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 10:34:32', '2020-12-02 10:34:32'),
