  ('zcrm_1579374000060176068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171532', 'Christine Torres', NULL, 'Not able to leave message about Cirrus MD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-12-02 10:17:13', '2020-12-02 10:17:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, '-Member called to first say that she was so appreciative of everyone on the Team (MPB, Planstin and Zion) for helping her out with her husband''s colonoscopy.  She felt like she didn''t fall between the cracks.

-Zion reached out to her yesterday after further investigation to talk to her about opening a NEED for this particular test since it is going to cost over the amount of the IUA.

-A NEED was opened and she is very happy and satisfied that everyone was so attentive.

-She also wanted to know what should she do about payment to the facility since she is Cash Pay.  Member was advised to call the facility today and speak with them regarding their payment process.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-12-02 10:15:43', '2020-12-02 10:15:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060172113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330064', 'Diane VanWeelden', NULL, 'Member was transferred to me because she had questions about her children on her membership and if they needed to be dependents.  She asked if she took only one off would her price go down.  Told her no. she would have to take them both off.  I gave her the pricing for her and her spouse.  She requested that I send her the Change form for when she wants to take them off.   Emailed that to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-02 10:10:05', '2020-12-02 10:10:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044279010', 'Helena Hofer', NULL, 'Helena called wanting to know what preventative care claims had been processed in the past- I gave her RCI''s number,  she also wanted to know a fair price on breast ultrasound so that she can negotiate down a bill of hers.  I gave her that HCBB info as well.  She thanked me for my help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 10:04:24', '2020-12-02 10:04:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466094', 'Chad Broker', NULL, 'Amy called to get help updating Chad''s payment information.  I sent the online form. -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 10:02:27', '2020-12-02 10:02:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060183011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '-Left message on her direct cell phone regarding ticket.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-12-02 09:57:32', '2020-12-02 09:57:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060176063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162322', 'Esther Turner', NULL, 'Spoke to member about Cirrus MD registration. No time to do on call. will check email. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-12-02 09:35:34', '2020-12-02 09:35:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060200021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047282132', 'Amanda Hoskins', NULL, 'Amanda called in yesterday for information on what is covered with as far as Covid testing is concerned.  I asked Kelly F to send her links to free Covid resources in her area as well as to attach the Sedera info on how much they will share in testing if member uploads bill through the portal. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-12-02 09:30:00', '2020-12-02 09:30:00'),
