  ('zcrm_1579374000060172093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862150', 'Judy Flanagan', NULL, 'After no response from member from email that Robert told me to send.  I will cancel this member.  I spoke to her once and left 2 subsequent vm''s asking for dates of service for both her Cirrus visit &amp; ER visit..  Robert tried to get in touch with her as well for that info with no success.  Jane emailed her too.  She has been non responsive.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-12-02 08:10:56', '2020-12-02 08:10:56'),
