  ('zcrm_1579374000060101070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060683010', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '11-30-20 Hillary needed regular ins separate from Michael and kids because she may need an ortho hip surgery and knee surgery. Dr. Mei-Dan is showing in Bright Health network. We found off-mkt plan for $465.91 Bright Health Silver $0 Deductible Direct plan that looks great for her scenario. Enrolled directly on Bright Health.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-30 16:41:48', '2020-11-30 16:41:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060101065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '11-30-20 They enrolled in Friday Health just now for 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-30 16:34:27', '2020-11-30 16:34:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060101057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '11-30-20 Enrolled Michael and Kids for Jan. 1st start date in SECURE $1000/$495. Enrolled Hillary in Bright Health Silver $0 Deductible Direct for $465.91. This way she can have her labral tear and knee issues dealt with.  I also cancelled the auto renewal for 2021 and I can still see their current plan showing in their enrollments. They should be all set for 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-30 16:19:46', '2020-11-30 16:30:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060101052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, '11-30 -20 John will work on creating solution to add Redirect Health and then we will send him information supporting that membership. I will tell him to set up Welcome Call as well for help in proceeding with that part of membership. We will wait until John has them enrolled.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-30 15:29:11', '2020-11-30 15:29:11'),
