  ('zcrm_1579374000060093048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630217', 'Rula Huber', NULL, 'Rula called in mistakenly, she still hasn''t heard back from Cirrus, she knows that Brody and team have been informed that she needs the service. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-30 15:02:22', '2020-11-30 15:02:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000060093043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, 'I spoke to Alan and walked him through the process of getting a colonoscopy for preventative care.  Alan was a bit upset about having to see a doctor to get a doctor''s order for one, but I reminded him it wouldn''t cost anything as long as it''s preventative.  Sent preventative care emails as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-30 14:58:43', '2020-11-30 14:58:43'),
