  ('zcrm_1579374000060093033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335359', 'Benjamin Roth', NULL, 'Katie (Benjamins mother) called in because Benjamin was in a car accident, has been to a few hospitals, taken a few ambulence rides and now is in ICU- she said upon me asking how he was "not good".  I gave her Sedera''s phone number and told her to reach out to them.  I let Wendy know as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-30 14:10:35', '2020-11-30 14:10:35'),
