  ('zcrm_1579374000059871112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964144', 'Christopher Loven', NULL, '11-24-20 Chris is healthy, just takes anxiety and sleep meds, no pre-x, no tobacco. Daughter is healthy and may switch to his later if gets bumped of x-wife''s plan. Chris is self-employed and is paying $610 for just Chris. He will do a Dec. 1st start date.  Choosing SECURE $1000/$275 per month and may add daughter later. He listened to audio and has reasonable understanding. Referred by Desiree Childs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-24 13:35:18', '2020-11-24 13:36:32'),
