  ('zcrm_1579374000059871090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '11-24-20 On Bright Health now. APTC $593.51 and Paying $135.36 in 2020 with $0 ded. Her income was set at $24,400 and she''s now worried that she put it too low. She thinks it''s more like $40K. I told her to talk to her accountant. She likes her plan but it will change with income change. She''ll do her homework regarding her income and let me know how she proceeds.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-24 12:16:35', '2020-11-24 12:36:21'),
