  ('zcrm_1579374000059891080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059150135', 'Ryan Ingram', NULL, 'I spoke with Ryan because the retry of the Enrollment declined.  I also advised that the Dec pmt was now due.  He will submit pmt update w/bank info.  I will retry.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-24 12:06:27', '2020-11-24 12:06:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059891072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280361', 'Sally Pistilli', NULL, '11.24.20:  Did not yet get a response from Sally to my email.  I called her and left a message to call me.  Sally called me back.  She seemed to be ok with the situation.  We had a good conversation and she didn''t mention canceling.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-11-24 12:04:06', '2020-12-14 09:44:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059891067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280361', 'Sally Pistilli', NULL, '11.23.20:  Andrea Hinman and KellyAnne discussed Sally''s issue w/me.  She tried to follow the protocol for getting her colonscopy.  She was told her physician and facility were in network until the day of her procedure, when she was told it wasn''t.  She went ahead with the procedure anyway but is upset because she spent a lot of time and effort to be sure all was in network.  She was billed $1400.  Andrea asked me to contact her and find out the specifics of this situation.  I emailed Sally to schedule a time to speak with her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-11-24 12:03:06', '2020-11-24 12:03:06'),
