  ('zcrm_1579374000059891008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023222', 'Linda Hutchason Wolfe', NULL, 'Per members VM, she was double billed on 10/28.  I refunded this out of Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-24 07:14:39', '2020-11-24 07:14:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059884021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, '-Member called to let us know that the Imaging Center had coded the CT as diagnostic.  It will be a $200  cost and that she would take care of it.  She scheduled her appointment for Dec 4.
-Member was so confused with all the information from all the Websites and very frustrated.
-Memberwould like to  offer her services to review any of the new Websites to see if  a new Member would would be able to understand it.  She feels strongly that if the message of our products were drilled down to a 5th grade level that the members would be able to manage their healthcare better.  She was very sincere in her offering as in her former days she was a Corporate Trainer.  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-24 07:12:14', '2020-11-24 07:12:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059891003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605126', 'Annmarie Lancaster', NULL, 'I received Bettiegram  form this member wanting to update her Pmt info.  I have sent out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-24 07:11:23', '2020-11-24 07:11:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059883054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516016', 'David Sims', NULL, '11-23-20 Dave called bc he just broke his arm and he gave them his Apex card which they rejected. He was panicked. He now is relieved to understand he just needs to pay his $1000 and get billed for the rest as self-pay. He''s doing his best to wait until tomorrow to move forward. He''s feeling bones moving around... UGH. I gave him Concierge # to call tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-23 17:05:47', '2020-11-23 17:06:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059883049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '11-23-20 He''s going to call his accountant and find out how much he can fund his HSA for 2020 and 2021 since household dynamic is different and partial year to fund HSA for 2020, plus over 55 for additional funds of $1000 possible. He thinks caps had to do with his S-Corp but I don''t believe so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-23 16:58:31', '2020-11-23 16:58:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059883044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '11-23-20 Tim - Here''s a very unique scenario. My clients Randy and Julie are not legally married. Julie is not legally divorced from her x of long ago. However, Julie and Randy have lived together for 12 years and share responsibility of kids. The have joint bank accounts, credit cards, i.e. they co-mingle funds. Randall files his taxes as Head of Household and Julie files, he believes, as Married Filing Separately. They want to know if they could join as a Family with Zion and with Planstin? Thanks!
New
Timothy Hirsch  3:36 PM
Yes, that is fine. Only thing that they want to be careful about is if they do the preventive HSA. Then for tax purposes they need to determine what they can legally contribute. We generally allow for domestic partnerships to enroll as member and spouse.
Wendy Scipione  4:45 PM
Tim, That is great news! I believe they will enroll. I will tell them to talk to their tax professional about the HSA funding. Thanks!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-23 16:46:38', '2020-11-23 16:46:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059883039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006191087', 'Drew Tarkington', NULL, '11-23-20 Brittany just called to learn about our new memberships from my old emails about converting from LHS. BUT, she just found out that she''s about 6 weeks pregnant and hasn''t even had her first dr. visit yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-23 16:43:56', '2020-11-23 16:43:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059883034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007902007', 'Natalie Wood', NULL, '11-23-20 Natalie called in to get help from Concierge and couldn''t reach anyone at the 1-800-519-2969. The system went straight to music and nobody ever answered. She emailed KellyAnne and I and KellyAnne is showing as out of office. So, I sent an email to Michele instead to help Natalie set up a pap screening and mammogram so she isn''t charged for those wellness visits and stays in network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-23 16:34:46', '2020-11-23 16:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059883029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001950031', 'Eric Nehls', NULL, '11-23-20 Called to update payment. I sent him the link since he was out walking his dog.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-23 16:18:29', '2020-11-23 16:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059883024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, '11-23-20 Oscar Bronze Classic Next is $194.17 and has $0 ded AND $35 co-pay for mental health which is what she wants for her 10 year old daughter Madelaine. Strongly considering this one or a Bright Health Bronze $6300. I''m forgetting other Bright Health one we viewed. But, OSCAR looks best!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-23 14:35:54', '2020-11-23 14:35:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059871061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953095', 'Susan Farrar', NULL, 'Susan called into Sedera to ask about a colonoscopy (she previously had a pollup so it will be diagnostic) she was told to call HMA in error by Sedera.  They told her she was cancelled.  I advised member to present as cash pay and submit as need to sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-23 14:30:40', '2020-11-23 14:30:40'),
