  ('zcrm_1579374000059774031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, 'Per Wendy this member no has funds in her account and has authorized us to draft.  I told member to advise member that this will be the last time that we would be able to accommodate her in doing this.  Next time she will cancel no questions asked.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-20 10:44:32', '2020-11-20 10:44:32'),
