  ('zcrm_1579374000059783008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, '11-20-20 Jennifer answered my call and has approveed paying for Nov and Dec plus the $50 reinstatement fee. She has promised the $ will be in the account by the 20th of every month moving forward. She apologized and appreciated my help. Patti will bill it today per our conversation just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-20 10:30:14', '2020-11-20 10:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059783003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165330', 'David Fenerty', NULL, '11-20-20 Ann is totally confused about Medicare and thinks David can join in Feb but his B-Day is in May. She wanted me to answer many Medicare questions which I cannot do. I told her David needs regular insurance until Medicare age of 65. She wants to keep his plan with Kaiser since he''s always been to Kaiser but then she wants him to be able to go to some hospital nearby. She''s going to call Andrea per my recommendation. She will call me back when she''s ready for me to renew his membership for $717.46 for Bronze 6500/50.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-20 10:24:55', '2020-11-20 10:24:55'),
