  ('zcrm_1579374000059750003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, 'helped Kallie understand how to submit a need to Zion for diagnostic mammogram.  Sent her all of the info that she needs to open up a need with Zion. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-20 07:16:58', '2020-11-20 07:16:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059720012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626120', 'Russell Finsterwald', NULL, 'send email concerning registration of CirrusMD    Debbie', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', 'debbie pasqualucci debbie pasqualucci', '2020-11-20 07:05:50', '2020-11-20 07:05:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059736029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11-19-20 We enrolled Carolyn for Jan. 1st 2021, into Bright Health Bronze HSA no APTC. We enrolled directly on Bright Health''s site. She lives off investments, so no fear of dropping into income low enough for APTC. With her multitude of health issues, we agreed she should move to traditional insurance. She was shocked by the price. We successfully set her up with a 12/20/20 payment date. $771.50 monthly cost. She then realized her functional medicine doctor is not in network and that won''t count towards her ded. She was bummed to realize that. But, she asked for recommendations for a new PCP in network. Dr. Eileen Gallagher was on the list and is open to more naturopathic solutions. I also saw Dr. Coco Dughi who many clients like and finally Dr. Christiansen I think, if I remember correctly. She will try them in hopes that they will refer her to get the labs and such that she needs done to complete those in-network. She knows she has to stay in the Centura and CO Health network (I believe that was the name). She will fund her HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-19 21:48:57', '2020-11-19 21:48:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059736021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427074', 'Fox Marie Magdovitz', NULL, '11-19-20 I emailed her dental plan through Humana, a new one called Bright Plus for $25.43.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-19 19:37:22', '2020-11-19 19:37:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059745008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, 'I helped Tyler out with a discount coupon for his wife''s prescription. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-19 14:48:13', '2020-11-19 14:48:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059724047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578069', 'Karla Degginger', NULL, 'Member submitted pmt update form.  Updated in Admin123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-19 14:29:34', '2020-11-19 14:29:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059736008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755459', 'Andrew Goldman', NULL, '11-19-20 Andrew is 60 and healthy, volunteer firefighter. Ann had cancer which ended treatment as of March 2019 therefore she will stay with Anthem. They were looking at Zion and Christian Healthshare Ministeries as well because of their additional price and protection for pre-x. But, once I better explained Zion''s pre-x clause she''s not concerned about Andrew''s Hashimotos in which he simply takes levothyroxine daily. He was diagnosed by blood test but is actually symptom free. They are both self-employed and they have an HSA and excited to continue to fund it! She will share with Andrew and I am talking with him tomorrow to enroll in SECURE $275/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-19 14:26:36', '2020-11-19 14:26:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059724042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725199', 'Susan McCormick-Davis', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-19 13:16:06', '2020-11-19 13:16:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059724037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725151', 'Amber Halford', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-19 12:59:43', '2020-11-19 12:59:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059724032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725103', 'Kim Sanderson', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-19 12:28:30', '2020-11-19 12:28:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059724027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-19 12:13:24', '2020-11-19 12:13:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059745003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578069', 'Karla Degginger', NULL, 'called to update payment, sent out online form and tagged Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-19 12:06:52', '2020-11-19 12:06:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059724022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025439070', 'David Jones', NULL, 'Retried Yearly Renewal Fee after member updated Pmt info', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-19 11:54:18', '2020-11-19 11:54:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059739008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, '-Member called back to say that CirrusMD suggested he get to ER or urgent care sometime today.
-Member is going to call Sedera to get advise from them which one he should go to.
-Member was much happier with the conversation with CirrusMD than Teledoc and is very happy they know have that service.  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-19 11:48:51', '2020-11-19 11:48:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059724017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608685', 'Christian Hager', NULL, 'I received and forwarded email form John re: this member wanting to know why we were still charging him for whole famil when back effective 9/1 her requested to remove wife & Children.  I dug into this and this is what happened: Member contact RCI and requests dependents to be removed they email him a form and this is done .  He calls after hours on 9/21 after he receives billing from us with family still on.  KellyC sends him out the Member change form which he never fills out.  I advised him that the only part of his plan that got changed was the MEC.  Member also did not like the $15 CC fee.  I resent him the Change form which he did not fill out correctly and am still waiting on Payment Update form.  I emailed Charles to let him know', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-19 11:44:17', '2020-11-19 11:44:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059739003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, '-Member called to find out to complain about Teledoc .  He stated that he called them to ask a couple of questions but they immediately told him he needed to be tested for CoVID.  He wanted to know if there was something he could do before jumping to be tested.
-Member was advised that he had access to CirrusMD.  
-Member waited on the phone with me until his registration was complete and had engaged with a doctor.
-Member was also told that his wife had access as well in the event she needed it.  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-19 11:32:06', '2020-11-19 11:32:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059736003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331022', 'Scott Fliegelman', NULL, '11-19-20 I talked with Scott and he''s super frustrated but we figured out the breakage in communication. He didn''t understand that his doctor still needed to call in his prescription to Costco since he was changing the location of where he was buying the prescription. He''s always bought it through Pharmaca for many years. He initially called Redirect the first time around and they submitted the script to Pharmaca per his request. He didn''t understand that he needed the Dr. to call it into Costco now that he''s buying it elsewhere. I told him to obtain the script if possible so he can bring it wherever he chooses. He will reach out to Redirect through the app and get his new and previous med prescribed and sent to Costco for the savings. He''s willing to drive a little further if it actually works and he gets the medications. He admitted life is fragile at the moment and he just needs to get over this hump. Also shared that there are too many companies involved, hence his frustration.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-19 11:25:45', '2020-11-19 11:25:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059724003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725001', 'Kathleen Malone', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-19 10:50:18', '2020-11-19 10:50:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059701018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, '11-19-20 Rita is a business owner, self-employed. Works with Five Rings Financial with 1099.  Husband is smoker so he''s staying with regular insurance. Son treated for anxiety and takes lemictol-generic, ADHD/bi-polar 1. He sees a mental health counselor 1x per week. They know about our new mental health benefit and they also understand he will have to pay for any additional visits on his own. He says he can access mental health visits for $50 through an LBGTQ place. Rita is cancer survivor for 10 years as of Jan. 1st 2021. Chance of recurrence is next to nothing, ie. same for all people who never had it. They believe it was caused due to major stress from old job that she quit long ago. It was non-hodkins lympoma B cell tonsilar affecting the lymphatic system. All other issues too place far more than 24 months ago such as partial hysterectomy. Her records are Wrong showing full hysterectomy but she still has her ovaries. She''s asked them to fix her record 3x and it always gets changed back. Same for an item on sons record that he has sinus issue and they labeled is as anxiety or something weird. She''s going to fight that. It''s all through Kaiser. Rita has neuronitis in left ear but there''s nothing to do for it. Only issue being treated is elevated blood pressure that is monitored. No significant issues, no hospital visits or anything. They are paying $1300 through husbands work now. He will stay on his plan for $300 and Rita and Angelo move to SECURE to remain compliant in CA and pay $495/$1000. Therefore they will save $600 per month. $200 towards HSA, $200 towards debt and $200 towards mental health, etc. Something like that is what she''s thinking.  She also wants to talk with her CPA who is referring clients to LHS now and I expressed my concern for that. She will share with CPA to refer clients to me.  Rita will discuss with husband and we are meeting on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-19 10:09:40', '2020-11-23 12:33:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059701013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066507053', 'Christian Knapp', NULL, '11-19-20 Julie called and apologized. They aren''t quite ready to make the decision today. They will stay with Cobra for Dec. and make the decision by Dec. 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-19 09:31:16', '2020-11-19 09:31:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059701008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, '11-19-20 I left vm to let her know if she doesn''t call in immediately to make payment then the cancellation will hold.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-19 09:28:51', '2020-11-19 09:28:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059701003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066507053', 'Christian Knapp', NULL, '11-19-20 I called Christian and Julie for our appt right now. Julie was supposed to be busy so she was having Christian take over but he''s not answering. They are deciding between CARE+ and SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-19 09:07:03', '2020-11-19 09:07:03'),
