  ('zcrm_1579374000059653031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, '11-18-20 Completed Rob''s LSW/NLG application. Next is Kirsten''s to complete the health questions. Rob answered No to all health questions and it appeared that he has immediate approval. But, there was no indication of next steps yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-18 20:26:28', '2020-11-18 20:26:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059653026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165398', 'Andrew Hogan', NULL, '11-18-20 After a battery of failures during the Welcome Call (no fault of KellyAnne''s) Andrew lost all confidence in MPB and has found another solution that he''s switching to for Jan. 1st. Big Bummer! He''s been a client for many years.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-18 20:14:33', '2020-11-18 20:14:33'),
