  ('zcrm_1579374000059653018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '11-18-20 Michelle is enrolling now in SECURE $275/$1000. Doing it on her phone.  Completed. She needs to update cc to ACH when she gets home. I''ll inform Patti now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-18 13:37:32', '2020-11-18 13:46:06'),
