  ('zcrm_1579374000059651043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001118010', 'Justin Box', NULL, 'member cancelled due to non Payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 13:26:20', '2020-11-18 13:26:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059651038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006263117', 'Derek Morris', NULL, 'Cancelled due to non Payment', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 13:24:15', '2020-11-18 13:24:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059653013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11-18-20 Carolyn is cancelling because she needs an oxygen concentrator due to low oxygen at night and she uses a c-pap machine. The concentrator will cost $1000''s of dollars and she knows it will be her responsibility to pay for 100%. I had no knowledge of these health issues. We are moving her to a traditional insurance likely with Bright Health Bronze $6850 HSA. She is frustrated by the $13,700 max out of pocket but understood the $6850 ded. Didn''t understand that''s per individual and therefore, $13,700 total max out of pocket.  None of her health issues were revealed to me prior to now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-18 13:21:08', '2020-11-19 21:42:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059643013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679258', 'Karin Schwarz', NULL, 'I helped Karin out with the many options she has available to get discount labs. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-18 12:03:46', '2020-11-18 12:03:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059651033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059650223', 'Laurie Heitz', NULL, 'Member Only $2000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 11:31:38', '2020-11-18 11:31:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059651028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059650175', 'Gary Collins', NULL, 'Member called in and asked why he was charged $128.75 for the set up.  I advised him about the 3% CC fee.  He asked me to send out Pmt Change form to update info.  I will update in Admin 123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 11:18:28', '2020-11-18 11:18:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059651023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427191', 'Brooke Altman', NULL, 'The Payment for the Account Set up fee declined.  I called and left a VM for the member.  I will send out Payment update form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 10:59:49', '2020-11-18 10:59:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059642018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925142', 'Kelly Schest', NULL, '-Spoke with member regarding instructions into getting into CirrusMD for her bladder infection. Stayed on the phone with her until she reached a Dr.  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-18 10:38:01', '2020-11-18 10:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059653008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679258', 'Karin Schwarz', NULL, '11-18-20 Karin reached out for help with some blood tests for thyroid. I answered her questions and connected her to KellyAnne for further assistance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-18 10:35:52', '2020-11-18 10:35:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059642013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057777111', 'Amy Chase', NULL, '-Planstin was contacted to determine if her cards had been sent to her.  I spoke with Cat form Planstin and she did confirm they were sent out on Nov 13.  Cat also confirmed that she would reach out to member to verify the email address as well as the Mammogram Facility that is in Network with this plan. - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-18 10:25:51', '2020-11-18 10:25:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059651018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059650175', 'Gary Collins', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 10:18:40', '2020-11-18 10:18:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059651013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059650127', 'Karen Guptil', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 10:12:25', '2020-11-18 10:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059655003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356101', 'Jonathan Webster', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Member was able to get in member portal but with misspelled email of magwebster1@gamil.com. Will call concierge to fix it.  Was in a hurry  with call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-18 10:10:56', '2020-11-18 10:21:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059642008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057777111', 'Amy Chase', NULL, '-Member wants to know if her facility where she wants to have her mammogram done is in network.
-Member was advised that it was not.  Member at this point has not received a card as well and would like to know when it would be coming in.
-Member was instructed that I would follow up with Planstin regarding her card and get back to her. - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-18 10:05:13', '2020-11-18 10:05:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059651008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059650079', 'Susana Bracamonte', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 10:03:09', '2020-11-18 10:03:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059643008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057777111', 'Amy Chase', NULL, 'Amy called because she thought she was double billed, we was but was refunded.  Patti took the call to explain. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-18 09:52:45', '2020-11-18 09:52:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059653003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842532', 'Todd Bremner', NULL, '11-18-20 Todd called bc he''s SUPER nervous about covid and didn''t really understand how his membership works. He grew up using Kaiser and used to being told what to do and where to go. Now he''s lost. I coached him about use of Concierge, Redirect and Sedera, how to handle each scenario. I also let him know if he didn''t get the response from Redirect in a timely fashion to call the Concierge for a quick route to gain help. He calmed down and feels more at peace and was very thankful for my time. He rarely uses healthcare but his son has a bone issue that they are going to Boulder Community Health and seeing a PA. He believes it''s a primary care doctor visit. He''s choosing to pay on his own the first time and then he will call Redirect next time. I told him if he doesn''t call Redirect first then he will have to pay for visit. He understood but appointment is already made and didn''t seem to want to deal with calling them for this one appt. He also needs to get a colonoscopy and I told him he MUST call Redirect first to let then negotiate that and pay on his behalf. He didn''t realize that was included at no cost as well. He''s happy again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-18 09:49:47', '2020-11-18 09:49:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059651003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059650031', 'Veronica Hill', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 09:44:26', '2020-11-18 09:44:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059643003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406017', 'Patricia Nard', NULL, 'I spoke to MIke, Trish''s husband.  He said he spoke with a female over at HSA of America- Wiley.   That person told him that we were switching everyone over to Zion, and he wanted to know why.  I told him that we were not, as far as I knew.  I explained that Zion is an option and that I would have to double check with Patti, but that Trish could probably stay on for another year.  I said that nothing is wrong with Sedera, we were giving our members options due to another group transition earlier in the year, and that is why we offer Zion.  As an option.  I told him to hold the line so I can put him in touch with Patti, so she could give him the latest information, and fill in anything that I missed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-18 09:18:37', '2020-11-18 09:18:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059642003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925142', 'Kelly Schest', NULL, '-Member left message about needing help with bladder infection.
-Member was contacted and a voice mail was left.  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-18 09:18:09', '2020-11-18 09:18:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059607018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, 'Stan had called to say that the imaging center said they had sent over the claim to RCI in September.  I reiterated that Jennifer Chasteen had spoken to him yesterday and told him that they did not have this claim, and that he needed to ask the imaging center to resend it.  Also I found the claim submission form on RCI''s site so that he could submit a pap smear that she had done. He was grateful for the extra hand holding. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-18 08:53:05', '2020-11-18 08:53:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059619003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521158', 'Jennifer Hansen', NULL, '-Member wanted to know how to open a Need for her son that has ADHD.
-Member was giving Zion''s number to discuss with them.
-Member was advised to get all receipts together to see if they add up to the IUA.
-Member was also advised about the CirrusMD services as well as their upcoming Mental Health component if she needs it for her son.                                                -MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-18 08:34:40', '2020-11-18 08:34:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059612018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611086', 'Lucas Zielasko', NULL, 'Member Only $2000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 08:29:27', '2020-11-18 08:29:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059607013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356101', 'Jonathan Webster', NULL, 'Stan called for help contacting RCI, I told him that I would reach out to Jennifer Chasteen and ask her to give him a phone call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-18 08:27:45', '2020-11-18 08:27:45'),
