  ('zcrm_1579374000059612003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656126', 'Kevin Lever', NULL, '11/17-received a bettiegram from this member asking for the rate chart for his wife because he was going to be aging into Medicare in Feb and assumed that wife would stay on the plan.  I advised that she would have to re-enroll.  He said that he did not want to do that and that this was taken care of during the conversion.  He said that all was good until MPB changed him from Sedera.  Told him that MPB had nothing to do with it and that he made the choice.  Didn''t like that.  Spouse should have been made the primary at the time of conversion.  Member submitted cancellation I will cancel Zion & billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-18 07:50:02', '2020-11-18 07:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059607008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356101', 'Jonathan Webster', NULL, 'Maggie is already registered for Cirrus MD- probably with the only email that we have for her on file.  Vanessa, when you do her welcome call tell her that Jonathan''s information has been found in their system as well- but he will have to provide his own unique email when setting this up @ mycirrusmd.com/register.  OR you can ask for his unique email so that we can set it up......whatever is easier for them.  She was hesitant to give me his email on the call that I just had with her the other day for whatever reason.  She is all set up in the MPB Portal, and she is all set up with both of their QR LIfe codes.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-18 07:20:07', '2020-11-18 07:20:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059607003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610380', 'Laura Watson', NULL, 'member called to cancel, she is switching to a different plan that''s less expensive.  Sent her a cancellation form to fill out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-18 07:08:03', '2020-11-18 07:08:03'),
