  ('zcrm_1579374000059580065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906018', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, '11-17-20 Heidi is moving from PDHC to SECURE since turning 60 and price sky rocketing. She is super healthy, hasn''t been to doctor in years other than for wellness, no pre-x! Dr. Locke is not in PHCS and doesn''t do annual wellness visits. If chooses to go she will self pay. CARE+ $215/$1000. She''s thrilled!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-17 14:05:02', '2020-11-17 14:05:02'),
