  ('zcrm_1579374000059565099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563343', 'Amy Simon', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $2000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-17 13:21:40', '2020-11-17 13:21:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059581008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679210', 'Jennifer Anderson', NULL, 'Jennifer called me today and said that she did everything the right way with getting her mammogram done and she thankfully got it done for an AMAZING price of only $50.  After she submitted her claim in to get reimbursed from Sedera they emailed her back Friday night denying the claim for the reason of her having a HDHP with a MEC with RCI/APEX, which is incorrect. She was very confused and very disappointed she said. I understand why she would be but I do not know why Sedera would have that as their records for her type of plan when she has the DPC plan. Patti even pointed out to me that she sent proof of Jen''s DPC to Elizabeth Vargas on 3/26/19. I told Jen to forward me the 2 emails she got from Sedera and that I would send someone a slack message at Sedera and get this fixed by the end of the day if not tomorrow morning. I slacked Sedera and also told Jen to call Sedera and tell whomever she gets a hold of the same thing she told me and that she does NOT have a MEC with RCI. The guy she spoke to said they will change in their system that she has DPC not RCI and will also email Patti Baron to get proof of Jen''s DPC sent to them again. Patti was able to send it and they then asked for an updated version. Patti called Jen and asked for this and Jen is sending that to Patti now and Patti will get it over to Sedera. Once they have the updated proof of DPC for Jen everything will be all set and fixed. Jen''s claim will be accepted and they will reimburse her asap. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-17 13:20:04', '2020-11-17 13:20:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059565094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679210', 'Jennifer Anderson', NULL, 'Sedera requested current proof of DPC I sent out via Outlook to Ciara', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-17 13:15:34', '2020-11-17 13:15:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059565089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, 'Member Only $2000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-17 13:08:07', '2020-11-17 13:08:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059580060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176005', 'Jennifer Moen', NULL, '11-17-20 Jennifer is a contractor/1099, healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. She does have a hand issue she wants to get PT done soon. She will find out if she has co-pays with Anthem - $340 / high ded. If just goes to ded she can switch now and just pay cash price for PT. She will save $65 per month with SECURE $1000/$275. We will talk again on Friday at 12:30 to finalize decision. Also earns too much for APTC with C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-17 13:04:07', '2020-11-17 13:04:07'),
