  ('zcrm_1579374000059580052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173089', 'Diane Forsberg', NULL, '11-17-20 Diane is choosing to move to SECURE from HES/LHS. New membership will be $275/$1000 down from LHS $399+$50. Gave her instructions to cancel LHS an  HES for Dec. 1 and SECURE begins Dec. 1st, 2020. App complete!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-17 12:28:51', '2020-11-17 12:38:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059565066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, 'Member called in because she had talked to RCI to ask questions and was told they did not have her in their system.  I followed up with RCI who told me they have no records of her calling.  Called member back and verified correct number sure enough Sedera gave her some other number.  RCI able to pull her up immediately', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-17 12:18:21', '2020-11-17 12:18:21'),
