  ('zcrm_1579374000059580039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007792019', 'Carolyn Hope Clark', NULL, '11-17-20 Carolyn''s C4 account is a complete disaster. Prices are showing for some Anthem plans. Her old tax credit if $852.05 is showing not her new projected amount of $821. In Estimate APTC outside of her account it showed me $821 APTC but when she did it on her end it showed her a $500+ APTC for her an Noah. It shows completely different carriers available in the Est tool vs within her actual account. She was curious about Rocky Mtn Health plans that show up in Est but they don''t show in Account. We thought it was bc her Drs. weren''t in the network but when add her Drs. then still different plans again show up in Est. Dr. Laura Erben and Dr. Lindsay Boyer.  We are both afraid to click on Choose New Plans for 2021 in case in sends the account into further dismay. She is opting to let it auto renew since she''s had good luck with Anthem and her doctors working with Anthem. Leaving her income at $40,522, 80305, 5/13/1957, 02/06/1998. I''m baffled! We will see what her account shows after Dec. 1st for auto renew. Not submitting a ticket yet in fear of causing more problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-17 11:47:23', '2020-11-17 11:47:59'),
