  ('zcrm_1579374000059585003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, '11.17.20:  Stan also called me re: Peggy''s mammogram.  He told me the issue, said Peggy is going in for another test and may not have given them her card when she went for the mammogram.  Not knowing Kelly assisted him already, I told him to direct the Imaging center to re-submit the bill, as well as the new bill to the TPA.  He mentioned he recently got a notice that one of the medical centers they use has left the PHCS network.  I recommended he always call the provider before making appts. for services to be sure they are in network. 
