  ('zcrm_1579374000059581003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885296', 'David Steiner', NULL, 'I was contacted by Megan Miller at Sedera that Dave contacted her and was saying he needs helps with his preventative bills that he has. She told him that he has APEX/RCI and that he needs to contact them directly for these issues. She said he was very confused by this and asked if someone here could reach out to him. I told her I would give him a call and that she was correct in telling him to contact RCI directly. She called him back and left a voice mail explaining exactly what I had told her. I also tried calling him and it went straight to voicemail as well as his phone is off. I left a detailed voicemail as well saying the same things me and Megan told him. For anything preventative related, bills, anything that he needs to contact RCI directly and left both of their phone numbers that I have for RCI with him, I lastly let him know that if he has any other questions that he can give us a call back whenever and will help him as best we can. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-17 09:00:32', '2020-11-17 09:00:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059580003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, 'Stan called because Peggy received a bill for her mammogram.  I made sure that the facility was in network, it was.  Then I gave Stan RCI''s claims number and told him that they would walk him through the process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-17 08:42:17', '2020-11-17 08:42:17'),
