  ('zcrm_1579374000059497013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608589', 'Genifer Murray', NULL, '11-16-20 Genifer has lost her job and is contemplating going onto Medicaid until she finds a new job. I just let her know her current membership is no longer available and the pre-x clause starts again. She says she doesn''t have any pre-x and only been to doctor for annual wellness in last 2 years. She knows if she cancels she will have other options, just not the membership she''s on now. She sounded disappointed and may keep her membership alive while she looks for job.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-16 12:24:40', '2020-11-16 12:24:40'),
