  ('zcrm_1579374000059476008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '11-16-20 Robin is enrolling now for SECURE $275/$1000. She just finished a pilates class and is going on a bike ride next. Definitely focused on live healthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-16 10:22:42', '2020-11-16 10:33:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059475016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042933004', 'James Pendleton', 'Redirect Term', 'Tracking #10793188
Sent by Patti Baron on 11/16/2020.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-16 10:11:40', '2020-11-16 10:11:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059476003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057170036', 'Derek Dimitri', NULL, '11-16-20 Derek called and his wife is 6 weeks pregnant they believe. She has her first 8 week ultrasound appt coming up soon. He will call Concierge for help in getting best quality fair price for ultrasound and whatever else is necessary at that viist. He now knows he will pay cash for that visit. He will go ahead and find traditional insurance for wife starting Jan. 1st since we are in open enrollment. He believes she won''t have another appointment until Jan anyhow. He sincerely appreciates our help and feels like we actually care! He will remain on the membership and remove his wife for Jan. 1st. He''ll complete form on Dec. 19th to remove her. He will add her and baby back after complete post-natal visits.  Again, super appreciative for our assistance!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-16 10:10:04', '2020-11-16 10:10:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059475011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042933004', 'James Pendleton', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation and re-enrolled in the Secure option w/Zion.  I will cancel with Sedera &amp; Redirect &amp; FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-16 10:09:53', '2020-11-16 10:09:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059473008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889025', 'Laurie Testa', NULL, 'she was just confused as to how her plan works.  She is going to call me later and I am going to walk her through getting passwords set up and all of that.  She also thinks she was double billed, she is going to also grab some statements before she calls again and I will hand her over to Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-16 09:30:46', '2020-11-16 09:30:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059475006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061180', 'William Reyes', NULL, 'Advisor emailed me with request to lower IUA from $2000 to $1000.  I updated in Admin 123 &amp; CRM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-16 09:29:22', '2020-11-16 09:29:22'),
