Take care and keep well.

All the best,

Chuck Korb', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-14 13:37:05', '2020-11-14 13:37:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059439013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294135', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, 'Josh text me asking for the phone his provider Tele-Medicine  phone number.  I provided him the toll free number for Redirect Health.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2020-11-14 09:14:21', '2020-11-14 09:14:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059433043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '11-13-20 Robin and I will enroll her on Monday at 8:45 before training call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-13 16:56:30', '2020-11-13 16:56:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059433038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057170036', 'Derek Dimitri', NULL, '11-13-20 Derek wife may be pregnant and called in to start a Need. Michele let me know and I called Derek. He was already informed that it may not be shared due to the timing of their effective date. Due date must be 1 year past effective date. They are about 1 month too soon. He''ll call me on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-13 16:52:40', '2020-11-13 16:52:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059433033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042933004', 'James Pendleton', NULL, '11-13-20 Jim is healthy, no pre-x and hasn''t been to doctor at all for past 2 years. Called to find something cheaper. I explained SECURE and he just enrolled for Dec. 1st. He cancelled his current PDHC that is $578 per month. SECURE is $275/$1000. He gets 1099 income from Linda Johnston. Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-13 16:26:07', '2020-11-13 16:26:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059433028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, '11-13-20 Rob is gathering SS#''s for kids and info regarding his current other life insurance policy to finalize NLG Term 30 $500K app. Applying for 30 year but likely choosing 20 year.  Can recommend they create a Trust for kids somewhere down the road.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-13 15:46:40', '2020-11-13 15:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059420081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043460179', 'Jason Steinberg', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Great call!  I put a request over on Sedera''s Slack asking that they resend him all welcome materials as well as info on how to register with Teladoc- he wants to utilize their Covid services.  Requesting from Patti that she send him a PDF and hard copy of his RCI card as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-13 14:55:13', '2020-11-13 14:55:13');
