  ('zcrm_1579374000059439003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005542023', 'Constance Trincali', NULL, '11.13.20:  Spoke w/Connie. She decided to stay with Liberty, not to risk sharing for her pre-existing condition (breast cancer).', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-11-13 14:55:11', '2020-11-13 14:55:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059433013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '11-13-20 Brandi is 39 and her thyroid issue she''s not interested in treating with lifelong meds or to have it removed. She''s planning to address it naturally if possible. She''s currently paying $178 through marketplace but is hoping income will increase significantly in 2021 since launching new biz. Hopes to have at least $50K or much more income. She loves this concept. She wants to run some numbers to determine which level and which membership to choose SECURE of CARE+. She might want to fund HSA after I explained in great detail about how they work. SECURE $275/$1000 or CARE+ $215/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-13 13:40:07', '2020-11-13 13:40:07'),
