  ('zcrm_1579374000059420061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056904199', 'Wesley Kanter', NULL, '11/11/20 member was transferred to me and told me he was very dissatisfied with his 2 mos on Redirect had gotten no service from them and wanted his $500 refunded.  I explained to him that that was not going to happen and that just because he didn''t use the plan he was not entitled to his money back. I told him to go back and speak to Jeff and let me know what he wanted to do.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-13 12:41:38', '2020-11-13 12:41:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059420056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, 'Kelly got Etta a QR Life code and sent it out. I sent Etta a welcome letter to schedule a welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-13 12:40:07', '2020-11-13 12:40:07'),
