  ('zcrm_1579374000059420036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', 'Change to DPC', 'This member apparently changed to a DPC back in July and never told us.  I advised that I could not change it or credit her retroactively.  But could change her going forward.  Letter below:

Hi Wendy and Patti, 

I inquired about changing my membership way back in July. I actually switched from ReDirect to a DPC in July, but never followed up with you about canceling ReDirect. Here are the invoices from my DPC - I''m guessing that you can not change this retroactively, but if you can credit me that would be great! Regardless, if you can just make sure the change is made for December 1st that would be great. 

Thank you. 

julie wilson', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-13 10:46:12', '2020-11-13 10:46:12'),
