  ('zcrm_1579374000059429003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781113', 'Therese Higgins', NULL, 'I had to create another envelope and assign another QR Life Code for Therese 3 days after I had already done all of this. Her old code is: H0K2T. I am not sure what happened to the first envelope I made. I know for a fact that nothing was sent out, if it was than it was NOT by me and Therese will have 2 QR Life Codes, which is fine. All she would have to do is just link the both of the QR Life Codes, which is very easy. Therese would just have to scan the new QR Code and it will link it directly to her first QR Life Code, simple fix. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-13 08:50:53', '2020-11-13 08:50:53'),
