  ('zcrm_1579374000059381028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '11-12-20 Fox is removing herself from Mitchell''s membership due to a divorce. She is currently paying for whole membership and billing will need to be udpated to Mitchell''s account. Fox is applying now for PSDHC on her own now without Mitchell or kids $500/$296. She''s also working to change her legal name to Fox Marie Magdovitz but her former last name is Fox, so she''s not sure how it will wind up.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-12 15:17:42', '2020-11-12 15:17:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059381023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, '11-12-20 Member wants wellness visits added if at all possible. I asked Rod if they could upgrade to Prodiver Directed Healthcare for Dec. 1st start date and he said yes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-12 15:05:26', '2020-11-12 15:05:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059381018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, 'researching what options Rachel might have for her son''s Oral Facial Speech therapy. I will email her my findings tomorrow morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-12 14:58:41', '2020-11-12 14:58:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059396003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674173', 'Ellen Tresnak', NULL, 'Call from Ellen.  She wanted her IUA Reduced this year.  She did not get a notice in July as she did other years, so she called MPowering in Aug. They said they were going through computer software change and that notices did not go out and they would be later.  But she  never got a notice.
She called again in Oct. and was told they were still behind.  Feels she is being ignored. 
Ellen is requesting to be changed to the 1500 IUA ($459) now.', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2020-11-12 14:35:38', '2020-11-12 14:35:38'),
