  ('zcrm_1579374000059307016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, '11-11-20 Jessica will close out the Need with Sedera. They believe they will need more treatment for Daniel''s ankle via a chiropractor and possible PT. I read the Guidelines to her about chiro and suggested they might want to get pre-approval or at least see if pre-approval is necessary in his circumstance. They know 25 visits max and they pay $65 per visit.  She also wants list of ACA compliant wellness and VSP link to Daniel.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-11 11:04:09', '2020-11-11 11:04:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059307011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, '11-11-20 Left vm for Jessica bc she thinks she''s still on Sedera Access but she chose MPB Carez. I gave her # for Concierge if she has a new need or to call me back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-11 10:37:19', '2020-11-11 10:37:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059307003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '11-11-20 Micheal revealed Hillary needs potentially two hip surgeries and a knee surgery! She will definitely need regular ins and looking at Anthem which is the only option with Dr. Eric McCarty.  Dr. Mei-Dan is Bright Health and Anthem. We looked up cost for family on Anthem Bronze Pathway X 6000 and it''s $1659 for family. If they just put Hillary on it''s around $450 and rest of family on SECURE for $495/$1000 for total around $950. He''s now open to this once he had sticker shock. He will talk with Hillary and get back to me today or tomorrow to proceed. He knows I can help with Anthem enrollment at well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-11 10:25:22', '2020-11-11 10:28:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059278038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295052', 'Susan Hodson', NULL, 'I returned members call, she had been in contact with Zion about her provider sending her for further testing on her breast.  I advised her that if her provider was in the network she should show the Planstin card because of discounts.  I told her that she would be still paying the same $1000 weather she used the card or not.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-11 10:20:32', '2020-11-11 10:20:32'),
