  ('zcrm_1579374000059246105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549326', 'Elizabeth Miller', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in very distraught, the doctor''s office that she was trying to set up a well women''s visit wasn''t being too helpful.  I called Emily from RCI and she was kind enough to get a hold of Dr. Emily Clements office- they have her plan squared away and they have made her an appointment.  I called Elizabeth back and gave her her member ID, got her new updated address where she is staying to take care of her mother and filled out an address update form on her behalf.  She seemed really relieved that all had been taken care of. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-10 12:51:03', '2020-11-10 12:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059253013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862150', 'Judy Flanagan', NULL, 'I received no response from Jane on this member so I asked Jane on the Affiliate call for some status.   After finding out from me Robert wanted to get with Zion about this members issue.  Robert asked me for Members name &amp; date of service.  I reached out to the member who told me that she did not know who Jane was and said that she thought that the date of service was sometime in Aug. but would get back with me.  I sent this info on to Robert.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-10 12:45:52', '2020-11-10 12:45:52'),
