  ('zcrm_1579374000059246080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447266', 'Ruhi Khan', NULL, 'Ruhi called in about whether or not her daughters heart tests that she has scheduled tomorrow would be considered a need.  I gave her Sedera''s phone number for that question as well as sent along information about how to open a need with Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-10 11:12:42', '2020-11-10 11:12:42'),
