  ('zcrm_1579374000059257008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '11-10-20 OK he called me back. I reiterated what KellyAnne told him. He''s not happy but recognizes it''s still better than his previous terrible insurance he had. But, he''s comparing it to his sister''s group plan that does "cover" the scan. He''ll pay cash from his HSA. The scan was about $1000 last year, so he''ll do that again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-10 10:42:42', '2020-11-10 10:42:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059257003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '11-10-20 I just called and left Nelson a vm to help clear up any questions and concerns he has regarding his membership per the above conversation with KellyAnne. She took all of the proper measures to help him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-10 10:30:33', '2020-11-10 10:30:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059246050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058265123', 'Xiao Neng March', NULL, 'Cirrus MD email registration sent, MPB Portal and QR Life code all set! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-10 10:30:22', '2020-11-10 10:30:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059237008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590004', 'Isabel Graefin Von Rittberg', NULL, 'Isabel called in and said that she just go done using CirrusMD and they recommended that she go see and ENT doctor because of some infection she might have in her ear. They said to call into here and see where to go from there. I told her with anything like that she can go anywhere but she should start with her primary care doctor first and have them refer her to someone. I made sure her primary is still in the PHCS Network and she was. I told her how to present herself as a cash pay and is to pay up to her $1000 IUA and anything after that she is to get in contact with Zion and open a need. She understood everything and thanked me very much for helping and how easy it was. Very happy member so far and she is all set for now.  She also asked me for a list of what is preventive with her plan. I sent her the website to be able to look at the full list in an email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-10 10:29:17', '2020-11-10 10:29:17'),
