  ('zcrm_1579374000059253003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, 'Member submitted bills for colonoscopy to Sedera who then told her it was not "covered".  I told her that anything preventative should not be submitted to Sedera. Angie gave her some erroneous number for RCI, person there told her that hse was not covered.  I gave her correct number for RCI and to ask them how to submit bills to RCI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-10 10:12:05', '2020-11-10 10:12:05'),
