  ('zcrm_1579374000059237003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549326', 'Elizabeth Miller', NULL, 'Libby called in and said that she recently moved from CO to FL. So first she needs  to change her address which I sent her the member change form to fill out. Second she said she is due for her Woman''s Well visit and asked if she can go to anyone or what. I told her that that is something that is Preventative and covered under her plan and that she needs to go to an approved provider in the PHCS Network. I let her know I would be more than happy to send her a list of Gynecologist''s in her new area. She provided me with the new zip code and I sent her a list. I also asked her if she has her RCI card which she did and found it while on the phone with me. I said she needs to bring that and I would send her another email with instructions on how to present her card. Lastly I sent her an email with the Welcome Call scheduler.  She lastly started talking about I believe she said either ER visit or Urgent Care visit and that she knows she went over her "Deductible". I stopped her and told her that it is and IUA  (explained the meaning and what hers is) and that she needs to get in contact with Sedera ASAP and gave her their phone number. She was very happy with all the help. Oh one last thing and she also called Patti afterwards to, but she asked me and Patti if we are affiliated with Surebridge Insurance. I told her no as well as Patti and that I never heard of them. She is being charged random time at random amounts. Patti told her that most of the time on statements there is a phone number that she could call and figure out with is going on and also she can tell the bank this and that she did not authorize it and they can stop the payment and investigate. Libby is very happy and satisfied with all the help we have provided her and seems extremely happy with us at the moment. She is all set for now and knows where to reach up if she has any other issues or questions. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-10 09:47:58', '2020-11-10 09:47:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059220008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, 'Nelson called in wanting to know if an Abdominal MRI would be a preventative care covered expense to check for Pancreatic Cancer (he has a family history).   I told him that I didn''t think that it was one of the mandated services per the ACA but that I would do a little digging and let him know.  He emailed me his abdominal MRI doctor''s order and I sent it over to Jennifer at RCI- she got back to me and let me know that it is not a covered expense under his plan.  I gathered all of the HCBB info I could on the procedure (although it seemed as though he wanted to stay with his original facility) I sent him a price graph showing fair price, and also a PDF Binding Price agreement he could use as another tool when negotiating a cash price.  I also told him that if the bill did go over his IUA of $1000, he could open up a need with Sedera.  I sent those instructions along to him as well.  Nelson was not happy this morning, he told me that he signed up with us to get straight answers, not to  get a line of BullSh&* and hide behind the ACA guidelines.  I felt that I was as kind and as informative as I could be, I even sent him a link to the ACA list of services that ARE covered. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-10 09:37:08', '2020-11-10 09:37:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059225008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '11-10-20 Robin asked a few more questions and will call me in a day or two to apply. Also wants VSP link to review.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-10 09:27:57', '2020-11-10 09:27:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059226003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162629', 'Christopher Spencer', NULL, '-Member (Maydesen) called to say that she had a $14,000 ER bill and needed to know where she needed to send the bill.
-Member was given Sedera''s direct number to open up a NEED. - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-10 09:10:46', '2020-11-10 09:10:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059225003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165392', 'Rob Nagler', NULL, '11-10-20 Rob asked to opt out of future email notifications. Done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-10 09:08:06', '2020-11-10 09:08:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059224003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521486', 'Ryan Ashley', NULL, 'This member was one that was billed multiple time during the conversion.  So we applied those payments to his October &amp; November medical cost share.  I emailed Wendy and the member to let them know', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-10 08:05:40', '2020-11-10 08:05:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059220003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862078', 'Marissa Merchant', NULL, 'explained how to get covered flu shots for her family. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-10 07:05:53', '2020-11-10 07:05:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059177038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002118005', 'Eric Nelson', NULL, '11-9-20 Asked to Opt-Out of email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-09 21:29:09', '2020-11-09 21:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059177028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '11/9/20 Rachel and Dan are not happy with Kaiser and looking at Oscar or Friday Health but want to check on good pediatricians in area. Told them to call chosen drs. to make sure exact plan is accepted. They will and know of Dec. 15th deadline for Jan. 1st. They somehow got put onto Medicaid just Rachel and Emunah but have tried to get off of Medicaid endlessly and can''t seem to. But, when login into C4 it shows proper APTC for 2021 $3246.40 and they can proceed to choose plans. Their income is around $52K and same for 2021. They prefer naturopathic, craniosacral and holistic care. But, with the subsidy their cost is only around $366 a month for 2021 and not worth paying double for MCS options at family price.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-09 16:31:47', '2020-11-09 16:31:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059177023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608589', 'Genifer Murray', NULL, '11-10-20 She received notification from Sedera that her membership fee is increasing bc changing age group from 40-49 to 50-59 with upcoming B-Day. Paying $333 now and going to up to $378. Left her a vm saying so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-09 14:37:08', '2020-11-09 14:37:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059177018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056687112', 'Sydney Greenwood', NULL, '11-9-20 I chose Cancel Auto Renew in her account per her email request since getting health ins from new job starting Jan 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-09 14:27:53', '2020-11-09 14:27:53'),
