  ('zcrm_1579374000059160079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, 'Kristy called in to complain that she can''t use the MPB.Health portal yet.  I explained WHY she couldn''t use it yet.  I sent her the online banking change cognito form.  I told her to just give us a call for now while she waits for access to make any changes to her account. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-09 13:53:17', '2020-11-09 13:53:17'),
