  ('zcrm_1579374000059182003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037871013', 'Dawn DeAno', NULL, 'KellyC transferred this member to me as she said that she didn''t have any documentation for her plan.  I went over her plan and the IUA and how it works.  I then told her that she could have another welcome call if/when she needs it.  I will send her link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-09 13:20:58', '2020-11-09 13:20:58'),
