  ('zcrm_1579374000059177003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '11-9-20 Carleen likes her Cigna so she can keep her current doctors. She increased her income to $25K and is getting a $178.78 APTC for now and 2021. Choosing to allow system to auto-renew on Dec. 1st. She will check her account in Dec. to make sure it all looks good and still paying successfully. New cost will be $135.33 for 2021 Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5000 with a $3500 ded and $6500 mop.  All set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-09 11:18:05', '2020-11-09 11:18:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059173003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645107', 'Edward Hill', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-09 10:50:46', '2020-11-09 10:50:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059153008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009579103', 'Steven Meusel', NULL, 'Louise called in and let me know that Husband would be aging into Medicare on 1/1/2021.  I advised that I would send her the Cancellation link and to submit after 12/1.  Also told her that Jan would have to re-enroll her in December as a single.  Left VM for Jan about this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-09 10:37:09', '2020-11-09 10:37:09'),
