  ('zcrm_1579374000059139013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Teresa reached out via SalesIQ and asked about the flu shot, I instructed her on where to go an get one for it to be covered, as well as answered other questions.   Emailed educational templates.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-09 09:56:18', '2020-11-09 09:56:18'),
