Question : I am a member does my health share pay for flu shots', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-11-09 09:42:06', '2020-11-09 09:42:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059139008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391005', 'John Colver', NULL, 'John called in about a preventative care bill, I redirected him to call RCI directly and explained that they could assist him the rest of the way with his bill. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-09 09:42:03', '2020-11-09 09:42:03'),
