  ('zcrm_1579374000059126003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '-Called to see if CirrusMD will give script for her Hypothyroidism. She had called them already for a UTI but wasn''t sure how often she could reach out to them.  Member was informed that she could call them as often as necessary.
-Member also wanted to know if there were any Mental Health Programs with her plan.  I let her know that I would double check to see if the new MAP plan was going to be with the old plans as well as the new ones.  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-09 07:50:27', '2020-11-09 07:50:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059114003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059112004', 'Salt Garrison', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-09 07:28:28', '2020-11-09 07:28:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059068058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007792019', 'Carolyn Hope Clark', NULL, '11-6-20 Spoke with Granville at C4 to figure out discrepancy with letters she received. He said they don''t offer that plan and therefore can''t renew that plan with the APTC. She told me some woman with C4 3 years ago enrolled her in a plan that wasn''t on the exchange but still credited her with the APTC. Hence, this is the problem we are running into now. Carolyn also told me she worked with some other agent a bunch of years ago who enrolled her in an off-exchange plan and she then was penalized $1000''s of dollars for not having on-exchange plan to obtain APTC. She understands she doesn''t want to make that mistake again.  We will review all plan options next week to see what''s available. Perhaps mention MCS as well since she will then not have to worry about income amount and APTC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-06 16:30:41', '2020-11-06 16:30:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059068050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '11-6-20 Michael is 53, Hillary 49, Lauren 18, Kyle 16, Remy 7. Using Anthem via C4 now for $700 with APTC. But, in 2021 income will be too high to receive APTC for Family of 5. Lives on mostly asset income but has a small biz where they derive their income from. No tobacco, no meds, no pre-x. Only thing in past 24 months was Lauren broke her foot. Discussed SECURE for $685/$1000. Referred by Maria Hassett. Looking at Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-06 16:18:26', '2021-01-04 15:41:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059070013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004687005', 'Lisa Kulig', NULL, '-Sent text stating for her to contact us when she has her script so that we would know what type of imaging test needed to be done.  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-06 14:47:33', '2020-11-06 14:47:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059068031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059112004', 'Salt Garrison', NULL, '11-6-20 Salt is enrolling now in SECURE $1000/$275 and he appreciates questions on app.  He''s only had a torn hamstring this past year and nothing else in the last 5 years.  He''s a panpsychic meaning all things have consciousness. Used to be Christian and is no longer one. Super pleased about this and for my assistance. He''s excited to refer new clients to me. So, I told him about the referral program and he''s even more excited now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-06 14:21:51', '2020-11-06 14:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059060033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Take a lot of time and care when speaking with, and listen. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-06 14:18:41', '2020-11-06 14:18:41'),
