  ('zcrm_1579374000059052048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001106387', 'Kelly Parnigoni', NULL, 'Prior HES Membership 1/1/2016-12/1/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-06 13:59:30', '2020-11-06 13:59:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059068026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '11-6-20 Robin is retired and 59. Gets insurance through PARA now and going up to $525 with Kaiser. She''s due for a colonoscopy and Kaiser is scheduled out to Feb or March. No major pre-x, no tobacco, just takes HRT compounded for $45 a month and topical cream for rosacea, plus cream for lip with pre-cancerous spot. Not concerned, just treating with cream. She knows the pre-x clause which I explained 2x to make sure she understands it. She really wants the wellness and HSA compliance for tax benefits of funding HSA. She finally realized she has an LLC for a property that she earns income on which will allow her to join SECURE! $1000/$275. Meeting again next Tuesday after she reviews information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-06 13:56:51', '2020-11-16 10:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059052043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061180', 'William Reyes', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-06 13:01:39', '2020-11-16 09:27:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059070008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004687005', 'Lisa Kulig', NULL, '-Member called wanting clarification on CirrusMD log-in.  After walking her through the process, she is now successfully registered with them.
