-Member was given Zion''s number to discuss next step''s for this possible Need.
-Member wanted us to check to see if she can get into Healthcare BlueBook so that she could see if there is a place close by her to have the imaging done. I told her I would get back with her on that and in the meantime, would do a search and see what was available to her.  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-06 12:46:39', '2020-11-06 12:46:39'),
