  ('zcrm_1579374000059052033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616121', 'Catherine McDowell', NULL, 'Member sent me an email saying that she was directed by Sedera to speak to me about removing her children from the membership.  She wanted to do this effective 11/1, I told her that that was not possible and that she could do that for a 12/1 effective.  I sent her out the link to the Change form and advised her of the new pricing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-06 12:28:47', '2020-11-06 12:28:47'),
