  ('zcrm_1579374000059068008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000907023', 'Melinda Niemczyk', NULL, '11-6-20 Patti called to let me know Sedera has reinstated Melinda into the Sedera Access Plus membership. All set again. Just spoke with Melinda and she''s happy to know she''s still with Sedera. She has outstanding Needs she''s working through and definitely did not choose to cancel or switch to Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-06 11:49:37', '2020-11-06 11:52:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059052023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904253', 'Marcella Friel', NULL, 'Got msg from Deb about this member wanting to cancel.  I called her and she wants to cancel eff 1/21.  I will send out link and I advised her to send in after 12/1 to be processed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-06 11:47:39', '2020-11-06 11:47:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059060018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023159', 'Max Rebel', NULL, 'Whitney called to set up a time for her to do a welcome call, I told her that would be fine, as long as either Max was on the line as well or, as long as Max scheduled his own time.  She told me that Max works 6 days a week and will not have any time to do the call.  I told her that I would send a form for the the two of them to fill out allowing Whitney to take the full responsibility of the call rather than Max, the primary member.    I also sent a scheduler.  They filled out the form, I printed out the PDF and attached it here in the CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-06 11:14:17', '2020-11-06 11:14:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059070003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544245', 'Bethany Schaap', NULL, '-Member called to verify the date the payment will come out of her account.
