  ('zcrm_1579374000059060013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, 'I called Mary Ann because Joan told me she wanted another welcome call.  Mary Ann was unable to do another call today and she will reach out to me directly next week to schedule the best time for her to get it done with me. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-06 09:23:46', '2020-11-06 09:23:46'),
