  ('zcrm_1579374000059029003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '11-5-20 Fox and Mitchell will discuss who keeps kids due to difference in cost. She knows I need time to get the enrollment platform reactivated to move them to separate accounts. She will let me know asap when they''ve made a decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 17:17:29', '2020-11-05 17:17:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059012072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000907023', 'Melinda Niemczyk', NULL, '11-5-20 UPDATE -  Melinda chose to KEEP Sedera Access Plus, not switch to MPB Carez Connected according to her application. I''ve submitted a tkt to get this corrected ASAP! She received a cancellation notice from Sedera. Zoho is showing wrong compared to her actual application I reviewed later than above note.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 16:55:37', '2020-11-05 16:55:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059012067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740037', 'Lauren Wagner', NULL, '11-5-20 Lauren chose to KEEP Sedera Access Plus, not switch to MPB Carez Connected according to her application. I''ve submitted a tkt to get this corrected ASAP! She received a cancellation notice from Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 16:54:34', '2020-11-05 16:54:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059012062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '11-5-20 Playing phone tag with him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 16:44:55', '2020-11-05 16:44:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059012054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '11-5-20 Figge is asking about mental health visits to include psychiatric care. I told him about our virtual healthcare option and the soon to come mental health benefit. But, he believes he needs to see a psychiatrist and obtain meds. He''s was surprised and disappointed by the lack of mental health benefit for more significant scenarios. He was hoping even traditional insurance would be better but rarely includes much for mental health except for Kaiser.  He sounds very stressed with life!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 16:24:37', '2020-11-05 16:24:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059012049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000907023', 'Melinda Niemczyk', NULL, '11-5-20 Guillermo called me to let me know Melinda called and was upset that she received an email from Sedera saying her membership is cancelled. I left her a vm saying that''s due to her changing her membership as of Aug. 1st and Zion is the new sharing organization included in her membership as of Aug. 1st. Hopefully that will alleviate her concerns.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 15:36:18', '2020-11-05 15:36:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059012038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001106387', 'Kelly Parnigoni', NULL, '11-5-20 Kelly called to complete LHS conversion application and deciding to cut their losses with LHS. Hoping to get reimbursed but not certain and didn''t want to miss this opportunity. Choosing MPB Carez Connected Worksite - $697/$1000 EF for Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 14:53:42', '2020-11-05 14:53:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059012033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654206', 'Elizabeth Burlingame', NULL, '11-5-20 Maya and Nathan are married now. Maya had some visits with specialists that Redirect told her weren''t "covered." So, she didn''t remember that goes through Sedera. I reminder her and showed how her to submit them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 14:42:44', '2020-11-05 14:42:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059009008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058400001', 'Teresa Walker', NULL, 'Teresa called in and just had her welcome call this morning and still had a bunch of questions. She wanted to know what is and what is not covered. I went over everything and explained the difference between what is and what is not covered and her IUA and the whole per need situation. She was very happy with my help. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-05 14:24:45', '2020-11-05 14:24:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059018003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009836013', 'James Brignall', NULL, '-James called wanting to know how to access his CirrusMD
-Member was walked through the process successfully
-Member was also given the link to MyHealth.us so that he could register his new QRLife code - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-05 13:26:57', '2020-11-05 13:26:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059012028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '11-5-20 Spoke with Joanne, Michelle''s mother. Joanne said she''s been in industry for 34 years with life/health license, etc. She told me IUA works the same as a deductible and that when she had cancer the deductible did Not reset. Instead of arguing, we moved on. It was at least 7 years ago this happened and on a small group plan. Who knows. She was a bit difficult to speak with and finally listened by the end. She wants to read up on the information I send and will advise Michelle. We also looked at traditional insurance which starts at $411.86 for lowest level Bronze plan with Anthem. Once she understood that she became more open to MCS. We will see. She''s on Medicare now herself, so not up to date on how healthcare works at this time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 13:02:36', '2020-11-05 13:02:36'),
