  ('zcrm_1579374000058999031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654099', 'Jennifer Avery', NULL, 'I will cancel member for non Payment.  3 notices have gone out  Cancelled Sedera &amp; RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-05 11:50:34', '2020-11-05 11:54:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058999026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029348121', 'Kristen Stephen', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she had been in the hospital 2 nights ago for an erratic heartbeat.  To identify what is going on she will have to wear a monitor.  She did not have to pay anything in the hospital will be billed.  I directed her to be in contact with Sedera to open a need and that they would be able to step her through the process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-05 11:14:46', '2020-11-05 11:14:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059012003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '11-5-20 Left vm for Fox and Mitchell to confirm who will keep kids if we are allowed to leave memberships active and just split off Fox or Fox and kids. Patti is sending message through Slack to see how we can do it to remain on Access.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-05 11:08:37', '2020-11-05 11:08:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058999021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005956089', 'C. Michaele Hogan', NULL, 'Member called in and wants to cancel however payment is pending.  I will send him Cancellation request and refund in a couple of days.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-05 11:01:52', '2020-11-05 11:01:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059009003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645107', 'Edward Hill', NULL, 'Edward called in and wanted to know how everything works since he just started. He has not had his welcome call yet so I sent him the welcome call scheduler. He said that sounded perfect and will schedule one when he gets it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-05 10:33:19', '2020-11-05 10:33:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058999016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544097', 'Heidi Hoke', NULL, 'The 10/28 pmt declined so I called the member and she gave me her CC. I will send her the Pmt update Form and she will update for next month', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-05 10:06:16', '2020-11-05 10:06:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059006003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005542023', 'Constance Trincali', NULL, '11:05.20:  Spoke w/Connie re: Liberty conversion plan.  Her only hesitation is she had a lumpectomy for breast cancer two years ago (Dec. 3 or 6 of 2018) and feels $25,000 may not be enough to protect her, although she has had no symptoms or treatment since that time.  Told her I would look into this w/Zion and let her know.
Spoke w/Tim Hirsh. He said if she didn''t have any medical Cx, Tx, or Sx or diagnostic testing since her lumpectomy, this would not be considered pre-existing. However, if any of her providers have any info. in their charts to the contrary, this would be classified as a pre-existing condition. Emailed Connie this info.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-11-05 10:04:05', '2020-11-05 15:08:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058999008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925046', 'Susan Korzon', NULL, 'Sedera was good enough to cancel this member for months of October &amp; November. I refunded the member these months.  Future billing cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-05 09:49:59', '2020-11-05 09:50:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059004008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-05 09:40:33', '2020-11-05 09:40:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000059004003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058400001', 'Teresa Walker', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-05 09:29:14', '2020-11-05 09:29:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058999003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004031922', 'Denise Pride', NULL, 'I received a forwarded email from admin letting me know that this member had thought HES was cancelled.  I responded that I had no Cancellation requests and sent it to her via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-05 09:04:58', '2020-11-05 09:04:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058979008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881016', 'Michael Grace', NULL, 'Michael called and needed help with prescriptions that he needs after a surgery that is scheduled today.  Sent prescription medication quote form. - KC and MR', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-05 08:53:46', '2020-11-05 08:53:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058979003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054820050', 'Michael Brisbane', NULL, 'I helped Michael log into his MPB.Health portal, I also helped explain to him who we are- what we offer- and the other platforms included in his plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-05 08:27:36', '2020-11-05 08:27:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059112004', 'Salt Garrison', NULL, '11-4-20 Salt is 53, lives in Broomfield, solopreneur and runs own Human Behavioral Health Specialist biz for about 2 years. He''s healthy, works out 2-3 times per week, no tobacco, no meds. He is getting a $195 APTC. His 2020 cost is $360 now and going up to $575 in 2021. He looking for something more affordable and was doing his annual wellness visit until he had a bad experience and has to find a new doctor. Discussed SECURE for $1000/$275 and is interested to learn more. We both had appointments and couldn''t talk further. But, he''s very interested.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 21:55:25', '2020-11-04 21:55:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060801098', 'Jodie Gilbert', NULL, '11-4-20 Jodie is turning 41 and divorced with 2 kids but only 1 that she files on her taxes as dependent. Both kids are on x''s insurance. She earns $60K before taxes and paying Cobra $500 since April. C4 account isn''t working. She and I get error after citizenship page every time even using Chrome.  Told her to call C4 and ask them to fix her account and make sure only 1 child is on there, therefore remove Benji. I don''t see Benji on the app for family.  May want to propose SECURE to her as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 21:49:47', '2020-11-04 21:49:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007792019', 'Carolyn Hope Clark', NULL, '11-4-20 Left vm for Ann Eisenhart bc of strange discrepancy between letters she''s receiving from Anthem vs what shows on C4 site. None of it really matches. Her current card shows $1000 ded and she wants to keep that, but newest letter shows information that matches C4 but not her card.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 17:00:28', '2020-11-04 17:00:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007792019', 'Carolyn Hope Clark', NULL, '11-4-20 Carolyn received an notice from Anthem that she can keep her current plan. But the plan they are showing is different from what C4HCO is showing for her. C4 shows Anthem Pathway X HMO 5500. Her renewal letter shows as 1000 ded. On C4 shows $6600 ded and family mop $11,400. Income is set to $40,522. She lives off her investments. She will send me a copy of her letter since it''s not what shows in C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 16:33:08', '2020-11-04 16:33:08');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165398', 'Andrew Hogan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Andrew was an amazing sport.  Opened Ticket.  Please read Ticket. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 15:25:58', '2020-11-04 15:25:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058970003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057544084', 'Martin Wescott', NULL, 'Invoices sent to Marty for Oct. and Nov.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-11-04 14:47:18', '2020-11-04 14:47:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005542023', 'Constance Trincali', NULL, '11.04.20:  Recvd. an email from Connie - wants to schedule a call to discuss Liberty conversion plan.  Scheduled call for 11.5.20 at 11:30 a.m.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-11-04 13:44:08', '2020-11-04 13:44:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391226', 'Pam Buderus', NULL, 'I am helping Pam with the registration process for Cirrus MD. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 13:43:54', '2020-11-04 13:43:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967156', 'Alexandria Wright', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-04 13:41:35', '2020-11-04 13:41:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356826', 'Jennifer Woomer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  The call went really well, I am working on getting some HCBB info to her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 13:35:14', '2020-11-04 13:35:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042007131', 'Kristin Smith', NULL, '11-4-20 Kristin is tired of Redirect since they''ve been difficult to work with each time. But, we priced out traditional insurance and even with an APTC of $154 her lowest cost plan is $630.13 Anthem. She realized she will stick with Redirect or move to CARE+. She''s employed as W2 by obgyn in Oakdale, MN. She also wanted to keep her MB doctor which she can do with Care+ or Redirect. Local Dr. is Astrid Lampey.  She has a cyst on her foot that she was just seen for and has an ortho appointment soon. Once she knows status of that she''ll make a decision likely for Jan. 1st effective date. Also in menopause but just taking estradiol and one other med that are cheap. No other expenses for that she said.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 13:29:11', '2020-11-04 13:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, 'Nelson called for help with a script coupon.  Emailed him all of the info and attached coupons in CRM. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 13:27:55', '2020-11-04 13:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-04 13:22:49', '2020-11-04 13:22:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, 'Previous HES Membership - 2/1/16-9/14/18', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-04 13:22:29', '2020-11-04 13:22:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967087', 'Busia Stern', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-04 13:15:54', '2020-11-04 13:15:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057908079', 'Caleb Cofsky', NULL, '11-4-20 We got Caleb''s tax credit to show and he''s going to talk with parents about the plans. I told him to make sure he sets up ongoing payment direct with carrier if he enrolls without my assistance. Choosing between Anthem and RMHC/UHC. Lives in Garfield County, 81623. Dr. Chad Knaus.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 12:47:24', '2020-11-04 21:39:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057908079', 'Caleb Cofsky', NULL, '11-4-20 Caleb chose to cancel membership already and is going without anything for Dec. He is expecting to only make about $18K in 2021 and can now get a $345 APTC and pay $50-$75 per month total with low to $0 ded. and low APTC. Lives in Garfield County 81623 and wants Dr. Chad Knaus. Jan. 1st start is goal now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 12:12:25', '2020-11-04 12:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058968003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, 'Sandy called in and wanted to know what was covered with her plan. I explained what is and what is not. Also went over the pre existing because her daughter has asthma. After December she will be covered up to $15k.  All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-04 12:12:08', '2020-11-04 12:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001006052', 'Lauren Costantini', NULL, '11-4-20 I wrote "I sent you the two lowest cost Bronze Plans. The I found a Bright Health Plan with $0 deductible! It''s actually only a few dollars more than Oscar''s plan and looks slightly better in many categories. The Bright Health $0 Ded wins my recommendation. I also sent you the lowest priced Bronze and Silver plans with Rocky Mountain Healthcare / United Healthcare and compared to review. Again, after looking at everything, I''d focus on the $0 deductible plans and probably choose Bright Health. Take a look and let me know your thoughts."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 11:48:46', '2020-11-04 11:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967035', 'Margaret Randolph', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-04 11:47:14', '2020-11-04 11:47:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758303', 'Stephanie Hart', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she had gotten other coverage that was going to start eff 1/1/21.  I advised her that I would send her link, however to hold off on submitting it until after 12/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-04 11:28:55', '2020-11-04 11:28:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, 'see ticket. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 11:20:04', '2020-11-04 11:20:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057908079', 'Caleb Cofsky', NULL, 'I received cancellation from member saying he found a better option.  I will cancel Zion &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-04 11:18:15', '2020-11-04 11:18:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737144', 'Catherine Rongey', NULL, 'Good Morning,

 

I was able to get the claim registered, it was sent out for pricing. I would allow up to 25 days for it to finish processing. ?

 

Thank you!

 

 

Kelly,

 

Get better soon! Thanks for all you do!!

 

Jennifer', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 11:12:58', '2020-11-04 11:12:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058319043', 'jordan batchelder', NULL, 'Jordan emailed info@ disgruntled because he said he didn''t receive anything....from anybody. I tried calling him, and left a message.  I emailed him back, I reminded him that he did receive a Welcome email from us, that he should make a Welcome  Call appointment.  I gave him info for both scenarios in regards to his daughters doctor appointment (Zion or Planstin).  I also told him that I would check with Zion/Planstin about his PDF cards. I offered that he call me back directly or make a welcome call appointment. -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 11:02:23', '2020-11-04 11:02:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058965023', 'Curtis Blaydes', NULL, '11-4-20 Enrolled him directly through Bright Health site since not candidate for subsidy and he didn''t have access to a computer. I was able to enroll him on my end. Price turned out to be $207.50 because he uses tobacco instead of $187.  He set up on auto pay from checking account. It forced me to select a payment date from 16th-20th. I chose Jan. 20, 2021 for his next payment date. First will be drafted immediately to effectuate policy. Chose cheapest Bronze Catastrophic Plan with Bright Health.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 10:53:16', '2020-11-04 10:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967156', 'Alexandria Wright', NULL, '11-4-20 Alexandria is 27 and healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Curtis Blaydes is her fiance but he''s a UFC - Professional Fighter! Makes $500K he said! He''s on insurance and we should NOT add him to her membership while he''s still fighting and uses tobacco. She and daughter are good candidates. She is self employed and chose $1000/$495 SECURE and wants wellness. Enrollment complete for Dec. 1st, 2020. They don''t have any insurance right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-04 10:49:51', '2020-11-04 10:49:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009579103', 'Steven Meusel', NULL, 'Louise is still emailing in upset about not being able to access HCBB- I appologized again, told her that we are working on it and offered to search whatever the family wanted on the site on their behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 10:40:18', '2020-11-04 10:40:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058962013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, '-Member called to find out how he would Open a Need with Zion regarding his sleep study.
-Member was given Zion''s number - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-04 10:23:15', '2020-11-04 10:23:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058962008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042221122', 'Sarah Wright', NULL, '-Member called to get clarification on plan and to see if there was anything they needed to do to renew. Member was told that no action was needed on their behalf if they were satisfied with the plan.  Member was advised of the $25 annual renewal fee.
-Vendor roles were clarified within the plans - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-04 10:01:55', '2020-11-04 10:01:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058962003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869315', 'Desiree Domo', NULL, '- Member called to say that she tried to get into CirrusMD
-A ticket was created from CirrusMD with Member''s permission to resolve issue.  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-04 09:59:09', '2020-11-04 09:59:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057777111', 'Amy Chase', NULL, 'completed prescription medication quote. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 09:50:41', '2020-11-04 09:50:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058959003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869315', 'Desiree Domo', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-04 09:26:11', '2020-11-04 09:26:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645223', 'Michaela Bielby', NULL, 'Michaela called because her last name was spelled wrong on her Zion card- it was also misspelled in our system.  I filled out a member change form on her behalf with revised spelling. Changed it in the CRM as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 09:19:40', '2020-11-04 09:19:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058950003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, 'reached out via script quote request for covid testing.  Sent template for how to get a discount on services through Zion, as well as links to free testing. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-11-04 09:18:17', '2020-11-04 09:18:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058947003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024892055', 'Elizabeth Neumann', NULL, 'Received Bettiegram from this member questioning the $25 renewal fee.  Charged correctly.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-04 08:54:53', '2020-11-04 08:54:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058965023', 'Curtis Blaydes', NULL, '11-3-20 Curtis 29 is a professional fighter for UFC! He''s NOT a good candidate for MCS. He makes $500K! No ins now but is looking at Bright Health cheapest Bronze plan for $187 for Jan 1st start date. He also uses tobacco. No meds and no health issues. He and Alexandria Wright plan to get married in a year and they have a daughter Harlie together. We will put Alexandria 27and Harlie 2 on MCS SECURE $1000/$495 for Dec. 1st start date. They do get their physicals done every year. Curtis gets his done multiple times a year due to his profession. Live in Denver County, in Lakewood, 80227.  Enrolling them tomorrow. Find out how to enroll in Bright Health directly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-03 16:50:22', '2020-11-04 10:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11-3-20 Called to figure out how to cancel LHS. Gave her instructions and she''s all set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-03 16:11:06', '2020-11-03 16:11:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11-3-20 Carolyn''s Financial Advisor told her Not to pay for any life insurance policies bc she''s already paying for LTC and he believes that''s sufficient. So, she''s scrapped the idea of any LB altogether. She doesn''t know how much it covers nor wants to share how much she''s paying for it. She''s chosen to enroll in SECURE now inspite of her Advisor steering her way from MCS bc he''s not familiar with them and prefers her to use ins. She''s going against his recommendation on this. $495/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-03 15:32:50', '2020-11-03 15:32:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '11-3-20 Kim has letter from Cigna stating $439.98 APTC and $398.65 for her cost for Cigna Bronze HSA. She hasn''t funded her HSA. She doesn''t know her income. We''ve put it around $56k per memory. BUT, she was super close to earning too much and needing to pay back $7K last year. She''s going to talk with her accountant and try to estimate her income for 2021 to help decide. We also discussed SECURE or CARE+ for $390 or $495 / $1000 IUA. I forgot to mentioned $125/$25 fees!  She will let me know when she has answers from accountant.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-03 15:11:39', '2020-11-03 15:11:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057908079', 'Caleb Cofsky', NULL, '11-3-20 Tried calling Caleb to find out why he''s cancelling already and his vm is full. I will email him next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-03 14:00:03', '2020-11-03 14:00:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058906061', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, 'Member Only $2000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-03 13:41:34', '2020-11-03 13:41:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967035', 'Margaret Randolph', NULL, '11-3-20  Margaret is 44 - 10/21/1976 and she''s a LHS member now for $399 month but also a member of Highlands Health and Wellness with Shelley Meyer DO. She pays $75 a month and gets her basic wellness visits she said, access to Dr. 24/7/365 and they do not bill to insurance but they do have reduced rate on labs, meds, etc. She knows she will need to show proof of membership. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco.  She''s joining DIRECT for $245/$1000. Enrolled for Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-03 13:39:16', '2020-11-03 13:39:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695393', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, 'Redirect Term: Tracking #10744752
Sent by Patti Baron on 11/3/2020.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-03 13:30:43', '2020-11-03 13:30:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058914023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929297', 'Lana Meell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-03 13:26:45', '2020-11-03 13:26:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695393', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Sedera &amp; Redirect &amp; cancel in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-03 13:25:06', '2020-11-03 13:25:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058919039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005542023', 'Constance Trincali', NULL, '11.03.20:  Emailed Connie to thank her for the referral of her friend Diane.  Also, reminded her I sent info. about our conversion plan from HES w/Liberty.  Asked if she is interested in discussing our conversion plan:  MPB Carez Connected Worksite, to let me know and I will schedule a call.  Recvd. an emai response from Connie.  Interested in looking at the Liberty conversion plan. Got my Sept. email but was too busy to read it.  Asked me to send it again. Sent it today.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-11-03 13:11:44', '2020-11-03 16:57:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058927003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002494019', 'Peter Fredriksson', NULL, '- Member called to ask what to do with his ER receipt that he paid for on Oct 24.  
-Member was given Zion''s number  -MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-11-03 13:01:50', '2020-11-03 13:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058914018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057887024', 'Roy Simmons', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-03 12:46:15', '2020-11-03 12:46:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058909013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356826', 'Jennifer Woomer', NULL, 'Jennifer called in and wanted to know how about going to her regular mammogram screening. I told her the steps and what she needs to do. Found her provider and facility in the network and told her to get in contact with Planstin to get her digital card. She was initially told by Jeff Kanter her affiliate that our concierge service calls and sets the appointment AND takes care of the payment. I explained to her that is not true at all legality reasons. She was a little upset but when I explained to her what she needs to do she was fine. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-03 12:00:15', '2020-11-03 12:00:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058914013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899452', 'Kristopher Hall', NULL, 'Welcome call with wife Sarah.  Already registered with CirrusMD. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-03 11:35:37', '2020-11-03 11:35:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058909008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057908079', 'Caleb Cofsky', NULL, 'Caleb called in and said that he would like to cancel. I sent him the cancellation link. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-03 10:55:28', '2020-11-03 10:55:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058923003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919182', 'Joshua Bowlin', NULL, 'I realized this member had declined for the last 3 mos, after 2 email trying to get pmt I will cancel with Sedera.  Also this member did not respond to any of the conversion emails did not make any decision.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-03 10:37:10', '2020-11-03 10:37:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058914008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177222', 'Amy Vasterling', NULL, '2nd Welcome call refresh. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-03 08:37:04', '2020-11-03 08:37:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058914003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645313', 'Peter Nesbitt', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-03 07:52:45', '2020-11-03 07:52:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058909003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082312', 'Kelly Panton', NULL, 'Kelly called in and thinks she broke her wrist and asked what to do and if she can go anywhere. I told her yes and that she presents herself as a cash pay and is responsible for the first $500 of her IUA. Anything more is when she needs to get in contact with Sedera and I gave Kelly their phone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-03 07:46:53', '2020-11-03 07:46:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058844031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11-2-20 Talked with Mara to determine best path. Possibly $1,499,000 Term 20 year and $500,000 IUL life long. Gives her almost $2M coverage and allows her to pass along $ to daughter tax free.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-02 18:17:05', '2020-11-02 18:17:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058883003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925046', 'Susan Korzon', NULL, 'Call with Susan. She is still being billed for Sedera plan and is very upset because she expected the plan to already be terminated.  She was notified that her Sedera Select plan was ending Aug. 31, which was then was pushed back 1 month to Sept. 30th. 
I helped her get other insurance for her family Effective OCT 1.  A cancellation form was NOT filled out because there was no notice that her plan was not ending afterall.   She is requesting a refund for OCT. and NOV or will file a suit to get the money back.
I''m having her fill out an official cancellation form so you have it on file, but this needs to be back dated.  The misinformation of cancellation date is a huge issue and needs to be rectified!!  - Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2020-11-02 17:47:27', '2020-11-02 17:47:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058881003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, '11.02.20:  Recvd. an email from Tim Hirsch/Zion. David Harper sent an email requesting his medical need be moved out of the "pre-existing conditions"  category, although his knee pain began three days before he converted from his Sedera plan to Zion on Aug. 1, 2020.  He had a consultation with his physician on Jul.29, 2020 when his physician recommended David get an MRI.  His complaint is since he didn''t get the MRI until August his condition shouldn''t be considered pre-existing. Tim asked that we refer this to David''s agent, Analisa, to explain how pre-existing conditions works within the Zion guidelines to her member.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-11-02 16:59:43', '2020-11-02 17:20:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058844023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11-2-20 Talked with Trevor and he mentioned it''s best to do 20 or 30 year term for Carolyn. She can''t do a 30 year term once she reaches age 55! He said 70% of people need LTC once reach 80''s. If she chooses $1,000,001  - $2M she will need Paramed. If chooses $2,000,001-$5M she will need paramed and they will get permission to review all doctor records and confidential financial records and e-inspection.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-02 16:12:38', '2020-11-02 16:13:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058844018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001106387', 'Kelly Parnigoni', NULL, '11-2-20 Ready to convert from LHS to MPB Carez Connected Worksite for Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-02 15:23:15', '2020-11-02 15:23:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058869013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057777111', 'Amy Chase', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-11-02 15:14:21', '2020-11-02 15:14:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058844013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11-2-20 Carolyn believes she was paid 1099 doing for for Census. She''s looking for 1099 or pay stub to provide proof. She wants SECURE with HSA $1000/$495 and understands she will pay 100% for any pre-x year one and knows the stepping stones and the pre-approval needed for any alternative care. Assuming she is 1099 she will call be to enroll in SECURE in a day or two. If not HSA, she will choose Bright Health HSA Bronze plan. She''s also looking at LSW Term 10 or more years for max $5M. But, has a LTC policy for about $100 a month she thinks and will find out what it covers and if worth keeping or not or if worth not doing LB options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-02 15:07:49', '2020-11-02 15:07:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058880003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286020', 'Anthony Carmola', NULL, 'Emily (member''s mother ) called in and wanted to know how to cancel this plan eff 1/1/2021.  I told her I would cancellation link , however not to submit until after 12/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-02 14:36:53', '2020-11-02 14:36:53'),
