  ('zcrm_1579374000058844003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893072', 'Elaine Roth', NULL, '11-2-20 Dr. Jefferson Roth is a chiropractor and alternative care is important to his family. Jefferson is on Medicare already. Wife is 59 and daughter in school and 20. They experimented with Christian Healthshare and weren''t that happy with it. They went back to Anthem for security. He''s friends with Julie Oldham and she shared her positive experience over the past 3 years.  So, he''s open to Care+. Julie is not working so they can''t get the MEC. He wants the MEC and doesn''t understand why they can''t have it after I explained twice. But, he''s still super interested in this membership for all of the other benefits. Both are healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no pre-x. Only recent issue was that daughter had kidney stones taken out in Jan. 2020. All is well ever since.  Looking at CARE+ for $1000/$390.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-11-02 09:59:11', '2020-11-02 09:59:11'),
