  ('zcrm_1579374000058831003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401191', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, 'Nathan called in and said he just changed his address on the website and I checked to see what address we had and it was wrong so I changed it in the CRM and will make sure his Welcome Package goes to the right place. He also said he needed direction on what to do for an Urgent Care he is going to today and I explained what he needs to do and sent him the submitting a Need to Zion template. All Set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-11-02 07:30:23', '2020-11-02 07:30:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058778019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862150', 'Judy Flanagan', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request citing the fact that she was rejected by Zion for Psychological needs.  She had gone to the hospital because she thought she was having a heart attack.  I sent the cancellation to Jane to reach out to the member to explain the EAP program for this member.  I will hold off until I hear from her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-11-02 07:28:48', '2020-11-02 07:28:48'),
