  ('zcrm_1579374000058782013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808040', 'Thomas DeAngelis', NULL, 'In processing this member I recognized the name and realized he was a former HES member. I reached out to Diane and asked about this member, She told me that she was 1st contacted by prospect on 10/8 looking for information after researching Zion.  Had subsequent meeting with him on 10/26 & 10/28 prior to he enrolling today on 10/30.  She asked prospect  if he had been working with any previous affiliates he mentioned Wendy''s name and was adamant that he no longer wanted to work with her.  I will process and change contact owner to the House account.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-30 12:53:38', '2020-10-30 12:53:38'),
