  ('zcrm_1579374000058778003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781113', 'Therese Higgins', NULL, '10-30-20 Therese is 60 and Individual member. Her husband died 3 years ago. She was on low dose blood pressure medication 4 months ago. No longer on meds. She believes it was due to her high stress job. She''s retired now. May work again but not sure. If so, she can add MEC. But, now she knows she has to pay for her annual wellness visits on her own. She''s actually a LHS member and has NEVER been reimbursed for any of her wellness visits yet. She knows how difficult they are and was thankful I knew how to cancel with them as well.  Also has water retention she takes a med for and isn''t concerned that it will cause any other issue. She actually has her health and life license which helps her understand all of this.  She says Judi Snyder speaks very highly of me and she''s so glad to have my help. She enrolled in CARE+ just now for $1000/$215 and All Set! Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-30 11:41:40', '2020-10-30 11:47:43'),
