  ('zcrm_1579374000058749013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058265123', 'Xiao Neng March', NULL, '10-30-20 Sounds like he reached Patti earlier and he''s pleased to hear he''s been refunded already. He verified when it will be billed in the future. He was thankful for the call back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-30 10:00:44', '2020-10-30 10:00:44'),
