  ('zcrm_1579374000058732018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, 'November pmt declined 1st notice sent - 10/28 2nd notice sent 10/30 3rd notice sent 11/3', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-30 09:15:14', '2020-11-03 12:07:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058735003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539007', 'Kris Srnka', NULL, 'Kris called in and it was about the most recent note below that Kelly C put in. She called Zion about the 3D Mammogram and who ever she spoke to at Zion was telling her the wrong info and saying no that is not something that is covered. The girl (she did not get her name) was confusing the heck out of her and even told Kris that she should call her agent Jane Kassel, which we both don''t know why she would say that and how she even knows that info. The way Kris explained how the girl at Zion was talking to her sounded like she was new and didn''t know the answers. So what the girl should have done was tell her she was not sure and would find out the correct answer and get back to her. I told her that I can''t really do anything on my end because that is 100% a Zion situation. Kris completely understood and said she knows and is not mad at us at all, she just wanted my suggestion on what to do now. I explained to her exactly what Kelly did about that a 3D Mammogram is NOT covered through Planstin as preventative, only a regular screening would be, but yes indeed a 3D Mammogram IS in fact covered through Zion. I told her to call back and ask for someone in upper management to get the right answer. She thanked me and is calling back now. I let her know to call me back if anything else goes wrong and we will see what we can do here. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-30 08:37:05', '2020-10-30 08:37:05'),
