  ('zcrm_1579374000058673103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052864149', 'Catherine Brown', NULL, 'i spoke with this member who was upset that after removing her daughter her price did not go down.  She told me that she spoke to "somebody who told her that her price would go down by $300".  I told her that since she still had her son on the plan she still would be a family.  She told me that if she had know she never would have took her daughter off the plan.  She advised that in the future we should ask members why they are making changes.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-29 13:41:05', '2020-10-29 13:41:05'),
