  ('zcrm_1579374000058673078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052864149', 'Catherine Brown', NULL, '10-29-20 Patti called me to share that Cathy was upset that her monthly payment didn''t decrease once she removed her daughter. Patti explained the price is the same for a family no matter the # of kids on the membership. Cathy didn''t like that answer and said it sounds like a scam. Patti explained further that that''s how it works. I just left a vm with Cathy to make sure she is all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-29 12:38:49', '2020-10-29 12:38:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058673073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427020', 'Doug Lewis', NULL, '10-29-20 Doug and Kelly are almost ready to move. They are paying $1000 a month still. Kelly is going to request her records to see what falls within the last 24 months. She has possible mild sleep apnea that they diagnosed in 2018 and not sure if anything beyond that. Also had some hormone therapy for perimenopause and also saw integrative medicine doctor March 2018-March 2019. She''s deciding if she wants to wait for Nov. 2021 to switch or do so now and deal with caps on pre-x. Doug has no pre-x. Just wants to check on stuff that runs in family to get baseline as preventative measure for items such as dimentia. No issues, just want his baseline and they know he would pay for that on own. Recommending SECURE $1000/$500 for both or $1000/$275 for just Doug. Want a Dec. 1st start date. Bug them if I don''t hear from them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-29 12:18:43', '2020-10-29 12:18:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058707008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331022', 'Scott Fliegelman', NULL, 'Scott had reached out to Wendy because he was confused about all of the different TPA''s - Wendy did a great job explaining everything to him but noted that he hadn''t had a welcome call yet.  I sent him a scheduler so he can gain a clearer understanding of his plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-29 12:06:54', '2020-10-29 12:06:54'),
