  ('zcrm_1579374000058634029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060808030', 'Mathieu Shields', NULL, '10-27-20 Mathieu is 34, wife 39 and two boys 6 and 3. Healthy, workout, run, etc. They are both self-employed now. Got Mathieu got laid off from start-up.  Their UHC is ending for $1300 month! It ends Oct. 31st. Told him to try to get Cobra for Nov. bc earliest start date is Dec. 1st.  Live in Longmont and pediatrician is Dr. Lauren Brave who they love and she''s in PHCS network.  Baby has RSV, respiratory issue but only as infant and no longer. Wife is taking meds for something he didn''t want to share. They do want dental and vision as well. Had Delta Dental for family and want VSP for adults. Sent them SECURE info for $1000/$685.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-27 15:41:31', '2020-10-27 15:53:28'),
