  ('zcrm_1579374000058634024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086450002', 'Andrew Bishop', NULL, '10-27-20 Andrew is working for Mirabelle Restaurant again as W2 employee. He has Type 1 Diabetes and I read him the limitations and exceptions from the Zion Guidelines. He''s buying his insulin from Canada for $47 a month vs $400+ in US! He''s allergic to penicillin. He has no ins now and is trying to decide if it''s worth gambling without insurance to save $2400+ a year and hope nothing goes wrong. He snowboards as well. I quoted CARE+ for $1000/$215 or $2000/$175. He will ponder. He knows deadline is Nov. 20th for Dec. 1st start date. He''ll review.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-27 14:52:14', '2020-10-27 14:52:14'),
