  ('zcrm_1579374000058645003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'Joanna called in and was just a mess. Her husband Jose has multiple procedures that he has scheduled for tomorrow 10/28/20 for quite a few issues he has going on. She called to figure out who she needs to talk to about payment for these procedures because the Mayo clinic that they have the appointments for have now stated that they HAVE to pay the total $18,000 up front before anything can be done. That was not was what was said to them in the past where they can just pay the $500 of their IUA and then be billed the rest and get it covered with Sedera. She is just confused and very frustrated with everything. I told her that all of this would be an issue with Sedera and not us unfortunately. She asked about John Kach and she thought he worked for Sedera and I said no he does not. She then asked who we were. I told her we are MPowering Benefits. She wrote that down as I told her. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and told her that is who she needs to contact about all of this. She was pretty upset about that. Before getting off the phone I told her I suggest for her and her husband when all of this is over and they have the time for another Welcome Call. She had no clue what that was but I explained it to her. I told her I would send her email with the Welcome Call scheduler. She sighed and said I would rather you don''t because I get too many emails and I am just so confused on who is who and I would rather just call in here when I need to. I said that is fine and to just go ahead and call Sedera asap. Very very very confused member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-27 14:28:42', '2020-10-27 14:28:42'),
