  ('zcrm_1579374000058592003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535099', 'Shirley Ospina', NULL, 'Assisted Shirley with enrolling (conversion) to Zion Health w/MEC, $2500 IUA.  I sent an email to Patti to verify it went through ok.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2020-10-26 17:48:51', '2020-10-26 17:48:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058588013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '10-26-20 Hasn''t received Welcome Email yet and wanted to know if it was best to do annual wellness visit on old ins or new. Suggested new just in case they uncover a new condition which would be considered pre-x. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-26 16:20:43', '2020-10-26 16:20:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058588008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '10-26 20 David called in asking what happens if Supreme Court overthrows ACA in 2021. I told him we are state run and I don''t believe it will affect CO at this time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-26 16:08:04', '2020-10-26 16:08:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058569003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'Quentin called and needed to replace his digital Planstin card and hard copies sent to him. I told him I would call Planstin  and have new digital cards sent out and hard copies mailed out. I called Planstin and they on the phone with me sent out PDF copies and sent a request for hard copies mailed to him. I had Planstin confirm his mailing address because Quentin let me know that his wife got some info over in Chicago. Planstin did in fact have the wrong address for the Chicago address. I had them change that to the current P.O. Box address that we have on file here. I called Quentin back to let him know the email was sent and hard copies are going to be mailed out shortly. Quentin also had a question about going to see a dermatologist. He asked if he can go anywhere and if everything goes towards  his "deductible". I told him yes he can go to whomever he chooses and corrected him and told him that he is responsible for the first $1000 of his IUA and anything after that is a Need with Zion. He understood and thanked me very much for getting the cards out asap. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-26 14:45:10', '2020-10-26 14:45:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058565003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, '-Spoke with member regarding CirrusMD Registration
-Unable to register
-Sent ticket to Cirrus MD on behalf of member with member''s permission - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-26 14:21:57', '2020-10-26 14:21:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058533023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679210', 'Jennifer Anderson', NULL, 'Jennifer called in and said she has yet to use her plan and needs to go get her first Mammogram. I explained what is included with her plan "Preventative" wise because she has DPC no MEC. I told her Mammogram, Colonoscopy, and child immunizations are covered under her plan. She can go anywhere of her choosing and pay for the Mammogram out of pocket and then submit the bill into Sedera and they will Reimburse her for it. I also suggested to her to have another Welcome Call to refresh her memory on her plan. She said that sounds great, so I sent her the Welcome Call scheduler email and How to Submit Bills to Sedera email''s. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-26 12:10:10', '2020-10-26 12:10:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058536023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630781', 'Sara Laurin', NULL, 'I asked Trisha to send this member out the 2 mos refund.   When they thought this was a fraudulent charge they cancelled CC.  The daughter gave me a name that I had never heard of as the person that enrolled  her, so clearly Jeff Edwards was not doing these enrollments.  I advised her that Mr Edwards had received commissions on this .', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-26 12:03:34', '2020-10-26 12:03:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058533013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078459001', 'Schaana Wetzelberger', NULL, 'Sent provider list for Urgent Care''s in her area per Patti''s request. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-26 11:40:29', '2020-10-26 11:40:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058536018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078459001', 'Schaana Wetzelberger', NULL, 'Member called in in response to Debbie''s call to her about registration for Cirrus MD.  She also asked about Flu shots.  I explained and am having Kelly send her out a list of Urgent cares in her area.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-26 11:35:10', '2020-10-26 11:35:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058536013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058535081', 'Amanda Bard', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-26 10:44:11', '2020-10-26 10:44:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058536008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809288', 'Therese McCarthy', NULL, 'Member Only $2000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-26 10:34:45', '2020-10-26 10:34:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058533008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822359', 'Heather Rose', NULL, 'Heather called in and said that her husband has mental health issues and is having trouble getting a prescription refilled because of the new plan they needed to switch over to from before. I was a little confused on what she was asking. I told her as of right now we don''t have mental health coverage BUT we are right now in the process of getting that type of counseling and what not on bored for the first of the year or sooner. For the meantime her husband is to present himself as a cash pay and is responsible for the first $1000 of their IUA. Anything after that is to go through Zion and start a need. She said that is not the issue. She said they used Teladoc before the conversion. I let her know that she does not have that anymore and it is called CirrusMD. I looked on her CRM here and they have a registration date of 9/25. She asked if there is a password for that  I said yes and that I will send her an email to get into it and if need be there is a forgot password button she can click and set up a new password. She thanked me and than lastly asked if she could just call the number on the prescription bottle and ask them to refill the medication. I said absolutely. That is all she needed and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-26 10:18:18', '2020-10-26 10:18:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058536003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058535020', 'Mindy Wolf', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-26 10:04:55', '2020-10-26 10:04:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058494013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054027098', 'David Sheldon', NULL, 'Dave has been emailing me and calling me in regards to his ER visit and billing.  also he wanted to know about how to obtain prescription pain medication.  I went through and have explained everything to him multiple times. He doesn''t seem to grasp the process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-23 14:34:57', '2020-10-23 14:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058494008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, 'sent healthgrades list of obgyn surgeons in the area to Tyler per request. (note I could not find anything under HCBB or Zion''s PHCS network) - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-23 14:19:46', '2020-10-23 14:19:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058494003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881023', 'Joanne Miale', NULL, 'Joanne called confused because the Zion site doesn''t show her specific plan and how the preventative care wait year is waived for her group of members.  She already had all of the links she needed from Zion to look for a mammogram facility and wellness screening. All set, un-confused. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-23 13:41:27', '2020-10-23 13:41:27'),
