  ('zcrm_1579374000058458003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '10-20-20 She also wants something to protect her in case of a catastrophic scenario per her financial advisor''s recommendation. I''m showing her LSW Term w/ LB. She has $4-$5M in assets, no debts and living off about $100K per year. Family health history, mom died of alzheimers, dad died of unknown causes (possibly poisoned). Carolyn''s health is great but has slightly elevated A1-C and not yet at pre-diabetic levels. But, she has sleep apnea since moved to CO which might be  a red flag with life insurance!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-22 15:35:25', '2020-10-22 15:35:25'),
