  ('zcrm_1579374000058450003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, '10-22-20 Tom called to understand what he needed to do to go get labs done. He actually spoke with a Rep at Zion who guided him and told him what to do and that he didn''t need pre-approval. The labs are not for wellness so doesn''t need to show card or go in network. He''s all set and comfortable.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-22 10:49:37', '2020-10-22 10:49:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058443041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462166', 'Tammie Smith', NULL, 'This member called in initially to ask why she received 4 different Welcome letters back in Aug.  I told her to disregard.  She also told me that she needs to go for her preventative (I will do a search for her) and needed to see an orthopedic for a hand issues she has been dealing  with.  I explained ho to present at both type of office visits.  I also explained how to start a need if need be.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-22 10:00:56', '2020-10-22 10:00:56'),
