  ('zcrm_1579374000058350043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-20 13:19:06', '2020-10-20 13:19:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058350038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, 'Member called in because she went to the Pharmacy to get colonoscopy prep and was told her plan was cancelled.  I contact RCI who told me that the Pharm Benefits Mgr had changed not whole plan.  I left a VM with member to explain.  She called back in and told me that she never received the new cards.  I sent her a temp card and will order new ones', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-20 13:18:26', '2020-10-20 13:18:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058371023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001106387', 'Kelly Parnigoni', NULL, '10-20-20 "We do plan to switch but am not going to do so until we receive about $700 in reimbursement that we are still waiting on.
Kelly"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-20 13:15:04', '2020-10-20 13:15:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058371018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165343', 'Renee Athay', NULL, '10-20-20 Renee is incredibly appreciative of my help with this. She has a block around health insurance and appreciates that I reach out and help her. She was even more happy that I saved her money with SECURE at $1000/$275. No pre-x. Last dr. visit was Dec 2018 for annual physical. Only old health issue was back in March of 2008 where she had benign ovarian tumors removed and total hysterectomy. Nothing since then. She''s lean, fit. She sold a piece of property so she has the ability to make this change in healthcare thinking it was going to cost more. Fortunately it''s less than LHS new $399 a month. She also takes bioidentical hormones and that''s the ONLY medication she''s ever taken ongoing. Living in Utah now and not sure where she''s going next. She may live abroad or come back to CO. It''s up in the air depending on outcome of pandemic. Completed enrollment for Nov. 1st start date and given instructions to cancel LHS. Did not recommend conversion option since no pre-x and cost is more, plus she wants all wellness visits since she''s neglected that for a while for fear that LHS wouldn''t pay.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-20 12:54:23', '2020-10-20 12:54:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058350033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547456', 'Joan Tekula', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I have cancelled Sedera &amp; billing &amp; RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-20 12:47:15', '2020-10-20 12:47:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058350028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001176011', 'Shannon Rahlves', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 30-49 Conn Wkst', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-20 12:15:25', '2020-10-20 12:15:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058374003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243659', 'Karen Meyer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Just waiting on New QR life code in the mail. CirrusMd registration complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-10-20 12:01:48', '2020-10-20 12:02:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058371013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165335', 'Glen Delman', NULL, '10-20-20 "Thanks Wendy,
I think we’ll stick with liberty for now. They owe us so much, and the money is starting to trickle in." Glen', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-20 11:20:31', '2020-10-20 11:20:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058371008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006958005', 'Kyla Fear', NULL, '10-19-20 "Hi, can you please take me off your list? I haven’t been with Liberty in years and have acquired new insurance long ago. Thanks!

Kyla Fear
Fearless Photography
720.935.2132"

I''m checking the box for opt-out on emails so I don''t keep contacting her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-20 11:17:32', '2020-10-20 11:17:32');
