  ('zcrm_1579374000058371003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001409001', 'Lynn Clark', NULL, '10-19-20 "Wendy, as I''ve mentioned a couple of times now, I''m now covered under my husband''s traditional employer insurance plan. Please remove me from your list. thanks, Lynn" 
I added her to the opt-out for emails so this doesn''t happen again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-20 11:15:20', '2020-10-20 11:15:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058362027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535099', 'Shirley Ospina', NULL, 'Shirley and I discussed making plan changes at this time is not in her best interest.  We will revisit her plan coverage next year into 2021.  No changes are authorized by Shirly at this time and she elects to stay with Sedera at the $500 IUA.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2020-10-20 10:33:10', '2020-10-20 10:33:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058369008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005455075', 'Linda Doremus', NULL, 'called because she hasn''t received her Zion card yet- I will contact Planstin and ask her that they send the PDF version out today and the hard copy as well.  Confirmed email and address.  Member says she is very happy with our services thus far. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-20 10:06:54', '2020-10-20 10:06:54'),
