  ('zcrm_1579374000058321016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '10-19-20 Shawna join SECURE and recently registered her biz with the State Dept of CO for proof of her biz self-employment. She chose $275/$1000. She''s in Lyons and in pre-evac area and is packing house and super stressed. She was happy to get this off her shoulders for Nov. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-19 14:55:57', '2020-10-19 14:55:57'),
