  ('zcrm_1579374000058320053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678097', 'Steve Gamelin', NULL, 'Per Kelly''s note below this member is cancelling after 2 mos on the plan.  I called and advised him to get the form inot me ASAP if he didn''t want to get charged.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-19 13:13:32', '2020-10-19 13:13:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058326013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678097', 'Steve Gamelin', NULL, 'left message with Betties for cancellation.  sent cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-19 13:04:47', '2020-10-19 13:04:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058320048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, 'Nicole called in and I did a search for a provider.  I was unable to find the provider but I was able to find Lone Tree Family Practice.  I told her to call provider an tell them she had PHCS Network and that she needed to see someone that took that.   I advised her of telling provider about aches &amp; pains and that she should make a 2nd appt or it might be Out of pocket.  Also told her about preventative coding.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-19 12:58:58', '2020-10-19 12:58:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058326008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471284', 'Michelle Caldwell', NULL, 'Michelle wanted to know if she could use Cirrus for thyroid medication, she also wanted a list of preventive care doctors in her area because her original doctor retired. sent 3 lists to choose from. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-19 12:58:41', '2020-10-19 12:58:41'),
