  ('zcrm_1579374000058320023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711271', 'Robert Weyrauch', NULL, 'Bob called in asking about Cards.  I spoke to Planstin and they to send him out a digital card and put him on the list for hard cards.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-19 10:38:00', '2020-10-19 10:38:00'),
