  ('zcrm_1579374000058320013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640011', 'Rich Piotrowski', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request. I will cancel Sedera &amp; Biling.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-19 10:07:25', '2020-10-19 10:07:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058320008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547361', 'Micah Goldbaum', NULL, 'Received 2nd from Kings Super Pharmacy Tech because member is giving them MPB Card and he had no billing info.  Asked if provider was in the PHCS network and he was clueless, so I''m guessing no.  I gave him RCI''s contact number to verify.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-19 10:06:48', '2020-10-19 10:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058320003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547361', 'Micah Goldbaum', NULL, 'Child Aron called in and was at the Kings Super Pharmacy and they were asking what the billing info was.  I asked member to ask if they where in the PHCS Network.  They were unsure.  I told them to submit to RCI and directed them to back of the card foe submission information.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-19 09:59:35', '2020-10-19 09:59:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058316004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356861', 'Peter Byram', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 825 
