  ('zcrm_1579374000058277018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904406', 'Clare Vass', NULL, 'Cirrus MD registration complete. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-16 16:16:08', '2020-10-16 16:16:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058282040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, '10-16-20 John needs to update his wife''s name in the records bc RCI doesn''t have it correct in their system and therefore, she''s been rejected at the doctor''s because her name isn''t showing up in the system. He corrected it with them once and it''s defaulted back to the wrong name again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-16 15:40:17', '2020-10-16 15:40:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058282035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, '10-16-20 John had a bunch of questions about membership. Called RCI asking for what''s included in benefits without understanding they only provide the wellness component. He now understands Sedera helps with big medical issues, he''s set with CirrusMD already and has used it. He now knows to call Concierge for all aspects of membership and to get meds priced out. Also he will call Team to gain help in pre-negotiating procedure to have cyst removed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-16 15:28:45', '2020-10-16 15:28:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058277013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000272', 'Katelyn Doty', NULL, 'missed welcome call, left a detailed message and sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-16 14:45:49', '2020-10-16 14:45:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058277008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, 'missed call from Scarrow, called back and left a message. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-16 14:24:05', '2020-10-16 14:24:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058281038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265152', 'Jared Volkers', NULL, 'spoke to member concerning registration of CirrusMS     DP', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-16 14:04:26', '2020-10-16 14:04:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058281033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056599058', 'Dakar Murry', NULL, 'left message concerning cirrusmd registration...DP', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-16 13:32:26', '2020-10-16 13:32:26'),
