  ('zcrm_1579374000058254053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058265123', 'Xiao Neng March', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-16 13:11:52', '2020-10-16 13:11:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058281023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539293', 'Matthew Hammerlund', NULL, 'Left message concerning CirrusMD registration..DP', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-16 13:07:02', '2020-10-16 13:07:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058254048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007369033', 'James Sorensen', NULL, 'Former Liberty member from 5/1/2017 to 2/1/2019', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-16 13:01:00', '2020-10-16 13:01:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058281018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044701054', 'Scott Malz', NULL, 'Left message concerning CirrusMD registration..DP', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-16 12:52:20', '2020-10-16 12:52:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058282016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '10-16-20 Tyler called bc wanted reassurance that pre-x is shared immediately in first year due to conversion from LHS. I confirmed that for him. His wife had brand new issue start on Sept. 28th and had to go to doctor. Found a cyst and they are now needing another opinion to determine if she needs surgery or not and if so, prefers to do it here in US, not in Nepal due to COVID dangers in hospitals now in Nepal. I encouraged him to open the Need to get the process started in case they want to delay the surgery so they don''t miss the 6 month time frame to submit the bills. He will do so and feels better after talking with me. They only have about $250-$300 in bills thus far from Oct. onward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-16 12:40:33', '2020-10-16 12:40:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058281013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228219', 'Phil Saalborn', NULL, 'Left message about cirrusmd registration..DP', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-16 12:27:09', '2020-10-16 12:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058281008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514133', 'Kelly Fleites', NULL, 'Member contacted to complete CirrusMD registration DP', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-16 12:17:01', '2020-10-16 12:17:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058254043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924293', 'Steven Ford', NULL, 'I spoke to this member in response to a Bettiegram asking if he had any preventative services.  I told him no.  He wanted to know if he could add that on.  I advised him that none of the Sedera options were available w/ a MEC and that he should be in contact with his advisor Kevin to discuss.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-16 12:03:18', '2020-10-16 12:03:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058282003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001006052', 'Lauren Costantini', NULL, '10-16-20 Lauren is 50. She had back fusion surgery just about 1 year ago. She also has some cardiac issues that she gets checked on. It shows PVC mitro valve regurgitation and atrial valve regurgitation and some other names I missed. But, they tell her it all looks fine for now. But, it feels too risky to expose her for with the pre-x clause. We are looking at traditional insurance instead. She was hoping to set income at Medicaid level but when told her threshold is about $16K she realized that''s probably not relevant. Then we put income at about $50K which is above subsidy level. If she can keep UHC for Dec. through company or Cobra she will try. Then we can start fresh with new plan for 2021 when the new rates come out. Scheduled for Nov. 4th at noon to review options.  Also, she will do a better job of estimating her income for 2021 by then. She had owned a consulting firm for many years, then worked for a company in which the job is ending Dec. 7th.  She also runs a Mtn Bike Tour Company which has been pretty dead during COVID. She can do winter tours with Fat Tire Biking but still may be slim for this year with pandemic.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-16 11:31:06', '2020-10-16 11:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058281003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924293', 'Steven Ford', NULL, '- Member called to find out if he had a MEC to cover the flu shot
-Member was informed we was not and stated that he received his shot at CVS last year so he would go there again.  -MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-16 11:15:52', '2020-10-16 11:15:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058254038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058265053', 'Mary Jo Wood', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-16 11:02:20', '2020-10-16 11:02:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058254033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630781', 'Sara Laurin', NULL, 'Member''s daughter Sara called asking what she was being charged the $50 for.  I explained and she told me that Liberty told her the usual story.  She is wanting all her money back as she says that her mother has no documentation about us.  Jeff Edwards is acting dumb about our price structure.  She is wanting all of the money back that her mother has paid.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-16 10:40:56', '2020-10-16 10:40:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058277003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, 'confirmed that his fulfillment letter was sent and suggested a time he should schedule his welcome call with us. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-16 10:29:13', '2020-10-16 10:29:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058254028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064015', 'Mary Jo Wood', NULL, 'Group canceling eff 11/1/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-16 09:46:56', '2020-10-16 09:46:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058267003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626180', 'Timothy Meisch', NULL, 'Cheryl the wife called in and said that she is just trying to help Tim her husband set up everything with us and just understand how this program works. She said they have had health sharing before and this plan just seems to be a little confusing. I pulled Tim up here and I said I see he has not had his Welcome Call and she said well that is the problem. I said yes that is very vital to have and that call will go over EVERYTHING about the plan and what to expect and the whole 9. She asked me to email her the link to set that up and I did. She at first when I confirmed the email said to take that one off because it is their office email and there is too much that comes into that and they might miss everything. So I took it off and put the one she wanted and while on the phone she said she has also been having issues with that email and not getting things. I sent it and she was not getting it, SO she said to just sent it again back to the original email. I put both emails here in the CRM and sent it again to the first email. She said she still was not getting it but got the other emails that were sent on Sept 22 from Kelly C. I told her sometimes our emails can fall in the spam or junk folder. She clicked that and found it, she laughed and said she will schedule the Welcome Call ASAP so they can get a better understanding of the plan. She was very sweet and we figured everything out. I told her the email that was sent on Sept 22nd from Kelly C was a letter outlining the plan and what  products and services come with it so to read through that as well. She will do so and they are excited to have the Welcome Call. All Set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-16 09:43:40', '2020-10-16 09:43:40'),
