  ('zcrm_1579374000058200077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841134', 'David Mason', NULL, 'Member called regarding labs were not covered for her annual.  Member was advised to call Quest to confirm that the bill was coded as preventative and to send the bill directly to RCI.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-15 14:58:30', '2020-10-15 14:58:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058200066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007369033', 'James Sorensen', NULL, '10-15-20 James is converting to MPB Carez Connected Worksite from LHS. No meds, no dr visits in 10 years, except got shingles 7-8 years ago and nothing since. He believes family member got some weird health issue from shingles vaccine and definitely not a believer of flu shots. Might move to Toronto for 9 of 12 months. He''s self-employed but not much work at the moment. Using dad''s address bc living in mtn cabin about 1 hr from FC. Choosing $317/$1000. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-15 14:55:58', '2020-10-15 15:03:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058200061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '10-15-20 Shawna set her business up with CO Dept of State officially. She is self employed and can choose the new Secure option with MEC for $275/$1000. She''s going to call me in a day or so to enroll. She''s feeling pinched financially bc of covid and her income is no hold since works in people''s homes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-15 14:32:01', '2020-10-15 14:32:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058206057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626277', 'Andrew Flack', NULL, 'Deirdra McHugh called and let me know that this member wanted to cancel after one month on the plan.  I sent out Cancellation form.  Deirdra email me and Charles was to respond', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-15 14:28:50', '2020-10-15 14:28:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058206052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630114', 'Elgin MacMillan', NULL, 'Elgin called me back today about the CirrusMD registration email I sent him and left the voicemail about. He said thank you so much and asked if Teladoc is what he uses. I explained not anymore it is now CirrusMD and to just open up that email and finish the process. He thanked me very much and was very happy that I did that for him. He also asked if this is the concierge number and I said yes so if he has any questions about his plan to always call into here first and we will answer them for him or guide him to the correct place. He was thrilled! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-15 14:04:34', '2020-10-15 14:04:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058200053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821781', 'Leeanne Whittaker', NULL, 'Called 303-772-8001 to remind her to complete CirrusMD registration.  This number is no longer associated with this member.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-15 14:04:14', '2020-10-15 14:04:14'),
