  ('zcrm_1579374000058206028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810668', 'Rosalie Chilcoat', NULL, 'Member called in and let me know that she has a supplemental Ins Policy that covers the first $5000 for Accidents.  Emme @ the providers office thought she was talking to that Ins Co.  She was very apologetic.  All straightened out now.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-15 12:04:16', '2020-10-15 12:04:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058200005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009743101', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '10-15-20 Maria just completed conversion app to switch to MPB Carez $294/$1000. She''s going to get one more PRP for her knee before Nov. 1st to include in her current Need with Sedera. Met AUA for knee this year. She''s going to upload all bills and supporting docs today for neck to make sure it''s all submitted before account gets locked. After this month, everything will be mostly just maintenance by seeing acupuncturist and chiro for knee and neck.  She knows she has to pay for first $1000 for those and must get alternative treatments pre-approved.  All set moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-15 11:13:37', '2020-10-15 11:13:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058156043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'Sent HCBB info for Dexa Scan, as well as her own HCBB login information so that she can get on the site and buy the procedure through MDNow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-15 11:11:05', '2020-10-15 11:11:05'),
