  ('zcrm_1579374000058206018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217126', 'Joseph Taylor', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request citing the fact that he had employer coverage and the fact that there were no "in-network" providers in his area.  He had Self Directed so he didn''t have to stay within the network.  Another affiliate not educating the member.  I will cancel him and cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-15 09:09:20', '2020-10-15 09:09:20'),
