  ('zcrm_1579374000058156033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055771107', 'Marcy Oppenheimer', NULL, 'Marcy called with loads of questions- firstly she wanted to know about Covid Testing- I offered to run a search for her but she said that she would just do it herself.  Then she had every question under the sun about her plan, I answered her questions, but told her that if she scheduled a welcome call she would understand everything and not have all of these questions.  Then I had to guide her to the email, and the link......she was quick to complain, but everything that I said was there....was there.  She is going to schedule a welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-15 07:44:37', '2020-10-15 07:44:37'),
