  ('zcrm_1579374000058183008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003914005', 'Kevin West', NULL, '10-14-20 Kevin and Sheila are still pondering their decision. They want to leave LHS but I told them it''s not in the best interest of Zion to join just for 2 months until they can join traditional insurance. We don''t know the new rates for traditional insurance yet. He knows he needs to decide by the 20th. They are just really concerned that Zion hasn''t been around long enough to sustain itself during a pandemic.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-14 11:58:03', '2020-10-14 11:58:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058156018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330254', 'Debra Rice', NULL, 'spoke to her for 20 minutes explaining her benefits. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-14 11:47:53', '2020-10-14 11:47:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058172038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141488', 'Evian Hanshaw', NULL, 'Evian called back and she didn''t want to talk about the CirrusMD email that I called and left a voicemail about. She asked about what Kelly Cheever helped her with last month about submitting bills to Sedera to start a need. She said she needs to have both of her knees replaced and she thought she needed to speak to a doctor that WE here at MPowering Benefits have. I told her  no that with something like that for surgery there is a 2ndMD process she needs to go through and that is all with Sedera. She said that''s fine and asked what she needs to do next after she just submitted her bills yesterday. I told her to call Sedera right away and they will set her up with a Needs Coordinator and they will be able to walk her through the process of what she needs to do next. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and she said she is calling them now. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-14 11:43:08', '2020-10-14 11:43:08'),
