  ('zcrm_1579374000058172028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046217265', 'Thomas Lammie', NULL, 'Email verification has been sent to Thomas''s email to finish the registration process for CirrusMD. I called him to let him know that I have started the 1st step for him and the email has been sent. So whenever he has a chance to open the email to finish the process. I told him a little bit about it and how it works with CirrusMD and he didn''t seem too interested but still thanked me for the info and the call to let him know. He said he doesn''t really go to doctors unless his arm is falling off for example. But at least he knows he has this product to use whenever need be and to finish the process to use CirrusMD. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-14 11:30:07', '2020-10-14 11:30:07'),
