  ('zcrm_1579374000058172018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522128', 'Keira Gannon', NULL, 'Email verification sent to Keira''s email to finish the registration process with CirrusMD. I called her to let her know I have done this and to go ahead when she has some free time and open the email and finish the process. She kinda knew about it so I briefly told her how it works and what she would need to do. She said that sounds great and thanked me very much for getting that email to her. She will open it up when she has a chance. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-14 11:09:25', '2020-10-14 11:09:25'),
