  ('zcrm_1579374000058183003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330254', 'Debra Rice', NULL, '10-14-20 Deb called bc she has a wellness visit from before she switched her membership to submit. She paid cash and didn''t realize she was supposed to show the card.  She also wants to get a colonoscopy soon and wants to make sure she does it properly. Finally she needs to update her banking account information. I told her to call MPB Concierge Team for help and answers to all of that. Plus she will need a medication in the future and will ask Concierge for pricing on that too. All set and super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-14 10:19:04', '2020-10-14 10:19:04'),
