  ('zcrm_1579374000058172003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034128172', 'Kim Delgado', NULL, 'Email verification sent to Kim''s email to finish the registration process with CirrusMD. I called her and she did answer the phone and I told her about CirrusMD and how it works because she said she never heard of it before. I told her about it and how she can use it and to check her email when she has a chance to finish that process with Cirrus. She was very happy to hear about this and was very thankful and will check her email and get everything started and registered!! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-14 09:56:36', '2020-10-14 09:56:36'),
