  ('zcrm_1579374000058162003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869315', 'Desiree Domo', NULL, 'Desi sent an email with questions and will follow up

1.	Would I get wellness + preventative on $215/mo for Care+? 

Yes, through Tivity Health and MSEAP.com but, there is no Preventative


2.	Is the $215 option you mentioned indeed Care+? I ask because you only mentioned CareZ in your email which is $234.

       Yes, MPB Care+  We’ve updated our website to reflect those changes.  https://mpb.health/products__trashed/mpb-care-plus/


3.	Can you send me in writing the different tiers? Or at least send the link that lays out what you''re offering? Are these prices guaranteed with no increase?

          https://mpb.health/solutions/  All the information is on website with different tiers and pricing.


4.	Do you offer HMA? If so, can you send info on that?

That is more a financial product and we are not offering it as of yet

5.	Am I in PHCS network with Care+ or CareZ?

If you do MPBHealth Secure then there is a PHCS with a MEC

6.	Will I still have up to 1 million coverage like I do now with Liberty? Do all options include this?

Yes, through the Connected Worksite


       7. Are you waiving the $125 enrollment fee? Is this different from the annual fee?

             We will waive the $100 but, the $25 is a one time yearly fee.


Desi,  If you have any further questions please reach out to me.  FYI, you would have until Oct 20th to be covered by us for November.', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-14 09:49:21', '2020-10-14 09:49:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058150013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904355', 'Linnea Peterson', NULL, '-Cirrus MD verification email was sent', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-14 09:46:27', '2020-10-14 09:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058156003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331105', 'Kathleen White', NULL, 'left a message with her trying to respond to the message that she left yesterday about needing a policy number at the doctor''s office. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-14 09:41:09', '2020-10-14 09:41:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058146018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', NULL, 'Email verification sent to Andrew''s email to finish the registration process for CirrusMD. I called him and left a voicemail to check his email and just finish that process when he has a chance and to call me back if he has any other questions. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-14 09:27:43', '2020-10-14 09:27:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058144008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002834005', 'Anthony Moreno', NULL, 'Anthony is not happy with Sedera''s processes and is claiming that they are giving him the "run-around"  I looked into this for Kaden James, who had opened a ticket about this and got correspondence from Hayli at Sedera who gave me the scoop.  It looks like they can help him out- but not totally.  And there''s the rub.  I suggested to Kaden that he asks Anthony to reach back out to Sedera so that they can come up with a compromise.  They are willing to help, and share, but not at 100% because where he is getting the surgery is not "fair price".  SEE TICKET. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-14 09:22:05', '2020-10-14 09:22:05'),
