  ('zcrm_1579374000058036054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330254', 'Debra Rice', NULL, '10-12-20 Left vm for Deb returning her call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-12 17:59:39', '2020-10-12 17:59:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058036049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605252', 'Marjorie Wolter', NULL, '10-12-20 I also talked with Stephen and told him I''d be happy to work with her since she won''t talk with him, reasons unknown to us all. She never talked with him regarding her challenges and frustrations but refused to do so. She was fortunately very nice to me and thankful for my help. I''ll help manage her moving forward. I won''t bother with the commissions.  Stephen was extremely grateful for my assistance with her!!!  Marjorie will have a new Welcome Call and we''ll schedule it to be with Vanessa.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-12 16:29:22', '2020-10-12 16:29:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058036044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605252', 'Marjorie Wolter', NULL, '10-12-20 Marjorie is thrilled to have a new option that is affordable. She''s very healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco and just wants to do her wellness visits with Dr. she''s waited for year to get into. I let her know the Dr. must code all aspects as wellness in order for there to be no cost to her. She super pleased to have her cost back down to only $275 per month with the $1000 IUA. She sounds knowledgeable and confident moving forward. She has a Nov. 1st start date and was the very 1st client I put through on the newest enrollment platform with the one price for all ages.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-12 16:25:00', '2020-10-12 16:25:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058036039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '10-12-20 Shawna called bc Sandra Haber told her she has a MEC and I never mentioned that to her. I didn''t talk about it bc Shawna said she''s unemployed at the moment. She''s normally self-employed but she''s not working now at all bc of covid. Once I explained the benefits of becoming self-employed, she will talk with her accountant to see how they can file taxes to show proof. She''s been running her income through her husband''s business she thinks. She''s not sure how they''ve done it recently. She will find out. I also told her we have a new membership that will be slightly cheaper but it wasn''t confirmed quite yet. She will surely tell Sandra who will want to switch.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-12 16:15:24', '2020-10-12 16:15:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953271', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331022', 'Scott Fliegelman', NULL, 'Scott called in and said that he needs to get some prescriptions filled and wanted to "Start with me". I told him that he has Redirect and his first point of contact is always going to be with them with anything medical. That is his plan providers. He did not have their phone number, of course(Redirect members never seem to know who Redirect is or have their info), he asked if he needs any sort of ID number or anything and I said no to just let them know who you are and they take it from there. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-12 14:00:20', '2020-10-12 14:00:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023222', 'Linda Hutchason Wolfe', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-12 13:56:28', '2020-10-12 13:56:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165373', 'Dieter Bruhn', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 50-64 Conn Wkst', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-12 13:50:22', '2020-10-12 13:50:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165373', 'Dieter Bruhn', NULL, 'Previous HES Membership 1/1/2015 -3/1/2017', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-12 13:49:46', '2020-10-12 13:49:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953266', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, 'called because he received a bill from Quest after his "preventative" labs, he was unclear as to why he got this bill.  This is from when he was with ASI- I told him to call ASI for more clarity on the subject, as well as told him to take a picture of his Quest bill and send it to claims@asibenefits.com - he was greatful for that information. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-12 13:36:04', '2020-10-12 13:36:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023159', 'Max Rebel', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-12 13:16:37', '2020-10-12 13:16:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953261', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816005', 'Christopher Coppage', NULL, 'Chris called in and said that he was at his annual wellness visit and needed his plan id number and "all that info". I asked him if he made sure #1 that the provider and facility was in the PHCS network and he said yes he called into here and we looked that up for him. I then asked if he had his Planstin card with him and he said uh I have my emergency card with me. I said no you HAVE to have your Planstin card with you when you go to ANY Preventative appt. He said yeah that is what they are looking for here. I told him that he physically HAS to have that card before making any appointments. I said he should NOT have made this appointment until he had his card. The only thing I suggested to him is to call Planstin an see if they can help him. Other than that there is nothing I can do to help him. He was told numerous times he has to have the card physically BEFORE making any appointments because he has to present that card upon arrival. He just sounded like he didn''t care and just wanted me to give him the info he needed. He just kept hesitating and saying uhhh uhhh yeah that''s what I need. Totally out of it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-12 13:11:08', '2020-10-12 13:11:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058023086', 'Lisa Schuster', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA 30-49 Conn Wkst', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-12 12:37:42', '2020-10-12 12:37:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058036034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003914005', 'Kevin West', NULL, '10-12-20 Hi Wendy,
Sheila and I talked it over and we don''t feel very comfortable with the "assumed" long-term financial stability of customer-funded 2-year-old company during a pandemic. We will reconsider Zion as we come out of this pandemic. Are we allowed to switch only during the yearly election period?

Please double check to see if Anthem is our most cost-effective choice. Sheila has no pre-existing conditions but is being treated for anxiety and insomnia, which is a direct result from Covid-19.
Sheila is 63 years and receiving monthly social security and if it can factor-in, I am also receiving social security. We are supplementing our income from social security by withdrawing from our IRA monthly. Will the insurance discounts use our Adjusted Gross Income OR our Taxable Income (they are very different totals)
I am still planning to speak to you at 11:00 on Thursday 11/15

Take Care,
Kevin West
Florissant, Teller County, CO
719-367-3503', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-12 12:29:44', '2020-10-12 12:29:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058036029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '10-12-20 Left vm for Fox to help her now. Sounds like she might have some pre-x or open needs. She wants to stay with membership if possible. I''ll find out details when we talk.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-12 12:27:50', '2020-10-12 12:27:50'),
