  ('zcrm_1579374000057953256', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'Melissa and David''s old QR Life Codes:H0BP1, and H0LXG. Assigning new ones and sending out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-12 12:19:33', '2020-10-12 12:19:33'),
