  ('zcrm_1579374000058036024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, '10-12-20 UPDATE- Spoke with Jennah and she''s not a tobacco user. Records must be wrong. We need to find out where that information is coming from and get it fixed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-12 12:10:31', '2020-10-12 12:10:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953246', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004876090', 'Cynthia Milling', NULL, 'I see a cancellation request email was sent to Cynthia. Just making note of it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-12 12:04:22', '2020-10-12 12:04:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953241', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610322', 'Patricia Whitmer', NULL, 'slightly anxious due to the fact that she received a welcome letter and she already had a welcome call, I explained why it was sent and reassured her that everything was in it''s place. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-12 11:59:40', '2020-10-12 11:59:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953236', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068349', 'Robin Roman', NULL, 'called in to make sure she was cancelled- she was still receiving emails. I confirmed that she was. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-12 11:57:54', '2020-10-12 11:57:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953231', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, 'she called to make sure she was setting up everything for her colonoscopy correctly.  I told her that she shouldn''t have to pay anything out of pocket if she goes in network and presents her RCI card. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-12 11:57:19', '2020-10-12 11:57:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058036016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '10-12-20 Carolyn is ready to leave LHS but price will go up if moves to our MPB Carez Connected Worksite b/c her daughter in also on the membership. $1000/$583 and she''s paying $499 with LHS. She has mold intoxication and she''s a functional medicine dr. who charges $300 for 30 min. She will need pre-approval for that and immediate sharing. If we wait for her annual renewal Feb. 1st she will miss the window for including pre-x but might get more costs shared with LHS over the next 3 months, if they follow through with their promises to share. Carolyn is also taking 3 meds and paying for those on own. She needs Saxenda 6 mg/1ml subcutaneous injection pen. Pays about $100 and thinks it lasts her 20 days but then wasn''t certain, could be 10 days. It''s definitely expensive on GoodRX! Pays for compounded hormone meds for $75 and mixes it herself. Also takes tirosint 50mg 1x daily, liothyronine 5 mg 4 tablets, 2-3x daily. Once price these out, it will help us determine if it''s better to move or stay put with LHS through Feb. 1st. Also see Dr. Helen Rho who shows in PHCS network for wellness. She has 172 bills some of which are duplicates. But, she may be best served by LHS at this point since she has pre-x and they are sharing in the cost above AUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-12 11:44:27', '2020-10-12 12:01:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953226', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, 'Terese called in and said that she has not gotten anything yet card wise or anything else and her son is sick. I asked her if she has gotten any emails with a digital copy for a Planstin or Zion card and she went to her emails and said the only thing she has gotten was the invitation for CirrusMD. I asked her if her husband has registered yet cuz he is the primary and she said she did for him the other day. I went to CirrusMD while on the phone with her and went through the registration process with her husbands info and that did not work. I used her info and that did work and the next screen said she had 2 steps left to complete the process and needed an email to verify identity. She did the whole process I just did and got to that screen as well. I told her to just complete the steps and she can add her children on as well and then they are ready to use the program. I let her know if she comes into any other technical issues she needs to contact CirrusMD because I can not help past the registration part. I gave her Cirrus''s phone number and told her in the bottom right hand corner there is a chat that she can use as well for support and they will get right back to her. Before all this when she told me her son was sick and that they haven''t gotten any cards I told her the process for her sons situation being injury/illness and presenting herself as a cash pay and paying up to the IUA of $5000 they chose. I also told her I would contact Planstin/Zion and ask them to send her their digital cards and request for hard copies as well. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-12 11:00:22', '2020-10-12 11:00:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610322', 'Patricia Whitmer', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that the amount on her invoice was wrong.  I looked into this and per Tricia this was true.  I had her update her invoice and resend the her.  In the future they will be right.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-12 10:46:50', '2020-10-12 10:46:50'),
