  ('zcrm_1579374000058036011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, '10-12-20 Tim Hirsch sent Patti message saying Jennah''s medical records are showing that she''s an everyday smoker. I don''t believe this to be true. But, I just left her a vm to call me right away to clarify.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-12 10:34:32', '2020-10-12 10:34:32'),
