  ('zcrm_1579374000057953211', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762183', 'Stephen Berry', NULL, 'Evie the wife called in and said they needed to cancel. She did not give a reason but was very sweet. I told her I will send the cancellation form via email and to just get that in before the 20th of the month because that is when we bill for the next months coverage. She said that is fine and will work on the form today. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-12 07:58:03', '2020-10-12 07:58:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953206', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002494019', 'Peter Fredriksson', NULL, 'I sent Peter information regarding top Dentist''s in his area and HCBB price graphs of what to expect.  I also added that we will be offering Planstin''s dental plan in a few months time, and to get with Paul about the very latest on that. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-12 07:24:27', '2020-10-12 07:24:27'),
