  ('zcrm_1579374000057953198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002494019', 'Peter Fredriksson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Really nice guy and excited for the plan! He set up his Cirrus account on the phone with me.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-09 14:43:45', '2020-10-09 14:44:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058008078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058017335', 'Daniel Basch', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $5000 IUA 30-49 CareZ Wkst', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-09 14:18:11', '2020-10-09 14:18:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, 'Elena called back into the office upset because her doctors office wouldn''t tell her if the coding on the LDL test was preventative or diagnostic because she didn''t want to have to pay for it. Michele and I told her that we wouldn''t know what her doctor coded it - that it is either diagnotic or preventative.  This information wasn''t good enough for her.  And there for- we didn''t help her.  I explained to Jan, that we would''ve LOVED helping her with fair prices from HCBB and sites like directlabs.com, if she would''ve called us ahead of time, told us that this would be diagnostic (which we highly suspect that it is - see notes from March 2019 Heart Scan) , or not even diagnostic- as a self pay we would''ve been able to give her the tools that she needed.  And she would''ve had the peace of mind to know that she had exactly what she needed.  Jan was unaware about the heart scan- it never even came up during the conversion.  Jan is going to share the directlabs template with Elena, as well as tell her what the fair price was listed at on HCBB $18.  Jan is going to speak to her about reaching out to us before she has these services done, and giving us more exact questions to answer so we all don''t get frustrated in the process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-09 13:44:04', '2020-10-09 13:44:04'),
