  ('zcrm_1579374000057953178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919765', 'Benjamin Jackson', NULL, 'replied to her email explaining why she cannot access the portal yet, and to just reach out to us if she has any questions or needs to update their account. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-09 09:22:51', '2020-10-09 09:22:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058008008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521350', 'Shane Michael Sorensen', NULL, 'Spoke to member about the 3 pmts that he owed up he is ok with me taking those payment now. I will reset his pmt date to 10/20 to get him back on track.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-09 09:20:57', '2020-10-09 09:20:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842532', 'Todd Bremner', NULL, 'let Todd know that he needs to speak to Redirect for his flu shot and gave him their phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-09 09:16:28', '2020-10-09 09:16:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000058008003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'Member called in letting me know that the payment had not been drafted and he wanted to check on it. I realized that he had not been billed for Sept &amp; Oct. I charged him and set billing date for 10/20.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-09 08:43:14', '2020-10-09 08:43:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057984018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056599123', 'Elizabeth Baker', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-10-09 07:52:26', '2020-10-09 07:52:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '10-8-20 Mitchell expects to need a Dec. 1st change date to split up family after divorce. He had a muscle tear around his diaphragm within the past year. He needs to get it checked again. He met his $500 IUA with it already. He doesn''t think anyone else in the family has any pre-x. I recommended he stays put with Sedera for now until that is resolved. The rest of the family could join MPB Secure with Zion or MPB Care+ with Zion to gain best option at this point since we can''t remove family and re-enroll in the PSDHC at this point. Sent him the price break down for him to provide to his lawyer to gain baseline for cost of membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-08 17:19:32', '2020-10-08 17:19:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605252', 'Marjorie Wolter', NULL, '10-8-20 Marjorie called me back and we spoke. She was calm and ready to get her questions answered.  She''s made it clear she does not want to work with Stephen Cox moving forward. She said she hadn''t spoken with him since she enrolled 1 1/2 years ago. But, she felt neglected that he never communicated with her since and also exposed since he reached out to her now that there was a problem. She felt like it should be her choice to reach out to him, not the other way around. I told her it was the normal chain of command. I also told her I''d get back with her about who to speak with moving forward. I''m going to make sure she is sent a new RCI/PHCS/Apex card and coached her the PHCS network is the only aspect that her Dr. will be familiar with and needs to know.  I coached her on what''s included in wellness and what is not. I also let her know that same card is what she can give to her accountant and also let them know it''s a MEC and has a high deductible attached to it to be compliant to fund the HSA. Dr. Glenda Weeman shows to be in the PHCS network as well. Her cost just jumped from $300+ to $600+ which also angers her, no surprise. She wasn''t given a chance to make any changes since notified just before billing. She is confident now and likes the concept of the membership. She just doesn''t use it ever and forgot how it all works and still wants another Welcome Call with Kelly once she receives her new card. All is well with her now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-08 16:49:37', '2020-10-08 16:49:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003914005', 'Kevin West', NULL, '10-8-20 Spoke with Kevin and Sheila. Sheila is concerned about Zion being a new company. Kevin is less interested in traditional insurance.  They think they are paying $475 a month for LHS but the $75 was their annual renewal fee. They should be paying $399 a month. Their income is around $62,500 for 2020. They would get a $359 APTC or so. But, they don''t have a life changing event now and prices will change for 2021. It gave them a baseline at least. We are talking again next week after they''ve had time to research Zion and the entire option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-08 16:09:12', '2020-10-08 16:09:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'David called in with a bunch of complaints about the conversion, he wanted to speak with John about it all.  But I answered all of his questions for him,  sent him a welcome call scheduler, preventative care info, and link to Zion''s website to upload some needs. He was grateful for my help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-08 14:56:40', '2020-10-08 14:56:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257237', 'Ken Bechtel', NULL, 'see ticket. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-08 14:54:50', '2020-10-08 14:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779348', 'Mary Beth Bruner', NULL, 'she wanted to reschedule her welcome call, so I did that for her and re-scheduled for her as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-08 14:29:39', '2020-10-08 14:29:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809171', 'Joseph Ayers', NULL, 'member was upset that she never got anything from Zion- Patti and I fixed that situation with Zion (the members were never in the system) she has received a PDF Zion card as well as has a hard copy coming to her in the mail.  I fixed her email situation as well as the other email on file kept bouncing our emails.  She''s a happy camper! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-08 13:37:05', '2020-10-08 13:37:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057988048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056506057', 'Patricia Grimsley', NULL, 'Emailed', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-08 13:35:26', '2020-10-08 13:35:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057988043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056506096', 'Don Nicol', NULL, 'LVM', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-08 13:34:55', '2020-10-08 13:34:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057988038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056908027', 'Shannon Lawrence', NULL, 'LVM', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-08 13:32:58', '2020-10-08 13:32:58'),
