  ('zcrm_1579374000057962238', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006799147', 'Celeste Prince', NULL, 'Per Rod I am to refund this member 2 months (what I originally offered her).  Wendy to follow up with Connie Bosserman former affiliate on status of this member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-08 13:12:22', '2020-10-08 13:12:22'),
