  ('zcrm_1579374000057962198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322508', 'Kirk Marshall', NULL, 'member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-08 12:33:27', '2020-10-08 12:33:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419199', 'Jane Rosenberg', NULL, 'Jane called in and said that she is very interested in a certain provider that she found on the PHCS Network but she wants all this integrative medicine and she already knows Sedera does not cover this type of stuff and is very upset that we and Sedera does not cover that type of stuff. She asked if we have any other plans that do cover that and what not. I said we do have Zion which is another Medical Cost Sharing organization but she needs to get with Wiley Long her affiliate to discus other plans, which is what she wants to do. She asked if I could send her Zion''s guidelines and I said no she needs to speak with Wiley about this. She will do so. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-08 12:29:01', '2020-10-08 12:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, 'Katie called in again and unfortunately the Boulder Community Hospital that I looked up in the network for her does not do flu shots. I asked for her regular doctor that she goes to and she was NOT in the network and she let me know she was just a woman''s doctor anyway and they wouldn''t do flu shots. I asked Kelly C for some help and she suggested to send her a list of urgent cares in her area and she can go to one of them. I told Katie I will send her a list of urgent cares in her area and they will do flu shots there and to bring her Planstin card that was just sent to her digitally. She has it printed out and everything. I hope she will be all set after this. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-08 12:06:04', '2020-10-08 12:06:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005454035', 'William Valentine', NULL, '10-8-20 Updated Enrolled for 2020 with Friday Health and has been for 3-4 years.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-08 12:05:56', '2020-10-08 12:05:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '10-8-20 From Dania - "Christian will need to enroll as a new member.  We will grandfather his existing Needs case, 00010535, but any services he received between 7/31 and whenever he enrolls as a new member will not be shareable."

"Christian is set to re-enroll. When he goes to member.sedera.com and enters his phone number it will ask him to create a passcode and go from there. His effective date will be 11/1."

Hi Dania and Team,

Christian Figge has completed his re-enrollment with Sedera Access Plus via the member portal. He''s set for a Nov. 1st new effective date. Please let me know if there''s anything else we need to do on our end.

Thanks,

Wendy', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-08 11:58:36', '2020-10-08 11:59:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057953034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, 'Welcome call on the fly complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-08 11:46:54', '2020-10-08 11:46:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057990008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, 'Diane called in and said that she was trying to log into her portal and was not able to . I let her know that the portal is being worked on right now and asked what she is trying to do. She said she is just trying to look over her health plan because it is getting close to the end of the year and about renewing. I told her with this type of health plan there is no renewing the plan just rolls over but I suggest she get in contact with Ron her affiliate to go over her plan and anything else she needs. She said she tried calling him first and his number was invalid. Patti said he got rid of a lot of his phone numbers and had the correct contact info to give her. Put her back to Patti and she gave Diane his updated contact info. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-08 11:42:03', '2020-10-08 11:42:03'),
