  ('zcrm_1579374000057962028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049974139', 'Jennifer Lucas', NULL, 'Kelly contacted me because she got another call from this member saying that per Jan''s direction she had submitted her bill for her Pap Smear to Sedera and was upset that no one had contacted her.  I contacted Jan and she denied telling her to submit to Sedera.  We spoke about switching her to Zion however member is unemployed at this time and would not be able to qualify for Worksite plan.  Jan to be back in touch with her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-08 10:33:47', '2020-10-08 10:33:47'),
