  ('zcrm_1579374000057867043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, 'Katie called in and asked what she needs to do to get her flu shot. I told her she needs to go to somewhere in the PHCS Network for it to be covered and she gave me the Boulder Community Hospital and I looked that up and they are in the network. I asked if she had her Planstin card or anything and she did not, so I told her I will call Planstin and have a digital card sent to her because she will need that for it to be covered. I called Planstin and Jenna I believe her name was said that she knew there was an issue with the file being uploaded and she said she is logging off her computer right now and going to talk to Layton who is the operations manager head and will get it fixed right this second and Katie will have a digital card sent to her right away!!! Amazing that Planstin is literally taking care of it themselves right away. She said normally they give people 24 hrs but is doing it right now for us! I am so happy and will call Katie back shortly to give it a little bit and let her know to look put for her digital Planstin card via email and they will also send hard copies out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-06 12:24:13', '2020-10-06 12:24:13'),
