  ('zcrm_1579374000057861021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752018', 'Kim Rust', NULL, 'Kim called me back and told me that it was ok for me to take the 2 pmts that she owed us so I will do that. Advised her of the 20th billing date.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-06 10:29:56', '2020-10-06 10:29:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057861016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605252', 'Marjorie Wolter', NULL, '10-6-20 I called Stephen and told him of the challenges with Marjorie and accusation that her "Rep" wasn''t helping her. Stephen never received any calls from her, so he had no way to know she needed help. I forwarded all of the emails that Kelly sent to Marjorie so he''s familiar with all of the communication. He will reach out to her right away to find out what she needs and how he can help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-06 10:24:37', '2020-10-06 10:24:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057861008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, 'Spoke with member and she said that she could not speak with me I left my contact number.  I advised her that her Sept &amp; October pmt had declined.  She said that she will be contacting Jan and will get back to me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-06 10:18:22', '2020-10-06 10:18:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057867003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046514182', 'Jordan Kirkwood', NULL, 'Changed Jordan''s address on file here because he lives with Rochelle Kirkwood his mother and she just recently last month changed her address but forgot to mention changing Jordan''s.  I will let Patti know to let all other systems know. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-06 09:55:19', '2020-10-06 09:55:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057865003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830079', 'Jose Hernandez', NULL, 'just calling to make sure he is doing everything right in getting a screening colonoscopy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-06 09:48:08', '2020-10-06 09:48:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057861003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'Spoke to this member and thru Wendy this member was able to get the lower rate (she is 58, spouse is 60) per Sedera. So is ok with me charging the 3 pmts she owes to get her caught up. I will do that now.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-06 09:44:39', '2020-10-06 09:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057844035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659573', 'Robin Bernhard', NULL, 'In looking over this members account her September pmt declined.  I contacted her and left a VM letting her know that she owes us 2 pmts of $612 (total of $1224) and that she needs to be in contact with me to make payment arrangements.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-06 08:58:42', '2020-10-06 08:58:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057844030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752018', 'Kim Rust', NULL, 'I have determined that this member owes us for September &amp; October (2 pmts of $284) for a total of $586.  I have left a VM for the member to make payment arrangements.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-06 08:41:32', '2020-10-06 08:41:32'),
