  ('zcrm_1579374000057729046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-10-06 07:47:58', '2020-10-06 07:47:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057827013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935075', 'Fabiola Gomes', NULL, 'Called in and asked for her 1095-B form for her taxes that she is doing for 2019(obviously). We are leaving now and Patti''s comp is already off and she said to take her info and Patti will send it to her tomorrow morning when she gets in. I let Fabiola know that she actually does not need that anymore because they took the mandate away and all she needs to do is check off that yes she had coverage for the year if anything. She asked how long she had this plan and I said exactly 1 year, her start date was March 1st 2018 and she was cancelled effective March 1st 2019. I told her that IRS actually asks people to not file that form, again because it is not mandated anymore. She was so so so happy to hear that but I said Patti will still send it to her tomorrow morning for her records. She was happy to hear that and thanked me very much. All Set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-05 14:47:21', '2020-10-05 14:47:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057804033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605252', 'Marjorie Wolter', NULL, 'emailed Marjorie to let her know that she needs to call RCI and ask THEM to verify benefits with the doctors office that is hard to get into.  and ask THEM for accreditation documents for her CPA. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-05 14:38:44', '2020-10-05 14:38:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057804028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'called into make sure she was registered with Cirrus.  I showed her that she is all set. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-05 14:36:43', '2020-10-05 14:36:43'),
