  ('zcrm_1579374000057735039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700071', 'Glenn Eddins', NULL, 'Member called in asking what his policy # was.  I asked him why he needed this, he told me that he injured his knee and need to see someone.  I went thru what he needed to do and told him to present as self pay.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-05 10:03:24', '2020-10-05 10:03:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057827003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700071', 'Glenn Eddins', NULL, 'Glenn called in and he asked for his policy number. There is no "policy number" for these types of plans. Asked him what is going on and he said he injured his knee. Told him the process with injury/illness. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-05 10:02:16', '2020-10-05 10:02:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057735034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006799147', 'Celeste Prince', NULL, 'Member called in saying that she has been trying to call into cancel her plan for 6 months.  She alluded to Liberty Health coaching product and having to be in the plan for 2 years .  I told her that she was getting  confused with the programs.  She wants $350 back for her She says that she called into the Concierge and never spoke to anyone.  Last contact with her on 1/23 to change her CC.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-05 09:20:43', '2020-10-05 09:20:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057804008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659919', 'Rachel Denning', NULL, 'Rachel called in for some tech support with Cirrus for her husband.  I walked her through all of the steps, and told her to please reach back out to us if they had any issues. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-05 08:16:33', '2020-10-05 08:16:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057805008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126041', 'Steven Strehlow', NULL, 'Member emailed Kelly C about billing and being charged twice in the month of Sept.   I sent an email explanation going over when &amp; for what she was billed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-05 07:27:37', '2020-10-05 07:27:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057805003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342112', 'Ana Maria Bravo', NULL, 'Received a call from a provider wanting to verify benefits for a mammogram.  I saw that this member had Redirect so I asked if this had been scheduled thru them.  Member was unsure said that she received text that she should go to this provider.  I directed them to Redirect, gave them their contact number.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-05 07:12:17', '2020-10-05 07:12:17'),
