  ('zcrm_1579374000057783028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'called Heather because she scheduled a welcome call- she didn''t know if she needed to schedule another one due to the welcome email that was just sent.  I answered her questions about Cirrus and her son traveling internationally. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-02 13:03:03', '2020-10-02 13:03:03'),
