  ('zcrm_1579374000057762057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057777061', 'Zachariah Giffin', NULL, '10-2-20 Old notes are all under Alexandra LeGrant who was formerly HES/LHS client and converted to MPB Carez Connected Wkst.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-02 11:35:03', '2020-10-02 11:35:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057762046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033509132', 'Brandi Webber', NULL, '10-2-20 MPB Carez Worksite w/ MEC $1000/$269 to fund HSA. Previous member as PSDHC but got a job that she didn''t love. So, just quit job and chose to go back to school recently and is doing some 1099 contract work while in school. SUPER nice!!!!  Enrolled for Nov. 1st, 2020. Also excited about the virtual healthcare now as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-02 11:23:07', '2020-10-02 11:26:24'),
