  ('zcrm_1579374000057762028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054027098', 'David Sheldon', NULL, 'After speaking with David on 9/29 and informing him that he owed for 2 mos (9 &amp; 10/20) he asked me to call him the next day 9/30 at a certain time.  Tried then &amp; the next day and received no response.  Will have to cancel him.  Called him to let him know, left VM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-02 10:09:21', '2020-10-02 10:30:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057729026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Member already had a welcome call with Kelly C in July. She was on schedule today again so left a detailed message and sent email if she needs another call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-10-02 09:50:34', '2020-10-02 09:50:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057762023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015735109', 'Steve Moeller', NULL, 'Steve called in and told me that he was going on Medicare effective 10/1 and wanted to come off the plan and wanted spouse to remain on the plan.  I told him that with hima as the primary the whole plan cancels and that spouse would have to re-enroll.  Amy called in and I explained this to her.  I will send out cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-02 09:36:30', '2020-10-02 09:36:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057729021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled her conversion call for Thursday, November 5, 2020 at 9:00 a.m. mountain time/ 11:00 a.m. est. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-10-02 09:26:18', '2020-10-02 09:26:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057763003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547456', 'Joan Tekula', NULL, 'Joan called in.  She has had irregular heart beat as a pre-ex.  Member since 6/19.  Has symptoms, going in for Holter Monitor and bloodwork.  Might be cardiac issue.  told her sharing would be limited to 15K (think it''s 25 with Sedera) told her to pay a down payment of 100 and they will bill her.  I will assist with opening a need.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-10-02 09:13:20', '2020-10-02 09:13:20'),
