  ('zcrm_1579374000057762003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283004', 'Phyllis McCarthy', NULL, 'I received Bettiegram that this member will be aging into Medicare 11/1/2020.  I have sent Cancellation Link and will call to let member know to fill it out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-02 07:49:18', '2020-10-02 07:49:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054986001', 'Ken Trombley', NULL, '10-1-20 Got the run around with Bright Health to get his account activated and possibly moved to Oct. 1st start date since he spent many hours trying to get access to his coverage without avail. Super frustrated but seems to have gotten it worked out on his own. He''s very verbose.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-01 15:03:36', '2020-10-01 15:03:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057735029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038161', 'Karee Watson', NULL, 'Karee called in and had a bunch of questions. She wanted to know after she registered with Cirrus Md everything was good to go. We checked and made sure she was actually registered and she was so that is all set. She than wanted to know if both of her providers she goes to are the same as her old plan with ASi being in the network and I said yes if they were in the PHCS network before they still would be but its always safe to check. I checked and they both are. She then asked about a flu shot and how that will work. She was just going to go to Walgreens or King Soopers and I said unfortunately that is something that you have to stay in the network as well for it to be covered and I suggested she get it done at her annual wellness visit but she literally just had hers and her provider did not have the flu shot at the time. I told her they usually are only around $40 and she might just have to pay out of pocket. She said she will just start with calling her provider because her mother just got it done there after the fact when she went, of course. I told her as long as the provider is in the PHCS network and they code it as preventative it will be covered. She was so so so happy with all the help and that I answered all of her questions easily. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-01 14:46:33', '2020-10-01 14:46:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057760008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155021', 'Jill Enriquez', NULL, 'ASI had told Jill that they couldn''t pay her mammogram provider until we paid our ASI bill.  per Rod- the bill will get paid tomorrow. I let Jill know that her bill will get paid soon. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-01 14:28:00', '2020-10-01 14:28:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057699031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959202', 'Diane Elliston', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation on 8/25/2020 for 10/ cancellation this was somehow missed I will cancel &amp; refund her Oct pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-01 14:11:20', '2020-10-01 14:13:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, '10-1-20 Carol''s membership renews 11/1/20 so it''s the perfect time to convert even though she met her AUA for 2020. She only has small mental health needs and chiro needs. She psyched to change to MPB Carez Connected Worksite LHS conversion for Nov. 1st. Will find out the other doctors at Boulder Medical Center since her PA isn''t showing in the PHCS network, Susan Puckett. She will find out tomorrow and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-01 13:49:17', '2020-10-01 13:49:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057760003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630149', 'Angie Mann', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent her out a form and tagged Jane in it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-10-01 13:47:29', '2020-10-01 13:47:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057699026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537054', 'Michael Sharpe', NULL, 'Member called in stating that he has been working with ASi on a bill that he paid out-of-pocket from March.  ASi has shared with him that they have cut him a check however cannot pay him until we clear our invoices with them.  I advised that I do not handle vendor billing only member billing.  I told Tricia about this and she will handle.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-01 13:38:20', '2020-10-01 13:38:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057739035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406061', 'Mark Ovind', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Kelly Cheever', 'Visit ID : 811 
Question : looking for health card for myself and daughter?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-10-01 13:29:08', '2020-10-01 13:29:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057735024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, 'Katrinia called in again and wanted to know if something was covered or not. I asked what she was wanting to know and she said a type of surgery. I couldn''t hear what kind she said because it was very muffled but I told her anything that has to do with any kind of surgery it is not something that is covered through her MEC with Planstin. I told her that would be something that is Injury/Illness and told her the run down and that if she knows she needs to have some form of surgery she needs to call Zion now. I gave her their phone number and she is going to call them. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-01 12:21:51', '2020-10-01 12:21:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057699021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006672003', 'Joanne Miale', NULL, 'When Vanessa asked me about this member I realized that we had not received her Oct pmt.  Told Vanessa to let her know that I would be charging her for Oct.  She said that she had submitted a Payment Change form, however I did not receive.  I contact the member and sent her out the Link to form and told her that I would be charging her for Oct today.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-01 11:57:32', '2020-10-01 11:57:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054986001', 'Ken Trombley', NULL, '10-1-20 Dion with C4 says they are having many system issues with the conversion to the new system. She can see he applied on 8/3/20 and had a start date of 9/1/20. Ken said Bright Health cancelled his plan even though he provided all the docs they asked for. Tkt # is 201001-000558. I will likely need to escalate to supervisor.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-01 11:55:41', '2020-10-01 11:55:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056506096', 'Don Nicol', NULL, 'LVM Don', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-01 11:51:30', '2020-10-01 11:51:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057729013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881023', 'Joanne Miale', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Patti is going to call member to change her credit card that was on file to a checking account instead for billing. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-10-01 11:51:08', '2020-10-01 11:52:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056908027', 'Shannon Lawrence', NULL, 'LVM again', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-01 11:49:41', '2020-10-01 11:49:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057221001', 'Michael Sheppard', NULL, 'Needs more time will call back on Monday Oct 5th', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-01 11:46:48', '2020-10-01 11:46:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057256001', 'Susan Ruckdeschel', NULL, 'Cant leave Vm sent SMS', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-01 11:44:21', '2020-10-01 11:44:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057474001', 'Chris Yaros', NULL, 'LVM', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-01 11:42:34', '2020-10-01 11:42:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057735019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033212', 'John Brausen', NULL, 'John called in and said that he needed to use a telemedicine program. I pulled him up and asked if he ever registered with CirrusMD. He hesitated and said he was not sure. I told him that is the virtual healthcare program with his plan and that on Sept 8th we sent him and email that he did open on the 9th at 11:10pm. I told him who is was from and the title of the email. He found it while on the phone and I told him to read through the email and the link is there for him to click and register. Once he is registered it is a text first and they will get back to him within 60 seconds or so and he can then start a video chat with a health care provider. He said that sounds great and is happy to start the process. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-01 11:41:01', '2020-10-01 11:41:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057474054', 'Patty Self', NULL, 'LVM', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-10-01 11:38:54', '2020-10-01 11:38:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057735014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'Greg called in and said that he needs to start a Need with his new health share Zion. I told him it works the same way as it did with Sedera and there is no network and he is responsible for the first $1000 of his IUA. Then he can call Zion and start the Need''s process with them. I gave him their phone number and he said that is awesome and is going to call them right away. Very happy with how easy it is and that it is basically the same as his old plan. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-10-01 11:26:10', '2020-10-01 11:26:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057729008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012724007', 'Brenda Flowers-Specht', NULL, '2nd conversion plan call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-10-01 11:06:56', '2020-10-01 11:06:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057738003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645357', 'Karen Haywood', NULL, '10-1-2- Patti checked billing and was billed on 9/9/20 and again on 9/20/20 and refunded on 9/24/20. I asked Karen to make sure she sees the 9/9/20 charge. She will check and let us know if it''s not showing for any reason. All set for 10/1/20 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-01 10:59:40', '2020-10-01 10:59:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057699016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Member called in and gave me a new CC. I charged her for September &amp; October. She is now current.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-01 10:49:49', '2020-10-01 10:49:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057735003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, '- Member called in to find out how to log in to CirrusMD
- Instructional email was sent - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-10-01 10:17:48', '2020-10-01 10:17:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057729003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-10-01 09:49:02', '2020-10-01 09:49:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057699011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049324001', 'Ronald Redko', NULL, 'I received cancellation request from the group for this member.  I will cancel w/Sedera &amp; RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-01 09:38:52', '2020-10-01 09:38:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057699003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810570', 'Mark Franklin', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Sedera. I cancelled billing and refunded Oct pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-10-01 07:47:33', '2020-10-01 07:47:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057603043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626180', 'Timothy Meisch', NULL, 'Misty Berryman called in about this member, saying that he never received a welcome email, or welcome packet in the mail.   I gave her the dates that the email was sent and told her that it had been opened.  I also said that the letter is probably in the mail already because it was printed on the 22nd.  She asked about the portal- I told her that the username was his email address and that he can select "forgot password" to change it to a better one than the auto generated one.  I told her that he needs to schedule a welcome call- that we could''ve helped answer his questions and fix any issues with third parties if he just reached out to us. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-30 15:00:34', '2020-09-30 15:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057603038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'Regina called for some hand holding whilst trying to register herself for CirrusMD.  I guided her to open a support ticket so that she can get it taken care of. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-30 14:46:52', '2020-09-30 14:46:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057664138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711271', 'Robert Weyrauch', NULL, 'Old Qr Life Code:H04W6. Giving a new on to Robert and daughter who is over the age of 18 in the MPowering Code section. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-30 14:46:11', '2020-09-30 14:46:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057603033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046514037', 'Eva Steele', NULL, 'helped Eva secure $200 mammogram through contract between HCBB and Green Radiology.  I gave her a call and walked her through the process, I emailed to follow up and asked if she could let me know how everything goes! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-30 14:45:45', '2020-09-30 14:45:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057664133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214053', 'Lisa Wade', NULL, 'Old QR Life Code:H06S6. Giving a new on in the MPowering Code section.-KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-30 14:44:45', '2020-09-30 14:44:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057603028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645357', 'Karen Haywood', NULL, 'called wondering what to expect in on boarding- I told her that the best way to know would be to schedule a welcome call.  Sent scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-30 14:44:19', '2020-09-30 14:44:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057664128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, 'Old QR Life Codes for Kristy and husband Ben. Kristy''s:H0Y7D and Ben''s:H0ZVR. Giving new ones in the MPowering Code sections.-KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-30 14:43:53', '2020-09-30 14:43:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057573151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626180', 'Timothy Meisch', NULL, 'Someone fro Weily longs office called in to let us know that this member had not received any cards as yet.  Said that member had contacted Sedera asking about this.  Member is with Zion.  I contacted Zion and asked about this member and had the line #''s in the file.  Zion said that they would get member in the system.  I then called member and left VM saying that his digital cards are on the way.  This needs to be addressed with Justin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-30 14:42:41', '2020-09-30 14:42:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057573146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411196', 'Jeremy Stollings', NULL, 'Member called and asked how much the MEC was .', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-30 14:38:26', '2020-09-30 14:38:26'),
