  ('zcrm_1579374000057664083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012724007', 'Brenda Flowers-Specht', NULL, 'Brenda called in and she said she has not used her plan or anything before because she is married to a "Big time Doctor" and has just been using him, but she wants to start going to actual providers on her own. I asked if she had a Welcome call and she said yes but she does not remember anything. I told her I highly suggest she have another welcome call and I explained how all of that works and how she can go about  having another one. She said that sounds great and she would love to. I did tell her though that for having an annual wellness visit she is to stay in the PHCS Network and then she mentioned if that is on the multiplan website. I said Yes exactly and that I will also send her the email that explains how to navigate the website step by step, she loved that idea. She thanked  me so much for being patient and baring with her. I said it is no problem at all and that is what I am here for. I told her either Kelly Cheever or Vanessa will be the ones to call her on the day and time she picks for the welcome call. She was very happy with everything I told her and sent her email wise. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-30 14:18:48', '2020-09-30 14:18:48'),
