  ('zcrm_1579374000057641033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, '9-30-20 Faith called in to inquire about billing on Aug. 17th, Sept. 8th and Oct. 30th. I explained Aug. 17th is for Aug., Sept 8th is for September and Sept. 30th is for October and should be back to usual timing of 21st of the month for next month''s membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-30 12:15:54', '2020-09-30 12:15:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057573116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881479', 'Desiree Childs', NULL, 'I responded to an email from this member asking about when her account would be debited.  I will let her know that we will be getting back to the monthly schedule on 10/20', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-30 12:09:44', '2020-09-30 12:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057573111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165323', 'Kevin Schill', NULL, 'I replied to an email from this member addressing the frequency of the payments for the Conversion members.  He was only charged 3 times so I outlined when he was charged and told him that we would be getting back on the usual monthly schedule on 10/20.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-30 12:06:18', '2020-09-30 12:06:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057573106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, 'Left VM with member in response to her inquiry about the $25 charge that we waived.  It was an extra $25 that was not charged in Aug for Sept.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-30 11:49:38', '2020-09-30 11:49:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057603023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601439', 'Chelsie Dawydiuk', NULL, 'The husband called in stating that his insurance won''t pay for his daughters surgery.  The hopsital will not perform the surgery without funds up front.  I gave him Sedera''s phone number and told him that he needed to call them, I told him that I would send an email that explained how to get all bills involved into the Sedera portal. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-30 11:46:00', '2020-09-30 11:46:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057664003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025389227', 'Tyson Krout', NULL, 'Tyson called in and said that he was on our website last night and wants to upgrade his plan. I pulled him up and let him know that he needs to speak with his affiliate about anything in regards to that. I told him who it was, James Ashford, and he said that is not who he usually speaks to but asked for his number and will give him a call. I gave him his number that we have on file here. If he calls back and can''t get in touch with him I will not know what to do honestly. Patti suggested to get with John and see what to do. If he calls back. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-30 11:43:16', '2020-09-30 11:43:16'),
