  ('zcrm_1579374000057603018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016132018', 'Robert Campbell', NULL, 'Amy called because she has been getting dead air from ASI- I told her that if she just submitted a bill on Sept 16th to them that it takes a few weeks to get through processing.  I told her that I would call Nancy on her behalf to see what is going on.  I called Nancy and left a vm for a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-30 10:13:45', '2020-09-30 10:13:45'),
