  ('zcrm_1579374000057573076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, 'Member contacted me and asked why he was billed 3 times in the last 45 days.  I explained that due to the transition of the billing system and gave him what he was charged and when it was for.  Member ok with this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-30 09:58:07', '2020-09-30 09:58:07'),
