  ('zcrm_1579374000057573066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384340', 'James Frohman', NULL, 'I messaged Dania about whether the family has to keep contributing in order to clear up his final expenses her response is that they can cancel.  I will cancel his membership', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-30 09:01:50', '2020-09-30 09:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057641028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830079', 'Jose Hernandez', NULL, '9-30-20 Jose called bc his ex-wife Iris Fernandez mentioned she''s using Redirect Health for her wellness visit and he''d never heard of that. He just received his Planstin card. He assumed and thought they were on the same plan. I explained due to the timing of their initial enrollments they were put into different groups and his group was forced to make a change recently. Iris'' group is not yet needing to make a change likely until after the new year in 2021. He understands now and will look up the doctors to use in the Multi-plan search tool for the PHCS network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-30 09:00:23', '2020-09-30 09:00:23'),
