  ('zcrm_1579374000057641023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057474022', 'Mark Beane', NULL, '9-29-20 Mark and wife are 40 year smokers! They are Not a good fit. I didn''t realize this until after I explained the entire membership.  It''s too risky. Then he thought he could use it as a short-term plan which I told him it''s not built for short-term medical options. He still wants to read through documentation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-29 16:20:32', '2020-09-29 16:20:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057641018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057474022', 'Mark Beane', NULL, '9-28-20 Mark 57 diagnosed with Crohn''s disease 6 months ago. He thinks diet is his issue. Wife 56 has type 2 diabetes, non-insulin dependent. Controlled with metformin, Trulicity and diet. Wife just lost job week ago and will lost benefits as of Oct. 1st. Cobra is $2K. Mark is self-employed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-29 15:58:58', '2020-09-29 15:58:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057641013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '9-29-20 Answered many questions. She seemed to think I only offered her Cigna and Bright Health but failed to mention Kaiser and Anthem and Friday Health. I just quoted her the two cheapest when we talked first. I also forgot to mentioned the $125 Admin fee to join MCS, hence why I send the email overview to cover everything. She is deciding. She doesn''t seem as interested in Kaiser now once heard price even with huge subsidy putting income at $30K. Zip 80540 and DOB 10/22/1959. Dental is with Metlife now which I''m not familiar with. I asked her to contact her dentist and ask which carriers they accept for Individuals to begin our search for dental plans.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-29 15:53:16', '2020-09-29 15:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057641008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645270', 'McCall Hoops', NULL, '9-29-20 Traci''s daughter McCall Hoops just joined via the LHS conversion bc her daughter is a LHS member but can''t join Traci''s membership because working for law firm, just turned 22 and is a W2 employee. Realized we should do LHS conversion since she''s a LHS member now and price was going up. MPB Carez Connected Worksite $1000/$242. No pre-x, no tobacco.  Enrollment complete for McCall. Nov. 1st start.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-29 15:41:27', '2020-09-29 15:41:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057641003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '9-29-20 Traci''s daughter McCall just joined via the LHS conversion bc her daughter is a LHS member but can''t join Traci''s membership because working for law firm, just turned 22 and is a W2 employee. Realized we should do LHS conversion since she''s a LHS member now and price was going up. MPB Carez Connected Worksite $1000/$242. Enrollment complete for McCall.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-29 15:39:04', '2020-09-29 15:39:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057603013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659050', 'Beth Bryant', NULL, 'called to get a rapid response covid test so that she would feel safe visiting her mom that is in a nursing home.  I told her that there were two ways she could handle this situation- the first being that she reach out to her primary care doctor that is in network and ask them- she would get a discount by going through the PHCS network.  The other option would be for me to look up free covid testing near her and send her all of the links. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-29 14:37:02', '2020-09-29 14:37:02'),
