  ('zcrm_1579374000057603008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659334', 'Kaye Reich', NULL, 'I called Kaye, and left a vm to tell her that there should be an invite from Cirrus in her inbox, that PDF copies of her card were sent from Planstin/Zion on Aug 11th to her other email address that we didn''t have on file -  Kaye@greensandjeans.com and that they would send more out to the address we have on our file, as well as a hard copy of her Planstin card- I was told that if a Zion member has Planstin they will only send a Planstin card.  Member is all set! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-29 10:43:48', '2020-09-29 10:43:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057603003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, 'I just spoke with Snatam Khalsa she told me about the craziness that ensued with Zion and Planstin- over that legal form she wanted to see if she needed to sign.  She called Zion- they transferred her to Planstin- Planstin told her not to sign the form and to hand them her Planstin card, even if it wasn''t preventative so that it would reprice at a discounted rate through the system.  She was a bit upset at ME for telling her that she didn''t have insurance and she told me to tell the rest of the members that they have a "health coverage plan" instead.   This is confusing our members!!!  I let Joan know via Teams. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-29 10:40:12', '2020-09-29 10:40:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057599003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053968006', 'Michael Jones', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-09-29 10:12:03', '2020-09-29 10:12:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057571013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781197', 'Daniel Siegrist', NULL, 'Dan had to go to the ER over the weekend and wanted to know how to submit a need to Sedera.  I told him to give them a call and then I sent instructions on how to submit a need in his Sedera portal. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-29 09:37:38', '2020-09-29 09:37:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057571008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359199', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, 'sent another email explaining the wait regarding the member portal.  asked what she needed to change regarding her membership so that I could send her a form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-29 09:28:09', '2020-09-29 09:28:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057573018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'This member called in and we spoke about preventative.  I went over what was sharable Wellness visit, OB Gyn &amp; Mammogram.  She expressed that she had a challenge prior to  find in Network providers.  She is in that "black hole" area in CO.  I told her that we would run a list for her with PCP''s &amp; OB Gyn''s in 81621, 81611, 81601.  I also advised her that eye exams were not shareable.  I also advised her to register for Cirrus MD now rather than later.  Sent out registrations template.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-29 09:01:25', '2020-09-29 09:02:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057573013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678052', 'Dennis Bakken', NULL, 'member cancelled this option and signed up for DPC plan in MPBA eff 8/1/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-29 08:02:33', '2020-09-29 08:02:33'),
