  ('zcrm_1579374000057570003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191486', 'Brian Riley', NULL, 'Hi Michael, I still have not made a decision so things will be left on hold until I can do that. I want to read up on all of this more and will have to take some time to do that with work and everything else going on at this time. Thanks for keeping in touch and will email you if any more questions or a decision has been made. Thanks again. Sincerely, brian.', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-09-29 07:04:03', '2020-09-29 07:04:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057563003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004755142', 'Adam-Paul Smolak', NULL, 'Call with Adam-Paul''s wife Aiyan. They are upset about the HES fee they''ve been paying, finding out from Liberty that it was not required, and want a refund back to 2017.  I explained that it provided a service that fees have already been paid on, such as Tele-doc.  She wants it cancelled Immediately!  They are looking at going back to a traditional plan.  Unhappy with Liberty/ Medical Cost Sharing.  
-- Sending her the cancellation link and copying Patti requesting to reverse any charges for OCT.', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2020-09-28 18:56:02', '2020-09-28 18:56:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057556038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659334', 'Kaye Reich', NULL, 'helping her fix her many problems with her conversion thus far. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-28 15:30:22', '2020-09-28 15:30:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057555016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003167005', 'Jackaline Brown', NULL, 'Jackaline called in and said that last month with her "Health Insurance" and was not supposed to be charged this month for Sept. and she got a $50 charge from us. We do not have her as cancelled or any form of notice that she wanted to cancel with us. The issue is she cancelled with Liberty and not with us. She thought cancelling with Liberty would cancel this plan as well. Since we are 2 separate companies we would have no idea unless she called into here and asked to be cancelled. Liberty does not make us aware when members cancel with them. I sent the call over to Patti since she is the one that handles cancellations. She explained all of this to her and let her know that she is going to send out a cancellation form but the other issue is that the email we have on file is not a working email, it bounces back when anything is sent. She got an updated good email from her and sent the form. She will be cancelled and the $50 will be refunded as she asked. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-28 14:35:37', '2020-09-28 14:35:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057545028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014743027', 'Jay Land', NULL, 'I left VM for Jay and he returned my call I told him that he underpaid his MCS for September by $203.50 and that we were getting ready to bill for Oct.  I will bill him for the adjustment amount today and then bill him for October on 9/30.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-28 14:22:53', '2020-09-28 14:22:53'),
