  ('zcrm_1579374000057556018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798003', 'Merret Anne Mann', NULL, 'I called Planstin to ask them about Merret''s Zion card- I was told that Zion/Planstin members are only getting the Planstin card because that is the only one that they need.  They are to present themselves as a cash pay patient- so on and so forth. emailed Merret and tagged Wendy in the thread. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-28 12:31:53', '2020-09-28 12:31:53'),
