  ('zcrm_1579374000057555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692772', 'Marguerite Sherwin', NULL, 'Marguerite called in and she wanted to know what to do to have her preventative colonoscopy. I told her that the provider and facility has to be in the PHCS Network. She and I both checked on the PHCS Multiplan website and her provider and the facility are in the network so she is good to go on that. I then explained what she needs to do with bringing her RCI card which she had in front of her and walked her through where it says on where to submit the claims to directly to RCI at the P.O. Box address on the cards. She understands it all and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-28 12:05:23', '2020-09-28 12:05:23'),
