  ('zcrm_1579374000057524003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544245', 'Bethany Schaap', NULL, 'I reached out to her to offer her to do a doctor search to see if they were in network.', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-28 09:51:59', '2020-09-28 09:51:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057523003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she has had a Heart attack and had to be hospitalized.  She said that she had been in contact with Zion and had paid her IUA of $1000 towards the hospital bill.  She was at her 1st visit at Cardiac Rehab and they were telling her that she would have to pay them 1/2 or they could not give her the cash discount.  I advised her to call Zion and gave her their contact number.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-28 09:50:53', '2020-09-28 09:51:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057486065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165373', 'Dieter Bruhn', NULL, '9-25-20 Dieter has some old bills he''s never submitted to LHS but not significant and maybe not exceeding AUA. He''s very interested in MPB Carez Connected LHS Conversion for $317/$1000.  Really likes the virtual healthcare addition and the concept as well as not paying $399 for LHS. He was hoping for a slightly lower price it sounded like, but he thinks he''s more likely to use the virtual health since hates going into a doctor. We will reconnect Oct. 6th for enrollment. He''ll do his due diligence between now and then.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-25 16:04:36', '2020-09-25 16:04:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057470343', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544245', 'Bethany Schaap', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 809 
Question : How did I find out if my doctor is in the PHCS network?  They say to check with you.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-09-25 15:57:06', '2020-09-25 15:57:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057472166', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798003', 'Merret Anne Mann', NULL, 'Well, that welcome call was nuts! She wanted me to start from the beginning and explain everything about her plan-the questions that she was asking were so basic, and she just wasn''t understanding anything that I was saying to her slowly, multiple times.  I hadn''t even started the call when she got really mad at me because I wouldn''t use the word insurance in reference to Zion.   "did you just say I don''t have catastrophic insurance?!  did those words literally just come out of your mouth?!"  then I said "ma''am" and she flipped told me not to f''n call her "ma''am"  I went silent and said that I didn''t want her to be confused, and I think that Wendy would be the best person to speak with her- I asked if she wanted me to transfer the line to Wendy- the member declined.  She asked me for 15 more minutes, and then she started in with "Ohhhhhhh!  so MPowering offers Cirrus?!  MPowering offers prescription med help and HCBB!  oh wow that''s impressive!"    In the back of my head I KNEW that Wendy explained how health cost sharing works to this woman, but that this woman had some issue cognitively that wouldn''t allow her to really understand her plan.  At the end of the call she thanked me for my patience and told me (again) that she doesn''t have reading comprehension.  I invited her to give us a phone call whenever she needed some understanding of something.  I spoke to Wendy about this, Wendy feels the same as I do that there is something cognitively wrong. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-25 15:36:25', '2020-09-25 15:36:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057486060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057474022', 'Mark Beane', NULL, '9-25-20 Mark left me a vm yesterday that I didn''t see bc of the new phone system. My ringer got turned off and I missed 6 calls. Working on returning calls still. Called Mark back and he had just spoken with Michael. Mark came to me via my current client Janet Ingvaldsen. Left a vm for Michael to let him know. I will be speaking with Mark on Monday. He had to go pick up an elderly family member right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-25 15:03:35', '2020-09-25 15:03:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057472161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!   Sent out post email, as well as both preventative care emails.  I am going to help her sort out some issues surrounding her Plantstin and Zion cards, and run a search for her in regards to HCBB and a gum graph. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-25 14:14:26', '2020-09-25 14:14:26'),
