  ('zcrm_1579374000057486036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165398', 'Andrew Hogan', NULL, '9-25-20 Patti did NOT charge the $125, she just forgot to take the statement out of the email. Called Andrew and he did see the $317 payment for Nov. membership and he was not charged the $125. He''s all set for Nov. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-25 11:22:46', '2020-09-25 11:22:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057486031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '9-25-20 Maurine is thrilled to have Oct. 1st start date and saw $344 charged already. BUT, she was also already charged the $525 on Sept. 22nd. Called Patti and she refunded Maurine the $525 immediately. Called Maurine and updated her too. Super happy!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-25 11:14:50', '2020-09-25 11:26:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057486026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165398', 'Andrew Hogan', NULL, '9-25-20 I called to let Andrew know he was charged already for his Nov. membership and next billing date will be Nov. 21st. BUT, he said he received an email receipt stating he is also going to be billed $125 which he shouldn''t be charged since he''s a LHS conversion client. Waiting to hear back from Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-25 11:10:25', '2020-09-25 11:10:25'),
