  ('zcrm_1579374000057386032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '9-24-20 Maurine completed app for MPB Carez Worksite w/ MEC bc in CA for $344/$1000 for Nov. 1st start date. She''s thrilled to bring cost back down from $525 to $344. She took great notes and will follow through with Welcome Call also. I had her complete the update banking form also to make it easy for Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-24 13:13:34', '2020-09-24 13:13:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057383008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547361', 'Micah Goldbaum', NULL, 'Bettigram stated that he needed some help figuring out how to get a colonoscopy.  I tried calling him back and it rang and rang then the phone asked for an access code.  I emailed him telling him that we got his message and asked that he either respond via email or give a call directly. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-24 12:26:07', '2020-09-24 12:26:07'),
