  ('zcrm_1579374000057386026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645313', 'Peter Nesbitt', NULL, '9-24-20 Peter is ready to enroll. He just needs to get payment information from Lady Fuller since she''s paying as the employer. John set the group up under IGC - International Gifting Company. Peter will wait to enroll in VSP once his annual renewal is ready for his current C4 vision plan.  He does not want the MEC so his price will be $209/$1000 for MPB Carez Worksite No MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-24 12:10:52', '2020-09-24 12:10:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057386021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '9-24-20 Maurine and I are playing phone tag. She wants to move to MPB Carez Worksite and Rod said I can do so via Select Group  Conversion since she''s a current client and lives in CA. She already got her colonoscopy over the summer, no pre-x and lives in CA, so MUST have MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-24 11:35:25', '2020-09-24 13:11:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057386016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '9-24-20 Keila called Anthem to reinstate her membership. They were going to call her back and she will pay full amount to get account up to date. She realized she must not have set it up properly before.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-24 11:30:22', '2020-09-24 11:30:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057386011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, '9-24-20 Lori called in to find out how her daughter  Sarah can get a medication for her knee while she''s in AK. She was told by someone that it''s not included in her membership. I left her a long vm explaining it it''s a New Need that it counts towards the Need. Best way to access meds at best price is by calling Concierge.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-24 11:24:57', '2020-09-24 11:24:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057383003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539007', 'Kris Srnka', NULL, 'Kris called in needing help understanding her preventative care, I ran a few searches for her, gave her Zion''s phone number and emailed her a list of imaging centers so she can get her mammogram.  I told her that the 3D mammogram will be covered through Zion, not her MEC.  She was very happy for the help.  Also she received her Planstin card but not her Zion card, I reached out to Zion because Planstins chat box was down.  Zion said that they would put the request in for a card to go out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-24 10:10:09', '2020-09-24 10:10:09'),
