  ('zcrm_1579374000057330056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '9-23-20 Aine is completing MPB Carez Worksite conversion for Select Group bc she''s a LHS client but needs the MEC compliance. Per the above notes, Rod is allowing her to convert with the group to get the added exceptions. She did call Zion to ask more questions and they told her she could enroll until the end of the month, hence her delayed enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-23 16:57:17', '2020-09-23 16:57:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057330048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '9-23-20 Maurine heard about conversion through Natalie Wood. Her rate also went from $322 to $525 for Oct. payment since she''s turning 60 in Oct. She is super healthy without any pre-x. Rod gave me permission to convert her via the Select Conversion Group. Her name rate with MPB Carez Worksite is $344/$1000 and Must have MEC bc in CA. She has already set up her CirrusMD via her current PSDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-23 16:32:37', '2020-09-23 16:33:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057330043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165398', 'Andrew Hogan', NULL, '9-23-20 Andrew completed LHS to MPB Carez Connected Worksite Conversion for $317/$1000 and knows to call for assistance with PHCS network for colonoscopy.  He will have a Nov. 1st start date and knows how to cancel with LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-23 16:27:40', '2020-09-23 16:27:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057330038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057329012', 'John Lazas', NULL, '9-23-20 John Lazas is local in Superior and in captive with US Health. He refers clients to other Medicare Specialists, LTC/LTD and Healthshare Specialists. He HCS Specialist focuses on one of the Christian Healthshares and he''s open to possibly referring folks to me for non religious MCS solutions. He''s licensed in 17 states. They have a dental plan he likes but it sounds the same as the rest. $1500 cap with $50 ded, 6-12 month waiting period for basic and major services, 3 networks with Cigna PPO as best, all for $20+-$39 a month for individual depending on plan choice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-23 16:09:26', '2020-09-23 16:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509046', 'Greg Jenkins', NULL, 'called because he thought he had cancelled- but he wasn''t and was charged 2 months.  He asked for a 2 month refund, but Patti told me that she was just going to give 1 month. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-23 15:34:13', '2020-09-23 15:34:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990335', 'Charles Grigsby', NULL, 'sent a letter explaining we are working on getting them into the portal and HCBB and that we will let them know once they can use these platforms. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-23 15:26:54', '2020-09-23 15:26:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451131', 'Adria Moshe', NULL, 'updated address, filled out an address update form for the member, I am reaching out to Nancy at ASI about a bill that she is dealing with. It doesn''t sound preventative and it is a year old. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-23 15:17:07', '2020-09-23 15:17:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057330033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047282078', 'Dipakkumar Patel', NULL, 'Zach called in and told me that this member went to his provider and was told that they don''t take cash.  So plan will not work for him.  I will send out cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-23 14:19:58', '2020-09-23 14:19:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057330028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361581', 'Kathryn Johnson', NULL, 'Member just had a question about her old payment method showing up on her receipt.  I told her that it was coming out of her new pmt method.  She said that she would check to make sure.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-23 14:03:16', '2020-09-23 14:03:16'),
