  ('zcrm_1579374000057330018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068229', 'Sharon Heiney', NULL, 'Member called in re: multiple billing.  She was very understanding I will be refunding her 1 pmt of $294 then charging an additional $50 for October pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-23 13:27:37', '2020-09-23 13:27:37'),
