  ('zcrm_1579374000057330008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '9-23-20 Olivia with C4 called and Anthem said they will reinstate her but she needs to pay June, July and Aug. backpay plus Sept. to be current. Total for June-Aug  is $644.96. Olivia said to call Anthem directly ASAP. Technically she has 10 biz days to complete the process. Anthem says she was never set up on auto pay which is why it didn''t work. Olivia also requested a reference # from Anthem for Keila to use if needed. Left vm for Kelia.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-23 12:30:55', '2020-09-23 12:30:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'she had many many billing questions for preventative care, I referred her to call RCI''s number for support as there has been an issue with our emails being able to send out on the members behalf, the emails just bounce back.  she was also upset that she had a rate increase "without anyone letting me know" I told her that Patti had tried and I asked Patti to give her a call back- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-23 12:25:14', '2020-09-23 12:25:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068229', 'Sharon Heiney', NULL, 'she called because she was double billed. I reached out to Patti and asked that she reach out to this member. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-23 12:22:54', '2020-09-23 12:22:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, 'Jodi called in again stating that she never received an email from me- she ended up finding it in her junk folder.  she understands that she needs to call RCI. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-23 12:22:00', '2020-09-23 12:22:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013453097', 'Jose j De La Cerda', NULL, 'Jose is having an extremely difficult time filling out his banking form.  Tricia is going to give him a phone call before end of day. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-23 12:21:11', '2020-09-23 12:21:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057330003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009743101', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '9-23-20 Maria has arthritis in neck and knee issue she needs to work on and submit bills to Sedera. She had a stomach issue and treated with acupuncture but Sedera denied it. Worked with Connie possibly and said she was not knowledgable at all. Wants to convert and gain her annual wellness visit back and I recommended possibly seeing Dr. Hillary Martin at Boulder Women''s Naturopathic Center. She will look into it. We will convert her for a Nov. 1st start date for MPB Carez Worksite with MEC $294/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-23 12:10:18', '2020-09-23 12:10:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, 'Jodi called in and had a couple questions regarding her colonoscopy that she is having tomorrow I believe she said. She was confused on some of the info that Jennifer gave her. She was confused about where it talked about coding being changed and then it not being covered at 100%. I told her the only reason that would happen is if they find any polyps and they need to remove those. I said that will then turn into a Diagnostic situation because of the removal of the polyps found. She will then be responsible to pay out of pocket subject to her IUA of $1000. Anything after that she will need to get in contact with Sedera and open up a Need with them. She understood and thanked me for the info and cleared up any confusion she had. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-23 11:15:53', '2020-09-23 11:15:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038088', 'Lisa Campbell', NULL, 'Lisa called in and she said that she got the conformation email for being cancelled and she got double billed. Her new premium came out and her old premium last night. I do not know what she could mean by new premium if she is cancelled but I let Patti know and she said she will give her call back after the lunch in that is going on right now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-23 10:20:14', '2020-09-23 10:20:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057326003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006871163', 'Deborah Pettit', NULL, 'Deborah called in and wanted to know what type of Mammogram is covered with her MEC. I let her know it is just the mammogram screening. It can NOT be the 3D, or any of the fancy digital ones. She was fine with that and I also let her know that the provider has to be in the PHCS Network and she said that she had the facility looked up last week and it was in the network. She asked if her regular doctor is supposed to call it in and I said yes and again made sure that the place is in network. She confirmed yes it is and I then told her she needs to make sure she brings her RCI card and that is HAS to be coded as Preventative for it to be covered and that on the back of her card the front desk can call the numbers to confirm her benefits and then right next to that it says submit claims to and they HAVE to bill everything to the P.O. Box address that is on the back of her card. I said that it happens sometimes where the provider bills the member and not RCI themselves. She said that is what she told Paul Cholak her affiliate, is the difficult part because that has always been her issue from previous times. I told her that if that does happen all she needs to do is put it in an envelope and mail it directly to RCI with the address on her RCI card. She understood everything and said that she will probably be calling me again with help and I said that is perfectly fine and that is what I am here for. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-23 10:11:25', '2020-09-23 10:11:25'),
