  ('zcrm_1579374000057239108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '9-22-20 Tyler applied over the weekend for MPB Carez Connceted as LHS conversion. He has to choose EC instead of ES to force the system to tally the price. We did this as a work around to get his enrollment complete in time. John Kach just changed it to the correct ES $493/$1000 IUA for 30-49. They are all set for 10/1/20 start date!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-22 11:06:23', '2020-09-22 11:06:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057216080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033451086', 'Tracy Goodemote', NULL, 'Tracy called in and said he was having trouble logging into the member portal and I let him know that it is not up and running just yet but when it is he will be notified via email. He than asked how he would go about adding someone to his plan. I told him there is a form that can be sent to him and that I would put him back to Patti who can help him with that. Member all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-22 10:49:47', '2020-09-22 10:49:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057240089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038730169', 'Emily LeMasters', NULL, 'Member requested cancellation form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-22 10:44:19', '2020-09-22 10:44:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057216075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005273011', 'Tina Le', NULL, 'Tina called in and asked if there was COVID testing done via stool sample. I said I have never heard of that before and the only way I have heard of was the normal way via mouth swab or up the nose. She asked if she should just call her doctor, I said yes that would be my best bet and then asked if it is covered via her MEC. I told her no it is not something that is preventative and it would be subject to her IUA of  $1000. I also let her know that depending on where she lives there are some states and areas that have free COVID Testing. I told her I will look around in her area and see if there is something I can find and email her the info. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-22 10:29:08', '2020-09-22 10:29:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057239103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678097', 'Steve Gamelin', NULL, 'Steve called in wondering where his cards were- I reached out to Planstin and they couldn''t find him in their system.  Ashlee asked that Patti give her a phone call.  Sent all of the info to Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-22 10:23:59', '2020-09-22 10:23:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057239098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'Spoke to Ashlee at Planstin, PDF copies going out again, and hard copies going out today. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-22 10:22:52', '2020-09-22 10:22:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057240084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, 'I spoke to member and she was under the impression that she had made her choice.  I told her that we did not get any choice from her.  I will send her link to conversion form and advise her to make choice ASAP.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-22 10:20:05', '2020-09-22 10:20:05'),
