  ('zcrm_1579374000057216055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, 'Julia called in and left a bettiegram with Patti and she needed to have her facility looked up for her mammogram and her appointment is at 11:15am. Patti called her and got the name of the place and I looked it up and it was in network and I made sure to have Patti ask her if she has her Planstin card and everything because she is a conversion and there has been issues with getting cards. She said yes she has it and everything is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-22 09:01:31', '2020-09-22 09:01:31'),
