  ('zcrm_1579374000057240046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035116005', 'Carol Smith', NULL, 'I was able to change billing to reflect new member &amp; spouse option.  So member will be billed correctly.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-22 07:54:18', '2020-09-22 07:54:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057239088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, 'Jodi called into the betties after hours to ask about a covid test being a "covered" expense or not with her colonoscopy, I emailed her and told her to call RCI for further instruction.  To ask if it would be bundled into the covered colonoscopy need  OR if the Covid test would be subject to a discounted rate through her copay plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-22 07:40:05', '2020-09-22 07:40:05'),
