  ('zcrm_1579374000057240026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, '9-21-20 Sent main phone #720-366-6196 for Sedera to use to reinstate Beth''s membership asap.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-21 16:35:54', '2020-09-21 16:35:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057240021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '9-21-20 Submitted Escalation for Keila to get reinstated per the request:
Escalations Team:

 

Please review email below and respond directly to the broker listed and copy the Broker Team with all updates and/or resolutions.

 

Broker Name:   Wendy Scipione
Broker Email:  WendyS@MyMPB.com
Broker Phone: 720-259-1555
Customer Name: Keila Hoover
C4 Account #:1300036225

INCIDENT # (IF AVAILABLE):  
Carrier: Anthem 
Effective Date: April 1st 2020

 

ISSUE:

1. Keila Hoover has her account set up with auto pay with Anthem. Apparently according to Anthem there was a wierd glitch that stopped her auto pay from working. They said to call C4 to reinstate her plan. She owes for Aug. and Sept. and is fully willing and wanting to pay to keep her plan active. She made no changes to her banking account set on autopay and it had been working April through July. Her plan is Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5150 HMO/Silver.  Please advise what she can do to reinstate it.

2.  She requested this as soon as she learned of the problem on 9/3.                                       

3. She now has a medical issue to tend to as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-21 16:34:41', '2020-09-21 16:34:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057240013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057253057', 'Tobin Ortenblad', NULL, '9-21-20 Referred by Keegan Swenson. Turning 26 Oct. 29th and will be off parents insurance. Professional cyclists and make about $25K AGI. Broke wrist 2-3 months ago and just dealt with it via an urgent care visit, specialist visit and surgery. Believes he''s healed and also healed from minor cracked collar bone about 1 year ago. No ongoing issue. Understands the pre-x clause. He doesn''t do his annual wellness visits but he has to have the MEC to be compliant in CA. So, I''m encouraging him to fund the HSA to gain tax benefits. Also has Kaiser now with parents and he likes it bc he''s used to it, but rates were $280 with $7800 ded or $380 for $1200-$1800 ded. He will peek at rates when open enrollment begins but doubts it will be better.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-21 15:53:11', '2020-09-21 16:03:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057233033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, 'called to see about getting a flu shot, I told her that would have to be an out of pocket expense. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-21 15:02:16', '2020-09-21 15:02:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057233028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Planstin/Zion didn''t process them correctly- I asked that they send the PDF copies of the card right away. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-21 14:50:55', '2020-09-21 14:50:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057233023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045739067', 'Rachel Namordi', NULL, 'I tried calling again, but it went directly to vm. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-21 14:29:15', '2020-09-21 14:29:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057209149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549095', 'Sean Frankhouse', NULL, 'I reinstated this member after he contacted me with new banking information.  I told him that I would be charging him for September &amp; October + $50 reinstatement fee.  He is ok with this.  $50 charged out of FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-21 13:51:49', '2020-09-21 13:51:49'),
