  ('zcrm_1579374000057242003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659223', 'James Julian', NULL, 'Stephanie called in and said that she is new to the program and her son just broke his arm and she didn''t know what to do. I walked her through the process and that she is to present herself as a cash pay and is responsible for the first $1500 out of pocket. Anything more than that she is to get in contact with Sedera and open up a need with them. There is no network and she can go anywhere of her choosing. She completely understood and repeated back to me what she does and she is all set and knows what to do and will call Sedera when she is getting close to that point of her IUA. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-21 13:03:44', '2020-09-21 13:03:44'),
