  ('zcrm_1579374000057157073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', NULL, '09.18.20:  Kymberlee emailed me to say she hasn''t received any materials as yet.  Responded &amp; asked if she received her digital card from Zion.  She answered she has not.  I told her I would call Zion and inquire.  Called Zion, spoke with Amy.  She sent the email w/digital card to Kymberlee and said it should reach her within 24 hrs.  Recvd. an email from Kymberlee - said she got her digital card and was amazed how quickly they sent it - and thanked me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-09-18 16:19:35', '2020-09-18 16:51:17'),
