  ('zcrm_1579374000057109092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, '9-17-20 Left vm for Carol since her AUA will reset on Oct. 1st. It''s the perfect time to make a change so her membership fee doesn''t automatically increase to $399 Oct. 1st. She said she has some mental health bills and met her AUA for 2020.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-17 16:37:09', '2020-09-17 16:37:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057109087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610303', 'Lauren Rathbun', NULL, '9-17-20 Ann, Lauren''s mom finally reached out and wants to talk tomorrow morning to talk with me and Lauren to help her decide. I don''t have Ann''s # yet but plugged in her email above.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-17 16:23:34', '2020-09-17 16:23:34'),
