  ('zcrm_1579374000057109077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679079', 'Bonnie Kern', NULL, 'Bonnie called in and had a few questions regarding her plan and who she needs to call and what to do and say. Her husband 2 days ago had to go to the ER and she said she gave her Planstin card to them. I explained to her that Planstin is ONLY for Preventative and Zion is her injury/illness. She is to tell the ER that they are cash pay and is responsible for $5000 out of pocket of their IUA. I told her I was not 100% sure but I heard that the cards that they go are an all in one card for both Zion and Planstin but to call Zion and make sure that is the case. I explained how everything works with Zion and opening a need after they have met their IUA of $5000. She said she is going to call Zion about the card being all in one for both Planstin and Zion. She than asked if her plan works the same way as it did with ASi where when it comes to injury/illness where there is no network. I said yes this plan works EXACTLY the same as before where there is no network and they can go to anywhere they want with non preventative situations. She then asked if when she went to the ER a couple weeks ago if it is the same thing. I said yes, she needs to do the same thing where she is cash pay and since this is a different need she is then responsible for the $5000 separately from her husbands ER visit. It is per need. She lastly said that I answered ALL of her questions and she 100% understands everything perfectly and will call the hospital and tell then NOT to bill Planstin and that she is a cash pay and will pay out of pocket. She is also calling Zion now to ask about the card and I also said if she has questions about opening a Need with them they will certainly walk her through the process and tell her what she needs to do. She is all set and knows exactly what to do now and is very very happy with all the help. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-17 14:24:48', '2020-09-17 14:24:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057137008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024225', 'Jason Fishburn', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Sent preventative care lit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-17 14:00:20', '2020-09-17 14:00:20'),
