  ('zcrm_1579374000057109057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359199', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, 'Kim called in and said that she is not able to log into her new member portal from the new website MPB.Health. I let her know that it is currently still being worked on and it not up yet but when it is she will be notified. I asked what type of information she is looking for.  She said she wanted something that told her what her preventative plan covers. I let her know that the portal would not have that type of info. I told her the portal is really just something that has all of her personal info in there that she can update at any time she needs to and if she ever wants to upload any sort of Documents that pertain to her health and what not. I told her though that I am more than happy to send her an email that will have a whole list of everything that is covered with her RCI Preventative portion of her plan for adults and children. She said that would be great! I sent that over to her via email. Her next question was something that was out of my purview  and Patti would need to answer something like that. I put the call to Patti and she was able to give her all the answers she needed. It was pertaining to something with Kim''s daughter and being covered with a different insurance group and that she will be taking both of her kids off of her taxes as dependents for next year and just needed to know what, if anything on her plan was considered "Insurance". Patti gave her all info she needed and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-17 12:26:12', '2020-09-17 12:26:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057109049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024130', 'Julie Meko', NULL, '9-17-20 Julie called and we began discussion but the connection was bad and she''s going to call me back shortly when in better service. Stayed in Costa Rica during lockdown since no covid in her town.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-17 11:39:33', '2020-09-17 11:39:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057109044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679198', 'Kari Rosckowff', NULL, '9-17-20 Kari called me back and I explained everything better about the conversion. She is interested in the behavioral health specialist service since she''s seeing a mental health doctor now and it''s expensive. I told her they are working towards adding that in the new year. She sounds really unhappy/sad and overwhelmed at the moment. She does not have any pre-existing conditions or open needs with Sedera. Conversion is complete for MPB Carez Worksite $294/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-17 11:13:53', '2020-09-17 11:41:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057109039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679198', 'Kari Rosckowff', NULL, '9-17-20 Kari decided not to call me back again because she saw that she was charged again for Sept. and assumed she was all set. I told her we are past multiple deadlines and that she must convert because her membership ended in its current form. She has a mammogram scheduled in Nov. and wants to keep that. If she converts to MPB Carez Worksite she will keep all of her annual wellness visits for only $10 more a month versus Sedera Access Plus. Actually once she pays the $3 for a new bank account fees with Sedera, she will only pay an extra $7 a month if she converts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-17 10:45:31', '2020-09-17 10:45:31'),
