  ('zcrm_1579374000057107003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'This member declined back in May for June so I put her in Cancellation status.  Therefore she was not notified of the plan changes by us.  She now has declined for September and we sent in her name as one of the members that hadn''t made a decision so she was cancelled.  I responded to an email letting member know of this and letting her know that she must be in contact with Jane ASAP to make a decision about her plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-17 08:08:40', '2020-09-17 08:08:40'),
