  ('zcrm_1579374000057045028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586070', 'Brandon Johnson', NULL, 'emergency room called and asked for the address for claims.  I explained Brandon''s healthshare to the woman and told her to tell Brandon that I would send him a link and instructions on how to open up a need with Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-16 15:09:39', '2020-09-16 15:09:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057063018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809171', 'Joseph Ayers', NULL, 'Lisa called in and wanted to know yet again when they will be getting their new cards. I let her know it should be any day now because I found out that they were sent out so to keep an eye out in her email and mail as the cards have been sent out, so any day now. She lastly wanted to know when payments are going to be taken out of their account on a set schedule. I let her know that there was an issue before with a glitch in the system and all the conversion people. I told her from this point on everything will be taken out on the normal time of the months the 20th-22nd. She still wasn''t liking my answer and said she just wants to make sure she is on the same page because she was charged twice, refunded for one of them, and now money has been taken out again, she said she can''t just not be prepared and have these large sums of money being taking out randomly. I told her the same thing again that from here on out it will be the normal time on the 20th or 22nd of the month, I asked her if she would like to speak to Patti because she is the one that deals with the billing dept. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-16 13:37:35', '2020-09-16 13:37:35'),
