  ('zcrm_1579374000057063013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Mary called in and though I was Kelly C and started saying that she was in contact with "Me"(Kelly C) about a bill that she got for her woman''s well visit that was 100% preventative and Kelly C said that she sent everything over to Jennifer at RCI and was just waiting to hear back from her back in Feb when Mary first called about this. Mary said she has not heard anything and even sent Kelly and email to her kellyc@mympb.com email and never heard back. She now has gotten a collection bill and is really worried and needs to know what is going on. I put the call into Kelly C since she has been the one working on this case and too many people working on it can get confusing. Not that I don''t want to help but as I said I am trying to make everything run smooth and not stepping on anyone''s toe''s. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-16 09:38:13', '2020-09-16 09:38:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057063008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori called in and said that they still have not gotten any card digital or hard copy and Evan has a physical scheduled for tomorrow. They are a August 1 start date so they should honestly be getting the cards today or tomorrow. We were told they would be sent out and delivered by between the 11th-15th. I gave her Planstin''s phone number to call and see what is going on and if they could just send a digital copy now for him to use at his appointment. She was happy to hear what I told her and is going to call Planstin now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-16 09:24:13', '2020-09-16 09:24:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057045013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002494019', 'Peter Fredriksson', NULL, 'asked him to reschedule a welcome call he somehow scheduled for this Thursday.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-16 09:16:35', '2020-09-16 09:16:35'),
