  ('zcrm_1579374000057021049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '9-15-20 Shawna called late yesterday and apologized for basically hanging up on me earlier. I went through traditional options with her. Did scenarios with her income at $30K or $45K. Even with the $600 APTC at $30K income level she saw the light with how much better MCS memberships are. She''s not going to pursue traditional and wants information on MPB Carez Individual.  She works in people''s home and therefore can''t work right now, so she''s unemployed and husband is retired. So, MPB Carez Individual is option I described at $324/$1000. She has thyroid issue and takes levothyroxine and takes 6 days a week, not 7. Must takes meds since no longer has functional thyroid. Understands pre-x clause. Cobra is $500 possibly per week! Husband was going to verify. If so, she wants to switch quickly. She''s interested in genealogy and family lineage. Knows of 18th deadline. DOB 10/22/1959. Zip 80540 in Lyons, CO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-15 17:36:38', '2020-09-15 17:36:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057021038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165398', 'Andrew Hogan', NULL, '9-15-20 Andrew is planning to become member of Alpine Integrated Medicine - https://www.aim4healthnw.com/ which is a Concierge membership. It was almost sufficient for approval but they DO bill insurance which means they are not eligible for the DPC discounted rate since they don''t operate like a DPC. Andrew can still do the MPB Carez Connected LHS conversion for $317/$1000. He can find another DPC if he wishes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-15 16:58:02', '2020-09-15 17:01:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056987118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, 'Sent refund letter', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-15 14:21:21', '2020-09-15 14:21:21'),
