  ('zcrm_1579374000056987058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202060', 'Kristen Henry', NULL, 'I helped Kristen figure out how to get a flu shot, told her that I would double check with CirrusMD for her.  I told her that I would make a ticket and keep it open and let her know via email or phone when she can expect to use this.  She asked if we had a referral program, I told her that we do, and gave her all of the contact info for Analisa.  I told her there was a $100 per referral. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-15 11:27:49', '2020-09-15 11:27:49'),
