  ('zcrm_1579374000057021018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202060', 'Kristen Henry', NULL, 'Kristen called in and asked to speak to Kelly Cheever in regards to returning Kelly''s call from the other day, they are speaking now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-15 11:17:11', '2020-09-15 11:17:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057021013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, 'Liz called in and asked for the number for their preventative care provider Planstin. She said she still has not gotten any cards or anything yet. That is all she wanted was their phone number. I gave it to her and she said thank you and hung up. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-15 11:01:13', '2020-09-15 11:01:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057021008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, '9-15-20 Completed conversion from Sedera Access Assoc to MPB Care Worksite Conversion for Sedera members. They are DPC and Rod gave permission to move them with the group. She chose $1000/$492 for the EF.  I still need to find out if any wellness is included from Zion for DPC members.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-15 10:54:41', '2020-09-15 10:54:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000057021003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001950031', 'Eric Nehls', NULL, '9-15-20 Eric is only paying $299 for EC with LHS and he thinks perhaps should be paying $399 and going up to $499. He will wait to see what cost goes up to next month before he makes a decision.  His son Matthew and Eric are the only ones on the membership now. Matthew had shoulder surgery Jan. 10th for injury and has been given go ahead to keep playing. He knows of the pre-x clause and exception. Eric takes cholesterol meds now for precaution. He had done LHS Health coaching program and got off of blood pressure and cholesterol meds at that point. He knows of LHS super slow payments and difficulty in get answers from anyone. If paying $499 next month then he will consider the move. Also son will have his own job and ins next Sept. 2021 and Eric is close to Medicare in 1 1/2 years, so again may stay put.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-15 10:51:39', '2020-09-15 10:51:39'),
