  ('zcrm_1579374000056962037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001175486', 'Katharine (Katie) Armstrong', NULL, '9-14-20 Started talking last week and we got cut short. She wants to know pricing, etc. via email she sent.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-14 16:10:48', '2020-09-14 16:10:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056962029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, '9-14-20 Kathleen is pissed since they still haven''t received any Welcome Emails, Welcome Packets, etc. She did get set up with CirrusMD herself and then had trouble getting Alan set up and Alan had a health issue late on Friday that they wanted to use the Virtual Healthcare for. Looks like Kelly was able to help them and Kathleen is on the way to King Soopers now to pick up prescription. She didn''t want to call Concierge at this point to change where she''s getting the meds. I told her I''d find out about her Welcome information and let her know. I left a vm for Joan just now. Also, Kathleen is setting up a sleep study for possible sleep apnea. She learned from Kelly that an affordable rate is $1400 ish and she''s getting the cash price at $995. I also read the guidelines to her regarding sleep apnea which states testing and equipment are not shareable. She seemed ok with that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-14 15:52:40', '2020-09-14 15:54:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056954043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, 'Kelly F told me that she spoke to Snatam, so I called to help walk her through what she needs to do.  I told her that she could either reach out to me tomorrow and that I would explain the process and transfer her to Zion health OR she could call Zion for a helping hand. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-14 15:13:32', '2020-09-14 15:13:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056962018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '9-14-20 Shawna is 60 turning 61 in Oct. 2020. Husband is on Medicare and she has Cobra now with Aetna only for 1 month so far. She has thyroid condition and takes meds. She likes to go to the chiro. Likes having co-pays if possible since used to traditional group ins. She took another call when we were talking and we got disconnected. I called her back and left a vm and haven''t heard back from yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-14 15:12:08', '2020-09-14 15:38:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056962013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000965114', 'Birchann Martin', NULL, '9-14-20 Birchann is interested in converting to MPB Carez Connected for $1000/$267 possibly. She just left vm and asked for pricing. She is very interested in switching. We have meeting on Thursday at 9:00! She asked about STD and I mentioned Living Benefits. She has a NLG Living Benefits plan already with Trevor. She''s not thrilled with Trevor and wants to either get a new broker or cancel her policy. I left a vm for Mara to see what they do in these scenarios.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-14 14:59:53', '2020-09-14 15:37:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056968023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165420', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I have notified Sedera &amp; Redirect to cancel her.  I have also let Tricia know that she is cancelled as  she sent check in.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-14 14:35:34', '2020-09-14 14:35:34'),
