  ('zcrm_1579374000056956013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990490', 'Megan Clark', NULL, 'Megan called in and said that she called on Friday and needed to cancel her membership and  who ever she talked to said they would send it in a few minutes and it is now Monday and has not gotten anything. I checked the email section here and no one sent her a cancellation form and there is no note either from Friday 9/11/20. She stated she may not have called the right number. I sent her the cancellation email with the link to the form as we were on the phone and she waited until she got it which she did in 1 minute or less. She thanked me and that was all she needed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-14 13:45:21', '2020-09-14 13:45:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056968013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053968006', 'Michael Jones', NULL, 'New Plan eff 10/1/20: Member Only $1000 IUA 50-64 MPB CareZ Wkst', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-14 12:56:44', '2020-09-14 12:56:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056968008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'New Plan Member &amp; Sp 50-64 $5000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-14 12:32:12', '2020-09-14 12:32:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056968003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Received cancellation form for this member.  I emailed Sedera &amp; will set up in Admin 123 to be billed for 10/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-14 12:31:38', '2020-09-14 12:31:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056954038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871127', 'John Taylor', NULL, 'called to update payment- sent online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-14 12:01:27', '2020-09-14 12:01:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056956008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'Lori called in about her daughter Sara who has her own separate account with us, and she wanted to know about changing Sara''s banking info and I told her Patti can send her a form to do so, she said that is perfect. Next question was if Sara had chosen a MEC with her new conversion plan, I looked her up and she did not. Lastly she wanted to know the process of what to do for Sara having an issue with her knee. I told her that is injury/illness and she is to present herself as a cash pay and that will give her a cash discount and she ONLY pays her IUA of $1000. Anything after that she is to ask to be billed the rest and then she is to contact Zion and start a Need with them. She asked if she needs to only go to in network providers and I told her no she can go anywhere she wants. Last question in regards to that is if she is going to need a referral to do so and go to an orthopedics. I told her I was not 100% sure on that but my best guess would be yes and that if she has a primary car doctor she can get one from them. Lori thanked me very very much and said I was a great help to her. Sent her to Patti to discuss changing of the bank info. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-14 11:53:36', '2020-09-14 11:53:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056962003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '9-14-20 Tyler and wife are switching to MPB Carez Connected Liberty Conversion for $1000/$493. Wife had kidney stone removed in 2016 in Nepal. Nothing pre-x. Told him about limitations with wellness and must go in-network and virtual care likely must be in US to gain access.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-14 10:45:01', '2020-09-14 10:45:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056954033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816274', 'Karen Jones', NULL, 'Karen called in for some direction with her new plan.  I sent her a prescription med quote form and a new welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-14 10:10:27', '2020-09-14 10:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056954028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816274', 'Karen Jones', NULL, 'called in...missed call, left a vm. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-14 09:58:08', '2020-09-14 09:58:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056956003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881016', 'Michael Grace', NULL, 'Called into here at MPowering and asked specifically for Wendy. I tried transferring and it asked me for a password. Michele told me her phone is not set up yet. I gave Michael her direct line and he said that is the number he called and it put him straight to here, so I gave him her cell phone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-14 09:46:36', '2020-09-14 09:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056954023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043000021', 'Joseph DeGain', NULL, 'Joseph called in stating that his daughter went to see the gynecologist and the gynecologist thought that breast reduction would be  a good thing for his daughter because she suffers from so much back pain.  He wondered if this was a shared expense with Sedera, I told him that we had a member have that approved for Sedera for their daughter but I told him that every case is different but that the best thing to do would be to get some clear direction from Sedera on this for his own  peace of mind.  He already has a call in to Sedera and he thanked me for my help.  Sending him template on how to upload bills to Sedera portal. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-14 09:44:29', '2020-09-14 09:44:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056954018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043000021', 'Joseph DeGain', NULL, 'he called in- missed- called him back and left a message on his vm. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-14 09:37:15', '2020-09-14 09:37:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056954013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'I am helping him understand how to get a covered flu vaccine in network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-14 09:34:54', '2020-09-14 09:34:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056954008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009579103', 'Steven Meusel', NULL, 'Louise is still upset that she can''t log into HCBB yet, I sent her the "not being able to access services" template.  Unfortunately we are going to have to do the legwork for her while she waits for her information to process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-14 08:52:58', '2020-09-14 08:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056954003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055156043', 'Walt Brubaker', NULL, 'I got an email from Walt wondering how to start using our prescription help program, so I sent him a prescription form as well as a welcome call scheduler so that he can learn how to use his plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-14 08:50:22', '2020-09-14 08:50:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056932003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, 'helped the family get their Cirrus MD registrations situated over the weekend. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-12 15:21:11', '2020-09-12 15:21:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056912043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001042108', 'Mark Nowak', NULL, '09.11.20:  Recvd. email from Mark - wants to discuss Liberty conversion plan options.  Scheduled a Zoom call for Tuesday, 9.15.20 at 1 p.m.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-09-11 15:47:04', '2020-09-11 15:47:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056912038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006585051', 'Patricia (Trish) Cornish', NULL, '09.11.20:  Emailed Trish to confirm she would be enrolling in the new MPB CareZ Connected Worksite plan.  Recvd. email from Trish saying she has decided to cancel  MPB and original Liberty memberships and go direct.  I responded telling her she will be paying more for LHS alone than for our new program that offers virtual primary care and preventive care.  She has up to Dec. 1 to change her mind.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-09-11 15:45:08', '2020-09-11 15:45:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056917023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, '9-11-20 Faith called to better understand her new membership. She still has not received the Welcome Call email but she did find the Virtual Healthcare email once I told her the date it was sent. She will read through that and register and download the app. She''s getting rid of her ASi card and now keeping her MPowering Benefits card. She will call the Concierge about mammogram questions bc last time was referred to a different type of mammogram for dense breasts but it might not be covered. She will inquire with Dr. and Concierge. She thinks she''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-11 15:37:40', '2020-09-11 15:37:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056912033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005573199', 'Austin Hrycenko', NULL, 'Per John will refund this member 2 mos &amp; cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-11 14:23:36', '2020-09-11 14:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888307', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005573199', 'Austin Hrycenko', NULL, 'Sandra and Austin called in, Sandra was the one talking the whole time and Austin was listening while on speaker phone. Sandra said when I picked up the call that they used to have Liberty and the HES with us and when they called Liberty and asked about the $50 charge on their account from My Academy of Health Excellence, Liberty told them that we here have no right what so ever to take the $50 charge out of their account and that they found out we no longer work with Liberty for the last 3 years. I would not be able to handle a call like this when they are trying to say we have no right to take money out of their account. I told Patti exactly what was going on and what they said and she said this would be a call best for John. I put them over to John and he spoke with them and explained everything in detail about what the $50 charge incurs and what services come with that. He explained that is not that we don''t work with Liberty members it was that Liberty decided to take away all outside sales and marketing vendors and we were one of them. Sandra and Austin was just not having it and did not like what John had to say. He explained that just because they have not chosen to use the services with us for the $50 does NOT mean we just stop payments. We can not tell if a member uses the services, that is on them. John asked what they would like him to do for them and they said they want every penny back that we have "taken without permission" since they started in Jan 1 2017. That is absolutely NOT possible and ludicrous. That was not said to them, but John said the best we can do is cancel the membership and refund them 2 months at the MOST. They did not like that at all and Sandra was just complaining and pretty much yelling at John. He said he is sorry but when we get the payment it gets spread out to third party vendors and we can not ask them for the money back, it just does not work that way. Again they did not like that but that is all John said he could do, nothing more. They eventually said fine and to cancel right away and refund the 2 months offered. John let Patti know to do this ASAP. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-11 14:20:51', '2020-09-11 14:20:51'),
