  ('zcrm_1579374000056912028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'I finally got an answer for Vanessa on this one.  Member ahd a need that had to be wound up at sedera , however didn''t get conversion form in til 8/27.  This would be a 10/1 start w/Zion.  I have directed Vanessa to tell them to fill out cancellation form (which I will send) and submit another Conversion for with plan details and we will process internally.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-11 12:16:09', '2020-09-11 12:16:09'),
