  ('zcrm_1579374000056912023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521636', 'Aaron Clawitter', NULL, 'Spoke with.Member and he had a need that he had to wind up with Sedera so apparently he was directed by Ron to email the admin email when he wanted to change.  This was of course missed.  I told him to go into Conversion cognito forms and fill out what he wants w/Zion and I will send him the Payment Update form so we can start getting automatic Payments and get him away from sending a check in.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-11 11:32:35', '2020-09-11 11:32:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041599111', 'Matthew Vendetti', NULL, 'Kelsey called in and said that she is going to be undergoing fertility treatments and wanted to know if any of that is covered under her plan. This was a first for me of being asked that so I asked Patti if any of that is and she said no because it is extremely expensive. I let Kelsey know this and she said that is fine but then asked if she gets pregnant from that if that part is covered or not. I did not want to keep going back and forth with Patti so I just put the call to her. Yes if she gets pregnant that will be something that is shared with Sedera as a regular need. Kelsey was happy to hear that and that is all she needed to know. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-11 11:30:49', '2020-09-11 11:30:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056906018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271339', 'Christina KUB', NULL, '9-10-20 Called Chrys bc Redirect told her she wasn''t protected for any specialists which made her panic and she sent me an email. I called her and explained the different companies and who does what. She just needs to see an eye dr for a cyst on her eyelid that she needs removed. I reminded her that her IUA is $2500 and if the cost exceeds $2500 they that''s when the costs are shared for any eligible item. She was relieved and thankful for the call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-11 11:19:58', '2020-09-11 11:19:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056906013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833209', 'KayLynn Hanson', NULL, '9-11-20 Spoke with Dr. Carl Hanson who is already on Medicare. Wife KayLynn doesn''t have any pre-x. Carl feels like LHS gives more freedom since not limited to a network for wellness and wellness is more inclusive. He believes the provider is the one that takes the brunt of LHS delayed payments. But, I told him the client I just spoke with is still waiting to be reimbursed $20K from 2 ER visits. He was surprised to hear that. He will ponder and discuss with wife. MPB Carez Connected for LHS Conversions is best price and most inclusive. He''s willing to pay for the blood work for annual wellness once I gave him price of MPB Carez with MEC. Connected option is most appealing to him now and he knows Oct. 20th is final deadline for the switch.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-11 11:10:20', '2020-09-11 11:10:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056875018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833045', 'John Mendocha', NULL, 'Spoke to John..He is very interested..  Sent him conversion email and quote', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-09-11 11:10:09', '2020-09-11 11:10:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056906008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '9-11-20 Janet wants to switch as soon as she gets reimbursed from LHS. She''s owed $20K from 2 ER visits. They did all sorts of tests including brain scan, heart tests, etc. and everything turned out clear. She''s hoping to be paid by Nov. which is 180 days past her incident. She knows the special pre-x clause will go away after Nov. 1st start date. She''s super pissed at LHS and excited to change memberships. She said they now have religious music and talking when she''s stuck on hold for 45 min. telling her to pray. It''s horrible she said.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-11 10:48:50', '2020-09-11 10:48:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056917013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141488', 'Evian Hanshaw', NULL, 'I helped Evian through the needs process, as well as second MD, she was worried that she wouldn''t be able to use the doctor that she wanted for a knee injury.  I told her that she could go to whomever she wanted.  I sent Sedera''s need sharing instructions to her.  She knows that she can get help finding the best price on an MRI from us if it is needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-11 10:45:05', '2020-09-11 10:45:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056917008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141488', 'Evian Hanshaw', NULL, 'came through as a missed call- I called her back and left a message. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-11 10:34:20', '2020-09-11 10:34:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716875', 'Cynthia Hunt', NULL, 'Cynthia called in and asked to be transferred to Patti I did so and she wanted to know why the card she was sent from Zion said Co-pay. Patti let her know the deal and that everyone got sent the wrong cards and that she does NOT have a co-pay and that the correct cards should be getting to her very shortly. Cynthia was ok with that because her appointment is not until a month from now and she should 100% have the correct card by then. I told Patti to get the providers name so I can make sure they are still in the PHCS network before she goes. I looked it up and her provider IS in the network so she is good to go for that. Patti also told her to please please register for CirrusMD because she can use that for practically anything and it is a great service. The one thing that Cynthia asked if CirrusMD would be able to do of course it was something they can not. She needs her maintenance medication for high blood pressure I believe needs to be refilled. That is something that she will need to have blood work done to be refilled, but anything else she can use Cirrus for, as in if she has a cold, or sick with anything along those lines,ect.. she is good to use CirrusMD for. I sent her another email with the link to register again and in that email let her know that her provider is all set in the PHCS network and she is good to go to use her. I also let her know that Patti did not know to let members know if they ask about the wrong copay card that was sent that people can still use the card if need  be. All the info on there is correct except the word copay, but her group ID number is going to be the same and everything else. So if need be and can not reschedule or wait for her appointment she can present the card. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-11 09:43:01', '2020-09-11 09:43:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056917003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925142', 'Kelly Schest', NULL, 'I spoke to Kelly about the ticket she had open,  her finding a Covid Test.  She was more concerned about where the hard copies of her cards were from Planstin and Zion- I reached out to Zion and they told me that the cards were sent on Aug 11th and that she should get them any day now.  I emailed Kelly that information. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-11 09:33:01', '2020-09-11 09:33:01'),
