  ('zcrm_1579374000056872047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808067', 'Elisa Gustafson', NULL, '9-10-20 Rodney is interested. I answered some questions and he will review the link next and call me with questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-10 15:41:58', '2020-09-10 15:41:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056872042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '9-10-20 Suzanne wants help with setting up ongoing payments with Bright Health. I just left her a vm and suggested she call Bright Health directly. She only has about 7-10 more days to do so according to her vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-10 14:54:03', '2020-09-10 14:54:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056872034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667149', 'Tonya Cauduro', NULL, '9-10-20 Determined Dr. Jordan Pastorek is in PHCS network which means other doctors in practice are in network. Called office to check. Enrolling now in MPB Carez Connected Worksite no DPC for LHS Conversion $317/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-10 14:06:14', '2020-09-10 14:06:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056892008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, 'Sales IQ chat attached. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-10 13:57:20', '2020-09-10 13:57:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056872029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056687112', 'Sydney Greenwood', NULL, '9-10-20 Bright Health Rep just called to obtain proof of SEP for Sydney.  I left vm and sent email to give her instructions to upload/send proof of SEP. Must send it to Underwriting@BrightHealthPlan.com and upload to C4 Docs section showing proof of loss of insurance due to job loss.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-10 13:36:36', '2020-09-10 14:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, 'Member will age up into 60 age band.  I will send email and adjust price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-10 13:06:23', '2020-09-10 13:06:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286020', 'Anthony Carmola', NULL, 'Elyse, Anthony''s mother called in and asked what and where she needs to submit her son''s, or him submit, his bills for a Jaw surgery he just had that was an emergency. I told her that before any type of surgery is done that there is a process they have to go through for it to be shared by Sedera. I told her how the Need''s process works and that he is to present himself as a cash pay and ONLY pays his IUA amount out of pocket of $500. Everything after that is to be submitted into Sedera and he is to open up a Need with them. If there is surgery involved there is a whole other process that needs to be done with Sedera called 2ndMD. I said that has to be done BEFORE the surgery or Sedera will not share it, to my knowledge. I told her that they need to contact Sedera ASAP!! She though she was talking to Sedera this whole time. I let her know that she called MPowering Benefits and I gave her Sedera''s phone number and I told her what to say when she calls and they will know exactly what to do and where to send her. She sounded very panicked after I told her all of this. She really wanted to get off the phone and speak to them. This is now out of our hands. If she or him calls in again I will let them know this and that this is all through Sedera now not us. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-10 12:32:32', '2020-09-10 12:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Member will be aging up to the 60 age band I will email and change pricing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-10 12:31:29', '2020-09-10 12:31:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056872021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, '9-10-20 Kristy wants to move from DPC Assoc with Sedera to MPB Carez Worksite DPC via Conversion option. Spoke with Rod for permission to use the conversion app for this one family. Price is $492 EF/ $1000 IUA for all age groups. This will be cheaper for them and allow them to lower their IUA from $2500 to $1000 since we don''t know when the renewal will take place with Sedera Access Plus. Find out if ANY wellness is included in this DPC membership via Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-10 12:22:21', '2020-09-10 12:27:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003158023', 'Lorene Cecilia', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 50-59 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-10 12:21:13', '2020-09-10 12:21:13'),
