  ('zcrm_1579374000056888018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029266240', 'Diane Kelly-Lokocz', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1500 IUA 40-49 PSD + Tobacco', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-10 12:10:10', '2020-09-10 12:10:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029266240', 'Diane Kelly-Lokocz', NULL, 'Member will age up into the 40 age band.  I will email &amp; change pricing in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-10 12:03:01', '2020-09-10 12:03:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391005', 'John Colver', NULL, 'John called in and said that he got his bill from May from his providers office when he had his annual wellness visit. I made sure the provider was on the PHCS List and he said yes that he presented his RCI card like he was told. So I let him know to just call his provider and let them know that they have to send the billing in to the P.O. Box address that is on the back of his RCI card. He had it handy while we were on the phone and confirmed everything I was saying. He 100% understood what I told him and he said it''s been this way since May trying to get his provider to bill RCI and not him. I told him if it is still an issue to email my the bill he got and I will try and send it over to someone at RCI on his behalf. He also asked if while I was at it if I could send him an update list of providers in his area. I said of course and sent him 2 different lists since the first on for GP''s only had 2 results in a 50 mile radius, so I sent him the GP list up to 100 miles because it gave me more results and an Internist list up to 100 miles that gave me 134 results! I am sure he will be thrilled to see that. He was so so so happy with everything I told him and was very happy that I confirmed with him that the billing from the preventative services is to be sent to the p.o box address for RCI. He was a very sweet and happy guy. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-10 11:59:36', '2020-09-10 11:59:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056892003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, 'she called in just making sure she was taking all of the right steps with her medical need and biopsy.  She told me that she was going to call Sedera later today about the process and 2nd MD. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-10 11:56:44', '2020-09-10 11:56:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056888003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044764041', 'Ryne Cooper', NULL, 'Member will be aging up to the 30 age band I will email and adjust pricing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-10 11:42:31', '2020-09-10 11:42:31');
