  ('zcrm_1579374000056885006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003296009', 'George Scott Davis', NULL, '09.10.20:  Called Scott.  He said he had a double pulmonary embolism last April and was hospitalized.  In the process of resolving pricing for need with Liberty.  Not going to convert at this point.  Happy w/Liberty so far.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-09-10 11:07:51', '2020-09-10 11:07:51'),
