  ('zcrm_1579374000056843033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678097', 'Steve Gamelin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member stated he is still not set up with CirrusMd  his info is not in system yet. He is calling concierge to check into it. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-09-10 08:57:44', '2020-09-10 08:57:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056847046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056506083', 'Camela Montana', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA MPB CareZ Ind', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-10 08:48:43', '2020-09-10 08:48:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056847041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056784001', 'Bartholomew Vermilya', NULL, 'New Plan:Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA MPB CareZ Wkst w/MEC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-10 08:39:58', '2020-09-10 08:39:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056859013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, 'Julie emailed me anxious that she and her son still do not have access to CirrusMD, I told her that we were doing everything we could to get all of our members into the system so that they can gain access. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-10 08:31:40', '2020-09-10 08:31:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056853008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006585051', 'Patricia (Trish) Cornish', NULL, '09.10.20:  Called Trish to discuss new Liberty plan conversion options. Told her to review the conversion site and I can help her with enrollment.   She will do conversion either today or tomorrow.  She just moved from Delray to the Panhandle area and gave me her new address.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-09-10 08:15:28', '2020-09-10 08:58:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056859008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, 'I helped Meghan narrow down an orthopedist for her knee.  HCBB and healthgrades verified.  I went over the entire needs process, directed her to zionhealth.org to upload the bills. Gave her a price of a fair price to expect at her first visit. I tagged Wendy to let her know what I was doing for the member, Meghan emailed me back to say that she found it all very helpful. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-10 07:28:31', '2020-09-10 07:28:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056859003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539007', 'Kris Srnka', NULL, 'Kris emailed in confused about the Cirrus registration reminder we sent out.  I confirmed on the Cirrus site that she was in fact already registered and emailed her back that information, telling her to disregard the reminder. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-10 07:21:11', '2020-09-10 07:21:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056847036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056904243', 'Samantha Camerino', NULL, '9-9-20 Dan was browsing our old site with old plans and was confused by all of the options. I sent him to Wendy.MPB.Health to help him see the membership we discussed. He''s interested in the MPB Carez Worksite with MEC for wellness and HSA compliance. We are talking tomorrow to enroll. $1000/$536.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-09 16:49:10', '2020-09-09 16:49:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056847028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659334', 'Kaye Reich', NULL, '9-9-20 Kaye called bc she''s concerned about all of the problems that have taken place since the conversion such as sent the wrong cards and still hasn''t received the corrected new cards yet, the wacky billing which she nows sees is all caught up and accurate and also I sent her the email about needing to stay in network for the MEC of which she didn''t include. She will ignore that email. She feels better after talking with me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-09 15:35:35', '2020-09-09 15:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056840023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, 'helped Kathleen research cost of sleep study in her area and sent her all of the info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-09 15:19:57', '2020-09-09 15:19:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056847023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '9-8-20 Carolyn is considering moving from LHS to MPB Carez Connected. She might have mold intoxification and sees a Functional Medicine doctor. She might need cognitive testing and to possibly see a neuropsychologist. She knows much of that may not be shareable since psychologists are not included in sharing. She has had trouble with reimbursements from LHS and had to just pay the bills herself to avoid being sent to collections. Price with LHS will be $499 and with MPB Carez Connected at $1000/$593. Sent her the email with the ChangeMyLiberty.com link and information. She didn''t receive it initially. Looks like I missed her on the email list. She knows of the 9/20 and 10/20 deadlines.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-09 15:04:23', '2020-09-09 15:04:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056840018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881640', 'Meghan Grabow', NULL, 'Meghan came through as a missed call, I called her back.  VM full. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-09 14:14:26', '2020-09-09 14:14:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056822150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056784001', 'Bartholomew Vermilya', NULL, 'Mike asked me to contact member because he had questions.  Turns out he was under the impression that he was enrolling in the Partially Self Directed plan compatible w/HSA.  I had mike contact him to tell him only option for him would be Zion Wkst plan. Member agreed so I will cancel in Sedera &amp; re-enroll him', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-09 14:11:57', '2020-09-09 14:11:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056843028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295052', 'Susan Hodson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-09-09 13:47:13', '2020-09-09 13:47:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056853003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, 'Kathleen called in and said that they still have not gotten anything with any information on how their plan works or any cards yet either. I looked her up and said she is a Sept. 1st start date and that she should be getting everything in the mail and email by the 11th and 15th of the month. She was a little frustrated with that because she said she is trying to plan out appointments that she needs to make and these places she is calling asks what her "insurance info" is and she doesn''t know what to tell them. I told her I understand and that there is about 500 other people in this conversion and it can take a little bit to get every single person in the system, but not to worry and to expect info very shortly. She was not happy with my answer but she thanked me anyway and hung up. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-09 13:10:11', '2020-09-09 13:10:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056847018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001245005', 'Linda Nelson', NULL, '9-9-20 Linda started off wanting the most catastrophic membership at the $5000 IUA until she completely understood how it works. She has a possible degenerative neck issue or Meniere''s disease. Two drs. disagree on what is causing her issues. So, the LHS conversion option with MPB Carez Connected Worksite will be best for the pre-x clause. $1000/$317. This way she can also get her thermogram done with pre-approval which is what she wants and she can do her pap screening but will need to be in network and likely not able to see her naturopath for that. We have an appointment next Tuesday to complete app after they look through the ChangeMyLiberty.com site. Planning to enroll for Oct. 1st to avoid the $399 new charge from LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-09 13:09:43', '2020-09-09 13:09:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056822145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056784001', 'Bartholomew Vermilya', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $2500 IUA MPB Direct Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-09 12:56:51', '2020-09-09 12:56:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056843023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003296009', 'George Scott Davis', NULL, '09.09.20:  Emailed Scott re: Liberty price increase and MPB plan options.  Received email from Scott.  Wants to discuss options tomorrow w/a call between 11 am and 1 pm.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-09-09 12:54:20', '2020-09-10 11:05:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056843018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116389', 'Katherin Khidirian', NULL, '09.09.20:  Emailed Katherin re: Liberty price increase and MPB plan options.  No response.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-09-09 12:33:14', '2021-01-28 12:51:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056843013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001042108', 'Mark Nowak', NULL, '09.09.20:  Emailed Mark re:  Liberty price increase and MPB plan options.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-09-09 12:20:30', '2020-09-09 12:20:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056847013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001853007', 'Scott Swannie', NULL, '9-9-20 Monica is 52 now and Scott is 56. Scott is self-employed and Monica is retired. They are LHS clients now but already met their AUA for the year with renewal March 1st 2021. Wants to move at that point. They had major challenges getting reimbursed for colonoscopy bc removed polyps, etc. Looking at MPB Carez Worksite for $1000/$636. Also has Aflac for backup.  She''s putting on her calendar to contact me at end of Jan. for March 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-09 12:15:49', '2020-09-09 12:15:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056840013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, '-Sent Virtual Healthcare Reminder 
