  ('zcrm_1579374000056822122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056506070', 'David Mitchell', NULL, 'Spoke to David will call back next week to change', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-09-09 11:33:35', '2020-09-09 11:34:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056847008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645357', 'Karen Haywood', NULL, '9-9-20 Karen is Renae Einspahr''s sister. Karen is with LHS as well and is converting through our system. She was not our client until now. She is turning 63 this month of Sept. 2020. Her husband is on Medicare already. She is healthy. Just has some small bills to submit to LHS still. She has glaucoma and sees eye doctor on occasion. She knows she will pay for those visits as pre-x. Told her the pre-x clause. She''s choosing MPB Carez Connected Worksite LHS Conversion $1000/$317. App complete!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-09 11:33:08', '2020-09-10 10:13:54'),
