  ('zcrm_1579374000056840003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678097', 'Steve Gamelin', NULL, 'Steve called Jan asking what was going on with his plan, he hadn''t received anything yet.  He was particularly concerned about getting onto CirrusMD.  I registered him and he got the email.  I went over briefly what the plan has for him and set up a welcome call with Vanessa tomorrow at 10:15.  I called Jan back to let her know that he was all taken care of. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-09 10:04:06', '2020-09-09 10:04:06'),
