  ('zcrm_1579374000056788050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808040', 'Thomas DeAngelis', NULL, '9-8-20 Thom wants an HSA compliant version so I quoted him MPB Carez Worksite with MEC. He wants to spend as little as possible though. We''ll see. He found Zion directly before.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-08 17:46:58', '2020-09-08 17:46:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056788018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013427005', 'Amber Schorie', NULL, '9-8-20 I called and gave Amber Jane''s work #. Jane is taking over Don''s clients. I''ll text Jane as well. Amber was fine with talking to Jane.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-08 17:15:53', '2020-09-08 17:15:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056788013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '9-8-20 Martha is trying to decide between MPB Carez Connected $1000/$897, MPB Carez Worksite $796.50 no MEC bc limited PHCS network or MPB Secure $910/$1500 due to no network restrictions in Aspen Area. She wants to keep her doctor and do her mammogram. It cost her $1000 last time. If she chooses MPB Carez Connected she will have to pay difference of $400.  She will run the #''s and figure out what makes sense.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-08 16:41:04', '2020-09-08 16:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056780054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013427005', 'Amber Schorie', NULL, 'Amber Schorie called in upset that she called in a week ago about her conversion and was told that someone would give her a call.  I explained, that although I didn''t have any notes in our system it would be best to call Don Croyle or Wendy Scipione.   I gave her their contact information and apologized. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-08 15:38:47', '2020-09-08 15:38:47'),
