  ('zcrm_1579374000056780041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012791050', 'Phillip Mauger', NULL, 'called to ask what CirrusMD was for....I reminded him that during the welcome call he told me that he wasn''''t going to use it but rather the Teladoc that he provides his employees.  He thanked me for the clarification. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-08 15:14:47', '2020-09-08 15:14:47'),
