  ('zcrm_1579374000056796003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003577005', 'Deidre Barshon', NULL, 'member inquired to switch has a list of Pre-Exsisitng.  Advised her to stay with Liberty', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-09-08 12:33:10', '2020-09-08 12:33:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056795003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003577005', 'Deidre Barshon', NULL, 'Deidre called and said that she got our email about Liberty raising their rates and how we are offering a different plan that would be lower than what Liberty is doing. She wanted a few examples of what we have and how we work before I put her back to Micheal. She asked many questions. She also asked about pre-existing conditions and how that works with us. I told her I was not too familiar  with how that works with Zion and what not and I did not want to give her the wrong answer or the wrong impression. I told her that Micheal who sent out the email and is our inside sales rep would be the one she needs to sit down with and talk to. She was very nice but she let me know she has a list of pre-existing condition''s and if that type of stuff is not covered its a deal breaker. So I do not think she will take the offer we have, not just because of that but because the only plan we are offering the Liberty people does not come with a MEC and when I asked her is Preventative is important to her and her family she said yes, so we shall see what happens when she talks to Micheal. I sent her back to him and he is speaking with her now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-08 12:31:40', '2020-09-08 12:31:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056780031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202060', 'Kristen Henry', NULL, 'her information was not found when she tried to register with CirrusMD.   Opened a ticket from John. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-08 12:30:27', '2020-09-08 12:30:27'),
