  ('zcrm_1579374000056780013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, 'Snatam called in confused as to what the email I sent meant to her.  She was confused as to the differences between Zion/Planstin/and MPB.Health.  So, I took the time to explain all of it to her, and told her that I had spoken to Joan, and that Joan thought it would be the best course of action if Snatam called Zion in regards to the hospital waiver.  I gave Snatam Zion''s information again.  This was for a medical need in regards to some ear issues her husband has been dealing with.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-08 10:44:11', '2020-09-08 10:45:12'),
