  ('zcrm_1579374000056769028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013453097', 'Jose j De La Cerda', NULL, 'Member called in after hours to update his credit card.  I left a VM with this member to tell him to contact Darius to make a choice in plans.  I also sent him out Payment update form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-08 10:19:24', '2020-09-08 10:19:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056780008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, 'Felicia wrote in for help with a bill, she also involved Kareen from ASI.  This is what Kareen had to say- We are not able to send this claim for pricing.  In order to send it the claim must contain the diagnosis code.  If the provider can give you that information or if they can bill us directly their bill would have all of the information that we would need.

 KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-08 10:19:09', '2020-09-08 10:19:09'),
