  ('zcrm_1579374000056769018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049974139', 'Jennifer Lucas', NULL, 'this member called into the Concierge very upset because she told us that she made it clear to her advisor that she needed Preventative.  I contacted Dan and he told me it was over a couple of meeting he presented it that this was the price and for a certain amount more you could get Preventative.  Their clearly was a misunderstanding.  He will contact member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-08 10:01:33', '2020-09-08 10:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056780003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779188', 'Jason LaPointe', NULL, 'sent Wendy an email telling her when to expect her cards, I asked that she not use her preventative care services until her card arrives.  And to submit injury/illness bills to Zionhealth.org. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-08 09:19:49', '2020-09-08 09:19:49'),
