  ('zcrm_1579374000056716033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626180', 'Timothy Meisch', NULL, 'called to make sure that they were in the system.  I told them that they were, and that they should expect their zion and Planstin cards between the 11th and 15th of the month.  I also went over instructions on what they should do if they do get sick and need to submit bills. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-04 15:01:41', '2020-09-04 15:01:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056719008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013016', 'Tranquilino Padilla', NULL, 'Tranquilino called in and asked what he is supposed to do with a bill he got for $135 for an incident with his knee. He thinks he blew it out and might need some form of surgery in the future. I explained how everything works with his plan, YET AGAIN, how Redirect works and that is always his first point of contact with anything medical. He said he has never heard that before . I also then explained how injury/illness works because of the type of incident he is dealing with right now. I told him his IUA and how is to be a cash paying patient up to $2500 and then anything after that he is to contact Sedera and open up a Need with them. He then said Oh wow I have been with you guys for years and this is the first I am hearing this. No it is not, he calls into here every single time something happens and I tell him this over and over and over again constantly. He has no clue and never ever remembers anything about all of this when it is told to him. After I explained the 2nd time about paying out of pocket for that bill he said ok I understand and that was that. He said thank you and the call ended.  I am going to send him a Welcome Call Scheduler because he really needs to have another one and have someone sit down with him and explain how his plan works yet again. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-04 14:36:53', '2020-09-04 14:36:53'),
