  ('zcrm_1579374000056693003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078004', 'Jason Scheier', NULL, 'Question?   Why have I only been paid $6.35/mo commission on this case?', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2020-09-03 18:22:14', '2020-09-03 18:22:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056683095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056687112', 'Sydney Greenwood', NULL, '9-3-20 She wants to keep Dr. Tracy Lee Jones who is only showing up in Bright Health and Oscar. She''s choosing Bright Health Silver 2 with no ded and $2600 mop.  Income is at $24K and gets a $154.64 APTC.  Her cost is $123.70.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 17:27:45', '2020-09-03 17:27:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056683090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881015', 'Manson Root', NULL, '9-3-20 Wife is from Taiwan and he sought some care there and it was high quality and cheap. He''s going to move to MPB Carez Connected Worksite No DPC. They are both healthy, no pre-x. He is going to have a cyst removed soon for $1016. He could get $16 reimbursed if he wants with this. He''s choosing $1000/$593. He''ll complete app on his own and told him how to cancel LHS. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 16:52:36', '2020-09-03 16:52:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056683085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056687112', 'Sydney Greenwood', NULL, '9-3-20 Sydney is Keith Jordano''s client but she''s in CO and needs traditional insurance with APTC, so he sent her to me. Lost insurance bc lost job. Keith picked out Cigna Silver $2500 EPO. Income was $27K before but now it''s $24K with unemployment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 16:22:01', '2020-09-03 16:22:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056683069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165396', 'Fabio (Gus) Pernetz', NULL, '9-3-20 Gus has no pre-x and is choosing MPB Carez Connected Worksite no DPC $1000/$317. He planning to live in Mexico this winter and not coaching. Wants to stay outdoors as much as possible and just work remotely. He''ll be in Baja near his dad and with his girlfriend. Still working with Sprongo and Stryd.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 15:28:18', '2020-09-03 15:39:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056683064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, '9-3-20 Alan called to inquire about the Welcome email he hasn''t received. I talked with Joan and learned of the newest technical glitch that is causing the delay. It will be sent as soon as possible. He has been charged already as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 15:08:25', '2020-09-03 15:08:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056683059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, '9-3-20 Since we didn''t charge her on time on the 20th of the month, she no longer has $344 to pay now and again on the 20th of Sept. She may revisit this the first of the year when her finances are better or possibly sooner.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 15:00:54', '2020-09-03 15:00:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056674043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003748040', 'Natalie Lampert', NULL, 'Natalie reached out to me on sales IQ very confused as to where she needed to upload a need with Zion, so I have her the Zion link for needs request.  She also had questions on getting Covid testing, I sent her many links for free tests in her area, she was happy about that but wanted to get tested right away.  I told her that if she couldn''t wait a day or two then it would be an out of pocket expense. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-03 14:52:28', '2020-09-03 14:52:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056683054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544313', 'Anu Lawrence', NULL, '9-3-20 Anu is healthy, no pre-x. Just converted from LHS to MPB Carez Connected Worksite for $267/$1000. Told him how to cancel with LHS also and had him update his address to his new Denver area address via the Cognito form. He''s all set now. He will also send 2 employees my way. He''s paying $200 towards their healthcare now. We could set them up as a group or as Individuals. Individuals might be easier for accounting/payment purposes with how he''s paying them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 14:32:11', '2020-09-03 14:32:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056663148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, 'This member was billed twice in FTNI for wrong amount.  Then right amount for August.  I will refund 2 pmts that were wrong and bill new amount to reflect correct amount for 9/1/2020 out of Admin 123 ($531)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-03 14:18:41', '2020-09-03 14:21:27'),
