  ('zcrm_1579374000056683049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002019001', 'Alexandra LeGrant', NULL, '9-3-20 Alexandra 34 is joining and adding her husband who is 40. He was not part of LHS. Since he''s the oldest I had her put him as the primary member. Looks like she''s now Alexandra Giffin as well, no longer LeGrant. She enrolled as ES MPB Carez Connected Worksite LHS Conversion for $493/$1000. No pre-x, healthy, didn''t even go to Dr. once last year. They mtn bike, ski, ect. Young and healthy and curious about maternity as well. I explained how that works. She''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 13:47:19', '2020-09-03 13:47:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056674033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'David called in confused as to where he was supposed to submit medical bills for his knee.  He went to the doctor on July 29, he got an MRI done in Aug.  Patti told him to submit the need to Zion for bills after Aug 1, the initial dr visit will be out of pocket. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-03 12:41:46', '2020-09-03 12:41:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056663128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'Call was transferred to me from Kelly C, this member had issues with his knee and went to a provider on 7/29.  Provider ordered MRI which was done in Aug.  He had questions about who would be responsible for this scenario.  I told him since Dr visit was $125 it would be out of pocket and that any further expenses would have to be submitted to Zion.  Advised him to open a need.  I also advised him of the $25k Pre-Ex limitation in the 1st year.  -PB', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-03 12:34:54', '2020-09-23 12:17:47'),
