  ('zcrm_1579374000056683033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '9-3-20 Traci is healthy, no pre-x, no health issues and same for Remi (F). Rich is on his own membership now. McCall may want to join this also but as independent.  Payton already has her own membership with SDHC. Traci is choosing MPB Care Connected Worksite LHS conversion at $1000/$596 EC. We had challenges with the app and got John on the phone to do a screen share and help with completing it successfully. Traci will let me know next week if McCall needs to be on her own membership as well. She''s waiting on employment info and possible coverage.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 11:56:39', '2020-09-03 12:24:51'),
