  ('zcrm_1579374000056683003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676887', 'James Chambers', NULL, '9-3-20 Talked with Jim and Deanna about possibly converting. Their price is $100 cheaper per couple at the $1000 IUA level or $19 at the $2500 with LHS. They don''t seem super eager to switch, but he did ask about possibly promoting this as well. No longer has health ins license. They will keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-03 10:23:46', '2020-09-03 10:23:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056674013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330064', 'Diane VanWeelden', NULL, 'called into our answering service and I left voicemail. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-03 10:20:52', '2020-09-03 10:20:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056671013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740011', 'Kathleen VanGoethem', NULL, 'Kathy called because she got a few emails about her digital card that was sent from planstin and then another email that said it was incorrect. She was a little worried. I let her know that the new cards are on the way but she can still use that digital card that was sent, it just had the incorrect plan name but she can still use it. I explained the whole process on what she needs to do for making preventative appointments. I told her it works exactly the same as her old plan with ASi and Sedera just its different companies now. Providers have to be in the PHCS Network and she just has to show her card and make sure everything is preventative only and the billing is coded as such. I looked up 2 providers for her for her woman''s well visit and her regular wellness visit. Both providers are in the network so she is all set. I sent her the email to look up providers for future reference. She was a lot more comfortable after I went over everything with her and let her know that everything is exactly the same as her old plan with ASi. She said that makes a lot more sense now. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-03 10:11:01', '2020-09-03 10:11:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056663008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, 'I left a VM for Sara''s father Rodney, to get contact # &amp; Pmt info and to verify her address.  We will also need Pmt info to Charge Sara for Aug &amp; Sept pmts.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-03 10:06:29', '2020-09-03 10:06:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056678003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, '- Cindy called to say she never recieved email
- Resent original email  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-09-03 09:56:05', '2020-09-03 09:56:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056671008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257594', 'Emily Taylor', NULL, 'Emily called to see what she needs to do to have her yearly pap smear and woman''s wellness visit. I explained everything to her about making sure the provider is in the PHCS Network, to have her RCI card and I explained what she needs to do with that card and sent an email explaining so as well, and to really stress to the provider that her appt. is preventative only and the billing needs to be coded as such. As we were speaking she got her RCI card and was already on the multiplan website to look up providers. I let her know that I will send the email that explains how to navigate the website because there are certain buttons she has to click to get to the right search page. She understood everything and was very happy for the help and she said everything was understandable and easy to navigate. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-03 09:53:50', '2020-09-03 09:53:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056674008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044265014', 'Rebecca Rechtman', NULL, 'I sent Paige the best I could to answer her questions about a $75 dollar dermatologist fee (no such thing) and submitting bills to Sedera.  I told her that she could give me a call if she needed more explanation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-03 09:27:46', '2020-09-03 09:27:46'),
