  ('zcrm_1579374000056618074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165322', 'Suzy OBanion', NULL, '9-2-20 Suzy and Noah married in 2016. Noah is 35 and Suzy 56 as of 2020. They moved to Steuben just recently. Going to look into Medicaid now and looking to get jobs 3-4 days week for each of them and earn $40K-$50K total. She will look into Healthcare.gov for subsidy when they know their income. I explained MPB Carez for Individuals in case their income is too high for decent subsidy. $576/$1000 ES. No health issues or pre-x.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 17:03:49', '2020-09-02 17:03:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056618069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165322', 'Suzy OBanion', NULL, '9-2-20 Suzy just moved to ME and is covered with Bright Health until end of Sept. She''s wondering if I have any options in ME. I left her a vm and told her I can possibly help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 16:41:12', '2020-09-02 16:41:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056618056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, '9-2-20 Enrolling now in MPB Carez with MEC Worksite $1000/$731.50. OOPS! She realized she wants to hold off for a Nov. 1st start date. She wants to wait for her employer to kick them off her current ins first and then will call me before Oct. 20th the enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 16:18:45', '2020-09-02 16:27:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056618048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502073', 'Bruce Wildman', NULL, '9-2-20 Bruce wanted to understand which membership he''s on Access vs Access +. Then he found pricing and wants to understand difference in price of $220 on Sedera vs $245 he''s paying. Told him he''s on Access now and will be moved to Access + sometime soon with possible price changes. He also wanted to understand value add for additional cost. BUT, he had friends in the cell phone biz who helped grow a company. Once the company reached a certain level they cut out the sales team and put them out of jobs. So, he understands the value of MPB in that sense as well and is hoping Sedera isn''t putting us out of biz. He was very appreciative of my time and will wait to hear if any changes are to be made.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 16:08:46', '2020-09-02 16:09:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056618043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056638001', 'Emily Bennett', NULL, '9-2-20 She called back and apologized profusely for the delayed return of call. They decided they will stay with LHS bc they can''t afford a higher monthly amount. She''s well aware of the problems with reimbursing. Sounds like she''s learned how to get them to pay and is willing to deal with the struggle. She will keep my information if their finances change.  She was thankful for my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 15:49:54', '2020-09-02 15:49:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056618038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '9-2-20 Want to know the cost of MEC and to add it but they haven''t been able to show proof of self employment yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 15:45:45', '2020-09-02 15:45:45'),
