  ('zcrm_1579374000056618028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, '9-2-20 Spoke with Guillermo to make sure he adjust Zoho and billing for both Arnold and Anders now that Anders will be separated out on his own membership as an independent. Guillermo called Arnold to get Anders phone and address. Waiting to hear back from Arnold.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 15:07:02', '2020-09-02 15:07:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056618023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238442', 'Anne DeWaters', NULL, '9-2-20 Called bc Redirect told her she''s not "covered" for specialists or anything big. I refreshed Annie''s mind on how it works and she thought that was the case but it just made her nervous. She''s all set. Just dealing with hormone, low testosterone issues from being a female.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 15:01:19', '2020-09-02 15:01:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056618018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176035', 'Renae Einspahr', NULL, '9-2-20 Renae completed app for $1000/$317 MPC Carez Connected Worksite LHS conversion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 14:56:48', '2020-09-02 14:56:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056623023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741134', 'Susan Nadeau', NULL, 'Susan wanted to make sure that she is cancelled when she needs to be in time for when she goes onto Medicare Nov 1, I sent a cancellation form so she can have it for peace of mind.  I told her the earliest she could fill it out and submit it would be the 2nd week in Oct and no later than the 20th.  Also told her to go ahead with her preventative care. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-02 14:56:41', '2020-09-02 14:56:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056623018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881658', 'James Lynch', NULL, 'James  called in upset because he has been double billed, I transferred the call to Patti, as well as contacted her on Microsoft Teams because she has probably left for the day. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-02 14:56:00', '2020-09-02 14:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056618013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176035', 'Renae Einspahr', NULL, '9-2-20 Renae is healthy, no pre-x, no incidents with LHS. She just needs her annual wellness visit but already did labs so not worried about that part. She''s completing conversion online now. We got to the last page. She''s choosing MPB Carez Connected Worksite No DPC, $1000/$317.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 13:43:07', '2020-09-02 13:43:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056618008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001106387', 'Kelly Parnigoni', NULL, '9-2-20 Talked with Kelly about MPB Carez Connected and will likely switch ti $1000/$697. Still waiting to be reimbursed from LHS for about $800-$1000. Also was told by LHS she could have 12 chiro visits included at not extra cost. Was paying $60 cash. Once submitted it as billed to LHS the chiro office charged $300 per session! She had to work with chiro office to get that reversed, since LHS hasn''t paid for any of it anyhow. Total pain. She said she''s willing to do some leg work bc the price is so much better but that scenario became a joke. I walked through the wellness aspect with her to clarify what is and it not included. She will discuss and let me know. Knows of the 20th deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-02 13:24:34', '2020-09-02 13:24:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056635003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-09-02 13:10:11', '2020-09-02 13:10:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056623013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155021', 'Jill Enriquez', NULL, 'I gave Jill a list of zion approved phcs network doctors 2 of which were showing on healthgrades so I gave that information as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-02 12:49:55', '2020-09-02 12:49:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056623008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162541', 'Harry Shaffer', NULL, 'called for help getting his address updated- sent him a form.  Then he wanted to know what to do about filling in his insurance information at his new DPC, I told him that he didn''t have insurance. and that he should explain that he is a member of a medical cost sharing community.  I told him that I would reach out to Patti and see if she recommended anything different. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-02 12:48:24', '2020-09-02 12:48:24'),
