  ('zcrm_1579374000056596013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009474065', 'J. Vance Andersen PLC', NULL, 'Vance called in and wanted to know why he and his wife have no gotten any cards yet because his wife needs to have a mammogram and colonoscopy. They started yesterday on 9/1/20. I let him know this and that the file for all the 9/1 people was just sent over yesterday so there will be no cards sent until around the 11th or the 15th of the month. They won''t be in Zion''s or Planstin''s system yet because the file was just sent yesterday. He also wanted to know why his old premium for Sedera was taken out of his account when he no longer has them and made the switch a few weeks ago. I sent him to Patti to answer that question. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-02 11:06:22', '2020-09-02 11:06:22'),
