Doris will ask Dr. if there are other ways to get oxygen tank at a more affordable rate. The cash price is $250 instead of $24 a month they are paying with their insurance. I may ask Kelly to research as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 15:52:24', '2020-09-01 15:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295052', 'Susan Hodson', NULL, '9-1-20 Susan called to understand all of the cards and what''s current and relevant and what to throw away, who to call, etc. She hasn''t done her Welcome Call yet. She will find that email and schedule the Welcome Call. If she still has questions, she will call me after. She felt embarrassed that she was confused, but I agreed with her that it was confusing with the wrong cards sent initially. She will follow through and was super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 15:43:01', '2020-09-01 15:43:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176111', 'Lisa Carnahan', NULL, '9-1-20 Lisa asked about mental health benefits and has psoriasis that she needs meds for. Explained the pre-x clause and she''s good with it. Also explained limited mental health and read direct from the Guidelines re mental health. She''s ok with it since LHS didn''t offer mental health either. She had 2 knee surgeries with LHS in Jan. 2019 and Dec. 2019. Still waiting for rest of reimbursements from LHS. Cost of 1st knee was $75K and fair market value is $30K. LHS paid them $54K and then UCHealth came back and asked for another $8K. Did other knee at Harmony Surgery Center with same doctor, same surgery, same distributor, same everything else and that one cost $23K!!! So, she''s been fighting with UC Health bc they still want $8K. Same parts/hardware charged $36K at UCHealth vs $4800 via Harmony Surgery Center!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 15:33:01', '2020-09-01 15:37:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086450002', 'Andrew Bishop', NULL, '9-1-20 He work for Nathalie Joly at Mirabelle (Restaurant) in Vail and interested in learning about the MPB Secure membership which is what Nathalie is using.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 14:48:55', '2020-09-01 14:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056534044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271490', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, 'Member called in again asking about College.  Gave him same story.  Sent out college letter managed expectations.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-01 14:41:01', '2020-09-01 14:41:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '9-1-20 Interested in learning about new LHS conversion option. Left her a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 14:37:21', '2020-09-01 14:37:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, 'what a mess, this family wants a MEC and dental.....they told me straight away that they were calling me with questions. I did not sent post welcome call information because I do not want to confuse them more.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 14:09:29', '2020-09-01 14:10:56');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000056534039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003680821', 'Dennis Dempsey', NULL, 'Member called in to explain that he cancelled LHS.  I sent him out cancellation and cancelled future pmts.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-01 14:06:38', '2020-09-01 14:06:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126041', 'Steven Strehlow', NULL, 'spoke to Julie, she is going to reschedule the call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 13:20:12', '2020-09-01 13:20:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, '9-1-20 I updated John''s email in Zoho and Patti just updated it in FTNI.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 13:10:39', '2020-09-01 13:10:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, '9-1-20 "Hi Wendy
Thanks for all your efforts in the last few weeks.
I was able to get proof of coverage from Regional Care, and hopefully that combined with theater you sent over will do the trick

I''ve been getting my test strips on eBay, and syringes at an online wholesaler, which comes to about $ 40.0-0 more per month
Then I found a coupon at Levemir for 3 vials for $ 99.00. So I had my Dr change the RX to 3 vials at a time, so I''m actually about even at the end of it all

Please note my new email address   johnkslc@gmail.com
I have updated at Sedera, and requested update at the admin email address where my billing info comes through.
Do you think I ned to call someone and make sure??

Take care
John"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 13:04:24', '2020-09-01 13:05:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009579103', 'Steven Meusel', NULL, 'I sent Louise a list of lab pricing from HCBB, I am also going to let her know that her information is being processed into the HCBB system and that she should be able to access it by either the end of today or tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 13:03:10', '2020-09-01 13:03:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '9-1-20 Etta is interested in joining Ian''s membership for $550/$1500 MPB Secure. She says no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. She''s currently a LHS member with the price increase Oct. 1st. She will discuss with Ian and complete form online to add herself to his membership. I told her of the 20th deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 13:01:49', '2020-09-01 13:01:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, 'I sent Kim PHCS/healthgrades.com list of in network providers.  I also sent her a welcome call scheduler, and preventive care email. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 13:00:18', '2020-09-01 13:00:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056534031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508083', 'Lee Pabon', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Planstin &amp; cancel billing.  I will bill member for September then cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-01 12:58:43', '2020-09-01 13:01:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056534023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047423028', 'Kathleen Van Haecke', NULL, 'Redirect Term:
Tracking #10490877
Sent by Patti Baron on 9/1/2020.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-01 12:48:40', '2020-09-01 12:48:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056534018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047423028', 'Kathleen Van Haecke', NULL, 'Rebecca Warner emailed me and asked what she was being charged $130 for.  After much digging I found this member being charged for the Redirect only option .  She advised me that she should have been cancelled back in Feb/2020.  I advised that I didn''t receive any cancellation for her.  I will cancel effective 9/1. &amp; refund the 9/20 pmt.  Moxie Girl now has no members', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-01 12:46:54', '2020-09-01 12:51:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455033', 'Manuel Viarrial', NULL, '9-1-20 Manny called to learn more about LHS conversion. He wants to discuss it with his wife and will call me back today or tomorrow to likely convert. Wife is on Medicare already. He has no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. He did have kidney stone issue 2-3 years ago and blood issue 4-5 years ago but all is good now. He also just had a physical and he''s healthy, no issues. I told him of the limited annual physical where he will have to pay for blood work etc. He was surprised.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 12:35:37', '2020-09-01 12:35:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126041', 'Steven Strehlow', NULL, 'Julie called in, missed call, called her back and left a message. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 12:21:41', '2020-09-01 12:21:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108399027', 'Doris Medina', NULL, '9-1-20 Doris is 54 and husband is 61. Husband has asthma and sleep apnea. Needs Breo inhaler, 60 blisters of 100 mcg/25 mcg will last two months. Pays only about $50 with insurance now. Uses oxygen concentrator tank for $24 month to rent machine. They are paying $800 and employer paying $300 with HMA through Vail Valley Foundation. Doris just started taking levothyroxine .25 1x daily for $10 a month.  If they can''t get Breo cheaper than it''s probably best to stay with employer coverage.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 12:05:29', '2020-09-01 12:05:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126041', 'Steven Strehlow', NULL, 'sent re-scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 11:52:48', '2020-09-01 11:52:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881016', 'Michael Grace', NULL, '9-1-20 Michael is LHS member and hasn''t used it in a long time but he needs to do so for some upcoming stuff. Left him a vm now as well. Interested in converting.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 11:48:02', '2020-09-01 11:48:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '9-1-20 Mitchell spoke with Patti about needing to split membership and wants prices, etc. I just left him a vm as well as Jennifer. I called Jennifer first not knowing whose number was whose. I noted them now. They are getting a divorce and trying to figure out the best way to split family for best price.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 11:45:04', '2020-09-01 11:45:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056551003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '9-1-20 Aine is looking into when her last breast exam took place. They found something and she tried to follow up with it. The process turned into a terrible experience and she just gave up. No diagnosis, no treatment, just an abnormal exam. It might have been more than 2 years ago. She''s not sure. Per Rod, I can put her on the Select Conversion option that is compliant with CA! She will call me back shortly, if she can.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-09-01 11:14:38', '2020-09-01 11:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, 'called to schedule a welcome call, sent a scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 11:14:33', '2020-09-01 11:14:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, 'Clark''s personal email address- clark.gustafson4@gmail.com', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 11:02:26', '2020-09-01 11:02:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056536013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809171', 'Joseph Ayers', NULL, 'Lisa called again today just wanting a status update on what is going on with her and her husbands file being sent over to Zion because they still have not gotten any cards or anything. John said that their file has been sent over it is just in the middle of being processed right now. I reassured her she has nothing to worry about, she was afraid that she is not covered for anything and she was dropped at the wayside. I told her no not at all, she is covered of course its just taking a little bit longer than we anticipated with getting everyone processed. She understands and just wanted clarification. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-01 10:57:08', '2020-09-01 10:57:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056544003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816005', 'Christopher Coppage', NULL, 'Member called and needed Planstin''s card for upcoming Preventative Care Appointment.
- After speaking with Patti - I informed Member that they would be recieiving thier card between Sept 11-25 (since they just signed on on Sept 1)
-Recommended that he change his doctor''s appointment until after he recieves his card. 
- Call closed  - MR', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-09-01 10:34:27', '2020-09-01 10:34:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056534013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, 'Member called in asking when she can expect her cards.  Member scheduled her mammogram for tomorrow 9/2 and needs it.  I advised that she would probably have to reschedule as the cards are usually sent around the 10th of the month.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-01 10:15:45', '2020-09-01 10:15:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056536008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in because she had just gotten off the phone with Planstin because she has not gotten any cards yet and she has a mammogram appointment for tomorrow. She just started on 9/1/20 today so she of course would not have any cards yet. Cards or emails do not get sent out until the middle of the month. We are telling her if she can just reschedule the appointment until she gets her cards. If she pays out of pocket we do not know if she will get reimbursed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-01 10:10:36', '2020-09-01 10:10:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056534008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012724007', 'Brenda Flowers-Specht', NULL, 'Was able to charge this member for the Aug pmt.  She advised that her CC had some fraud and CC provider was being extra cautious.   I charged her for Aug and she is to be charged for Sept.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-01 09:43:40', '2020-09-01 09:43:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056536003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885384', 'Jennifer Cowden', NULL, 'Jennifer called in and said that she wanted to know what she needs to do when bills start coming from and ER visit she had a couple weeks ago. She told me that she was told when she signed up for this plan that if the bills are more than her IUA of $1500 she is to show her RCI card. I stopped her and said that is 100% incorrect and she should never ever show that card for ER visits or anything of that nature. I told her that card is strictly for Preventative visits ONLY. When is comes to injury/illness she is to present herself as a cash pay patient and is responsible for the first $1500 out of pocket. Anything after that she is to submit her bills into Sedera and open up a Need with them. I told her to call the ER she went to and tell them to disregard the RCI card she showed and to pay out of pocket for $1500 of her IUA. I let her know that I will send her an email that explains how to submit her bills to Sedera and start a need. I told her to call Sedera when she can to let them know what happened and they can help walk her thorough the process. She was very thankful and apologized for her mess. I said it is not problem at all it was her first time doing something like this. No need to apologize, it happens. She knows what to do now and will fix her issue. Very thankful for the help. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-09-01 09:24:15', '2020-09-01 09:24:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530449', 'Emily Jaynes', NULL, 'sent a list of dermatologists in network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 09:24:12', '2020-09-01 09:24:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056534003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, 'Member''s husband called in to ask about a Mammogram that she got 11/5/2019.  I left a VM and told him that because she did not have MEC coverage this would be reimbursable by Sedera since she has no MEC coverage.  Went over how to submit to Sedera.  However  since Mammogram was done so long ago (within 6 mos) they would not be able to reimburse.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-09-01 09:05:17', '2020-09-01 09:05:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056522003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447500', 'Clove Berger', NULL, 'Wendy sent instructions on uploading a need yesterday evening. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-09-01 07:03:59', '2020-09-01 07:03:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165513', 'Christine Pietras', NULL, '8-31-20 Interested in conversion MPB Carez Connect or MPB Carez and No MEC. Price is still a hurdle for them or rather big increase. But, they are still waiting for reimbursements from LHS for kidney stones that Kyle had in the spring. They didn''t reach their AUA of $2250 she doesn''t think. She''ll discuss with Kyle and get back to me before 20th of Sept.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 16:55:21', '2020-08-31 16:55:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447500', 'Clove Berger', NULL, '8-31-20 Husband just broke foot two days ago. They already incurred about $400 with one urgent care visit and an ortho visit. Surgery will likely be $8K with the cash price at 30% discount. Told her to start the Need immediately with Sedera and they will likely front the deposit for the surgery. Told her to redo the Conversion app immediately for Sedera Access Plus to remain members to ride out this Need. She still wants to convert later as soon as done with surgery to gain rest of benefits back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 16:08:55', '2020-08-31 16:17:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '8-31-20 "With that price increase I''m interested in the switch. I believe we discussed the options before and I think I was stuck on the credit card part. We had actually made our decision to switch and then the pandemic hit the majority of our cash flow and I forgot. But with this massive increase, I think we need to switch. Is this still the same plan or modified?"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 15:58:24', '2020-08-31 15:58:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676181', 'Margaret Stephens', NULL, '8-31-20 She wants to opt out of any further communications.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 15:43:41', '2020-08-31 15:43:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862376', 'Rachel Hrezo', NULL, '8-31-20 I talked with Darius about Rachel''s membership not cancelling. Darius already knew about this because he''s been in contact with Rachel all along. Rachel told Darius she contacted John Greco''s office numerous times to let them know to cancel her membership. They said they would.  After multiple attempts she gave up. John''s office kept paying as an oversight and never cancelled the membership. Rachel has been employed by a new company for quite a while now as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 15:39:11', '2020-08-31 15:42:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056467048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, 'I am assisting Julie in setting up Cirrus accounts, John said that she and her son Clark will be able to register in 24 hours. I will check in with her tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-31 15:21:09', '2020-08-31 15:21:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012051083', 'Nancy Gentry', NULL, '8-31-20 Nancy wanted to understand her new cards and what company does what. She missed her Welcome Call. I''ll send another email. She has a new Need for her son who is told he should see a urologist. She will go in as a self pay patient. I told her to call Concierge Team if cost might exceed $1000 and gave her the #. She can''t find her MPB card and I told her to request a new one when she calls Concierge.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 15:18:42', '2020-08-31 15:18:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056467043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881479', 'Desiree Childs', NULL, 'she called in for help understanding her preventative care benefits.  I sent her a few templates and answered all of her questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-31 15:18:04', '2020-08-31 15:18:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '8-31-20 John was curious about other options but he didn''t realize he has the  chiro benefit through Redirect which he will now take advantage of. He will complete his welcome call and he will call Redirect to get his chiro visits paid for, at least 12. He sees his chiro every 2 weeks or so. He found some plan on Redirect for $250 that also included dental and vision and he was asking. I don''t know what he was looking at. But, he''s now pleased to stay with his current membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 14:25:18', '2020-08-31 14:25:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030928113', 'Heather Lakey', NULL, 'Memebr submitted Cancellation request.  I will cancel Sedera &amp; Refund Sept Pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 14:17:15', '2020-08-31 14:17:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056512013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005914697', 'Melissa Galt', NULL, 'left Melissa a VmMand sent her an email', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-08-31 13:10:49', '2020-08-31 13:10:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056512008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004053001', 'Idelle Steinberg', NULL, 'Spoke to Idelle sent her email and quote after speaking to her', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-08-31 12:58:24', '2020-08-31 12:58:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056512003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544097', 'Heidi Hoke', NULL, 'Sent her email and a quote after speaking with her', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-08-31 12:55:37', '2020-08-31 12:55:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033509057', 'Allison Piekarski', NULL, 'I refunded extra pmt that was charged', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 12:51:21', '2020-08-31 12:51:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030928113', 'Heather Lakey', NULL, 'Member requested cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 12:10:58', '2020-08-31 12:10:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006447028', 'Margaret (Maggie) Webster', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 11:45:59', '2020-08-31 11:45:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238523', 'Jennifer Ranabargar', NULL, 'Redirect Term:
Tracking #10484055
Sent by Patti Baron on 8/31/2020.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 11:38:16', '2020-08-31 11:38:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238523', 'Jennifer Ranabargar', NULL, 'Member responded back to me that she had cancelled her member earlier in the month.  I have no record of this.  I have termed this member in Redirect &amp; Sedera.  Member declied so no refund needed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 11:36:35', '2020-08-31 11:36:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056467038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508083', 'Lee Pabon', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent him the online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-31 11:32:45', '2020-08-31 11:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568331', 'Carol Boire', NULL, 'Member called I sent her the link to the payment update form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 11:22:14', '2020-08-31 11:22:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056467033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, 'sent Kimberly the template that goes over how to submit a need with Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-31 11:21:31', '2020-08-31 11:21:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009525007', 'Jill Suarez', NULL, '8-31-20 Jill is healthy. She thinks she had covid in Feb. They wouldn''t test her at the time at the time. She was now tested recently for having the antibodies. She understands it will be considered pre-x if something further comes from having covid. She understands pre-x clause and stepping stones per year. She chose MPB Carez Conversion with MEC and knows to stay in network for wellness. If nobody in network she will need pre-approval. Complete $1000/$294 MPB Carez w/ MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 10:58:49', '2020-08-31 12:26:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056467028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007278037', 'Richard Wrightsman', NULL, 'called to ask about the steps on getting a flu shot.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-31 10:56:42', '2020-08-31 10:56:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243610', 'Paula Chavez', NULL, 'I refunded this member one payment billed in error', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 10:53:15', '2020-08-31 10:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056467023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', NULL, 'she said she spoke to someone in the office that is going to send her a health insurance waiver for her daughter''s college. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-31 10:50:07', '2020-08-31 10:50:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056467018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280361', 'Sally Pistilli', NULL, 'Sally was very confused about her plan,  I went over a mini welcome call with her, I also sent out many templates to go along with it.  I told her that if there are any questions that come up with reading the new information to give us a call back so that we can walk her through the process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-31 10:47:53', '2020-08-31 10:47:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009525007', 'Jill Suarez', NULL, '8-31-20 Jill called me on Sat. and I just left her a returned vm now on Monday at 10:30. She''s nervous bc doesn''t want to lose benefits. Engaged in process now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 10:39:49', '2020-08-31 10:39:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, '8-31-20 Kimberly called for help with creating her Need. She approaching the 6 month deadline for creating a new Need. She will call Concierge today to gain some assistance with creating the Need. She has the bills in digital form now and ready to go. She was a bit confused as to who to call and what the deadlines were. She seems confident now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 10:38:39', '2020-08-31 10:38:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238523', 'Jennifer Ranabargar', NULL, 'Member''s 9/20 was returned I will reach out to her since so late also sent final notice so member could update pmt info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 10:37:39', '2020-08-31 10:42:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354084', 'Ioanna Petropoulou', NULL, '8-31-20 Ioanna called to make sure they didn''t need to do anything to renew. I told her the renewal for the Assoc hasn''t happened yet. If/when it does, they will be notified. So, there''s nothing for them to do right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 10:32:21', '2020-08-31 10:32:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056492003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480226', 'Konstantinos Stamatiou', NULL, '8-31-20 Ioanna called to make sure they didn''t need to do anything to renew. I told her the renewal for the Assoc hasn''t happened yet. If/when it does, they will be notified. So, there''s nothing for them to do right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-31 10:32:14', '2020-08-31 10:32:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041406092', 'Pratik Patil', NULL, 'Received returned pmnt ver late in the month for the 9/2020 MCS.  Reached out to member and I will send him Pmt update form to update pmt.  Advised him of the lateness of the month.  Member directed me to recharge current Bk info and then sent me new pmt info for future which I changed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 10:32:00', '2020-08-31 12:59:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056457018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841134', 'David Mason', NULL, 'CC updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-31 09:50:41', '2020-08-31 09:50:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056467013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009579103', 'Steven Meusel', NULL, 'I spoke with Louise,  I helped her with information on a new primary care doctor that she is going to start seeing from HCBB and healthgrades.  I sent her that information and will help her look up lab pricing once she gets  a list to me. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-31 09:31:41', '2020-08-31 09:31:41'),
