  ('zcrm_1579374000056425018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004299077', 'Carolyn Banks', NULL, '8-30-20 Remind Carol to update her address!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-30 17:34:32', '2020-08-30 17:34:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165335', 'Glen Delman', NULL, '8-28-20 Glen called asking about LHS conversion. They are owed about $10K so not wanting to move until they are repaid. Told him about conversion deadline and he will still wait until 1st of year. So, may have other options to share at that point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 17:23:36', '2020-08-28 17:23:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, '8-28-20 John called and told me Rossana is all set to stay with Sedera Access Plus moving forward. John notified Patti and she will make adjustments on her end. I called Rossana and she was thrilled for this news to ride out this incident. She will call me as soon as she''s confident it''s all cleared up. She really wants to move to MPB Carez while given the opportunity, so she will call me when she''s ready within the next month or so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 16:48:17', '2020-08-28 16:48:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009143063', 'Adam Rothberg', NULL, '8-28-20 Adam called to see if he can do Sedera Access Plus for September to make sure his health issue isn''t something more significant. His Dr. visit today turned out fine. But, he wants to get through another month to be certain. I had him redo the Conversion form and I added a note to it to notify the team of what''s going on. I also emailed Patti, John and Guillermo to fill them in and to make the change.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 16:42:26', '2020-08-28 16:42:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056405028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'I helped Jose fill out his online conversion form that will keep him on with Sedera.  I tried to call Kevin but he was out of the office, I ended up emailing him with a copy of the completed form to let him know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-28 16:09:24', '2020-08-28 16:09:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056405023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291686', 'Craig Frithsen', NULL, 'I sent Craig the Dr. Nomination link for the PHCS network, I suggested that he call the doctors office sometime next week and put a face on the request. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-28 15:16:07', '2020-08-28 15:16:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214053', 'Lisa Wade', NULL, '8-28-20 Lisa will complete conversion on her own bc was not in front of a computer right now. She will choose a Nov. 1st start date bc husband is moving to Medicare Nov. 1st. Doesn''t make sense to move her before bc they''d have to pay $399 Indiv LHS and $317 for her with MPB. Instead will pay $499 for one month to LHS and then $317 MPB Carez Connected Worksite No DPC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 14:39:38', '2020-08-28 14:39:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808040', 'Thomas DeAngelis', NULL, '8-28-20 Signed up with Sedera in Dec. 2019. He''s open to Zion but after the pandemic passes. Curious about in Dec. 2020. He wants to make sure Zion is financially solvent. He was mortified by the My Academy of Health Excellence''s service. He was never able to get any help from Concierge or returned calls or benefits from the $50 he said. Then with LHS he wasn''t able to get full reimbursement for their wellness visit. He''s open to MPB Carez but also found Zion Direct at $2500 for about $399.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 14:23:12', '2020-08-28 14:23:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056408068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822390', 'Lillian Chatham', NULL, 'Member submitted change of address I will notify Zion &amp; change in Admin123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 13:58:00', '2020-08-28 13:58:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056425013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, 'I got a call from a doctors office asking to confirm eligibility and benefits for a member. It was for Lucas who is under Helen here and when I saw they have Redirect I told the lady that that is who she needs to call and gave her their phone number but I let her know it is going to be an issue because Redirect are the ones that choose the doctors and make the appointments. She started to say that she doesn''t understand this then and I just stopped her mid sentence and said she needs to contact Redirect and speak with them. She thanked me very much and is calling them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-28 13:22:21', '2020-08-28 13:22:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056408063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, 'Member submitted address update I will email to Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 13:21:46', '2020-08-28 13:21:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056425008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881479', 'Desiree Childs', NULL, 'Desiree called in and said that she is part of the new plans that she just choose and wanted to know how everything works because she is needing to find a new provider. I told her it works exactly the same way ASi worked. Same PHCS Network for preventative providers, same thing as showing her Planstin card, and same thing with making sure everything is preventative ONLY. Same goes for Zion, they work the exact same way Sedera did with opening a need and being a cash pay patient up to their chosen IUA. All the same just different names. She was thrilled to hear that and needed to look up a new provider. I told her I can send her an email that explains how to navigate the MultiPlan Website and what buttons she needs to click to get to the correct place to search for providers. She said that sounds great and to go ahead and send that. I warned her and let her know though that after she has chosen a provider to call them and just double check that the provider she is choosing is still in the PHCS network because sometimes MultiPlan''s website is not fully updated and we don''t want her to use a provider and then come to find out they are not in the PHCS network anymore and then her preventative appointment isn''t covered. She fully understood that and I could tell she was taking notes and wrote that down. She was thrilled with how easy everything is and will be looking out for the email I sent her with the MultiPlan site. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-28 13:15:38', '2020-08-28 13:15:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056408058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539338', 'Pamela Omilian', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel with Sedera and cancel billing in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 13:02:39', '2020-08-28 13:02:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056408053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539053', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, 'I billed this member an additional $135 due to price difference for 9/2020.  I will cancel any further pmts in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 12:57:10', '2020-08-28 12:57:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056408048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'I billed this member $18 difference between billed amount and actual amount.  I will cancel any further pmts in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 12:54:27', '2020-08-28 12:54:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056408043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, 'I refunded this member $73 due to difference in pricing for 9/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 12:46:39', '2020-08-28 12:46:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056408038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, 'I refunded $48 due to pricing difference in plans for 9/2020.  I will cancel out of FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 12:43:21', '2020-08-28 12:43:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056425003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925046', 'Susan Korzon', NULL, 'Susan called in and asked me if we are cancelling her plan. I said no the only way you would be cancelled is if you called in and asked us to cancel you. She then said " Ok let me word this a different way, I was told by our broker (Jane) that you guys are cancelling the plan that we have is that correct?" I looked and saw that she has the ASi plan. So I then explained to her the conversion process and that 3 emails were sent to her to make the conversion process and pick her choice on what she is going to convert to. She was not at all happy and started asking me so many questions. She asked who we are replacing ASi with and what her new monthly premium is going to be, ect.. A bunch of questions I could not answer because it would all be based on what plan she chooses. I said a few times that she needs to speak with Jane her affiliate who is going to sit down an go over everything with her to make sure she makes the best choice for her and her family. She was just not understanding that and made me look really dumb. Because I could not answer her questions because again the answers to her questions will all be based on what her choice is going to be. I told her there are a few different options and that she needs to call Jane and discuss everything with her and that I can not answer her questions. She was getting really frustrated and pretty much after I said the same thing again about getting in contact with Jane she finally said Ok fine and hung up as I was still talking. I have a feeling that she is going to go back to Jane and bad mouth me and say that I was of no help ect... -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-28 12:32:54', '2020-08-28 12:32:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056408033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', NULL, 'I billed member and additional $33 out of FTNI due to price increase in the Access option.  Cancelled any further billing out of FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 12:24:31', '2020-08-28 12:24:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056405018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, 'Snatam emailed info@ early Wednesday morning, I didn''t find it until this morning. The email was in reference to whether or not she should sign a insurance waiver from a hospital to receive a 25% discount.    I had originally asked my team for some help with this.  But Joan said the best thing for the member to do would be to call Zion directly about this.  I tried to give Snatam a phone call and left a voicemail,  I also sent her an email with Joan''s suggestion and Zion''s contact info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-28 12:14:43', '2020-08-28 12:14:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056405013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052476986', 'Michelle Dow', NULL, 'Joan looked at the lettered response from Michelle''s daughters college and says that there is nothing that we are going to be able to do to satisfy the requirements that they list.  Because Michelle has mentioned it before, my email letting her know this latest news included a link to our cancellation form.  She does not know whether or not if it is just her daughter cancelling, or the both of them. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-28 12:08:57', '2020-08-28 12:08:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056405008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674272', 'LeAnn Gunnell', NULL, 'I spoke with Jennifer at RCI about the bills LeAnn was upset about.  It turns out that the colonoscopy will be getting paid on because it was in network and preventative in nature.  The wellness visit, however, will not be.  It sounded like she went over all the right questions and feels duped.  I told her then it is on the doctors office to give her a deep cash pay discount for this mess she''s in now. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-28 11:55:54', '2020-08-28 11:55:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056423003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, '-Member emailed a non-insurance waiver from the hospital.  
-Wanted to know if she should sign the waiver.  
-Directed her  to Zion''s member services.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-08-28 11:38:22', '2020-08-28 11:38:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009525007', 'Jill Suarez', NULL, '8-28-20 Jill finally called and left me a vm and talked with Patti. She was out of town for last month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 11:07:13', '2020-08-28 11:07:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291686', 'Craig Frithsen', NULL, '8-28-20 Craig''s doctors are Not in the PHCS network. It''s super small up in Steamboat. I suggested he ask his doctor to become part of the network and to call the Concierge for assistance with that. He will. His Dr. is Niedermeier and Dr. Speer. They are part of the same practice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 10:57:05', '2020-08-28 10:57:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291686', 'Craig Frithsen', NULL, '8-28-20 Returned Craig''s call and left vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 10:46:55', '2020-08-28 10:46:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779188', 'Jason LaPointe', NULL, '8-28-20 Wendy called and triple checked that her account is set up right since hasn''t seen a bill yet. I called Patti and she let me know they have not billed for Sept. 1st yet! I had no idea. Patti verified one last time that their account is set up accurately and will be billed in the next few days. Relayed info to Wendy and she will continue to watch the account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 10:45:42', '2020-08-28 10:45:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056408028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322148', 'Mike Gold', NULL, 'Updated payment method', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 10:24:28', '2020-08-28 10:24:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056418003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049898077', 'Debbie Thibault', NULL, '8-28-20 Patti updated their price moving forward for Oct. 1st at the 60-64 age bracket. New price will be $970 for Sept. 20th billing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-28 10:11:32', '2020-08-28 10:12:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056416004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, '08.28.20:  Cathy left phone message - Karl has not received any materials for his plan as yet.  Returned call - left message to ask if he got an email from Planstin or Zion w/digital membership cards and to call me to discuss.  Cathy returned call.  Said Karl did not receive any emails or cards. Told her I''d look into it.  Called Zion & Planstin - neither had Karl in their system.  Said if I gave them Karl''s info., they would enter it into their system and send him the digital cards, etc. today.  That is what was done.  I sent Karl and email and copied Cathy to let him know he will be getting his Planstin and Zion cards from Planstin in an email today.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-08-28 10:04:14', '2020-08-28 16:22:15'),
