  ('zcrm_1579374000056408003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, 'Spoke with John and and cleared up the confusion about his Redirect plan.  He told me that he has to be more involved in this.  I told him that he would need to contact Redirect to request cards and the Spruce app.  He asked if he would have to re-enroll come Dec and I told him that unless he cancels his plan would continue.  He asked about the ReDirect plan and if there were anything new we were offering.   I directed him again to Wendy on this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-28 08:41:29', '2020-08-28 08:41:29'),
