  ('zcrm_1579374000056350033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004500005', 'Chester (Chet) Dickson', NULL, '8-27-20 Chet called and I reviewed membership with him for LHS conversion. He wants to read through rest of info and will likely go this route for MPB Carez Connected $1000/$317. Knows of our deadline and knows how to cancel with LHS. Also knows to complete conversion online and will likely do so on his own. Will contact me with any troubles.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-27 16:59:17', '2020-08-27 16:59:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056350028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056599004', 'Adam Davis', NULL, '8-27-20 Adam is 43, moved to Boulder from Philly recently. He''s self-employed, goes to his annual wellness visits but not yet this year bc of covid. Had an HSA a while back but no longer. He chose MPB Carez with MEC for wellness and encouraged him to fund an HSA. No pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. Has an Anthem silver plan now for about $300+ a month. He enrolled and will follow through with Welcome Call. All set to go! $1000/$294 MPB Carez with MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-27 16:29:34', '2020-08-27 16:29:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056350023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165427', 'April Porterfield', NULL, '8-27-20 Spoke with April and explained it all to her and she''s happy she switched. She asked about the HMA account. I will send her information to read through. She is interested in that as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-27 15:48:41', '2020-08-27 15:48:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056350018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004641025', 'Ruth Ebbinghaus', NULL, '8-27-20 Ruth is very interested in switching. She will discuss with Marty. She has thyroid issue and that''s it. Takes meds which cost only $29 for 3 months. Their new price was going to be $499 with LHS. Still waiting for her doctor to be reimbursed for her wellness visit. She is going out of town to pick up mother in law and not sure what week will look like next week. She knows the deadline and how to enroll and how to cancel LHS. She will call me if she runs into trouble. Says she is tech savvy. Should be all set and was super happy I emailed her with the new option since I didn''t have a good option at the start of the year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-27 15:20:15', '2020-08-27 15:20:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056350013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, '8-27-20 I received a nasty email from Samantha about not getting a covid test for free. I spoke with Joan and she will have a Concierge Team Member look for possible free options and then will call Samantha back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-27 14:57:46', '2020-08-27 14:57:46'),
