  ('zcrm_1579374000056350008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006585073', 'Kelly Hastedt', NULL, '8-27-20 "Hey-

I have been trying for YEARS to get a reimbursement from medcost for when I had liberty healthshare. Can you direct me to anyone else to handle this?

Thank you,
Kelly"

I sent her this - "If you have submitted health expenses for sharing before June 2019 that remain unresolved, please email us immediately at memberresolution@libertyhealthshare.org.
 
Our new Member Resolution team is highly trained with a mandate from me to resolve your issues as swiftly and efficiently as possible. Our goal is to respond to you within 24-72 hours.
 
We are also creating additional ways for you to contact our Member Resolution team and I will be sharing this information with you shortly."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-27 14:04:49', '2020-08-27 14:04:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056350003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935161', 'Jill St. Aubin King', NULL, '8-27-20 I cc''ed Patti on email stating Patti will charge the difference.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-27 14:03:21', '2020-08-27 14:03:21'),
