  ('zcrm_1579374000056330003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881015', 'Manson Root', NULL, '8-27-20 Manson responded with interest to MPB Carez Connected Conversion but said site isn''t helpful and he can''t pull up the documents. I responded.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-27 13:38:56', '2020-08-27 13:38:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056316008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Refunded extra pmt that was drafted on 8/21 also killed further pmts', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-27 13:37:12', '2020-08-27 13:37:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056318003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126041', 'Steven Strehlow', NULL, 'Julie called in and asked about getting info about their new plans because they have not gotten anything yet, no cards, nothing. she said that she had to wait until she got everything to have her Welcome Call with us. I said generally yes it is best to have all info in front of them but with this situation because it is taking a long time for cards to be sent she can have the Welcome Call at anytime. I sent her the scheduler just now and she will set up a day and time when her husband is available to sit down with her and have the call. I also called Zion when I got off the phone with Julie and asked them when and if digital cards were sent. Shelby at Zion was very very helpful and she said that both their Planstin and Zion Digital cards were emailed over to Steven''s email TODAY! I asked Shelby if there is any sort of letter or info that is sent to them that kinda goes over their plan and just some general knowledge. She said with the digital cards that were sent today there is a letter that has some info on it but when the hard copies are mailed out there is a couple letters that have a lot more info on them for the members to go over. I asked if and when the hard copies were sent out to them and Shelby said she does not know because Planstin are the ones sending all that out, BUT she is going to contact Planstin right now as I am typing this to find out the exact date and will give me a call back to let me know. Once she does that I will email Julie the answer on when to expect the hard copies of their cards and letters. Shelby was fantastic and gave me all amazing answers which in turn makes the member very happy. Which Julie was! She thanked me so so so much and said I have been a GREAT help to her and they feel a LOT better now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-27 12:45:13', '2020-08-27 12:45:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056316003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Updated member''s pmt info', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-27 12:21:40', '2020-08-27 12:21:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056293003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078004', 'Jason Scheier', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel him with Sedera and refund pmt that was taken for Sept.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-27 10:29:46', '2020-08-27 10:29:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056292003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674272', 'LeAnn Gunnell', NULL, 'no phone calls from LeAnn were received over night, so, I sent LeAnn an email instead asking her to either respond to my email so that I can help her or give me a phone call. tagged Joan in the letter. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-27 10:15:44', '2020-08-27 10:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056289005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, 'Samantha called in and asked is RCI would cover COVID  testing and I let her know that unfortunately as of right now no. I can''t tell  her the answer for the future if that would be something they will add whenever RCI does some sort of renewal or update. I let her know that if I hear anything different I will let her know. She was pretty upset and said that is frighting and most other insurance''s do cover that.... I apologized and said again that as of right now to my knowledge its not and will let her know if I hear otherwise. I am going to ask Patti and see if she knows anything about that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-27 10:04:12', '2020-08-27 10:04:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056280013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010815118', 'Kristina (Tina) Wood', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-27 09:16:31', '2020-08-27 09:16:31'),
