  ('zcrm_1579374000056260033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'called to update her payment info.  sent online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-26 17:01:27', '2020-08-26 17:01:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087146', 'Emily Donahue', NULL, '8-26-20 Emily''s mom answered the phone and will have Emily call me back. Patti called to let me know Emily just had a baby and hasn''t even started a Need. She didn''t seem to understand any of the process in spite of successfully completing the Welcome Call and hearing my educational pitch. She was instructed by Patti to call Sedera and create a Need immediately.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 16:47:52', '2020-08-26 16:47:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869148', 'Richard Gundersen', NULL, '8-26-20 Interested in learning more about the conversion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 16:35:14', '2020-08-26 16:35:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056260028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, 'Cirrus would not provide Nancy with a referral so as to get her Covid test for free, Michele and I spent a bit finding links resources for free testing around her.  Nancy was thrilled by all of this! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-26 16:18:37', '2020-08-26 16:18:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056260023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052476986', 'Michelle Dow', NULL, 'Michelle got a response from her daughters college Colorado State saying that the plan her daughter has through us is not sufficient.  Analisa thought that she might be able to show her MEC card- but Analisa gave her the wrong information...Michelle doesn''t have a MEC.  I told Michelle that if the Redirect letter didn''t do the trick then there may not be any other options.  She said that if the letter doesn''t work that she is going to take her daughter off of the plan.  I told her that I was going to send the letter to Joan, because she was working on the letter last week for another case.  I sent all forwarded information to Joan and tagged Michele in the thread. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-26 16:01:22', '2020-08-26 16:01:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667149', 'Tonya Cauduro', NULL, '8-26-20 Tonya called to inquire about Liberty Conversion. She doesn''t have any pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Looking at $317/$1000 IUA for Oct. 1st start date. Explained differences and benefits of MPB Carez Connected. We have a date set on Sept. 10th to revisit and enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 15:48:34', '2020-08-26 15:48:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009143063', 'Adam Rothberg', NULL, '8-26-20 Adam called a bit panicked about his move bc he''s had some blood tests run and is afraid of what happens if it''s now pre-x. He will get answers from his Dr. tomorrow to allow him to make an educated decision. He will call me if he feels he needs to remain with Sedera to avoid the pre-x clause bc he''s not afraid of $25K in expenses, he''s afraid if they far exceed $25K. Again he will call me if he needs to remain with Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 15:24:46', '2020-08-26 15:24:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056260018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674272', 'LeAnn Gunnell', NULL, 'LeAnn wrote into Kelly F upset because one of her bills was being denied due to the doctor not being in network (apparently) she asked for a phone call, so I gave her one and left a message.  I am going to mention what all of the multiplan lists Kelly F gave her say on each one...that she needs to call to make sure first.  Then I am going to ask her to send whatever bills she has in question over so that I can share them with Jennifer at RCI. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-26 15:08:40', '2020-08-26 15:08:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056250008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087146', 'Emily Donahue', NULL, 'Emily called in and asked if her "number" that she needs to meet is worth her submitting her bills to be paid back. I stopped her and I asked her what  she was talking about. I explained the entirety of her plan to her. The difference between Injury/Illness and what he IUA is and how that works and submitting to start a Need with Sedera. I explained what RCI is and how that is the preventative side to her plan and how that works with being in network and then showing her RCI card and the whole 9. She understands NOTHING! She told me that when she had her welcome call a year ago that from her understanding was every single time she goes to see any doctor she is to pay cash and then submit the bills to US at MPowering Benefits and we reimburse her. I told her absolutely not. I said she never ever ever pays cash when she goes to the doctor every single time UNLESS it is with injury/illness and told her she has to pay the first $1500 out of pocket first and then anything after that she sends to Sedera and starts a Need and they will cover the rest of the bills. After I told her all of this she sounded very out of it and said "Well than what do you consider having a baby? I just had a baby." I told her that is a whole other situation. I put her to Patti to explain cuz i do not know what to tell her about that. Patti explained to her everything I did about Sedera and injury/illness. Emily than asked Patti about having a baby. Patti told Emily that she was supposed to have been in contact with Sedera through the entire pregnancy, NOT after the fact that she already had the baby. This is going to be a huge issue. Emily also asked me after I had explained to her how the injury/illness portion of her plan works why she is paying 300 some dollars if we never reimburse her. I stopped her and I then explained the preventative portion and so on. Emily knows NOTHING about this plan or how anything works. She literally thinks that EVERY SINGLE time she goes to any sort of doctors appointment she is to pay cash and then we at MPowering pay her back. She is now so confused. Patti gave her Sedera''s phone number and told her that she needs to immediately call them the second she gets off the phone with her and see what could possibly be done to help her. Patti also called Wendy about this and told her everything cuz Wendy is Emily''s affiliate. Wendy said that it is probably not going to be that bad because they will look back about 6 months. Point is Emily has no clue how her plan works what so ever. I am going to send her a Welcome Call Scheduler to have another one. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-26 14:19:34', '2020-08-26 14:19:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056260013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042073115', 'Mailan Boris', NULL, 'I have been helping Mai find a lab and explained the vagueness of the ACA when it comes to bloodwork.  Sent HCBB lab pricing graphs and link to ACA list of mandated services. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-26 14:05:07', '2020-08-26 14:05:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238442', 'Anne DeWaters', NULL, '8-26-20 Annie called wanting to understand procedure to get labs done that are already prescribed by dr. and to inquire about how to get meds the best way.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 14:02:54', '2020-08-26 14:02:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056252013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869003', 'Adele Domo', NULL, 'Spoke to Adele and sent her and Desi the quote for a 33 y.o. single female non smoker', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-08-26 13:18:57', '2020-08-26 13:18:57'),
