  ('zcrm_1579374000056252008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630587', 'Lisa Eden', NULL, 'Spoke to Lisa..sen quote and informational email.  Looking at MPBCareZ   MPB Direct and Care+  too expensive', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-08-26 12:42:30', '2020-08-26 12:42:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678021', 'Kirsten Casner', NULL, '8-26-20 Per Ryan Hoff she was charged 2x on one day and again 5 days later. Patti is researching it now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 12:34:05', '2020-08-26 12:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056260003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447348', 'Iris Frieling', NULL, 'she used the welcome call scheduler to ask someone different about a knee injury issue with the Planstin/Zion card.  Jane and Wendy already had a meeting with her yesterday about this.  It seems as though the long time primary care doctor''s office thinks that this member has a $1000 deductible to be met and cancelled her appointment to be seen from an knee injury inflicted on the 20th of this month.  Iris is pretty wound up about the whole thing.  I told her that the best thing to do would be to wait for Wendy and Jane to contact her. She said that she''d have to reschedule the welcome call until all of this subsides. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-26 12:28:15', '2020-08-26 12:28:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752368', 'Jill Fields', NULL, '8-26-20 Guillermo corrected Jill''s account yesterday to reflect the correct MPB Sedera Access Plus membership. All looks good now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 12:23:12', '2020-08-26 12:23:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935161', 'Jill St. Aubin King', NULL, '8-26-20 ES $2500/$436 MPB Carez Worksite for Aug. 1st, 2020 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 12:14:09', '2020-08-26 12:14:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056848001', 'Nora Kenney', NULL, '8-26-20 Nora is 34 and super healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Paying $500+ to Anthem via Cobra. She gets her annual wellness visits every year. She is self-employed, has HSA already. Dr. Lindsey  Appel (Gyn) is in network and Dr. Jeffrey Magaziner is Not. She will find a new PCP if necessary. She will make $30-$35K this year which is way less than normal. Will also check state exchange. Looks pretty cheap that way potentially.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 12:09:10', '2020-08-26 12:09:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056252003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630587', 'Lisa Eden', NULL, 'Called Lisa..LVM', 'Michael Leonetti', 'Michael Leonetti', '2020-08-26 11:54:55', '2020-08-26 11:54:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056232049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809267', 'Diana Hollinger', NULL, 'Member called in and said that she did not make a choice and assumed that her plan would be cancelled.  I sent her out the cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-26 11:40:54', '2020-08-26 11:40:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056250003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575309', 'Corrie Black', NULL, 'Corrie called in and wanted to know if she daughters annual physical is something that is covered with her plan. I said yes and she just needs to follow the same protocol for anything else that is preventative, provider in the PHCS Network, show RCI card and make sure everything is coded as preventative, and make sure they submit the billing to the P.O. Box address that is on the back of her card. She was not sure if the provider was in the network so I checked for her quickly b/c she was at the office as we were talking and the provider is in the network. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-26 11:30:18', '2020-08-26 11:30:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779188', 'Jason LaPointe', NULL, '8-26-20 Guillermo just verified they will be billed at $931.50 bc oldest family member is 52. He said it''s all set in Admin 123. Waiting to make sure it''s corrected here as well.
UPDATE- I changed the price to show accurately in Zoho to show $931.50.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 10:54:39', '2020-08-26 11:23:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056244003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056638001', 'Emily Bennett', NULL, '8-26-20 Emily is friends with Val Johnson and Emily and family are current LHS members. Their price is going from $499 to $675 with $2250 AUA. They are mostly healthy except son (15) has peanut allergy and went to hospital this past year for reaction from eating wrong thing by accident. He also has excema. Emily has thyroid issue. She wants the lowest price option. They earn about $100K per year. Looking at Liberty Conversion with MPB Carez Connected no DPC. She wants to keep her doctors. She also prefers to do thermogram instead of mammogram which she can do with this membership with pre-approval. She was happy to hear that. If they choose the $2500 IUA it''s $597. Or, looking at MPB Care+ for $1500/$559. But, she''s afraid of the pre-x clause in year one since son landed in hospital for his allergies.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-26 10:13:58', '2020-08-26 10:13:58'),
