  ('zcrm_1579374000056232013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086209', 'Samantha Creach', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I refunded the Sept payment after refunding the extra pmt 8/25  that was taken.  I will notify Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-26 08:39:50', '2020-08-26 09:07:22'),
