  ('zcrm_1579374000056232003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779613', 'Michael Coy', NULL, 'Member called in and was charged an extra pmt and then proceeded to tell me that he turns 65 in September.  I sent him the cancellation form and will refund him the 2 pmts.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-26 08:06:58', '2020-08-26 08:06:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056193053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, 'Nancy called in and I helped her get signed up and onto Cirrus.  Her neighbor has been exposed to Covid and she feels she needs to get tested because her husband is very high risk with cystic fibrosis.  She called back to say that the CirrusMD doctor was "slick" super fast....agreed that she should get tested and then sent her online resources for testing in her area.  She was still a bit nervous about the whole situation so I checked on things like pricing and locations, she was so happy that I helped her out, she said that she is going to get in the car with her husband and get in line at a drive through test site.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-25 17:41:06', '2020-08-25 17:41:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056193048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228151', 'Jennifer Wright', NULL, 'Jenny called to ask that we retry her payment.  Patti will do this tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-25 17:36:09', '2020-08-25 17:36:09'),
