  ('zcrm_1579374000056146039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, '8-25-20 Patti called me to let me know Greg has a need that he needs to upload, but Sedera already cancelled him out of their system, so he can''t upload his need that was from July while he was a member. Patti will reach out to Dania tomorrow to rectify the problem. He was still a member when he incurred the need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-25 16:56:39', '2020-08-25 16:56:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056146034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086209', 'Samantha Creach', NULL, '8-25-20 Talked with Patti and she sees Sammi''s cancellation request. Patti will honor a Sept. 1st end date even though it''s after the 20th. I just called and let Sammi know and she was super appreciative. She still can''t get her bank to refund the $35 bc she already had this happen once before and they gave her a 1 time refund and that was in June. She will start her new short-term plan for Sept. 1st now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-25 16:55:26', '2020-08-25 16:55:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056193033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Hooray!  I found her doctor in network!  Philip Priebe - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-25 16:35:27', '2020-08-25 16:35:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056146026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086209', 'Samantha Creach', NULL, '8-25-20 Yes, I spoke with Sammi now and she was pissed that she can''t cancel for Sept. 1st. I had her complete the cancellation form. If Patti is able to cancel her for Sept. 1st she will greatly appreciate it. They are getting some short-term plan in OH or somewhere while they travel/live around the country.  She''s always been super nice, but this time she was very frustrated since now she has to pay $35 overdraft fee to her bank because of the double billing. They are paying less for their short-term plan.  I''ll see what Patti can do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-25 15:47:35', '2020-08-25 15:50:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056146021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000907023', 'Melinda Niemczyk', NULL, 'Called bc frustrated her bank account isn''t working. It''s the same account as it''s been for 15 years. She''s not sure what can be the problem. She was going to call Patti next to have her help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-25 15:44:29', '2020-08-25 15:44:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056193028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086209', 'Samantha Creach', NULL, 'Samantha called in because the bank said they wouldn''t refund the money.  She needs Patti to try another route?  Also she spoke of cancelling....but when I told her that the deadline is the 20th of the month, it didn''t sound like she liked that too much.  Sent Patti a note to catch up with Samantha tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-25 15:38:37', '2020-08-25 15:38:37'),
