  ('zcrm_1579374000056193008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949042', 'Aeja Dik', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Member told me that she doesn''t speak English very well so she is going to go over the email I am sending and welcome letter in her mail before she calls me back with additional questions.  She did not know that the $2500 would be per need- she thought it was a deductible.  She was also under the impression that her pre-x medications would be covered at 100% after the 1st year.  I went over all Sedera logistics at least twice with her.  I told her to call us back with any further questions and we will get through them together! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-25 13:25:42', '2020-08-25 13:25:42'),
