  ('zcrm_1579374000056146008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056191010', 'Beth Wilson', NULL, '8-25-20 Beth chose Cigna Connect HSA Bronze 6500 EPO/Bronze for $648.75. She''s prefer to pay full price and get money back in taxes later if possible. Paid with cc online. I helped complete her app bc Safari wasn''t working to enter a date. She will reassess this at a later date in Nov. Perhaps breast reduction will be complete by then.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-25 11:54:47', '2020-08-25 11:59:35'),
