  ('zcrm_1579374000056178034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '08.25.20:  Answered Brooke''s text asking why they were billed $511. Explained that they were billed for their old program (since they converted at end of billing cycle) and were charged for new plan.   Patti has credited the $511 and will charge them for the new plan @ $431 tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-08-25 11:27:01', '2020-08-25 11:27:01'),
