  ('zcrm_1579374000056153003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331105', 'Kathleen White', NULL, 'Member was billed in error out of MPBA in FTNI .  I refunded this member and set up future billing in Admin 123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-25 09:50:12', '2020-08-25 09:50:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056146003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949042', 'Aeja Dik', NULL, 'Aeja called in and said she is new to this plan and has never needed to utilize it yet and wanted to know all about her plan. I asked her if she has had her Welcome Call yet and she said no. I explained to her what it is and that right when she started she should have gotten a Welcome email and in that email it had a Welcome Call Scheduler in it and she should have picked a day and time that was best for her and one of out wellness coordinators would have called her and sat down for about 30 mins or however it may take depending on how many questions she may have. She said that would be great and I let her know I am going to send her the Welcome Call Scheduler again and for her to go ahead and choose what day and time is best for her and either Kelly Cheever will call her or Vanessa. I said there even may be an opening today and she loved that Idea. I said just go ahead and open the email and click the link in it and it will bring her right to the page to schedule her day and time. She thanked me very very much and will do that right away. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-25 09:40:20', '2020-08-25 09:40:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056138003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037540001', 'Yolanda Ferrer', NULL, 'Yolanda called in and said this is her first time using this for a medical emergency and wanted to know what she needs to do. She had an incident on Friday and was in the ER from then until the next day on Saturday 8/21-20-8/22/20. I let her know that there is no network she can go anywhere she likes, she is to present herself as a cash pay and only pays out of pocket $500 which is her IUA. Anything after that she is to ask to be billed the rest and then submit those bills into Sedera and start a Need with them. I gave her their phone number and send her the email the explains how to starts the Need process with Sedera. She thanked me very much and said I was very helpful and answered all her questions with ease and is happy it is not a long drawn out process. I told her it is very simple as long as she just does everything she needs to do which she has so far. She is all set and very happy with us and the process. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-25 09:22:15', '2020-08-25 09:22:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056042028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010492001', 'Anabella Aguilar', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member will contact Wendy for dental and vision plans. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-25 08:13:59', '2020-08-25 08:23:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056105008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656209', 'Bonnie Kleinhans', NULL, 'Member was billed in error I will refund 1 month', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-25 08:08:05', '2020-08-25 08:08:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000056105003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862376', 'Rachel Hrezo', NULL, 'Received Phone call from this members employer John Greco.  He told me that Rachel was his secretary and that she left his employ on or about 5/2018.  Said that he had been paying for this this whole time.  I told him that I could refund him the Sept pmt and cancel he ok with this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-25 07:53:28', '2020-08-25 07:53:28'),
