  ('zcrm_1579374000056089027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', NULL, '8-24-20 Patti figured out the problem with Mark''s payments and she''s figured out MPB owes him $882! I spoke with Mark and the 3 of us connected so Mark could give Patti his checking account information for an immediate refund. Once the refund goes through, Patti will delete out his checking account information moving forward. I also let Mark know he''d get an email from Sedera stating a change or adjustment to his account that he can ignore.  He was super appreciative and understanding. It should be all set moving forward!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-24 14:43:42', '2020-08-24 14:43:42'),
