  ('zcrm_1579374000056089016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937096', 'Ramon Pinela', NULL, '8-24-20 I notified Ramon via email that his membership has been cancelled due to non-payment. He told me numerous times he wanted to keep his membership but will never follow through with completing conversion. He was going to have his daughter help but he wasn''t sure he could do it by the deadline. He been given multiple opportunities for over a month to update the billing information and convert his membership. Cancelled now as of Aug. 1st back date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-24 13:54:05', '2020-08-24 13:54:21'),
