  ('zcrm_1579374000055951003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447500', 'Clove Berger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Verified with office that enrollment is good to go. Requesting school form from Zion. By end of day Zion will provide to us. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-21 12:01:07', '2020-08-21 12:01:07'),
