  ('zcrm_1579374000055949003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028543301', 'James Marcellus', NULL, 'Trisha is going to either find James'' Redirect 1095 or try to get his receipts from between Jan19-Dec19  I told him that this is not what the IRS was asking for but he wanted it anyway. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-21 11:57:27', '2020-08-21 11:57:27'),
