  ('zcrm_1579374000055897008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042073115', 'Mailan Boris', NULL, 'She called in wondering if Teladoc would be able to get her some antibiotic''s for a tooth infection, I told her that there was a strong possibility.  She has downloaded the app but wanted to call to see if there was a quicker way to get a hold of a doctor. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-21 10:52:58', '2020-08-21 10:52:58'),
