  ('zcrm_1579374000055890016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779188', 'Jason LaPointe', NULL, '8-21-20 Talked with Patti and she said Kelly will call them to let them know they need to re-enroll under Jason''s name and it will be officially converted for a Sept. 1st start date now instead. They were missed somehow in the system because Wendy B. completed the conversion and they didn''t connect the dots.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-21 10:38:43', '2020-08-21 10:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055890011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881640', 'Meghan Grabow', NULL, '8-21-20 Patti creating task to cancel her membership since added to Jason Wright''s membership. Patti will also refund Meghan the $279 now since she was billed in July for Aug. membership while she was already charged for membership with Jason as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-21 10:36:17', '2020-08-21 10:36:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055897003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466180', 'Sarah Pyper', NULL, 'Called for help with scheduling tests and doctor''s appointments, gave her Redirect''s number and Sedera''s if this turns into a large need. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-21 10:29:05', '2020-08-21 10:29:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055890003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447500', 'Clove Berger', NULL, '8-21-20 Clove called in and already did her Welcome Call but we couldn''t find her app. It never went through. She just redid it and it''s all set for MPB Carez w/ MEC $1000/$294.  I left her a vm to make sure she doesn''t have any open needs with Sedera or pre-x. If so, told her to call me, if not, she''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-21 10:22:35', '2020-08-21 10:23:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055870023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029949150', 'James Purvis', NULL, 'called in trying to get into his member portal.  I told him that he hasn''t been assigned a username and password yet.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-21 10:05:17', '2020-08-21 10:05:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055870018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056599058', 'Dakar Murry', NULL, 'Called about switching plans and getting his premium down...I gave him Wiley Long''s contact info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-21 10:01:41', '2020-08-21 10:01:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055870013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'Rose and Edward have been calling ALL morning.  First it was for the OptumRX plan,  then it was Rose not being on the PDF copy of the card, and then Rose called to tell me what her diabetes schedule looks like an exam and labwork every 3 months and that is what she will be using her MEC for.  I told her that these visits and labs would NOT be covered by her Planstin card.  She asked me if all this would be covered at all...I told her that it would be after her IUA of $2500 and up to $25000 because it will be treated like a pre-ex condition.   I asked if she had spoken to Ron Patterson before making this transition and she told me that she didn''t remember...that there are so many names and different companies she can''t keep track.  I answered all questions at least 5 times, I reached out to Patti just to let her know what is going on.  For right now let''s see what these members decide to do with all of this new information. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-21 09:46:42', '2020-08-21 09:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055847100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993023', 'Tom LaScola', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Sedera &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-21 09:14:16', '2020-08-21 09:14:16'),
