  ('zcrm_1579374000055870003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'he wanted to know more about the Optum medication plan through Planstin, I told him that the best place to go is to Planstin.com under resources and then he complained that he had a flip phone and no internet service and the best option....for him....would be their phone number.  I gave him the number, then he called back to complain that he couldn''t get a hold of anybody.  I told him that it could be due to the fact that they are not currently in the office yet.  THEN he told me that I might has well send that information to his wife because she wanted the information now and he didn''t trust the phone number I sent him.   I told him that it wouldn''t be a problem. (jerk)  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-21 08:04:20', '2020-08-21 08:04:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055847085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299149', 'Grant Hudson', NULL, 'Member left Betties VM I called him back and he asked about changing his pmt info.  Told him he changed it to a CC on 8/3.  He said he did that in error.  I will send him out another Pmt update form to update when he needs to.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-21 07:27:40', '2020-08-21 07:27:40'),
