  ('zcrm_1579374000055826092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014743027', 'Jay Land', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 784 
Question : I am not sure what else I need to do to confirm the changes made to my plan on 08/20/20, but if so, let me know.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-08-20 21:51:12', '2020-08-20 21:51:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055847075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '8-20-20 Kristen called because she''s over the top frustrated by the increased rates for meds through Citizen''s RX. She just paid way more for some generic meds like $50 for something that used to be $5 with WelldyneRX. She picked up 3 meds and it was way too expensive. I told her to call the Concierge to get best prices. She will do so. She thought I had looked up all prices for her but I had only looked at prices I could access easily while on phone. She will try that next. She was also irate that Sedera is asking her to complete some forms to apply for discounts on $5000 med for daughter that just increased by $100.  Med Lupron is to stop puberty and treatment was approved by Sedera before they started the whole process. Sedera has paid for it for almost a year! Kristen didn''t want to give out her private SS#''s to random companies to apply for the discounts. After listening to all of her gripes, I suggested she check out the validity of the company they want her to apply to. Plus anything following HIPPA laws is extra protected. She just doesn''t want to be forced to give out that information. Even the Karis Group was unable to negotiate the cost down which is why they are asking her to apply for a program to get a better price. Even after she vented extensively, she understands this is still her best healthcare membership in the last 10 years. She used to be a mental health therapist and now is a real estate agent. Also use to do psych evals in hospital. Wishes they could get good group insurance, but I told her none of it''s "good" anymore. She hasn''t had group ins for 10 years. It''s all changed since then anyhow. She thanked me for my thoughts and will call Concierge and fill out application for discounts on Lupron.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-20 16:57:05', '2020-08-20 16:57:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055847070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '8-20-20 He wants help with understanding conversion changes and possibly help with dental. Calling me back shortly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-20 16:23:19', '2020-08-20 16:23:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055847065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679198', 'Kari Rosckowff', NULL, '8-20-20 Phone tag. Just left her a vm 1 hr after she called me back. Told her deadline again is today and to call me if possible.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-20 16:06:08', '2020-08-20 16:06:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055847042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, '8-20-20 Tom''s friends with Jamie Lagarde and wanted to understand why Sedera thinks it''s ok to double their monthly membership fee for 60-64. Jamie has not called him back. HeTom''s not pleased. Tom did not say anything in his vm to tip Jamie off. 
Tom and wife are super healthy, eat well, exercise, no pre-x, etc. So, he believes his only option is to move to MPB Carez w/ DPC ES $1000/$361. He''s a member of MD VIP and pay $125 a month per person. They get their annual wellness visits through MD VIP, access 24/7/365, and they help negotiate rates when have to leave to go to specialist or do labs or anything else. He''s thrilled about MD VIP. MD VIP is headquartered in FL but they find the best in class doctors all around the country to invite them into MD VIP to provide best service to patients. He uses PCP Dr. Jim Robinson. But, another friend or family uses an MD VIP who is also a cardiologist since that was important to that person. Zion can call 985-809-7171 to confirm their membership.
Completed conversion and was very thankful for my help and will follow through with Welcome Call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-20 15:19:31', '2020-08-20 15:39:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055847034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055920063', 'Lady Fuller', NULL, '8-20-20 Lady just enrolled in MPB Carez Worksite w/ MEC $1000/$294. She is business owner for biz in Denver which is her source of income. She''s hoping to have her employees join as well. She will pay for them. They are paying $600 now! This will cut their cost down to $269 or $294 for $1000 IUA since all in 20''s and 30''s. She will have them call me now if they want to join for Sept. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-20 14:55:43', '2020-08-20 15:04:22'),
