  ('zcrm_1579374000055847003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', NULL, '8-20-20 Steve called and he suddenly has a new blood disorder they are testing for now. Instructed him to open a Need. He''s met his IUA already. He will stay with Sedera Access Plus for now. He has a follow up appt in 6 weeks from now. Doctor also wants to check his knee and spine for some reason. He eats all organic and exercises, etc. So, it''s bizarre having a blood issue. We will connect again shortly to complete conversion. Sedera Access Plus $1000/$378. App was stuck in spinning mode in his end. I was able to click Complete and then it finished successfully with the auto generated email showing his choice. He''s all set and Andre showed him how to create a new Need. He asked hospital for proof of cash discount to be sent to him. They are mailing it to him now and he''ll start the process of Need next week. He knows if/when this is wrapped up he can switch to MPB Carez for getting back wellness, HSA and lower monthly.  He''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-20 12:03:40', '2020-08-20 16:02:50'),
