  ('zcrm_1579374000055763003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659143', 'Kristina Razma', NULL, 'called in to our answering system after hours asking about a pap smear bill, mammogram, and lab work.  I emailed her to remind her to reach out to Redirect Health and gave her their number again.  I invited her to call back in and speak to me if she needed me to further explain how her plan words.  Because I remember doing her welcome call not to long ago I thought this appropriate. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-20 07:03:35', '2020-08-20 07:03:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055742067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816308', 'Melissa McKenzie', NULL, '8-19-20 Jen-Ai Stokesbary - jenu88@yahoo.com is interested in paying for her Nanny Melissa McKenzie''s healthcare. Melissa is 43 and currently no ins. Just broke her foot and is in a cast/boot now. She did have x-rays and diagnosis. Not sure how much PT if any will be needed. The 3 of us will talk tomorrow at 1:30 for potential Sept. 1st start date. Melissa started working 3 weeks ago, so could be SEP if need be. Getting paid $20 an hour for 9 hours a day. Turns out to be about $46K per year annualized. Likely too high for subsidy or borderline. She''s single and just moved back to CO from TX during COVID. She is trying to quit smoking!!! Apparently quit recently but not for super long. Enrolled in MPB Carez Worksite w/ MEC. Quit smoking 3 weeks ago. Added the $50 fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-19 17:00:50', '2020-08-21 15:40:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055742062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822033', 'Barbara Beumee', NULL, '8-19-20 Barb just got a new job and will get benefits as of Sept. 1st. Wants to cancel membership. I sent her link and instructions and also left vm with instructions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-19 16:42:59', '2020-08-19 16:42:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055723201', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758155', 'Natalie Jex-Landoe', NULL, 'Joshua from Sedera reached out to me regarding this member...she called them stating that she was going to cancel and just giving them the heads up.....and that we would already know this.  I told Josh that from the looks of things in our system she hadn''t yet contacted us....or filled out a cancellation form.  So I gave her a call, left a very detailed voicemail informing her that we did not have a submitted form and that she needed to complete the form before midnight tonight due to the deadline. -I sent her the online form.  KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-19 15:50:41', '2020-08-19 15:51:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055723196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497007', 'Misti Wilson', NULL, 'Misti called because she didn''t see a way of adding her husband and children to the CirrusMD platform.  I grabbed the personal email that belongs to her husband and told her that I would reach out to John about this so that it gets fixed.  Sent John a message through teams. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-19 15:36:40', '2020-08-19 15:36:40'),
