Brooke Childs', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-19 15:29:57', '2020-08-19 15:29:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055723191', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, 'Worked on a list of quality gastro doctors in Matts area because he is having gastro issues.  I sent him 4 doctors to choose from, and I sent him a price graph from HCBB letting him know what he should expect to pay and also to ensure that they do not charge him more than they should. Also sent Sedera Needs template. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-19 14:50:45', '2020-08-19 14:50:45'),
