  ('zcrm_1579374000055723181', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005544245', 'Bethany Schaap', NULL, 'The member called in to ask questions about the new Liberty plan, I told her that she needed to speak with Andrea.  I told the member after a few questions that I needed to answer the members calls as they come in.  I emailed Andrea to give her the heads up. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-19 13:57:25', '2020-08-19 13:57:25'),
