  ('zcrm_1579374000055723161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030252076', 'Darryl Claunch', NULL, 'Ashley called to see if she still had the right card to bring her son to his preventative care appointment, she did.  She wanted to know what to do when she arrived to the visit, I sent her the Wellness visit instructions template. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-19 13:30:02', '2020-08-19 13:30:02'),
