  ('zcrm_1579374000055663008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024401', 'Merily Pompa', NULL, '8-18-20 Merily is doing conversion now and put me on hold... Her husband is a Dr. and they use intergrative medicine, they go to Mexico for treatments at times, they are not a fan of big pharma or mandatory vaccines! She''s sending me a link to a movie to watch called The Act by Andy Wigfield / $12 to watch. She was part of raising $100K to fund the movie. They are showing it in UT soon. She sent me an invite to an event via my personal cell just now. Completed conversion for$5000 / $546.50 MPB Carez EF. They DO NOT do mammograms or colonoscopies and do not want the wellness component. Kids are still dependents living at home., 22, 21 and 16.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-18 09:43:33', '2020-08-18 09:56:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055663003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, '8-18-20 Mat emailed bc he was charged the full $294 that was showing on his conversion form. I forgot to update the form. But, I sent the proof of DPC to Patti on 7/22. It looks like it fell through the cracks. Zoho and Cognito were not updated. Patti and John just looked at it and will refund mat the difference of $95 now. He''s a member of Green Hills Direct family Care with Dr. Kimberly Legg Corba D.O.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-18 09:41:05', '2020-08-18 11:45:19'),
