  ('zcrm_1579374000055651003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177182', 'Anna Thexton', NULL, 'Anna called in with questions about some knee pain she has been having, she is seeing her chiropractor and alternative medicine doctor for.  I told her that it would be shared up to $25000 because it sounded like it would be treated as pre-existing.  She didn''t think that she had received an invitation from CirrusMD, but I helped her find it in an email search.  She wanted to know what the needs process looked like and I went through that with her, I also directed her to the welcome email sent from Zion and told her to check out all of the links they sent.  I told her that zionhealth.org would be a great resource for her, and I also encouraged her to give Zion a phone call because they had a very specific way of handling the alternative care- if and when it turned into traditional medicine care with a surgeon.  She was so happy with all of the answers and advice that I gave her.  She will be giving Zion a phone call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-18 08:02:59', '2020-08-18 08:02:59'),
