  ('zcrm_1579374000055578138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, 'Katrina called because she had just gotten a $13000 bill from a colonoscopy her gastro wanted her to have because of her diverticulitis.  She wanted to know if she would have to pay that.  After finally finding out the plan she had converted onto I told her that she would be responsible for the first $1000 and that the rest Zion would pick up/up to $25000 because this would be considered a pre existing condition.  She was relieved to hear that she wouldn''t have to pay the whole bill and just a portion. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-17 18:50:04', '2020-08-17 18:50:04'),
