  ('zcrm_1579374000055603021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '08.16.20:  Emailed Kim and Kevin. Asked if they completed their conversion form (as I didn''t see it in the cognito forms).  Reminded them of the 8/20 deadline for this conversion.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-08-16 14:33:45', '2020-08-16 14:33:45'),
