  ('zcrm_1579374000055578028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636811', 'Roberta Mell', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-14 07:04:33', '2020-08-14 07:04:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055578023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, 'working on finishing up a prescription quote request for Quinn. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-13 18:28:02', '2020-08-13 18:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055587003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816049', 'William Webb', NULL, '8-11-20 Josh is 37 and wife is soon to be 37. They are with LHS now. Family of 5. Wife has disc problem in back but never really treated it. Throws it out sometimes. IF she chooses to a surgery at some point they priced it out at $8K-$10K due to a degenerative disc. NOT self-employed. But, can do LHS conversion with extra provisions with MPB. MPB Carez Connect = $697/$1000 and no waiting period for pre-x, wellness right away, plus alternative thermography allowed with pre-approval. Also, wife often goes to chiro and pays $60-$100 per visit he thinks. She has strong anxiety and takes meds.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 18:06:46', '2020-08-13 18:09:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055578018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, 'Planstin has officially added Meghan into their system per Wendy.  Patti has been informed about this as well.  I emailed Meghan and Jason to let them know that they will be receiving a new Planstin card with both of their names on it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-13 17:33:56', '2020-08-13 17:33:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286201', 'Brian Pierce', NULL, '8-13-20 Registered for CirrusMD successfully per test.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 17:21:42', '2020-08-13 17:21:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, '8-13-20 Megan received card for Co-Pay network not for HSA membership erroneously. Discovering ALL members received wrong card now and elevating to Planstin manager and Robert Steele to discuss tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 17:19:11', '2020-08-13 17:19:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, '8-13-20 Per a call to the Concierge Team that Kelly C fielded, Jason Wright inquired about why his wife Meghan Grabow was not showing on his Planstin card. Upon inquiring with Planstin it''s because they were not showing her as part of the membership. I''ve added her to the membership with Planstin.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 17:18:15', '2020-08-13 17:18:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005273011', 'Tina Le', NULL, '8-13-20 Called to make sure she didn''t need to cancel directly with Sedera and I told her MPB is taking care of that on her behalf. She thought so since paying the membership to MPB. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 17:12:29', '2020-08-13 17:12:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626120', 'Russell Finsterwald', NULL, '8-13-20 Russell asked Sophia, his girlfriend to complete enrollment for him for MPB Carez NO MEC, $1000/$209 worksite membership. Enrollment complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 16:32:40', '2020-08-13 16:32:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '8-13-20 Called bc still confused since didn''t receive emails she thought. I resent her the Welcome Call email to sign up for that again since 1st time they told her to wait until after the 20th. She found the CirrusMD email to register. She looked at bank account and has not been charged yet which she now knows is delayed. She also knows that read emails from Zion as well. She''s all set for the moment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 15:40:32', '2020-08-13 15:40:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055578013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003780045', 'Kenneth Malsky', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-13 14:52:09', '2020-08-13 14:52:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055578008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007278037', 'Richard Wrightsman', NULL, 'called to ask what to say at preventative care doctor to explain what type of plan he has, sent Wellness Visit Instructions template. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-13 14:50:52', '2020-08-13 14:50:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002934007', 'Holly Orban', NULL, 'Called into cancel with the $50 charge every month. Sent her the cancellation email and she needs the most recent $50 refunded, so the charge from 8/5/20 needs to be refunded. She was very upset when she just found out that we no longer work with Liberty for about a year now. She said she has done some research and what not and asked if she was notified when we parted ways. I told her that yes there was an email in a newsletter that was sent back in August of last year stating we were parting way''s. She said she is going to continue to do research on this because she feels she was forced to have this and pay every month for something she has never ever used nor would use. I have a feeling we are going to be hearing from her in the near future and possibly with a lawyer. That is how she was making it seem was her next steps.... -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-13 14:26:13', '2020-08-13 14:26:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626082', 'Kathleen Briscoe-Thompson', NULL, '8-13-20 Alan and Kathleen enrolled just now via worksite through Kathleen''s business. They are all set to go! See above for details.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 14:25:14', '2020-08-13 14:25:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055578003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331105', 'Kathleen White', NULL, 'Welcome call complete, though Kathy was a bit myphed about finding out for the first time that the $500 per need was not a deductible and that she would have to pay on it up to 3 times per membership year.  She asked if this was a change as well, and I told her that it was not.   She also was unaware that she needed to pay a $3.00 per month on a bank account with Sedera.  She argued with me about the MPB.Health invitation for joining CirrusMD.....until she found it, and when I offered to stay on the line with her to set it up she told me that this would be a valuable waste of her time when she might need to time to ask me more questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-13 13:53:32', '2020-08-13 13:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055547013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, 'Refunded this member the $100 that was charged at enrollment .  Will be re-enrolling w/Zion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-13 13:33:25', '2020-08-13 13:33:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055547008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, 'Sent form a 2nd time to update pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-13 13:13:53', '2020-08-13 13:13:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '8-13-20 James and Julie are both 50 and kids 12 and 15. Full cost of Anthem is about $2200. Live in Aspen area. Healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no pre-x other than med for hair loss. Lost job unexpectedly and insurance as of July 31st! Was earning $250K-$300K. Wife is teacher. Going to get cash distribution from biz he was part of as a K-1 within the month. But, must join the MPB Carez Individual for $1000/$846.50. Explained wellness limits. They hike, bike, ski, etc. James will call me later to provide accurate SS#''s.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 12:57:07', '2020-08-13 12:57:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816206', 'Josephine Guarneros', NULL, '8-13-20 Josephine is turning 26 in Oct and is independent. Moving to CO in a week to teach dance lessons! She teaches many types such as tap, contemporary, etc. She''s healthy, just has psoriasis and some allergies. Was taking allergy shots but done with them now. Most of her allergies aren''t activated in Colorado! Has been taking Zyrtec. No tobacco. Works as W4 employee so best for MPB Carez for Individuals, $1000/$244. Sept. 1st start date. Brian, her dad will join us for her enrollment on 20th and he will pay for now while she''s getting life in order.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 12:53:09', '2020-08-13 12:53:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522001', 'Michael Higgins', NULL, '8-13-20 Contemplating going to MPB Secure so she never has to deal with RCI again. She will discuss with husband and get back to me. Cost is going from $574 to $625 for $1500 IUA level.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-13 12:43:11', '2020-08-13 12:43:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055539008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706105', 'Joseph Freije', NULL, 'missed welcome call, left message, sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-13 12:33:25', '2020-08-13 12:33:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055548003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004641096', 'Michael Higgins', NULL, 'Called in to ask what the $50 charge was that she has been paying for every month. She said that she was never made aware of this and thought it was part of her Liberty charges and health plan. She said she has never used any of this and will not. She was very upset to hear this and that is was not part of Liberty. She asked for a refund for this past month. I confirmed with Patti because she is the one that takes care of that and she said yes that is fine. Tina was very happy about that and said I was very helpful and very nice. She was expecting a totally different experience when calling to cancel and that whomever was going to be mean and nasty to her because that is usually how things go when she calls to cancel something. She wishes she knew that this was not part of Liberty or there was more to it. She is not cancelling with Liberty only HES for the $50. Very sweet lady. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-13 12:26:08', '2020-08-13 12:26:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055547003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361828', 'Andrew Papantoniou', NULL, 'This member was charged for 8/2020 since he submitted late. Difference betweem Sedera &amp; new Zion plan $95. I will refund out of FTNI and set payments up going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-13 12:25:53', '2020-08-13 12:25:53'),
