  ('zcrm_1579374000055522008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593044', 'Jonathan Blaylock', NULL, 'Member called in just found out that his wife is pregnant.  I advised him that it would be a $5k IUA and to be in touch w/ Sedera and that they would step him thru the process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-13 10:31:02', '2020-08-13 10:31:02'),
