  ('zcrm_1579374000055488003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233082', 'Daniel Wisdom', NULL, 'No response.  Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-13 08:03:40', '2020-08-13 08:03:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055484003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575167', 'Peggy Neises', NULL, 'Peggy called in and said that she needs to make an eye appointment and wanted to know if that is something that is covered or considered preventative with her plan. I said it is not and explained how she goes about doing that with Sedera and opening up a Need with them after she has met the $1000 IUA. She also said that her husband already had a dentists appointment and some thing happen with that and asked how that will work. I told her that will be the same exact situation as her eye appointment. He is responsible for the first $1000 and anything after that is to be submitted into Sedera and he open''s up a Need with them. I sent her the email that explains how to do that along with Sedera''s phone number for her to call ASAP when they are open. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-13 07:47:18', '2020-08-13 07:47:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055443048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647085', 'Christopher Lopez', NULL, 'Sent Chris HCBB Vasectomy info and Amber Copper IUD coupon and HCBB info as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-12 17:40:28', '2020-08-12 17:40:28'),
