  ('zcrm_1579374000055443033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899042', 'Ashley Mooney', NULL, 'tried giving her a call for a welcome call that she had scheduled.  lmom inviting her to give me a call back so that we could finish her conversion form.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-12 15:55:26', '2020-08-12 15:55:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055443028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'resent post welcome call summary to Deb....for some reason she didn''t get or see the one that Vanessa sent earlier on the 10th.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-12 15:27:00', '2020-08-12 15:27:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055443023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, 'Jason called to gain a bit more understanding in regards to his billing and making sure that his wife was added.  Also he wanted to make sure that his wife was in their system as the Planstin PDF states that it should show both member and their spouses'' name if enrolled. I reached out to Wendy about this and told Jason that either she or myself would update him about this as soon as we hear back from our contact at Planstin. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-12 15:18:33', '2020-08-12 15:18:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055472008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'Spoke to Alicia.  Having surgery on 9/9.  Second part of a reconstruction.  2nd MD process was completed and she LOVED it.  Thought is was a great experience.  Putting her in touch with her needs coordinator to ensure all is in order.  Provider is looking for a down payment.  Alicia is addressing that with Sedera.  Sent a Slack message asking Sedera to reach out to her.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-08-12 14:59:09', '2020-08-12 14:59:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055443018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, 'Missed welcome call, vm box full, sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-12 14:44:21', '2020-08-12 14:44:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055443013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752240', 'Carolyn Decker', NULL, 'Welcome call Complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-12 14:43:42', '2020-08-12 14:43:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055448028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322148', 'Mike Gold', NULL, 'this member had already been billed for Sedera amount.  Price difference was $6. I charged him out of FTNI and will set up future Zion billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-12 14:34:37', '2020-08-12 14:34:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055437013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046514246', 'Arthur Sattva', NULL, 'Siri called in and she thought she is to call into us to set up appointments for her Wellness Visits. I let her know that is Redirect and that is always going to be her first point of contact. With anything medical emergency she can call into here I can help her through the process of what she needs to do and then she will need to contact Sedera to open up her Need. I also explained what else we offer here and she was Ok with everything. I gave her Redirect''s phone number to call and have them set an appointment she and her husband need. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-12 14:03:48', '2020-08-12 14:03:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055437008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052864149', 'Catherine Brown', NULL, 'Cathy called in and asked about if she needed to call and let us know that her daughter is going to college. I said no it doesn''t affect her or her plan at all and then she started asking about what she does if there is some sort of medical emergency that happens with her daughter. I explained the process of Sedera and starting a Need with them after she has paid the $1000 of her IUA. She fully understood that and then asked what about anything else other than emergencies. I told her that is through Redirect. She then hesitated for a second (I could tell she was about to ask well then who are you and what do you do?) and said "Ok so you guys are kinda like the Umbrella for both of those 2 corporations? I said Exactly! I also told her what is included with me here at MPowering, not just me the concierge service, there is prescription services(explained in full), and a telemedicine service(explained in full). She immensely understands  everything. The first member EVER that FULLY understood who we are when it comes to being in the middle of 2 different vendors(Redirect&Sedera,RCI&Sedera, ASi&Sedera, and now Zion&Us or Zion&Planstin). She lastly called back after our convo and asked if the college does not accept her daughters plan if she is able to take her off the plan for the summer or however long and put her back on when need be. I said of course. It is a very simple process and to just let us know in advance. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-12 14:01:26', '2020-08-12 14:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055472003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, 'Spoke to Jill.  Needs a re-fill for Armour Thyroid.  Doctor is out of town and she is leaving on a trip.  Told her to call ReDirect, they may be willing to call in a scrip for a refill.  Texted coupon $30.87', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-08-12 13:42:11', '2020-08-12 13:42:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055443008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-12 13:30:03', '2020-08-12 13:30:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055450013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, '8-12-20 Jill is cancelling MPB Secure/Redirect bc turning 60 and joining MPB Carez w/ MEC $344/$1000. Just has thyroid issue that she handles with diet and meds.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-12 13:27:48', '2020-08-12 13:29:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055450008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, '8-12-20 Have 3 emails for them so put one into the Nickname category.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-12 12:45:08', '2020-08-12 12:45:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055450003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, '8-12-20 Julianne 46 and James 47, kids almost 8 and 6 are excited about MPB Carez w/ MEC worksite $1000/$731.50. Have an HSA already. James is self-employed. Julianne is considering quitting and going per diem with work to stay home and teach kids since BVSD is going all online for now.  Working for hospital and paying $500-$600 plus hospital pays rest. Very health, no meds, no tobacco, no pre-x. Daughter has glasses and gets one check up per year. Has VSP now but for Julianne and daughter bc forced to have primary adult through the hospital coverage. They likely want an Oct. 1st start date! Make sure to select Oct. on application!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-12 12:43:42', '2020-08-12 12:43:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055443003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509046', 'Greg Jenkins', NULL, 'Welcome call with Sheila and Greg complete. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-12 12:39:02', '2020-08-12 12:39:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055437003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, 'Melany called in and asked what she needs to do for her Dermatology appointment that she needs to go do because she has some moles that she needs to take care of. I explained to her how that works and that there is no network she needs to stay in and she is to present herself as a cash pay patient and she is responsible for the first $500 of her IUA. She 100% understood that. I let her know that she needs to keep all of her receipts and bills for this/these visit/visit''s and submit everything into Sedera. If this becomes more than her IUA what Sedera will do is, once they have gotten proof of her paying her IUA, they will contact the provider and negotiate the billing down to a final cost. Once everyone has come to an agreement of final cost then Sedera cuts a check and sends the check to her. She will then use that check to pay the provider. She then asked and said that is absolutely should be if not, if when she goes for preventative annual wellness visit is skin check is part of that preventative cost and covered. I told her that no it is not. Anything skin check is diagnostic for Dermatology. She did not understand that and then got very angry with me and said that does not make sense and she needs to argue with the doctor then. I asked her if she would please hold and I double checked with Patti. Patti said the same thing I did and that it is NOT something considered preventative. She just was not taking my word for it so I had Patti speak to her and told her the same EXACT thing that I did. The only thing Patti told her that I didn''t was that it is not us saying no and not covering it. It is what the ACA Guidelines deem preventative, the Federal Govt'' is the one that made these choice''s, not us. She seemed to be ok with that and understood. She thanked us for all the info and for helping her out explaining everything she needed to know.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-12 12:20:23', '2020-08-12 12:20:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055389069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003748040', 'Natalie Lampert', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Chose MPB CareZ with MEC, IUA $2,500/$264.  Verified plan with Patti. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-12 12:00:04', '2020-08-12 12:00:54'),
