  ('zcrm_1579374000055353042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411075', 'Nancy Levinson', NULL, '8-11-20 Wendy,
What is the process to terminate my health coverage? I am transitioning to full time at my job next week and will be provided with their healthcare program. LMK. Thank you so much for all you’ve done over the past two years.
Nancy', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-11 16:56:05', '2020-08-11 16:56:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055339023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  I ran a doctor search for a preventative care doctor in network and quality, priced out some meds with Reid, and looked up a max amount he can put into his HSA this year.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-11 16:20:51', '2020-08-11 16:20:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055338017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521236', 'Laura Chasko', NULL, '08/11/20 Called Laura - Left Message regarding Zion digital card will be emailed to her.  Gave her Zion''s phone number to call for help with completing Medical Needs Form.  Emailed her this information as well.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2020-08-11 14:30:52', '2020-08-11 14:30:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055339018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007637033', 'Nancy Elgie', NULL, 'reached out to Nancy per Analisa and Wendy''s request.  She was having difficulty sending in her preventative care claim to ASI. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-11 14:14:05', '2020-08-11 14:14:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055339013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, 'missed welcome call, attempt number 2, left vm and sent a new scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-11 13:40:40', '2020-08-11 13:40:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055359003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029420050', 'Jason Liddell', NULL, 'Took a fall in Canada while on vacation in Feb. .  Ended up in the emergency room via ambulance.  Showed him how to open a need and upload bills.  ER == $1100, Ambulance - $500.  Told him to get it into the system seeing as he is leaving Sedera.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-08-11 13:33:44', '2020-08-11 13:33:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055353028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, '8-11-20 Debra chose $1000/$344 MPB Carez with MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-11 13:08:35', '2020-08-11 13:08:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055353023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042221180', 'Lisa Watson', NULL, 'Member called in with questions about a open need that she has with Sedera.  I directed her to Sedera.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-11 13:00:43', '2020-08-11 13:00:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055353018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003780045', 'Kenneth Malsky', NULL, '8-11-20 Ken has high blood pressure and cholesterol and takes meds and exercises via walking to control it.  He is self-employed, 58 and gets his annual wellness visits. Dr. Melanie Mirande is Not in the PHCS network so told him it has to be pre-approved. He thinks it costs $400 for blood work and $150 for Dr. visit. He also has no pituitary gland and hypogonadism, ie. low testosterone. He looked at Christian Healthsharing and it''s only $175 a month for $125K cap and can add $45 per quarter for up to $1M per incident. I''m not sure they will truly share in annual wellness visit but he thinks so. They have $500 per incident. He''s choosing them. Doesn''t want to pay $344 a month since he believes he''s healthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-11 12:39:14', '2020-08-11 12:39:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055353013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521236', 'Laura Chasko', NULL, 'Laura called Paul Cholak and said that she got into a horse back riding accident back on the 6th and is still in the hospital. She does not have any information for Zion or anything on coverage. Paul called Joan and told her the rundown and Joan came into the office and spoke with me about this. We called Laura to get more info on exactly what happened. She has had 2 surgeries in regards to this accident. I explained to her what is going to happen. She needs to get her membership ID card and then present herself as a cash pay patient up to her IUA of $1000. Anything after that she is to ask to be billed and then send all the billing and proof of the $1000 into Zion and start a Need with them. Joan is on the phone with Zion as we speak and getting the information she needs to give to Laura. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-11 12:26:40', '2020-08-11 12:26:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055339008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391226', 'Pam Buderus', NULL, 'Pam had scheduled two welcome call times with us, , one at 12:30 and one at 2:00,  their were no answers for either call, vm''s left for each call and Vanessa sent out a scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-11 12:04:46', '2020-08-11 12:04:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055353008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462222', 'Ann Apfelbeck', NULL, 'Got an EOB sent to us from RCI that was supposed to be send to Ann. RCI has the wrong address. The did not put the number after the P.O. Box. Patti is updating their system now. I am sending the letter back to her along with the 2 inserts for her plan. the CirrusMD Registration insert and the PSD insert. Even tho we emailed her the CirrusMD Registration and she opened it I want to send it to her just in case if she forgot and did not go through with registering. Most people can''t retain emails we sent in the past so I will send everything along with her EOB from RCI for her Preventative Mammogram. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-11 11:40:37', '2020-08-11 11:40:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055333063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050956676', 'Elizabeth Card', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-11 11:40:17', '2020-08-11 11:40:17'),
