  ('zcrm_1579374000055353003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '08.07.20:  Recvd. call from Mary Ann - interested in an MPB plan for her and her husband.  Has a DPC and would like to start an HSA.  Told her DPC patients are not eligible for HSA since they can''t get a MEC, as far as I know but I will look into the best plan for her needs.  Scheduled a zoom meeting with her for Thurs., 8/13.  Mary Ann is an insurance agent and may be interested in offering MPB plans.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-08-11 11:02:23', '2020-08-11 11:02:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055333053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391226', 'Pam Buderus', NULL, 'No response. Sent email to reschedule call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-11 10:50:15', '2020-08-11 10:50:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055333048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706105', 'Joseph Freije', NULL, 'No response. Sent email to reschedule call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-11 10:12:02', '2020-08-11 10:12:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055333043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-11 10:08:28', '2020-08-11 10:08:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055338012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, 'Angel called in and she just had some questions about pregnancy. She is NOT pregnant but is a planner and just wants to get the correct answers before she goes about trying for her 3rd child. With her 2nd child she has gestational diabetes which was born in 2018, so she wanted to know if she were to get pregnant in the near future as in this year, would that be considered a pre existing condition and she would have to pay for EVERYTHING more than $20,000 out of pocket. I asked Patti about this because I have not had a pregnancy question like this before and I know she has multiple times. I would have asked Joan or Kelly C but we are on a conference call right now training Michelle. Patti did not want to give me the wrong answer so she slacked Sedera about this. Once we have gotten an answer I will call Angel back. -KF 

**Update On the same day Aug 11th Patti slacked Dania about this over at Sedera and she said that her situation if her 3rd child she is going to try for were to have the same issue with the gestational diabetes it would NOT be a pre-x condition. I called Aubrey back and let her know and she was so happy to hear that. She had no further questions and is all set.** -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-11 10:03:18', '2020-10-01 10:29:45'),
