  ('zcrm_1579374000055301086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, '8-10-20 debraheap@outlook.com is an OLD email. But, I added it back into the system to be able to track old emails here, otherwise they all disappear from the history.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 20:34:05', '2020-08-10 20:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862078', 'Marissa Merchant', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Send preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-10 17:59:41', '2020-08-10 17:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056904243', 'Samantha Camerino', NULL, '8-10-20 Dan Silverberg is 40 and wife Samantha Camerino just turned 41. Both are healthy, no tobacco, wife just takes birth control. Wife will be ending her job end of Sept. and then will lose insurance. They are only paying about $200 now and employer pays rest. Household income over $100K. Described MPB Carez with MEC Worksite since both self employed.  They will needs Oct. 1st start date. Know the Sept. 20th deadline and will get back to me if wife chooses to end job.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 17:29:24', '2020-09-10 16:19:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', NULL, '8-10-20 Wants to know if flu shots and COVID tests are covered. Kelly C said Yes for flu shots IF coded as preventative and looking into COVID. I also told Ricki I heard that Walgreens in Westminster or Broomfield is offering them for free, plus some hospitals and doctors are doing the same.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 17:06:38', '2020-08-10 17:06:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'sent another welcome call scheduler via email per Wendy and Patti. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-10 16:59:31', '2020-08-10 16:59:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509046', 'Greg Jenkins', NULL, 'Sheila called in frantic that they haven''t received anything in the mail or their email yet.  I calmed her down and told her to give us a call if they haven''t received everything by the 15th, I also asked if she had scheduled a welcome call yet.  The answer was no.  I helped her schedule one later this week. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-10 16:58:55', '2020-08-10 16:58:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, '8-10-20 Brian was laid off in Feb and company paying 75% of cost and he''s paying about $275, but that ends at end of Aug. He''s healthy, no tobacco. He had rotator cuff surgery in Aug. of 2018 and PT for 8 months following. He knows that''s within the 24 months for pre-x. He also had hip surgery in Dec. 2019. Strongly believes he will have no further issues with either of these, no worried. He''s 60. He started his own biz since he was laid off, so self-employed and can join MPB Carez worksite $1000/$344 with MEC. Has his own HSA already and wants to fund it. Enrolled just now for himself. Wants to refer his daughter, Josephine Guarneros for MPB Carez for Individuals. She''s turning 26 in October and W2 employee. She might get a 1099 contractor side job. Gave him prices for both options. She''s healthy, just allergies that she often takes meds for, no tobacco. He also wants to refer his brother Richard Guarneros. He''s excited about the $100 referral fee for each as well!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 16:30:20', '2020-08-10 16:30:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-10 16:19:14', '2020-08-10 16:19:14'),
