  ('zcrm_1579374000055295078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Sent preventative care literature. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-10 15:53:29', '2020-08-10 15:53:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029337149', 'Michael Taylor', NULL, 'called confused by the email he received on the 3rd about his plan.  I told him to disregard it, I pulled up his form to reassure him of the plan he chose. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-10 15:52:38', '2020-08-10 15:52:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, '8-10-20 Debra thought her employer was giving her good new insurance and just learned it''s only an indemnity plan. She wants to convert her membership to MPB Carez and she will talk it over with husband tonight to see if she wants to include MEC or not. Prefers to do thermography but knows she will pay for that on own. Needs colonoscopy sometime soon too. Likely will choose $2500/$319 with MEC to keep costs down but looking over budget tonight. Talking again tomorrow to decide.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 15:33:00', '2020-08-10 15:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001853007', 'Scott Swannie', NULL, '8-10-20 Monica called to find out about options to possibly move away from LHS. Not pleased about the fact that it''s taking 6 months to get reimbursed from LHS now. But, just reaching AUA from some wellness visits, which doesn''t totally make sense to me. She''s leaving for vacation and will be back on the 21st. Wants me to reach out if I haven''t heard from her close thereafter. On my calendar for Monday Aug. 24th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 14:55:00', '2020-08-10 14:55:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007637033', 'Nancy Elgie', NULL, '8-10-20 Talked with Nancy and she has lingering knee issue. She just wants to see ortho once and get PT prescribed and go to PT once to get appropriate exercises to do o her own. She wants to membership that most closely represents her current membership which is MPB Carez with MEC at $1000/$344.  She will complete app tonight and be done with it. Told her Analisa is her point person from here on out. She was super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 14:47:26', '2020-08-10 14:47:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003780045', 'Kenneth Malsky', NULL, '8-10-20 Ken is super pissed bc LHS is increasing his rate from $299 to $399 and he says he started at $199. He also doesn''t want to pay the $50 a month bc he doesn''t know what it''s for. I told him it''s for many services but it''s a moot point. The new membership will be one price and include all aspects of the membership which I will know more tomorrow. We are talking at 12:00 MST tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 14:36:55', '2020-08-10 14:36:55'),
