  ('zcrm_1579374000055301043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, '8-5-20 Mikayla is on college ins now. Middle daughter trying to get on Medicaid due to car accident where other driver was at fault. Had brain injury! Choosing to stay with Sedera for pre-x protection.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 13:14:18', '2020-08-10 13:14:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, '8-10-20 Alisha just completed conversion form. Chose MPB Sedera Access Plus $1000/$492 EC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 13:11:07', '2020-08-10 13:11:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, '8-10-20 Patti contacted Redirect and asked them to add kids. She submitted correctly but they missed the inclusion of the kids somehow. It''s updated and Helen has already scheduled some appt for wellness for kids to keep process moving forward. She on the right path now and feeling more confident.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 13:06:40', '2020-08-10 13:06:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054027098', 'David Sheldon', NULL, '8-10-20 Jonathan called and emailed a bunch bc he hasn''t seen account billed yet and no proof of membership. But, he did receive the Welcome email today which wasn''t populated corrected with username, pwd, and QR Life Code. I notified John and he''s going to resend all of the emails with the information included. Jonathan is fine to wait for payment to withdraw, he just wanted to make sure his son''s memberhip began on Aug. 1st and it has. He will submit change of address for his son while he''s in SC for now. Will change it back when comes back to Lakewood.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 13:05:02', '2020-08-10 13:05:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, 'Redirect has fixed this problem.  Dependent added.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-10 12:58:15', '2020-08-10 12:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, '8-10-20 Andy read the information well. He''s choosing MPB Carez with MEC for $1000/$931.50.   No pre-x.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 12:53:28', '2020-08-10 12:53:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, 'Wendy called in and said that Helen had called into Redirect to access benefits for her children and was told that they were not on the plan.  I added them vai ad dependent form, but went back in and saw that dependents were on the original form.  I emailed Patti @ Group Resources for some help on this. Awaiting a call back.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-10 12:50:17', '2020-08-10 12:50:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'called at her scheduled welcome call time, even though her conversion form isn''t finished.  I left a vm asking her to contact me if she needed to fill out the form again. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-10 12:48:39', '2020-08-10 12:48:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, 'Tracking #10402798
Sent by Patti Baron on 8/10/2020.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-10 12:39:17', '2020-08-10 12:39:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Sent preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-10 12:34:29', '2020-08-10 12:34:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466094', 'Chad Broker', NULL, 'Gina, Chad''s wife, called in and said that when she went to pick up his maintenance blood pressure medication last night and she handed the pharmacist their RCI card the pharmacist said that Chad no longer has "Insurance". His policy is cancelled and what not. She was calling to make sure that is not true because no one has cancelled. I pulled him up and he is NOT cancelled. I let her know this and also told her that there is no reason she should be giving any type of card for prescriptions. That is not how it works. I told her that for maintenance medications work here is she or Chad is to fill out a Prescription Quote Form that I send her/him via email and they fill it out with all the info needed and I look that up and send them the most discounted coupons to their email or have it texted to their phone. That is the ONLY way that works for prescriptions. She said well for over a year they have always handed their card and it was always cheaper when doing so, which doesn''t make sense to me. Anyway she asked to send the prescription quote form to the email here on file and I did. They will fill it out when they can and send it back to me. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 12:26:49', '2020-08-10 12:26:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, '8-10-20 Helen called and was frustrated and confused. She''s been calling Concierge line and cal won''t go through. System says line is not in service. I had her try to call with another phone which was her sons phone and it worked! Another one of these mysterious phones that can''t reach Concierge 1-800-519-2969. Told her they are changing the phone system soon and will hopefully solve that problem. She also hasn''t had success with Redirect. Her kids aren''t showing in Redirect''s system. I called Patti to look into it and will resend list if need be. Patti will call me with an answer shortly. Then Helen is now understanding that she just needs to give Redirect the name of the clinic she wants her kids to use at college. She wanted them to go here but couldn''t get responses fast enough. They will now try to go in South Carolina at school. She will wait for my confirmation that kids are in Redirect''s system before she calls them back to make appt and get approved and paid for.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 12:26:28', '2020-08-10 12:26:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039268017', 'Matthew Sayre', NULL, 'Matthew called in to cancel and wanted to know what the process is to do so. I explained to him the process with me sending him the cancellation email with a link to click and brings him straight to the cancellation form. He just needs to fill it out and click submit, once he does that it comes straight back to Patti Baron and once she cancels everything out she will send an email that confirms that she has cancelled everything out and he is all set. He was very happy with me helping him out and how easy it is. Thanked me very much. Also did not state why is was cancelling, I like to find out so if there was some sort of issue on our behalf or something along those lines there might be a chance to safe him from cancelling. Just to get a general idea and put together a list or spreadsheet of reasons why people cancel. If there is an average or main reason why people cancel we might be able to do something to stop it from happening. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 12:21:43', '2020-08-10 12:21:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, '8-10-20 Left vm for our appt.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 12:14:40', '2020-08-10 12:14:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790155', 'Todd Nelson', NULL, 'Called in to cancel and said that he wanted to cancel for the 20th of the month. I told him that is when we bill for next month''s coverage so I suggested he put it in for the day before or so. Sent him the cancellation form via email and explained how to do it. He thanked me very much but did not give a reason at to why he is cancelling. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 12:10:13', '2020-08-10 12:10:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919591', 'James Jordan', NULL, '8-10-20 I just spoke with James Jordan and he still hasn''t received anything to register with Cirrus for Virtual Care. His wife has a rash she wanted help with. She''s just managing it her own without assistance.    Robert place a request with CirrusMD an Thursday as far as I know. It''s Monday and James didn''t receive anything to move forward. John Kach said he''ll look into it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 12:03:56', '2020-08-10 12:03:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862150', 'Judy Flanagan', NULL, 'Judy called in and said over the weekend she had to go to an urgent care and said she did not have cards to show and nothing was covered. I explained to her that it is not something that will be covered. Anything that is injury/illness and when she needs to go to the hospital or anything like that she is to present herself as a cash pay patient and pay up to her IUA of $1000. Anything after that Zion comes into play and picks up the rest of the cost. I explained to her that she choose Planstin as her MEC and that is her preventative portion of her plan. She will be getting cards and info sent in the mail and emails around the 15th of the month. I explained to her what the entails and covers like her annual wellness visit, mammogram screening, colonoscopy screening, ect... I told all of that info will be sent to her around the 15th of the month. She also asked about what to do with CirrusMD because she needs to speak to a doctor ASAP! When she had he welcome call she was not in the system yet. I told her that what I can do is give her name to John Kach in the office and he can bump her up to the top of the list and get her in the system as fast as possible. I told her I will email her the CirrusMD registration info and to try again because we have been working on it all last week and over the weekend. She was very frustrated and confused at first with what is what and how everything works. After explaining everything to her she sounded a lot less stressed and seemed to get it a little better. She thanked me very much and was more relieved after helping her out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 11:11:59', '2020-08-10 11:11:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055301003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331022', 'Scott Fliegelman', NULL, '8-10-20 Enrolled in PDHC/ MPB Secure $1000/$350 EO. I refreshed his memory about how the membership works with Redirect and told him of no longer cap on per incident with Sedera.  He''s good to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-10 10:53:05', '2020-08-10 10:53:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'David called in and said that he has been trying to speak with John about a few repeat bills he has gotten in the mail from his lab work at LabCorp from his annual wellness visit he has back in Feb. I told him what to do and what the process will be with that. I asked him to send over via email everything that he has gotten from LabCorp and I will send all of that over to someone at ASi and tag him in the thread as well so once we get an email back he will know what is going on and what to do, ect.. I let him know the possibilities on why he is getting these bills sent to him and he totally understands everything. I also let him know that he will be responsible for anything on there that IS indeed Diagnostic and not Preventative. He was totally Ok with that and perfectly understands the reasoning why. Now if he did not give the Ok for anything Diagnostic or ask for anything along those lines than that is not his fault and he does not need to pay for that. What he will need to do though is contact the provider and let them know Hey I did not tell you this was or is ok to have these types of tests or blood work. I told you guys ONLY Preventative. They have to comply and take that off of the billing because he will NOT and ASi will NOT pay for that. I lastly let him know for future reference that if he is having any issue or question''s during his preventative wellness visit that those types of things are considered Diagnostic and won''t be covered. So we always tell out members to try and make a separate appointment for things like that so billing does not get all wacky and messed up. We like to make it as smooth and easy as possible. He was a very nice guy and said he understood everything I let him know.  I am just waiting for his emails with all the bills attached and will start the email thread over to ASi once I get everything David sent me. He thanked me so so so much and said I was very helpful and he has a much much better and clearer idea of how it all works and what he needs to do for the future. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 10:49:24', '2020-08-10 10:49:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055279064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052617079', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-10 10:47:35', '2020-08-10 10:47:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, 'Jennah called in in response to the email that Kelly C sent her about info on getting all the info she needs for the conversion on Zion health and CirrusMD, ect.. I let her know that she should be getting everything in the mail and emails by the 15th of the month. She was specifically asking because she had a fall over the weekend and thinks she needs to get x-rays and what not. I told her what to do and that there is no network she needs to stay in for anything related to this for injury/illness and that she will be responsible for whatever she choose for her IUA with Zion health. I told her she can certainly use CirrusMD first if she wants to skip driving somewhere and paying  a lot of money for someone to just tell her what she already knows and what not. I sent her the registration email for CirrusMD. I told her that if she can not get in, because we are working on getting everyone in the system as fast as possible, to just let me know and I will give her info and why she needs to get in over to John Kach to push her file and get her in the system ahead of everyone. He can certainly do that for her since it is an emergency. I also wrote up a mock email that has all the info that I have for Zion for her to call and start a Need with them and help her through the process as best as I could. I gave her Zion''s phone number, website, email address for her to email them with any questions she might have if she can''t get someone on the phone right away, I also wrote the process of starting that need and presenting herself and how to do that. She is also going to need a membership ID because that is what it says on my paper with all the info we have so far. She is to present her Membership ID Card and declare herself as a cash pay patient. Same as with Sedera only there was not ID card with them. She pays the amount of her IUA she choose during the conversion and that sometimes the provider will even be paid by Zion BEFORE any services or procedures even start. She should be all set with everything I provided her. She thanked me very very much and said I was very helpful and she feels a lot better know with the info I gave her. Happy Member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 10:40:51', '2020-08-10 10:40:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779188', 'Jason LaPointe', NULL, 'Wendy called in and asked if ANYTHING at all can be covered for her yearly physical that she just had but she did not stay in the network. She did not say why, but I told her the best that ASi can do is pay 130% of medicare allowable but it is not always a 100% guarantee. She was perfectly fine with all of that she just wanted to call in and see. I gave her ASi''s phone number for her to call and explain and see what they say along with telling her what the back of her ASi card says about that and that everything that she has bill wise and receipts to send over to ASi to the P.O Box address on the back of her card. She is going to do all that and call them first right now. She thanked me greatly and said everything I told her was great and helpful. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 10:32:32', '2020-08-10 10:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055279059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-10 10:24:15', '2020-08-10 10:24:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055292170', 'Caleb Fisher', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam  $5000 IUA 18-29 MPB CareZ Ind', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-10 10:14:56', '2020-08-10 10:14:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601222', 'Ashley Markison', NULL, 'Ashley called in and said over the weekend she went to the hospital(didn''t say exactly what for) and asked if we "Cover" that. I explained to her how it works with opening a "Need" with Sedera but she has to pay for the first $500 of her IUA. Anything that is injury/illness and or a medical emergency there is no network that she needs to stay in like she would with Preventative. I told her to make sure that she keeps all her bills and what not that prove and show that she has paid that $500. She is to submit it into Sedera and open up a "Need". I gave her Sedera''s phone number because that is what she asked for and I also told her I will be sending(already sent) the email that explains how to submit bills and start a "Need" with Sedera along with their contact info in there. She thanked me and is calling then now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 10:14:21', '2020-08-10 10:14:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055292101', 'Lori Zubrod', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 50-59 MPB Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-10 10:01:27', '2020-08-10 10:01:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055279023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537009', 'Jeanine Ford', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-10 09:28:07', '2020-08-10 09:28:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830370', 'Michele "Shelly" Valinttine', NULL, 'Shelly called in and had a question on what to do about a certain procedure she needs to have done. Stem Cell injection on her knee from a car accident that happened back in 2019.. I let her know this would be injury/illness so an out of pocket cost up to her IUA she choose from the conversion with Zion which she said is $1000. I told her first though the at fault car insurance is what needs to be used first and fore most BEFORE anything from us or Zion can be used. She said she understands that and what the issue is the at fault car insurance has denied her claim and she is choosing NOT to get surgery done on her knee. So what would be her next step now that her claim was denied. I was not 100% sure and did not want to give her the wrong info so I asked is Patti might know the answer and she said all we can really offer her is to contact Zion about this since it would be a "Need" to be started after she meets the requirements. Another issue that I heard Patti tell Shelly since this was something that started in 2019 way before her start date there might be the issue with Pre-exsisting and paying for the first $25,000, BUT I believe the deal was wit Zion and the whole plan and deal we got with the conversion is that the first year for pre-x was waved. Shelly is going to contact Zion now and see what the deal is and what she needs to do, this is out of out hands now and with Zion. Patti gave her the phone number for member services with Zion. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 09:14:28', '2020-08-10 09:14:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830370', 'Michele "Shelly" Valinttine', NULL, 'Member called in and expressed to me that she is looking at having to do Stem Cell treatments to help a knee injury that she received from a Car Accident in 2019.  This was denied for payment by the Car Insurance.  I advised her that there was a limit on what they would share on Pre-Ex conditions of $25K.  I told her to contact Zion and explain her situation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-10 09:11:44', '2020-08-10 09:11:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055279018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830370', 'Michele "Shelly" Valinttine', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-10 08:55:23', '2020-08-10 08:55:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055299003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033574061', 'Shawna Sands', NULL, 'Shawna called in and needed to update her payment. Patti sent her the form to fill out via email and will update that ASAP when she sends the form in. -KF/PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-10 08:40:30', '2020-08-10 08:40:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055279013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-10 08:20:15', '2020-08-10 08:20:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001853007', 'Scott Swannie', NULL, 'Member sent in cancellation I will cancel subscription.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-10 07:36:30', '2020-08-10 07:36:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055295003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, 'MPB CareZ plan w/MEC $5000 IUA/ M&amp;F $681 per mo - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-10 07:22:35', '2020-08-10 07:22:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055269033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871127', 'John Taylor', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Great members!  I sent prescription information for Kelly as well as HMA lit for John. -- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 17:42:56', '2020-08-07 17:42:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055269028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881563', 'Juan Tapia', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Sent all preventive care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 17:14:52', '2020-08-07 17:14:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055269023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  She wanted to let us know that she didn''t "choose" a MEC, but that she had to have one.  She was very nervous, and directing me to fill in the blanks of the plan her way, because she needed to update her Word Doc on our plan.  I remained patient with her, I did offer her to send her Word Document to make sure it was right. She apologized at the end of the call thanking me for being patient with her.  I sent her all preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 16:56:58', '2020-08-07 16:56:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055269018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Heather called in to state that her daughter saw a surgeon today and now she has to have $30000 surgery.  She wanted to be reminded of how much Zion will pay out for a pre ex.    She was upset that she had to change and now that she is in this to face she is just really overwhelmed.  I suggested that she call Jane, but she thought she was just going to have to "deal with it"  I told her that maybe Jane would have some good suggestions and asked if she wanted ME to reach out to Jane for her....but she declined. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 14:58:13', '2020-08-07 14:58:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055269013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'sent list of quality doctors to Patricia that might be able to help her daughter find a good dermatologist. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 14:43:06', '2020-08-07 14:43:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055269008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Mentioned referral, sent all preventative care templates, going to help her with a list of quality derms for her daughter Sarah. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 14:10:29', '2020-08-07 14:10:29'),
