  ('zcrm_1579374000055203018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047282078', 'Dipakkumar Patel', NULL, 'H0Q7I and H0Q1B are the old QR Life Codes for him and his wife. I am assigning 2 new ones in the section of QR Life Code and sending out in the mail today with letter and insert that is necessary. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-07 11:47:12', '2020-08-07 11:47:12'),
