  ('zcrm_1579374000055210018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862130', 'Marion Steed', NULL, 'Member called in asking about billing.  I left a VM advising her of the transition and that we would be billing in the next couple of days.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-07 10:08:08', '2020-08-07 10:08:08'),
