  ('zcrm_1579374000055224013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033509057', 'Allison Piekarski', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-07 09:18:33', '2020-08-07 09:18:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055203013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002240103', 'Robyn Spirtas', NULL, 'Robyn called in and was very rude and said "What they hell have I been paying $50 for 4 years for?" I explained all the things that include in that $50 and she said "Well I don''t use and won''t use ANY of that, so what else can you offer me that I have paid $50 for 4 years?" I told her that what I said is all that is included in that charge. She demanded to be cancelled than. I said no problem at all and explained to her the process and that I will be sending her a cancellation email with a link for her to click and fill out the form and submit it back to us online. Once that gets back to us Patti Baron will process the cancellation and send an email letting her know everything is processed and cancelled out and she will not be charged again, I will make sure of it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-07 09:09:47', '2020-08-07 09:09:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055210008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'I heard back from RCI about whether the Colonoscopy Prep would be shared.  She can just give the Pharmacy the RCI card and it will be covered at 100%.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-07 09:06:53', '2020-08-07 09:06:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055224008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-07 08:52:39', '2020-08-07 08:52:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055224003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870078', 'Suzanne Donner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-07 08:29:45', '2020-08-07 08:29:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055205018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871127', 'John Taylor', NULL, 'MPB CareZ w/ MEC $2500 IUA, Mand S $561 per mo - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 08:13:04', '2020-08-07 08:13:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055205013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881563', 'Juan Tapia', NULL, 'MPB CareZ w/MEC, $2500 IUA/ M&amp;F $806.50 per mo - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 08:03:57', '2020-08-07 08:03:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055203008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, 'Lester called in and said that he has not received anything yet for his conversion plan. No emails or anything. He wanted to know if he is covered or not and wanted to know if they need to make an appointment with Cirrus what to do. I explained to him that we have been waiting for everything to get put together and send out. I told him to expect all of that in emails and physical letters in the mail in the next week or week and half. I told him that a few people have gotten through and put over into Cirrus''s system so he can certainly try if he absolutely needs to. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-07 08:02:16', '2020-08-07 08:02:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055205008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, 'MPB CareZ w/MEC, $1000 IUA/ $294 per mo - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 07:58:58', '2020-08-07 07:58:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055210003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055206021', 'Frank Poth', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $2500 IUA 50-64 MPB CareZ Wkst', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-07 07:57:30', '2020-08-07 07:57:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055205003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411051', 'James Sullivan', NULL, 'MPB CareZ w/MEC w/MEC $1000 IUA /MO $294 per mo - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-07 07:52:28', '2020-08-07 07:52:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451131', 'Adria Moshe', NULL, 'Child''s name according to medical records is Simara. Adria informed me that she is the process of changing her daughters name and will let us know when it is  updated on her child''s birth certificate.', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', '2020-08-07 07:42:09', '2020-08-07 07:42:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055203003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419076', 'Dana Michie', NULL, 'This member called in and asked about a colonoscopy that will be diagnostic since she has had polyps  in the past.  I advised her to contact Sedera and give the a heads up.  Told her she would have to pay 1st $1500 and then Sedera would pick up the rest.  Told her to present as "cash pay".', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-07 07:41:45', '2020-08-07 07:41:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055159068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042221180', 'Lisa Watson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Member is very nervous and unsure.  I sent all educational emails and told her that she can call us with any and all of her questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-06 17:48:14', '2020-08-06 17:48:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055159063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862112', 'Shuwen Lau', NULL, 'Tricky situation, she doesn''t really know if she is staying with us for another month longer.  She didn''t really feel like she should do this call because she is ill and still doesn''t know what she needs to do.   I told her that I would sent the post email so at least she could get a summary of everything.  I told her to cancel before the 20th of the month. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-06 16:41:56', '2020-08-06 16:41:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055159058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243610', 'Paula Chavez', NULL, 'missed welcome call, left vm, sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-06 16:18:55', '2020-08-06 16:18:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055159053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'missed welcome call, left vm, sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-06 15:42:05', '2020-08-06 15:42:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055159048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Great member! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-06 15:24:39', '2020-08-06 15:24:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055159043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779506', 'Susan Weiner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Sent all preventative care templates.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-06 14:44:15', '2020-08-06 14:44:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055159038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Member was a bit myphed when I told him about HCBB- he told me that in Denver there wasn''t many places that provide a fair price. He didn''t want us to "make" him drive 300 miles out of town to get an MRI if he needed one.  I told him that no one was going to make him drive 300 miles...."yeah, but are you going to pay for my $30000 MRI if I don''t want to drive 300 miles to get a $10000 MRI?"  I told him that this would be a good question to ask Zion. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-06 13:21:00', '2020-08-06 13:21:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055157041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462299', 'Devon Scholl', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel with Sedera &amp; Apex &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-06 12:32:51', '2020-08-06 12:32:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055159033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899160', 'Rosemary Veilleux', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Mentioned Referral, sent all preventative care templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-06 12:28:34', '2020-08-06 12:28:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055157033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028844054', 'Michael Matz', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form.  Going on Medicare.  I will cancel with Sedera &amp; Apex', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-06 12:22:19', '2020-08-06 12:25:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055189003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'Maurine called in said that she has everything scheduled for her colonoscopy and she has done everything that needs to be done to make sure it is covered but has a prescription that she needs to take before the visit, a liquid of sorts, and Rite Aid asked for her insurance information. I just wanted to check with Patti on this and see what the deal is with that and Patti informed me that that is an out of pocket cost. When I told this to Maurine she does not understand why and asked for an explanation. She also said that she wants something in writing about her entire plan and what it entails as for what she is paying us for. She also asked that around this time she was told she would get something from us about a plan renewal and change of her IUA. I put her back to Patti to answer these question because I did not get the full details on these answers. Patti said that she will call in RCI and see if the prescription is something they will cover. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-06 12:08:49', '2020-08-06 12:08:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055176028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497204', 'Charles Strother', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-06 11:55:22', '2020-08-06 11:55:22'),
