  ('zcrm_1579374000055157028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610078', 'Chad Foss', NULL, 'This member did not make choice until 7/27 so was billed Sedera amount.  They then elected to go with Zion.  I refunded their pmt and they will be billed Zion amount soon.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-06 10:34:27', '2020-08-06 10:34:27'),
