  ('zcrm_1579374000055157003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel with Sedera &amp; ASI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-06 07:17:14', '2020-08-06 07:17:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919591', 'James Jordan', NULL, 'Lisa has a really bad rash that is bothering her and they wanted to utilize CirrusMD, I told them that I would try to get a hold of John to get them directly into the system so that they could use it. Still waiting, I''ve reached out to Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 18:31:09', '2020-08-05 18:31:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899138', 'Andrew Eisenberg', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Andrew is an ER dr, and works in telehealth and thought our plan was super cool!  He is going to write a bunch of his thoughts in the survey that I sent.  He also has a referral that had her heart set on the PSD plan, she was ready to jump in because it was a plan like Andrew''s and she was looking at it off of our mpoweringbenefits.org site, but I told her that I didn''t think that the plan was available, and that was disappointing to her.  I told her that is where she really needs to speak with Wiley Long.  Then Andrew brought up Mike Montes and said that Mike was the original person that went through the plan with him.   I told him to refer Kako Kaughlin to whomever he feels comfortable with, just someone besides me that is in sales. I am going to let Patti know about this conversation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 18:11:49', '2020-08-05 18:11:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630172', 'Jessica Lynn Showalter', NULL, 'missed welcome call, left vm, and also sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 16:56:51', '2020-08-05 16:56:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610002', 'Deborah Vaughan', NULL, 'This member only wanted me to have the questions she had answered, and didn''t like the actual answers.  She asked if there would be an email sent to her at the end of the call, I told her that there was.  She then said that she would prefer that I send it to her, and that if she had any questions about it after she read it....she would call me.  I sent her the form.  Debbie had no clue as to how the plan worked and how it works now.  I am reaching out to Joan about this. - KC
I am not even comfortable with assigning my name to a welcome call that shows it''s complete. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 16:47:26', '2020-08-05 16:50:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055123062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055156108', 'Zhou Qian', NULL, '8-5-20 Enrolling now. Frustrated by how difficult our healthcare system is here. Choosing $204/$1000 MPB Carez No MEC and using cc and ok with cc fees bc scary to give bank account information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 16:29:20', '2020-08-05 16:29:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'I called him to make sure that he received his planstin card.  He did.  He was happy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 16:16:48', '2020-08-05 16:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055123057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '8-5-20 Chose Bright Health Silver for $136.13 with $594 APTC. She can get this with a $0 ded and $2700 mop. If income increases she can move back to MPB in future. Painter and really uncertain of income at this point with covid. Completed app for Sept. 1 and cancelled MPB. Will request proof of SEP from MPB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 16:14:52', '2020-08-05 16:14:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005273011', 'Tina Le', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 15:47:25', '2020-08-05 15:47:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, '08.05.20:  Recvd. a call from Paul Cholak letting me know that Marc has not yet recvd. his MEC card and his son scheduled a wellness visit on Friday 8.7.20.  I contacted Zion and spoke w/Shelby.  Marc is enrolled in Zion currently but Planstin has not yet sent their digital MEC card. Shelby said she will call Planstin and ask them to email the digital card to Marc today. She will let me know when they do.
Recvd. a call from Shelby telling me Planstin emailed a digital card to Marc.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-08-05 15:31:49', '2020-08-05 15:31:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055123046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083032', 'Sorel Haruf', NULL, '8-5-20 Sorel is in 50''s and choosing MPB Carez w/o MEC $1000/$284. She will pay for it on her own. She was frustrated since she had to pay $40 or $80 for her mammogram that was supposed to be at no cost. I told her next time to call the Concierge for help to get the bill re-coded.  She is going to dermatologist tomorrow for skin check and lips burned from trip to NH with Helen and Dan.  Knows of pre-x clause if something goes wrong at derm visit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 15:29:12', '2020-08-05 15:31:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497185', 'Virginia Haupert', NULL, 'Missed welcome call, left vm, sent her another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 15:24:41', '2020-08-05 15:24:41');
