  ('zcrm_1579374000055123041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083032', 'Sorel Haruf', NULL, '8-5-20 Just missed her call and called and left her a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 15:12:56', '2020-08-05 15:12:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010288007', 'David Martin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! Address is incorrect- I sent them the update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 14:48:55', '2020-08-05 14:56:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055123036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055156108', 'Zhou Qian', NULL, '8-5-20 Zhou is 45, healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no pre-x. Goes to China for wellness visits every year where it''s easy and cheap. She is self-employed. Found us through her friend who is Not a member of affiliated with MPB but just knew of MPB from other friends. Zhou is interested in the $2500/$204 MPB Carez No MEC. Calling her after 4:00 to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 14:40:35', '2020-08-05 14:40:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055123031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331022', 'Scott Fliegelman', NULL, '8-5-20 We are meeting to enroll him on Monday at 10:30 when he''s not pressed for time. PDHC is what we discussed for EO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 14:19:23', '2020-08-05 14:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549155', 'Joshua Brewer', NULL, 'called because he needed help finding a primary doctor and getting set up with a specialist.  I reminded him that he has Redirect.  I reminded him of the app...and he realized that he had already downloaded it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 14:10:53', '2020-08-05 14:10:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055123026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '8-5-20 Suzanne''s income is expected to be $24,400 as best guess.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 14:05:13', '2020-08-05 14:05:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055132003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862112', 'Shuwen Lau', NULL, 'Spoke to me mbeer, walked her through creating a need and scheduling a 2nd md appointment .  Cancer diagnosis, scheduling pre surgical consults.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-08-05 13:55:45', '2020-08-05 13:55:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055087043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003195011', 'Camille Leon', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! Great preventive lifestyle member!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-05 13:51:39', '2020-08-05 13:52:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055123021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, '8-5-20 Liz just completed conversion to MPB Carez with MEC $1000/$344. No open Needs and nothing pre-x to deal with. Small issues have been resolved. Has HSA dormant bc accountant told her not to fund it. I told her the MEC makes it compliant to fund. I explained it in greater detail to let her accountant know about the MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 13:50:39', '2020-08-05 13:50:39'),
