  ('zcrm_1579374000055113053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788094', 'Daniel Webb', NULL, 'Member called in with questions about the $25 annual fee.  Asked why he and his wife were on separate plans.  I read him Wendy''s note below.  He asked about aging into Medicare and I told him that he would have to cancel when he turned 65 did not have option to stay.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-05 12:55:37', '2020-08-05 12:55:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055120018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788094', 'Daniel Webb', NULL, 'Dan called in and asked what the $25 charge was on his credit card. I explained to him that is his yearly renewal fee. He was ok with that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-05 12:53:28', '2020-08-05 12:53:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055113048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663233', 'Jason Lewis', NULL, 'Member called in wondering why he was charged when he cancelled.  I advised him that he noted 8/31 as effective date.  I changed and cancelled him', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-05 12:29:52', '2020-08-05 12:29:52'),
