  ('zcrm_1579374000055123016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862112', 'Shuwen Lau', NULL, '8-5-20 Updated Shuwen''s choice to remain with Sedera. She was not cancelled from Sedera yet. John is working on cancelling her from Zion ASAP. List was sent on Monday night and Zion is loading it manually. Likely not processed yet.  I will ask Patti about Billing if old or new amount will be billed for Aug. 1st? Let Shuwen know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 12:04:42', '2020-08-05 12:04:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055118041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'No Response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-08-05 11:34:16', '2020-08-05 11:34:16'),
