  ('zcrm_1579374000055120013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238350', 'Amy Wentworth', NULL, 'Amy called in and said she has yet use her plan and wanted to know how to go about using it. I pulled her up here and she has Redirect. I let her know that Redirect is always going to be her first point of contact with anything. If she has a medical emergency she is to pay out of pocket up to her IUA of $1000 and then she would contact Sedera and open up a Need with them. Everything else is through Redirect. I gave her their phone number to call because she has an appointment tomorrow. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-05 10:25:04', '2020-08-05 10:25:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055123003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055112303', 'Scott Yarian', NULL, '8-5-20 Scott is enrolling now EF MPB Carez w/ MEC $931.50/$1000. Has 24 year old son married and wants to connect us. Twins are in college and still dependents and joining with family. He has his own LLC, state tax ID, etc., so good to go for Worksite membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-05 10:11:05', '2020-08-05 10:11:05'),
