  ('zcrm_1579374000055056063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919914', 'Tracy Sutton', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Tracy has an ear infection and wants to use CirrusMD.  I told her that I would ask John to push her enrollment through right away for her.  She was appreciative of that. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-04 17:16:36', '2020-08-04 17:16:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055075056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', NULL, '8-4-20 Chose MPB Carez with MEC EO $294/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-04 17:13:55', '2020-08-04 17:13:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055075051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862112', 'Shuwen Lau', NULL, '8-4-20 Shuwen just called me back and wants to understand CA laws and penalties. I just sent her a link to read about it. She will update her application request if Sedera will allow her to reinstate her membership as of Aug. 1st, if it''s been cancelled on their end. Shuwen also wants to refer her son to me to help him while he''s thinking about health insurance. She will connect us via email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-04 16:53:24', '2020-08-04 16:53:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055056058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, 'This was not the best welcome call because Scott had just found out that his son was having a mountain bike race and was racing to get there himself.  I asked if he wanted to reschedule and he told me no, that he had already had a welcome call in the past and he just needed the talking points and asked me to make it as short and sweet as I could.  So I did.  I told him that if he gets through with reading the summary and has additional questions he could reach out to me.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-04 16:50:29', '2020-08-04 16:50:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055075046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286201', 'Brian Pierce', NULL, '8-4-20 Called bc hasn''t been billed yet and he wants to use Virtual Care and hasn''t recieved any of the Welcome emails to proceed with registration, etc. Left him vm explaining he joined at same time 400+ people are converting and processing their memberships. So, everything has been delayed. Will be billed in next 24-48 hours and other communications will follow in the days thereafter.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-04 16:45:09', '2020-08-04 16:45:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055075041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, '8-4-20 Jill called bc she has the opportunity through her x-husband to join some federal worked health insurance with Anthem at $500+ that includes a discount already. She just has a thyroid issue for long time and nothing else. She''s still likely better served with the MCS but she will review docs and decide. I don''t have access to those to compare. She can move to MPB Carez for Sept. 1 at $344 with MEC EO assuming self employed.  Left her a vm to inform her of her options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-04 16:38:13', '2020-08-04 16:38:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055075036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899508', 'Kyle Gustafson', NULL, '8-4-20 Kyle originally said there are no  pre-x in his family. After I explained pros and cons of each membership, he then revealed his wife has an open Need with Sedera and needs further care. She is looking into possible surgery that was quoted at $7K but Sedera says it should be around $4K, so she''s been looking around to find a doctor within the price range. Apparently she''s super frustrated with Sedera. I recommended to stay with Sedera until health issue resolved. He''s going to discuss with wife and is curious if it will be easier with MPB Carez with Zion. I recommended they find a Dr. in the PHCS network to possibly avoid the challenges. But, again, I''d recommend staying with Sedera with this open need. He''ll talk it over with wife and call me tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-04 16:31:27', '2020-08-04 16:31:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055075031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862112', 'Shuwen Lau', NULL, '8-4-20 Shuwen called in panicked bc she had a diagnosis on breast cancer on 7/31/20. She wants to stay with Sedera if possible, since it''s now a pre-existing condition if she moves. She won''t remain compliant in CA but she will be protected with Sedera since it''s a new need. I will talk with John in the morning to see if she can reinstate her membership as of Aug. 1st.  I think she was billed at the old rate with Sedera already for the month of Aug. I''ve explained pros and cons of each decision. She had no prior knowledge of this health issue and realizes the timing was terrible.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-04 16:25:11', '2020-08-04 16:25:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055056053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-04 15:56:32', '2020-08-04 15:56:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055056048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647085', 'Christopher Lopez', NULL, 'Welcome call Complete!   - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-04 15:54:30', '2020-08-04 15:54:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055056043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'He scheduled another welcome call so I called him and asked how I could help him today.  He got annoyed that I said he had a scheduled welcome call- he denied.  He said he "get''s it"  and that he needs to wait for his enrollment things until the middle of the month.  I asked if he had any other questions. He said no.  He was pretty grumpy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-04 14:47:00', '2020-08-04 14:47:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055056038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  They are both sending lab bills stating that they thought they would be covered. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-04 14:42:29', '2020-08-04 14:42:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055068021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522001', 'Michael Higgins', NULL, 'Lisa called in and said that she just wanted to let everybody in the company know that for almost a year and a half now RCI has been going back and forth with her fighting for paying for a $140 Preventative Mammogram Bill that she had done and everything was done correctly.  All parties are in the PHCS Network and everything was coded as preventative. She said that RCI has been saying no to paying it because they told her that they are NOT getting funds from us at MPowering Benefits and Lisa has been contemplating bringing legal action upon RCI. She said everything is solved now but she just wants to warn us that this is what RCI is telling her and she is afraid of what is going to happen when her husband goes to have his routine Colonoscopy done which is a couple thousand. She emailed John Kach and Wendy this morning about this just letting everyone know that this is what is being said to her from RCI and I full hardheartedly believe her. It is just my guy feeling. Why lie about something like this for only $140. She said she has just got off the phone with RCI. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-04 14:04:40', '2020-08-04 14:04:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055059043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055057166', 'Karen Sherry', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 50-64 MPB CareZ Indv', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-08-04 14:01:35', '2020-08-04 14:01:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055056033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331067', 'Tessa Manton', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Sent address update form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-04 13:49:52', '2020-08-04 13:49:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055075023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '8-4-20 She''s a bit unnerved by everything. We looked at C4 and Silver plans are $200+ but with $3500 ded and 6500 mop with income at $30,400 for 2020 with biz and payments from x. Realized that may not be in her best interest. Back to thinking over MPB Carez. Wants to chat with Janet Ingvaldsen and think it over for the night.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-04 13:11:15', '2020-08-04 13:11:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055056028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862078', 'Marissa Merchant', NULL, 'missed welcome call, left vm, sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-04 13:06:25', '2020-08-04 13:06:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055068016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529712', 'Angela Minerich', NULL, 'Angela called in and said that she has never used her plan or anything and has an appointment with an OBGYN I think she said tomorrow or one day this week. I pulled her up and told her that she has Redirect and she is to always contact them firstly for anything Medical related and they will help her with everything. She did not have their phone number and I gave it to her to call now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-04 12:40:52', '2020-08-04 12:40:52'),
