  ('zcrm_1579374000055068003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521138', 'Jamie Solow', NULL, 'Jamie called in because of an Email that was sent out last night in regards to the conversion and the payment being delayed and he said he was confused because he thought that he was switching over from Sedera to Zion Health. I said yes he is correct, his new plan IS going to be with Zion health. He was just a little worried because he also did not know who to call or who we are in regards to his plan. He did not understand who we are here at MPowering Benefits. I explained to him that we are the Group and Zion is his actual plan, we are not his plan. He also asked if he needs to get benefits and he needs to open up a need if he is supposed to call into here. I said No that would be Zion and I provided their number to him. He seemed to understand a little better and said that is all he needed and thanked me for the info. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-04 08:51:06', '2020-08-04 08:51:06'),
