  ('zcrm_1579374000055013058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521331', 'Vickie Peterson', NULL, 'David had called in wondering if we had his plan correctly- I told him that email was worded incorrectly and that a new email would be coming over soon.  He was happy for the followup and thrilled that she is keeping the same plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-03 17:37:44', '2020-08-03 17:37:44'),
