  ('zcrm_1579374000054988111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268055', 'Earl Henderson', NULL, '8-3-20 Earl wants insurance to cover mortgage. 
1) How much is mortgage? $360K
2) How many years left on mortgage? Just refinanced, therefore max is 20 years for life policy
3) Other policies so we don''t double up?
4) 20 Year is max for term since over 55 yrs old. Yes, 20 year
5) Lender requiring insurance? Looking at regular mortgage ins and cost is similar for much less.
6) Ask for full monthly expenses in addition to mortgage? Just mortgage for debts. Pay off cc every month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-03 16:38:30', '2020-08-04 13:21:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055013048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004687005', 'Lisa Kulig', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-03 16:25:18', '2020-08-03 16:25:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054988100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521350', 'Shane Michael Sorensen', NULL, '8-3-20 Called and let Shane know the payment will come out in the next 24-48 hours. He wasn''t concerned. We verified his pmt amount of $636 and he''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-03 16:12:51', '2020-08-03 16:13:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054988095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005273011', 'Tina Le', NULL, '8-3-20 Called to make sure she understands everything. Recently did a pneumococcal immunization at Walmart and will submit it for possible sharing. Also son having wart treated and not sure if cost will exceed $500, if so, will submit as new Need. Otherwise, no other outstanding issues. Chose MPB Carez with MEC EF $931.50/$1000. Initially chose $2500 IUA and realized that wasn''t the best choice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-03 16:07:45', '2020-08-03 16:07:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000055013043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990490', 'Megan Clark', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!    Mentioned referral, sent address change form because address is wrong. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-03 15:57:20', '2020-08-03 15:57:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054988090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004367112', 'Noah Spencer', NULL, '8-3-20 Noah called bc rates are going from $249+$50 with LHS to $399 as of Oct. 1st. He''s going to complete his annual wellness with LHS and will make sure it costs less than $400. He''s joining MPB Carez as Individual bc he''s W2 employee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-03 15:48:18', '2020-08-03 15:48:18'),
