  ('zcrm_1579374000055013028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014765004', 'Samuel Berryman', NULL, 'Misty called in to make sure that they were not being billed for the 3rd time, she said that she has already been billed twice.  I reached out to Patti on this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-08-03 14:56:21', '2020-08-03 14:56:21'),
