  ('zcrm_1579374000054988080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, '8-3-20 Discussed LB with him at $500K and sent the other $250K and $1M to address first need to protect them in case of major health issue. He had learned a bit about these 1+ ago to use for retirement income or cash benefits. He''s definitely interested to see what that looks like. He will ponder either a monthly amount he''d want as base in retirement or monthly or annual amount he can commit comfortably now to begin preparing for ongoing retirement income. Also mentioned $1M baby. He''s funding a 529 Plan now to save for college. But, I told him to think of amount he''d be able to put aside for kids in addition if we want to go down that path in the future. He''ll discuss with Kristen and let me know when he''s ready to talk again. She''s going to be out of town right now and not sure when they''ll have time to talk. Totally receptive to these concepts.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-03 14:47:43', '2020-08-03 14:47:43'),
