  ('zcrm_1579374000055015003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299183', 'Lori Wilson', NULL, 'Lori emailed me asking about what is covered with her plan. I sent her the 64+ list of preventative services covered and a bunch of general education emails to go along with it. How to present herself and her RCI card and what to say along with the PHCS Provider look up email with the site and step by step instructions on how to navigate the website. I also sent her a welcome call scheduler for a refresher if she chooses. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-08-03 12:47:10', '2020-08-03 12:47:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054988055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626120', 'Russell Finsterwald', NULL, '8-3-20 Russell is 28 and he''s been with LHS for last 2 years. He just received price increase notice. Price going from $249 to $399 as individual. He''s most interested in the $209/$1000 MPB Carez worksite w/o MEC. He has funded an HSA before so pondering that. Healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco, never used LHS but had heard of their troubles in reimbursing people in a timely fashion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-08-03 12:28:48', '2020-08-03 12:28:48'),
