  ('zcrm_1579374000054876062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165420', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, '7-31-20 Jennifer requested upgrade to MPB Secure for Sept. 1st start date. Forwarded request to Patti. New cost is $378/$500, only a $3 difference in price for her with many added benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-31 13:25:00', '2020-07-31 13:25:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054877018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, 'Felicia called in and said that she had missed a call from Kelly Cheever for her Welcome Call. I put her through to Kelly C and she took the call. Completing the Welcome Call now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-31 13:19:55', '2020-07-31 13:19:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054876054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939106', 'Jessica Muniz', NULL, '7-31-20 Daniel had an ankle surgery at end of Jan. He thinks it''s doing well and likely no more PT. Jess understands if he has more issues with it they will pay $1000 IUA and costs are shared up to $25K year 1 and 2... Jess knows she will pay for her hypothyroid labs still unless exceeds $1000. Choosing MPB Carez w/ MEC for ES $536/$1000. Kids on CHP+ still I think. She was asking about some regulation that was trying to get passed to add further regulation and transparency around MCS. She doesn''t know outcome and neither do I.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-31 13:16:23', '2020-07-31 13:17:41'),
