  ('zcrm_1579374000054876041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165420', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, '7-31-20 Wellness visit is still outstanding from 7 months ago! I''ve asked Kelly C to look into it. She will do so after her wellness call now. She can see the ticket in the system. Also Jenny wants to upgrade to MPB Secure bc she talked with Jodie Brenner who joined after Jenny did and Jodie''s on MPB Secure. Jenny is thrilled bc she may be able to get all or part of PCP doctor visits with naturopath paid for by Redirect. Cost is only $3 more a month! She will request the move via email later today for Sept. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-31 12:03:19', '2020-07-31 12:03:19'),
