  ('zcrm_1579374000054876031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056191010', 'Beth Wilson', NULL, '7-31-20 Beth is 60, paying $674 now. Moving from Portland, OR to Broomfield, CO on Aug. 10th. She has hypothyroid and takes naturothroid which is only about $10 a month. She likes alternative treatment. She is self-employed and she gets annual wellness and funds an HSA. MPB Carez with MEC $1000/$344.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-31 10:42:57', '2020-07-31 10:42:57'),
