  ('zcrm_1579374000054831028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575309', 'Corrie Black', NULL, 'Corrie called in and said that she needs to submit 2 claims. I asked her what they were for and she sad they were both 2 separate injuries, one for her and one for her husband. I explained to her the process of what she needs to do for injury/illness and told her that they are responsible for the first $1500 out of pocket for both claims since they are 2 different incidences. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and told her to give them a call ASAP. I also sent her the email that explains how to open a need with Sedera. She thanked me and is going to call them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-30 13:29:36', '2020-07-30 13:29:36'),
