  ('zcrm_1579374000054835023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', NULL, 'Lynn called in and she wanted some help in filling out paperwork for her child that will be going to CSU in the fall.  I expressed to her that other members didn''t have very much luck with that and that the only thing that she could try would be the Letter Requesting Waiver of Coverage.  I advised that it most likely wouldn''t work.  I emailed it to her.  She will try anyway.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-30 12:58:24', '2020-07-30 12:58:24'),
